DESCRIPTION:The complete route is 50 miles but as this is a\nloop around to
 wn there are numerous options\nfor returning home early on familiar roads w
 e\nhave ridden all year.\n\nBut who wants to do that?  Join your BBC\nfrien
 ds for a little post-ride end-of-the-official\n-season food and beverage at
  Yogi's on\nEast 10th Street.\n\n<a href="http://www.bloomingtonbicycleclub
 .org/private/BBCMaps/map_pack_1/around_bloomington.pdf">Ride Around Bloomin
 gton 50</a>\n\n<a href="http://ridewithgps.com/routes/798242">GPS</a>\n\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20141019T235547Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot @ 39.15435\,-86.523
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Ride Around Bloomington - Leader: Stan Ellis
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
