 f the season.  The\nbasic route is 24 miles out to the wildlife\nviewing pl
 atform with longer options of\n29 and 32 miles available.  Hopefully\,\nit 
 will be warmer than last year.\n\n<a href="http://www.bloomingtonbicycleclu
 b.org/private/BBCMaps/map_pack_2/muscatatuck.pdf">Ride Map</a>\n\n<a href="
 http://ridewithgps.com/routes/2188159">GPS</a>
