CREATED:20170308T012016Z
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/19486419">Tramway</a> 1
 9 miles. Consider bringing lights.\n\nNotes: The "Older\, Wiser\, and a Lit
 tle Slower" training group emphasizes moderate rides\, and a route planned 
 in advance that is posted on the ride calendar. This is a no drop ride\, bu
 t not a beginner's ride. The OWLS often average 15 to 19 mph on flat roads\
 , and typically have an overall average moving speed between 13 to 15 mph i
 ncluding hills. Early season rides will be somewhat shorter and slower.\n\n
 Starts in the parking lot at Sherwood Oaks Christian Church: <a href="https
 ://www.google.com/maps/place//@39.135188\,-86.500368\,1155m/data=!3m1!1e3!4
 m2!3m1!1s0x0:0x0">Map</a>\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20170314T003332Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:OWLS Ride
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-APPLE-TRAVEL-ADVISORY-BEHAVIOR:AUTOMATIC
END:VEVENT
