DESCRIPTION:This is a fun little ridge romp through\nYellowwood State Fores
 t\, HNF Trail D\,\nand points south in the Elkinsville area.\nDon't plan on
  seeing any cars\, and\nhave your bike well prepared !\n\nRide is mix of gr
 avel\, double track forest\ntrail\, and easy single track on segments\nof H
 NF Trail D. Suitable for MTB\,\ngravel bike or CX. \n\nMeet at former easts
 ide K-Mart\n@ 5:30 if you want to car pool.\nThe ride leaves from the Upper
 \nHandicapped Parking Lot at the\ntop of the big hill on Crooked\nCreek Roa
 d about 6:00PM.\n\nBRING LIGHTS!! BRING LIGHTS!!\n\n<a href="http://bloomin
 gtonbicycleclub.org/maps/Gravel_Rides/Trail%20D%20Elkinsville%20Loop%2019.p
 df">Trail D Elkinsville Loop 19<a/>\n\n<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/rou
 tes/17869507">GPS Files<a/>\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20170222T222548Z
LOCATION:Big K Parking Lot @ 39.162664\, -86.492045
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Trail D Elkinsville Loop 19
