UID:hco699533qc0mvtql62rpv18vc@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20151014T173000
CREATED:20150901T004427Z
DESCRIPTION:Car pool at 5:30 from Mr. Lubies\, or as otherwise\nannounced. 
 Bring a lite - just in case!\n \nThis ride is very timely. It can only be d
 one a few\ndays a year without getting your feet wet.  We start\nat the Cro
 oked Creek boat ramp\, ride across a\ncurrently dry portion of  lake Monroe
 \, then down\nBlue Creek Road past the Hidden\nCabin\, to the South Nebo tr
 ail head\, up Nebo\nto the Connector\, down Combs Rd to Elkinsville\nRd\, a
 nd return to the boat ramp.\n\nApproximately  22 miles\n\n<a href="http://r
 idewithgps.com/routes/10773471">Blue Creek Elkinsville Loop 22</a>\n\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20151014T232547Z
LOCATION:Mr Lubies on East Third Street @ 39.164990\, -86.472144
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Blue Creek Elkinsville Loop 22
TRANSP:OPAQUE
