DESCRIPTION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot  <a href="https://www.google.com/ma
 ps/place//@39.1543611\,-86.523\,15z">map</a>\n\nThe north end of the route 
 is modified this\nyear to cross SR 37 at Arlington Road - \nabout the only 
 place left to cross it !!\nThe complete route is a little longer at 56\nmil
 es\, but as this is a loop around town\nthere are numerous options for retu
 rning\nhome early on familiar roads we have\nridden all year.\n\nBut who wa
 nts to do that?  Join your BBC\nfriends for a little post-ride end-of-the-o
 fficial\n-road-season food and beverage at Yogi's\non East 10th Street righ
 t after the ride.\n\n<a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/John_B
 assett_Maps/Ride%20Around%20Bloomington%202016%20Version%2056.pdf">Ride Aro
 und Bloomington 2016 Version<a/>\n\n<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes
 /17338806">GPS files</a>\n\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20161027T213403Z
