DESCRIPTION:This is 27 pretty hilly miles.  The road may\nbe rough in spots
 \, but the roiling hills of\nKetchum Road are beautiful. Note the\nentrance
  to a great hiking trail as you zip\nby at Cedar Bluff Nature Preserve.\n\n
 There will be an optional 50 mile version\nextending a little farther south
  led by Glenn\nBerger.\n\n<a href="http://www.bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/pr
 ivate/BBCMaps/map_pack_2/cedar_bluff.pdf">Cedar Bluff Nature Preserve</a>\n
 <a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/John_Bassett_Maps/Cedar_Blu
 ff_50_Mile_Option_2016.pdf">Cedar Bluff 50 Mile Option<a/>\n<a href="https:
 //ridewithgps.com/routes/12625168">GPS Files 50 Mile Option</a>\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20170408T140935Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot @ 39.15435\,-86.523
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Cedar Bluff Nature Preserve - Leaders: John Connell & Glenn Berger
TRANSP:OPAQUE
