DESCRIPTION:This is a 20 mile gravel ride beginning\nat the Blackwell Horse
  Camp on\nTower Ridge Road\, heads to\nHickory Grove Church\, and then circ
 les\nback to the horse camp via a great\ndownhill run on McPike Branch\nRoa
 d and a nice climb on Dutch Ridge\nRoad.  The route is predominately\ngrave
 l with a little bit of pavement\,\nand no trail.  Route is suitable\nfor CX
 \, gravel bike\, or MTB.\n\nMeet at 5:30PM at the former K-Mart\nEast parki
 ng lot to car pool.  The ride\nleaves from Blackwell Horse Camp\nabout 6:00
 PM.\n\nBRING LIGHTS!!\n \n<a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/G
 ravel_Rides/All%20Around%20Yellowstone%2020.pdf">All Around Yellowstone 20<
 a/>\n\n<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/18155202">GPS Files<a/>
