DESCRIPTION:We usually do this scenic route over to Brown\nCounty later in 
 the year\, but we are doing it\nearlier this year so Yusuf can show off his
 \nnew route out of town using the SR 46 bicycle\ntunnel.\n\nThe main route 
 is a hilly 56 miles\, but a shorter\n33 mile version is available.  But\, w
 hy go short\nand miss Bear Wallow Hill ??\n\n4/28/16 UPDATE:  WE UNDERSTAND
  THAT\nTHE LICK CREEK BRIGE ON SR 45 AT\nHELMSBERG IS INDEED STILL OPEN.\nS
 O\, WE WILL RIDE THE NORMAL ROUTE\nBACK FROM NASHVILLE.  MAPS HAVE\nBEEN UP
 DATED.\n\n<a href="http://www.bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/private/BBCMaps/ma
 p_pack_1/nashville_old_hilly.pdf">Ye Old Hilly Route to Nashville<a/>\n\n<a
  href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/12924561">GPS Links<a/>
LAST-MODIFIED:20160429T013740Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot @ 39.15435\,-86.523
