BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART:20140614T190000Z
DTEND:20140614T210000Z
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:20140611T182137Z-13551-575900000-2421-0@kallirhoe.acdjdg.dingman.org
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20140611T185311Z
DESCRIPTION:Route in Google Maps: <a href="http://bit.ly/1q4C8K1">http://bi
 t.ly/1q4C8K1</a>\n\nNo reason to withold our love from the local ice cream 
 places. We'll start at the Clear Creek Trail parking lot on Tapp Road\, and
  make our way South on the trail to the Bloomington Rail Trail\, and then f
 ollow the rail trail north to the B-Line Trail and then break off the trail
  to get to Chocolate Moose. The full one-way route is about six miles.\n\nF
 or the return\, we will take the group's temperature and either return the 
 way we came\, or take a short-cut through residential neighborhoods for abo
 ut a 3 mile return.\n\nSHORTER OPTIONS: Anyone seeking a shorter route can 
 join us mid-way using the Bloomington Rail Trail trailheads at W Church Ln 
 or W Country Club Dr. Since nobody chose the shorter options last time\, yo
 u will need to contact Andrew Dingman ahead of time to meet us there. If yo
 u do not contact me\, the group will not stop either place and won't even c
 ome within sight of the Church Lane trailhead. Call or text 812-391-2126 or
  e-mail andrew at dingman dot org. Please contact me before noon on Saturda
 y to guarantee that I know to expect you if you are choosing a short option
 .
LAST-MODIFIED:20140612T132301Z
LOCATION:Clear Creek Trailhead on Tapp Rd @ 39.136212\, -86.561028
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Family Ride - Chocolate Moose
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
