CREATED:20160315T010811Z
DESCRIPTION:This ride is a take off on the Old Around\nBoltinghouse Cruise\
 , a short (22 mile) early\nseason route around the legendary hill on\nBolti
 nghouse Road.  We have offered this\nlonger version the last three years wi
 th the\noriginal ride as a shorter version.  Nobody\nhas opted for the old 
 ride the past three\nyears\, so this year we feature the Way\nAround Boltin
 ghouse Cruise as the featured\nride.\n\nYou can always shortcut on Anderson
 \nRoad for a nice\, shorter  28 mile loop.\nThere are usually a few intrepi
 d soles who\nturn left at Dolan and ride up the big hill just\nfor grins!\n
 \n<a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/John_Bassett_Maps/Way_Aro
 und_Boltinghouse_36.pdf">Way Around Boltinghouse 36<a/>\n\n<a href="http://
 ridewithgps.com/routes/1000066">GPS Links</a>\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20160319T165436Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot @ 39.15435\,-86.523
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Way Around Boltinghouse 36 - Leader: John Bassett
TRANSP:OPAQUE
