BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART:20150530T140000Z
DTEND:20150530T190000Z
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:9bj77ihb88io0rvu1rbf4dfgss@google.com
CREATED:20150527T004924Z
DESCRIPTION:This 61 mile route in Eastern Brown and Western\nBartholomew Co
 unties was listed as the “Best\nRide in Indiana” in the September 2012 issu
 e of\nBicycling Magazine.\n\n“You can ride 50 miles and see 10 cars total\,
  and\nyou can start and finish at Dag’s\, a great ice-\ncream shop with uni
 que flavors.  Try persimmon\,\nheavenly hash\, or a concoction called coffe
 e and\nbrownies.”  You be the judge on the ride and the\nice cream !\n\nThe
  route is a Figure-of-Eight crossing at Pike’s\nPeak in eastern Brown Count
 y.  It is revised from\nlast year due to the closing of Crouch's Market\nin
  Pike's Peak  This year we will loop westward\nto Story for a rest stop at 
 the Story Inn.  Doing only\nthe north part of the loop gives a nice short o
 ption\nof about 38 miles.\n\nThis is a drive and ride.  Meet at Bryan Park 
 at\n8:45 AM to car pool or provide your own transport\nto Columbus.  Ride w
 ill depart at 10:00 from the\nJay C on the west side of Columbus.\n\n<a hre
 f="http://ridewithgps.com/routes/2375442">GPS</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20160601T033132Z
LOCATION:Jay C Parking Lot\, Columbus\, IN @ 39.200238\, -85.9722
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Best Ride in Indiana: Leaders:  Tim Gehres\, Yusuf Ahmed & John Kai
 lll
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
