DESCRIPTION:We will follow up the Ice Cream Run on 7th and Longview with a 
 trek down the Allen Street Greenway\, starting from the Bryan Park parking 
 lot on Henderson Street by the intersection with Dixie. This is the lot nex
 t to the fenced playground for younger children. We will cross the park and
  meander East through neighborhood streets on the Allen Street greenway\, r
 eturn\, cross the park on the other path\, and finish with a visit to Feast
  for afternoon coffee/snacks before\, of course\, letting the kids finish u
 p at the playgrounds.\n\nJoin with Google Hangouts: https://hangouts.google
 .com/hangouts/_/calendar/Y3VjNjZndW9hbTFoaGNxcTJybmFuaWlubDhAZ3JvdXAuY2FsZW
 5kYXIuZ29vZ2xlLmNvbQ._68o32d9g6ooj2l1h74pjid1gb8mjad1j6cmjadpl74o30c1g60mj2
 b9m81lm2r3cd5p6grr55pgm6p3achjisp39dpjmqobe5pnn4po?hs=121
LAST-MODIFIED:20150613T042242Z
LOCATION:Henderson St and Dixie St (Northwest corner of Bryan Park)
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Family Ride: Allen Street Greenway (& Feast)
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
