DESCRIPTION:Join this training run for the March 11th\nDeath March! The rid
 e is the reverse\nof the Death March No. 1 training\nride we did earlier th
 is year.\nThe route is a mix of\none-third gravel in and around the\nHoosie
 r National Forest and two-thirds\npavement with a short stretch along\nSR 5
 8 at Norman. Suitable for MTB\nand CX bikes.\n\nMeet at the former Big K pa
 rking lot\non East Third Street at 10:00 to car\npool. Ride will leave from
  the Hickory\nRidge Fire Tower on Tower Ridge Road\nabout 10:40.\n\n<a href
 ="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/19055532">Death March Training Ride No. 1 
 Reverse 33</a>\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20170218T145849Z
LOCATION:Big K Parking Lot @ 39.162664\, -86.492045
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Death March Training No. 1 Reverse- 33
