UID:es29r9p0q3pm7e1qscb90q779c@google.com
CREATED:20160802T021846Z
DESCRIPTION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot  <a href="https://www.google.com/ma
 ps/place//@39.1543611\,-86.523\,15z">map</a>\n\nThe featured attraction of 
 this ride is the quaint\nlittle covered bridge southwest of Bloomfield\non 
 Plummer Creek.  Ride to the bridge\, turn\naround\, do a lunch break in Blo
 omfield\, and\nreturn home via Springville.  We will probably\nneed to bypa
 ss the bridge that is out at\nSpringville by heading east a short distance\
 non SR 54 and north on Cobb Lane to\nSpringville-Judah Road.  This bypass i
 s \nshown on the GPS link below.\n\nNOTE: The Bloomfield IGA is now closed.
 \nSo plan on lunch at the Subway on SR 54\,\nseven blocks west of the Court
 house.\n\n<a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/private/BBCMaps/map_pa
 ck_1/bloomfield_bridge.pdf">Bloomfield Covered Bridge 80</a>\n\n<a href="ht
 tp://ridewithgps.com/routes/5530963">GPS<a/>
LAST-MODIFIED:20160824T020930Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Bloomfield Covered Bridge - Leader: Bob DeGroff
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
