CREATED:20170410T014155Z
DESCRIPTION:This scenic route was named after the\nquaint eastern Greene Co
 unty community\nof Hobbieville.  However\, due to awful\nParis-Roubaix type
  pavement on Rock East\nRoad we will detour our route right onto\nCarmichae
 l Road rather than go through\nHobbieville. So\, the ride this year is agai
 n\ncalled the Not Hobbieville Ride.\n\nThe route is a fairly hilly 45 miles
  and is\nshown on the map and and GPS links below.\nSee the other Cincinnat
 i. Visit the\nhistoric\, refurbished Yoho Grocery in\nSolsberry.  Laugh in 
 the face of Whitehall\nHill and take a sharp right at its base.\n\n<a href=
 "http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/John_Bassett_Maps/Not_Hobbieville_R
 ide_45.pdf">Not Hobbieville Ride 45</a>\n\n<a href="http://ridewithgps.com/
 routes/4584847">GPS Files<a/>
LAST-MODIFIED:20170410T015559Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot @ 39.15435\,-86.523
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Not Hobbieville Ride - Leader: John Kalill
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
