UID:mpkln9h94can3pb5b7r6smnvgs@google.com
CREATED:20150609T002513Z
DESCRIPTION:Intermediate level rides of moderate pace and\ndistance.  Milea
 ge will increase as the season\nprogresses\, and pace is anticipated to be\
 n15-16 mph.  The rides will start promptly at 5:45\nwith or without a sched
 uled leader.  Riders are\nexpected to look out for each other during the\nr
 ide. Ride maps with regrouping points and GPS\nlinks will be posted here in
  advance.  Riders\nunfamiliar with the route should bring along a\ncopy of 
 the map.  Non-members will be required\nto sign a liability waiver prior to
  participation.\n\n<a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/iRides/C
 ircle_West.pdf">Cricle West 33<a/>\n\n<a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclu
 b.org/maps/GPX_iRide_Files/Circle_West_33.gpx">GPS<a/>\n\nNOTE:  We will fo
 llow our usual Fullerton Pike\noption for crossing SR 37 on the way back to
 \ntown due to the I69 construction at That Rd.
LAST-MODIFIED:20160615T070021Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot @ 39.15435\,-86.523
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:iRide
TRANSP:OPAQUE
