BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART:20160604T140000Z
DTEND:20160604T190000Z
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:j9kv28qdja26fk8le7fp12o5fg@google.com
CREATED:20160513T002333Z
DESCRIPTION:This 61 mile route in Eastern Brown and\nWestern Bartholomew Co
 unties was\nlisted as the “Best Ride in Indiana” in the\nSeptember 2012 iss
 ue of Bicycling\nMagazine.\n\n“You can ride 50 miles and see 10 cars\ntotal
 \, and you can start and finish at Dag’s\,\na great ice-cream shop with uni
 que flavors.\nTry persimmon\, heavenly hash\, or a\nconcoction called coffe
 e and brownies.”\nYou be the judge on the ride and the\nice cream !\n \nThe
  route is a Figure-of-Eight crossing at\nPike’s Peak in eastern Brown Count
 y.  It is\nrevised from the original due to the closing\nof Crouch's Market
  in Pike's Peak  We will\nloop westward to Story for a rest stop at the\nSt
 ory Inn.  Doing only the north part of the\nloop gives a nice short option 
 of about 38\nmiles.\n\nThis is a drive and ride.  Meet at Bryan Park\nat 8:
 45 AM to car pool or provide your own\ntransport to Columbus.  Ride will de
 part at\n10:00 from the Jay C on the west side of\nColumbus.\n\n<a href="ht
 tp://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/John_Bassett_Maps/Best_Ride_in_Indiana
 _Story_Option_61.pdf">Best Ride in Indiana Story Option 61<a/>\n\n<a href="
 http://ridewithgps.com/routes/2375442">GPS Links</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20160513T003001Z
LOCATION:Jay C Parking Lot\, Columbus\, IN @ 39.200238\, -85.9722
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Best Ride in Indiana: Leader: John Kailll
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
