UID:lnbtq7ag223la2mnpf94ub4a2g@google.com
CREATED:20160325T002657Z
DESCRIPTION:This is a drive and ride that we did in 2014\nand is back by po
 pular demand.  We will\ndo the route we did in 2014 (no gravel) !  \n\nThe 
 entire route is 96 miles and begins and\nends at Spring Mill State Park.  S
 tart there\nbecause a century ride will get you to the Ohio\nRiver and back
 .  Shorter options include turning\nback north at Marengo for a 63 mile loo
 p\, or\nturning right at the famous Crawford County\nShoe Tree for about 82
  miles.  Tour God’s\nCounty and enjoy the spectacular view of the\nOhio Riv
 er at the Leavenworth Overlook\, the\npoint where we turn back north.\n\nCa
 r pool leaving Bryan Park at 8:30\, or meet\nat Spring Mill State Park Inn 
 (Parking\nGarage) at 10:00.  Bring your park pass.\nThis is a good one.\n\n
 <a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/John_Bassett_Maps/Spring%20
 Mill%20Leavenworth%2096%20revised.pdf">Paper Maps and Cue Sheet</a>\n\n<a h
 ref="http://ridewithgps.com/routes/2970469">GPS Links</a>\n\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20160521T215552Z
LOCATION:Spring Mill State Park\, Mitchell\, IN @ 38.735030\, -86.414270
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Spring Mill to Leavenworth 96 - Leader: John Bassett
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-APPLE-TRAVEL-ADVISORY-BEHAVIOR:AUTOMATIC
END:VEVENT
