DESCRIPTION:This one is 33 miles and lots of hills.\nThar's limestone in th
 em thar hills!\nThis route hits four stone quarries and\ntheir accompanying
  hills -- making it a stone belt\nde rigueur ride. The short option of 23 m
 iles on\nHarmony Road crosses over the impressive\nnew high bridge over I-6
 9.\n  \n<a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/John_Bassett_Maps/T
 he_Limestone_Tour_33.pdf">The Limestone Tour  33</a>\n\n<a href="http://rid
 ewithgps.com/routes/1031287">GPS Files</a>
