 de around / \nthrough the Hoosier National Forest.\nThe ride starts and end
 s from a new\nlocation\, Greg's (that would be Anderson)\nMTB Camp at the i
 ntersection of SR 446\nand Tower Ridge Road.\n\nMTB\, cross or gravel bike 
 preferred.\nThis is all 75 percent gravel\, and a little\npavement.  \n\nMe
 et at the Old K-Mart East parking\nlot @ 5:30 to car pool to the MTB Camp.\
 nStart is 6:00PM\n\n<a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/Gravel_
 Rides/Greg-s-Hunters_Creek-McPike_26.pdf">Greg's Hunters Creek McPike 26</a
 >\n\n<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/20985688">GPS Files</a>\n
