BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART:20161231T150000Z
DTEND:20161231T200000Z
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:l3qarq15acr7b76f8h39evfdag@google.com
CREATED:20161230T015854Z
DESCRIPTION:This is a special one way gravel / trail ride\nstarting at Trai
 lhead Pizza and finishing\nat the Hollis Cabin on Berry Ridge Road\nin Brow
 n County.  The route is out\nMcGowan Road\, up Jack Ass Hill\, and over\non
  Gilmore Ridge to TC Steele.  The \nroute then follows mostly double\ntrack
  (Bartley Ridge and Miller Ridge)\nand easy single track (Trail D) southeas
 t\nto Blue Creek Road\, Elkinsville Road\, \nStory\, 135 South\, Mt Nebo Ro
 ad\, and\nfinally Berry Ridge Road to the Cabin.\n\nThe ride starts at Trai
 lhead Pizza\n(park across the street at the old log\nchurch) located at the
  intersection of\nSR 446 and Pine Grove Road. \n\nSince this is a one way r
 ide we need to\ncarefully arrange transport back from\nthe Cabin.  Drivers 
 will pack dry clothes\nand any end-of-ride items you need to\nBrown County.
   We have a couple of\nvolunteers\, but more are likely needed.\nAs an ince
 ntive\, drivers will get free\npizza at Trailhead after we return to\nBloom
 ington.\n\nContact John B if you are interested in\nthis last ride of the y
 ear adventure.\n<a href="mailto:jbassett@bluemarble.net">jbassett@bluemarbl
 e.net</a>\n\n<a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/Gravel_Rides/T
 rail%20D%20to%20Cabin%2030.pdf">Trail D to the Cabin 30</a>\n\n<a href="htt
 ps://ridewithgps.com/routes/18235483">GPS Files<a/>
LAST-MODIFIED:20161230T022812Z
LOCATION:Trailhead Pizzeria\, 4303 S State Rd 446\, Bloomington\, IN 47401\
 , USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:GRR Trail D to the Cabin 30 (Last Ride of the Year)
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
