 ich offers 39 &\n46 mile shorter options.) Keep your eyes peeled\nfor buffa
 lo and potholes! Those who sign on for\nthe full 57 are treated to riding o
 n Rocky Hill\nRoad - an Owen County hidden treasure.\n\n<a href="http://blo
 omingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/Jim%20Schroeder/Ellstigospewhi.pdf">Elstigospe
 whi</a>\n\n<a href="http://ridewithgps.com/routes/1585554">GPS</a>\n
