CREATED:20150426T130728Z
DESCRIPTION:Due to I69 road construction at Hobbieville\nwe will detour our
  route west to Carmichael\nRoad rather than go through Hobbieville.\nSo\, t
 he ride this year is again called the\nNot Hobbieville Ride.  The route is 
 45\nmiles and is shown on the PDF\nand GPS links below.\n\nThe west end of 
 Carmichael Road is torn\nup as well and the hill going up to SR 45\nis basi
 cally gravel.  Otherwise\, it will be\na pretty nice ride.\n\nSee the other
  Cincinnati. Visit the\nhistoric\, refurbished Yoho Grocery in\nSolsberry. 
  Laugh in the face of Whitehall\nHill and take a sharp right at its base.\n
 \n<a href="http://www.bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/private/BBCMaps/map_pack_2
 /nothobbieville.pdf">Not Hobbieville Ride</a>\n\n<a href="http://ridewithgp
 s.com/routes/4584847">Not Hobbieville Ride 45 GPS<a/>
LAST-MODIFIED:20150426T130819Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot @ 39.15435\,-86.523
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Not Hobbieville Ride - Leader: John Bassett
TRANSP:OPAQUE
