DESCRIPTION:Midwest Trail Ride Horseman's Camp (<a href="https://www.google
 .com/maps/place//@38.9822421\,-86.368119\,2456m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m2!3m1!1s0x0
 :0x0">map</a>)\n\nGravel Grovel has been called "Mother Nature's Cylo-cross
  Course" through the beautiful and rugged Hoosier National Forest.\n\nIt's 
 also an un-level\, level playing field\, for mountain bikes to battle 'cros
 s bikes. A mix of gravel road\, singletrack trail\, fire road\, and pavemen
 t mean that any bike could come out on top for the day\; it all depends on 
 the rider and the conditions.\n\nThe 60-mile course is the original gravel 
 road race in Indiana... and the 20-mile option gives a taste of the adventu
 re at less of a commitment.\n\n<a href="http://www.dinoseries.com/gravel-gr
 ovel/">Gravel Grovel</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20151127T203214Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Gravel Grovel
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
X-APPLE-TRAVEL-ADVISORY-BEHAVIOR:AUTOMATIC
