 ll includes Bear Wallow Hill).\nThose 30 extra miles are worth it! This is 
 a\nchallenging route with some great scenery.\nThe Cordry-Sweetwater Bermud
 a Triangle has\nswallowed some riders so bring a map and try\nto keep other
  riders in sight.\n\nThe route will utilize Bittersweet Road which\nhas bee
 n improved\, at least in part..\n\n<a href="http://www.bloomingtonbicyclecl
 ub.org/private/BBCMaps/map_pack_1/cordry_sweetwater.pdf">Cordry-Sweetwater 
 Lakes</a>\n\n<a href="http://ridewithgps.com/routes/1530307">GPS<a/>
