 ps/place//@39.1543611\,-86.523\,15z">map</a>\n\nDifficult either way you cu
 t it-- 55 miles standard\,\n43 mile short option. Find relief on either rou
 te at\nYoho's Grocery in Solsberry. Do take the gravel\nroad down to see th
 e railroad trestle up close\nand personal. It's impressive!\n\nThis year's 
 route will utilize That Road and\nthe New Rockport Road overpass over I69\n
 to Leave / Return from Bloomington.\n\n<a href="http://www.bloomingtonbicyc
 leclub.org/private/BBCMaps/map_pack_2/tulip_trestle.pdf">Tulip Trestle</a>\
 n\n<a href="http://ridewithgps.com/routes/10126605">GPS (Leave / Return via
  That Road and Rockport I69 Overpass)<a/> 
