UID:20140611T185828Z-13551-575900000-2421-1452@kallirhoe.acdjdg.dingman.org
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20140611T191502Z
DESCRIPTION:Google Maps route link:<a href="http://bit.ly/1nxkdc3">http://b
 it.ly/1nxkdc3</a>\n\nStart in neighborhood streets on the East side of Bloo
 mington and meander our way in through the IU campus and downtown for Taste
 . With luck\, we'll arrive between the opening rush and dinner rush. Free b
 ike valet service will be offered from 3pm to 11pm courtesy of Bicycle Gara
 ge.\n\nLONGER ROUTE OPTION: If you want to burn more than 3.6 miles of calo
 ries on the way to Taste\, contact me about starting from Butler Park or Br
 yan Park. I'll be starting from right near Butler Park anyway and don't min
 d a detour to Bryan Park if there are people to meet. Contact Andrew Dingma
 n at 812-391-2126 or andrew at dingman dot org before noon the day of the r
 ide to take this option.
LAST-MODIFIED:20140620T134402Z
LOCATION:Park Ridge East Park @ 39.167088\, -86.473569
SEQUENCE:3
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Family Ride - Tase of Bloomington
TRANSP:OPAQUE
