 ps/place//@39.1543611\,-86.523\,15z">map</a>\n\nTour scenic Lawrence County
  for some Fall color.\nNot only do you get to go to Bartlettsville once -\n
 you get to go to Bartlettsville twice in the same\n ride! This is 52 miles 
 rated difficult with a 44 mile\noption\, also supposedly difficult.\n\n<a h
 ref="http://www.bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/private/BBCMaps/map_pack_1/bartl
 ettsville.pdf">Paper Map and Que Sheet<a/>\n\n<a href="http://ridewithgps.c
 om/routes/1832583">GPS</a>
