DESCRIPTION:We did this route late last year and determined that\nit would 
 be a great Fall club ride.  There are three\nversions\, all leaving from th
 e CVS Parking Lot in\nBrownstown.  The long route climbs the Knobstone\nEsc
 arpment\, the most prominent topographic\nfeature in Indiana\, three times.
   \n\n<a href="http://ridewithgps.com/routes/241174">BySSM (Escarpment) - 1
 02</a>\n\n<a href="http://ridewithgps.com/routes/3894476">BySy - 68</a>\n\n
 <a href="http://ridewithgps.com/routes/3894318">By - 47</a>\n\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20140926T003737Z
LOCATION:CVS Parking Lot in Brownstown @ 38.876016\, -86.043195
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:BySSM (Escarpment Ride) - Leader: Jim Schroeder
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
