DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/19978833">Rush Ridge</a
 > 20 miles.\n\nThe "Older\, Wiser\, and a Little Slower" training group emp
 hasizes moderate rides\, and a route planned in advance that is posted on t
 he ride calendar. This is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride. The O
 WLS often average 15 to 19 mph on flat roads\, and typically have an overal
 l average moving speed between 13 and 15 mph including hills. Early season 
 rides will be somewhat shorter and slower.\n\nStarts in the parking lot at 
 Sherwood Oaks Christian Church: <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/
 /@39.135188\,-86.500368\,1155m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0x0">Map</a>\n
