UID:p297u0f7o5dt3b4obh5i6pkgnk@google.com
CREATED:20140322T002522Z
DESCRIPTION:Due to I69 road construction at Hobbieville\nwe will detour our
  route west to Carmichael\nRoad rather than go through Hobbieville.\nSo\, t
 he ride this year is called the Not\nHobbieville Ride.  The route is 45 mil
 es\nand is shown on the GPS link below.\nPaper map copies and que sheets wi
 ll\nbe distributed via the BBC email list.\n\nSee the other Cincinnati. Vis
 it the\nhistoric\, refurbished Yoho Grocery in\nSolsberry.  Laugh in the fa
 ce of Whitehall\nHill and take a sharp right at its base.\n\n<a href="http:
 //www.bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/private/BBCMaps/map_pack_2/hobbieville.pdf
 ">Hobbieville Ride</a>\n\n<a href="http://ridewithgps.com/routes/4584847">N
 ot Hobbieville Ride 45 GPS<a/>
LAST-MODIFIED:20140430T214358Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot @ 39.15435\,-86.523
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Hobbieville Ride - Leader: Dan Fowler
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
