UID:eueojh4q5sg57btgtlj87do1to@google.com
CREATED:20170516T024956Z
DESCRIPTION:This 22-mile loop includes Trail 19.\nIf Trail 19 is impassable
 \, we can\nremove it from the route by keeping\nstraight on Tower Ridge. We
  can also\ncheck it out first and turn around if we\ndon't like it. The res
 t of the route\nremains the same.\n\nThe ride starts and ends from Tower\nR
 idge Camp at the intersection of SR 446\nand Tower Ridge Road.\n\nMeet at t
 he Old K-Mart East parking\nlot @ 5:30 to car pool to the MTB Camp.\nStart 
 is 6:00PM\n\n<a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/Gravel_Rides/T
 ower_Ridge_to_HNF_Trail__19_.pdf">Tower Ridge to HNF Trail 19</a>\n\n<a hre
 f="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/21176852">GPS Files</a>\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20170516T025625Z
LOCATION:Big K Parking Lot @ 39.162664\, -86.492045
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Tower Ridge to HNF Trail 19
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
