 ire State building was quarried at Oolitic.\nHave your pic taken with the J
 oe Palooka statue.\nTest your legs on Patton Hill Rd. The short option\n(39
  miles) sends you home early on friendly\nOld SR 37.\n\n<a href="http://www
 .bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/private/BBCMaps/map_pack_1/joe_palooka_oolitic.
 pdf">Joe Palooka Ride to Oolitic 57</a>\n\n<a href="http://ridewithgps.com/
 routes/704028">GPS<a/>
