 There will be an optional 50 mile version\nextending a little farther south
  led by Glen\nBerger.\n\n<a href="http://www.bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/pri
 vate/BBCMaps/map_pack_2/cedar_bluff.pdf">Cedar Bluff Nature Preserve</a>\n<
 a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/John_Bassett_Maps/Cedar_Bluf
 f_50_Mile_Option_2016.pdf">Cedar Bluff 50 Mile Option<a/>\n<a href="https:/
 /ridewithgps.com/routes/12625168">GPS Link 50 Mile Option</a>\n
