 ll utilize Bittersweet Road which\nhas been improved\, at least in part..\n
 \n<a href="http://www.bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/private/BBCMaps/map_pack_1
 /cordry_sweetwater.pdf">Cordry-Sweetwater Lakes</a>\n\n<a href="http://ride
 withgps.com/routes/1530307">GPS<a/>
