DESCRIPTION:Join in a little Memorial Day fun for a Reverse\nNashville 90\,
  or a shorter (57 mile) Nashville\nRide alternative.  The two routes will b
 e\ntogether for the first 25 miles to Nashville.\nThe Reverse 90 folks will
  continue on to\nGnaw Bone\, Stone Head\, Story\, Freetown\,\nKurtz\, Norma
 n\, Zelma\, Heltonville\, and finally\nreturn to Bloomington via SR 446.\n\
 n<a href="http://ridewithgps.com/routes/7966403">Memorial Day Reverse Nashv
 ille 90<a/>\n\nNot feeling like 90 miles?  Ride to Nashville with\nthe long
  group\, have lunch\, and then tackle the\nBear Wallow Hill in this Memoria
 l Day adaption of\nthe Hilly Route to Nashville.  The route measures\nout a
 t about 57 miles and returns to Bloomington\nvia Robinson Road and Old SR 3
 7.\n\n<a href="http://ridewithgps.com/routes/7978265">Memorial Day Ride to 
 Nashville 57<a/>\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20160601T033132Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot @ 39.15435\,-86.523
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Memorial Day Reverse Nashville 90 - Leader: Jeremy Schott
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
