  Paragon? Good lord\nwillin' and the crik don't rise\, or I guess \nthat wo
 uld be the White River...\n\nThis 2016 version is modified to go out\nand c
 ome back on Old SR 37 because\nof the closure of Acuff Road and the\nBean B
 lossom Bridge on Bottom Road.\n\nFor extra credit\, continue on north from\
 nParagon on a century called Mooresville\nMadness\, courtesy of Jim Schroed
 er.  \n\n<a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/John_Bassett_Maps/
 Paragon_Ride_2016_Version_46.pdf">Paragon Ride 2016 Version 46</a>\n\n<a hr
