DESCRIPTION:Gravel Road Rides of moderate pace and distance\,\ngenerally a 
 short drive from Bloomington.  Routes\nare generally in the Hoosier Nationa
 l Forest or\nYellowwood State Forest.\n\nCar pool at 5:30 from Mr. Lubies\,
  or as otherwise\nannounced. Bring a lite - just in case!\n\n<a href="http:
 //ridewithgps.com/routes/6487642">GRR All Around TC Steele 21</a>\n 
LAST-MODIFIED:20151014T232547Z
