X-GOOGLE-CONFERENCE:https://hangouts.google.com/hangouts/_/calendar/Y3VjNjZ
 ndW9hbTFoaGNxcTJybmFuaWlubDhAZ3JvdXAuY2FsZW5kYXIuZ29vZ2xlLmNvbQ._68o32d9g6k
 p3gl1h70o38c9ob8mj6d9j6omjadpl74o30c1g60mj2b9h6106mobcdhkn4q3fckn62or4d9i6e
 bj4d5n6erb1don6usj7
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20150528T184846Z
DESCRIPTION:Weather permitting (see below for wet-weather contingency)\, we
  will start at the South end of the Bloomington Rail Trail on Church Lane j
 ust West of Rogers. There is a parking lot on the North side of Church lane
  for the trail system. We will then ride the Bloomington Rail Trail north t
 o the B-Line trail\, and then north to Showers Common\, where we will take 
 a break. Parents who so choose may want to go to Bloomingfoods one block so
 uth for a snack\, or bring their own to eat at Showers Common.\n\nFamilies 
 looking for a shorter route option may join the ride at Country Club Road\,
  where the rail trail and B-Line meet. We will not depart the parking lot o
 n the south side of Country Club Road until at least 2:30\, to accommodate 
 families choosing this option.\n\nBecause the Rail Trail (south of Country 
 Club Road) is gravel rather than a paved surface\, wet weather makes it a p
 oor location for many bicycles\, and our wheels contribute excessively to e
 rosion. If the trail is too wet to responsibly ride a road bike on\, the Fa
 mily Ride will consist of the short option only\, and start at 2:30. Any de
 cision to skip the Southern portion will be posted to the club mailing list
  and facebook groups by noon.\n\nJoin with Google Hangouts: https://hangout
 s.google.com/hangouts/_/calendar/Y3VjNjZndW9hbTFoaGNxcTJybmFuaWlubDhAZ3JvdX
 AuY2FsZW5kYXIuZ29vZ2xlLmNvbQ._68o32d9g6kp3gl1h70o38c9ob8mj6d9j6omjadpl74o30
 c1g60mj2b9h6106mobcdhkn4q3fckn62or4d9i6ebj4d5n6erb1don6usj7?hs=121
LAST-MODIFIED:20150607T135957Z
SEQUENCE:3
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Family Ride: Rail Trails
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-GOOGLE-HANGOUT:https://plus.google.com/hangouts/_/calendar/Y3VjNjZndW9hbT
 FoaGNxcTJybmFuaWlubDhAZ3JvdXAuY2FsZW5kYXIuZ29vZ2xlLmNvbQ._68o32d9g6kp3gl1h7
 0o38c9ob8mj6d9j6omjadpl74o30c1g60mj2b9h6106mobcdhkn4q3fckn62or4d9i6ebj4d5n6
 erb1don6usj7
END:VEVENT
