DESCRIPTION:This route is sort of known\nfor Wineries\, but mainly known fo
 r\nhills.  You get a good dose of Lake\nLemon and some nice country roads\n
 in the northwest part of the county.\n\nSince Kinser Pike is closed at SR 3
 7\,\nand Bottom Road is closed at Bean\nBlossom Creek\, we will detour on\n
 Acuff Road and Maple Grove Rd. to\nget up north.  We will follow Sample\nRo
 ad across SR37. \n\n<a href="http://www.bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/private/
 BBCMaps/map_pack_2/wineries.pdf">The Wineries Ride 45</a>\n\n<a href="https
 ://ridewithgps.com/routes/7157320">GPS Links<a/>\n
