BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART:20141005T123000Z
DTEND:20141005T170000Z
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:8shm2co5kbvl39cqpaqvj48cvg@google.com
CREATED:20140929T193120Z
DESCRIPTION:NOT AN OFFICIAL  BBC EVENT\n\nThis coming Sunday the IU Dance M
 arathon will have the annual Torch Ride. It's about a 55 mile ride from Ril
 ey Children Hospital in Indianapolis back to Bloomington. We will be taking
  riders up by bus at 8:30 AM arriving around 9:30 and should be done around
  1:00 at my best guess. We do not take the highway and the ride is led by R
 ick Leash who knows some very scenic back roads. It's not very difficult\, 
 although the end of the ride does have some hills. We also provide a UHaul 
 to take everyone's bike up to Indianapolis. The cost is $25 per rider and t
 he first 50 riders who sign up are provided with a free lunch. All proceeds
  will directly benefit Riley. The link to sign up is <a href="http://www.iu
 dm.org/torchride">iudm.org/torchride</a>. Email: iabrugge@imail.iu.edu\n\nJ
 oin with Google Hangouts: https://hangouts.google.com/hangouts/_/umail.iu.e
 du/riley-torch?hceid=Y3VjNjZndW9hbTFoaGNxcTJybmFuaWlubDhAZ3JvdXAuY2FsZW5kYX
