DESCRIPTION:Ninety miles difficult. This "almost" century\nincorporates the
  best of what this area has to\noffer cyclists - big climbs\, rolling hills
 \, curves\,\nflats\, buccolic views\, bizarre town names\n(Zelma) and sites
  (the Stonehead). Ride this\nonce and you'll ride it again !  Warning: No\n
 indoor plumbing till Story at mile 50\, unless\nyou can sweet talk the ladi
 es at the store in\nFreetown.\n\n<a href="http://www.bloomingtonbicycleclub
 .org/private/BBCMaps/map_pack_1/nashville_90.pdf">Nashville 90</a>\n\n<a hr
 ef="http://ridewithgps.com/routes/4608332">GPS<a/>
