 tley Ridge.\nIncluded is the gargantuan climb of\nJackass Hill (a.k.a the b
 ig hill on \nMcGowen Road) !\n\nRIDE WILL LEAVE FROM THE HUNTER\nCHECK IN A
 T THE INTERSECTION OF KENT\nROAD AND SR 46 EAST.\n
