UID:bhkal3k7utg14cjsgos5g6js24@google.com
CREATED:20150310T013418Z
DESCRIPTION:This is a short (22 mile) early season route around\nthe legend
 ary hill on Boltinghouse Road.  We'll ride\nthe route in reverse and make a
  stop at the\nbottom of the hill.  Those who want can get a\nmeasure of the
 ir Winter conditioning by doing a\nshort up and back to the top of the hill
 .  This is fun\nto do early and late in the season to measure\nyour progres
 s.\n\nTwo longer options\, 27 miles up to Anderson\nRoad\, and 36 miles up 
 to Morgan Monroe will be\navailable.\n\n<a href="http://www.bloomingtonbicy
 cleclub.org/private/BBCMaps/map_pack_1/abc.pdf">Basic Ride Map PDF</a>\n<a 
 href="http://ridewithgps.com/routes/957052">Basic Ride Map GPS</a>\n<a href
 ="http://ridewithgps.com/routes/1000073">Ride Map 27 mile GPS</a>\n<a href=
 "http://ridewithgps.com/routes/1000066">Ride Map 36 mile GPS</a>\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20150319T130138Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot @ 39.15435\,-86.523
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:ABC Around Boltinghouse - Leader: Tim Gehres
TRANSP:OPAQUE
