CREATED:20150408T004658Z
DESCRIPTION:51 moderate miles with a 26 mile short option. This\nroute take
 s riders through Morgan Monroe State\nForest and past "The Touchables" Scul
 pture\nGarden. Consider coasting and taking a gander at\nthe unique pieces 
 scattered on the west side of the\nroad.\n\nThe "traditional" route back fo
 llows a short section\nof SR 37 four lane.  Bypass this and add a little\ns
 pice to your life by taking Liberty Loop and \nHacker Creek Road south (and
