  feature lower mileage (19-25 miles) and slower paces. They use Bloomington
  area low traffic roads.\n\n B-Line\, Clear Creek Trail\, Crop Circle\, Ket
 cham Runaround.( 24 miles). <a href="http://www.bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/
 niceneasy/"> Ketcham Runaround Map</a>.\n\n\nJoin with Google Hangouts: htt
 ps://plus.google.com/hangouts/_/umail.iu.edu/robrown?hceid=cm9icm93bkB1bWFp
 bC5pdS5lZHU.k9a76477onlm5ktu9i9r992o58&hs=121
