CREATED:20150310T014042Z
DESCRIPTION:47 miles rated difficult.\nSince Bottom Road is closed at Bean\
 nBlossom Creek\, we will detour on\nAcuff Road and Maple Grove Rd.\nWe will
  follow Simpson Chapel all the way\nnorth to the Olivery Winery entrance.  
 We'll\nthen ride a short section of SR 37 north\none-half mile to Fox Hollo
 w Rd and\nconnect back into Old SR 37.  The\nGPS link below shows this revi
 sed\nrouting.\n\nThere is also a scheduled bridge replacement\non SR 45 bet
 ween North Shore and South\nShore that may impact the route.  Stay tuned.\n
 \nShorter version available.\n\n<a href="http://www.bloomingtonbicycleclub.
 org/private/BBCMaps/map_pack_2/wineries.pdf">Wineries Ride - 44 miles</a>\n
 \n<a href="http://ridewithgps.com/routes/7499575">GPS via Maple Grove Rd an
 d Fox Hollow</a>
