BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART:20160604T180000Z
DTEND:20160604T210000Z
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:20160524T225732Z-3518-575900000-1-0@amphitrite.acdjdg.dingman.org
X-GOOGLE-CONFERENCE:https://plus.google.com/hangouts/_/calendar/Y3VjNjZndW9
 hbTFoaGNxcTJybmFuaWlubDhAZ3JvdXAuY2FsZW5kYXIuZ29vZ2xlLmNvbQ._68o32dhg6kp38l
 1i68qjecpib8mj6d9h70mjadpl74o30c1g60mj2b9g81gmqs38d5q74qbkckn62or4d9i6ebj4d
 5n6erb1don6usj7
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20160524T225918Z
DESCRIPTION:This season's Family Ride series will kick off with what has ty
 pically been our most popular ride\, the Ice Cream Run to Bruster's. Featur
 ing the 7th and Longview Greenway\, a bit of the B-Line\, two parks\, and o
 f course ice cream\, this route should please the whole family.\n\nThere ar
 e two route options\, clocking in at 2.4 miles or 9 miles round-trip. For t
 he long option\, we will leave at 2:00pm in the parking lot at the East sid
 e of Butler Park\, on Fairview St just north of 9th St. Riders choosing the
  short option should expect to depart about 2:30pm from Park Ridge Park\, a
 t the intersection of E. Longview Ave and N. Glenwood Ave. The entire group
  will arrive at Brusters before 3:00. We will depart when the adults reach 
 consensus that it is time\, and re-trace our path together.\n\nEither can b
 e cut in half by having an accomplice drop you off at the beginning and pic
 k you up at Bruster's. (Note that you must supply your own accomplice)\n\nB
 oth route maps show us riding on 3rd street for about a block. Rest assured
  that we will not actually do  any such thing.\nLong option map: <a href="h
 ttps://goo.gl/pHAqOK">https://goo.gl/pHAqOK</a>\nShort option map: <a href=
 "https://goo.gl/W3VcBf">https://goo.gl/W3VcBf</a>\n\n\nJoin with Google Han
 gouts: https://plus.google.com/hangouts/_/calendar/Y3VjNjZndW9hbTFoaGNxcTJy
 bmFuaWlubDhAZ3JvdXAuY2FsZW5kYXIuZ29vZ2xlLmNvbQ._68o32dhg6kp38l1i68qjecpib8m
 j6d9h70mjadpl74o30c1g60mj2b9g81gmqs38d5q74qbkckn62or4d9i6ebj4d5n6erb1don6us
 j7?hs=121
LAST-MODIFIED:20160529T131646Z
LOCATION:Butler Park
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Family Ride: Ice Cream Run
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
