CREATED:20150408T002544Z
DESCRIPTION:POSTPONED UNTIL SUNDAY AT 1:00PM\n\nDue to I69 road constructio
 n at Hobbieville\nwe will detour our route west to Carmichael\nRoad rather 
 than go through Hobbieville.\nSo\, the ride this year is again called the\n
 Not Hobbieville Ride.  The route is 45\nmiles and is shown on the PDF\nand 
 GPS links below.\n\nThe west end of Carmichael Road is torn\nup as well and
  the hill going up to SR 45\nis basically gravel.  Otherwise\, it will be\n
 a pretty nice ride.\n\nSee the other Cincinnati. Visit the\nhistoric\, refu
 rbished Yoho Grocery in\nSolsberry.  Laugh in the face of Whitehall\nHill a
 nd take a sharp right at its base.\n\n<a href="http://www.bloomingtonbicycl
 eclub.org/private/BBCMaps/map_pack_2/nothobbieville.pdf">Not Hobbieville Ri
 de</a>\n\n<a href="http://ridewithgps.com/routes/4584847">Not Hobbieville R
 ide 45 GPS<a/>
LAST-MODIFIED:20150425T113632Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot @ 39.15435\,-86.523
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Not Hobbieville Ride - Leader: John Bassett
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
