DESCRIPTION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot  <a href="https://www.google.com/ma
 ps/place//@39.1543611\,-86.523\,15z">map</a>\n\nSee Lake Monroe from every 
 angle without benefit of boat! Spoil this pleasant ride around the lake by 
 descending & climbing all the boat ramps. Monster\, 74 miles. Wimp\, 44. \n
 \n<a href="http://www.bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/private/BBCMaps/map_pack_2
 /boat_ramps.pdf">Tour de Boat Ramps</a>
