BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART:20170603T130000Z
DTEND:20170603T210000Z
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:a3jdm80mm7vjq134jqn5b6q8ic@google.com
CREATED:20170427T004022Z
DESCRIPTION:This is a drive and ride was a huge success\nlast year\, and is
  back by by popular demand. \n\nThe entire route is 96 miles and begins and
 \nends at Spring Mill State Park.  Start there\nbecause a century ride will
  get you to the Ohio\nRiver and back.  Shorter options include turning\nbac
 k north at Marengo for a 63 mile loop\, or\nturning right at the famous Cra
 wford County\nShoe Tree for about 82 miles.  Tour some of\nthe best souther
 n Indiana has to offer\, and\nenjoy the spectacular view of the Ohio River\
 nat the Leavenworth Overlook\, the point where\nwe turn back north.\n\nCar 
 pool leaving Bryan Park at 7:30\, or meet\nat Spring Mill State Park Inn (P
 arking\nGarage) at 9:00.  Bring your park pass.\nThis is a good one.\n\n<a 
 href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/John_Bassett_Maps/Spring%20Mil
 l%20Leavenworth%2096%20revised.pdf">Spring Mill to Leavenworth</a>\n\n<a hr
 ef="http://ridewithgps.com/routes/2970469">GPS Links</a>\n\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20170427T004814Z
LOCATION:Spring Mill State Park\, Mitchell\, IN @ 38.735030\, -86.414270
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Spring Mill to Leavenworth 96 - Leader: John Bassett
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
