 omfield\, and\nreturn home via Springville.\n\nNOTE: The Bloomfield IGA is 
 now closed.  So plan\non lunch at the Subway on SR 54\, seven blocks\nwest 
 of the Courthouse.\n\n<a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/private/BB
 CMaps/map_pack_1/bloomfield_bridge.pdf">Bloomfield Covered Bridge 80</a>\n\
 n<a href="http://ridewithgps.com/routes/5530963">GPS<a/>
