UID:g9bko3t5f6k0i5ho7b8ci8k7o8@google.com
CREATED:20161017T222913Z
DESCRIPTION:Car pool at 5:30 from Salt Creek Cycles\n \nPOSPONED DUE TO RAI
 N !!\nNO GRAVEL RIDE TONIGHT!!\n\nGet a taste of the recent Brown County Ep
 ic\non this one!  This was one of the most\npopular evening gravel rides we
  did last\nyear.  We start at the Crooked Creek\nboat ramp\, ride across an
  almost dry portion\nof  Lake Monroe to Elkinsville on the old\nBlue Creek 
 Youno Road (dirt) \, up Combs\nRoad\, across the Nebo Connector\, down\nthe
  north side of Nebo (single track)\, around\non Blue Creek Road past the Hi
 dden Cabin\,\nup a giant dirt road hill\, and back to the\nboat ramp.\n\nAp
 proximately  17 miles - most suitable\nfor MTB.\n\nBRING LIGHTS!  BRING LIG
 HTS!\n\n<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/17204767">Reverse Blue Cree
 k Elkinsville Loop 17</a>\n\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20161019T204842Z
LOCATION:Salt Creek Cycles @39.164521\, -86.479319
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Gravel Road Ride - Reverse Blue Creek Elkinsville Loop 17 (POSTPONE
 D DUE TO RAIN)
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
