DESCRIPTION:This century is a must - the route as mapped\non GPS is 99.3 mi
 les.  So\, if you ride any\ndistance to the start\, this is a century ride.
 \nRiders interested in a shorter option may\nwant to retrace their steps fr
 om Spencer\,\nor follow one of the routes below.  Last\nyear\, folks got to
 tally drenched on this\nride!  So\, we deserve better weather this\nyear.\n
  \n<a href="http://www.bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/private/BBCMaps/map_pack_
 2/clay_city.pdf">Joe's Clay City "Almost A Century"</a>\n\n<a href="http://
 ridewithgps.com/routes/5611691">GPS<a/>\n\nShort options\, 66 and 45 miles:
 \n\n<a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/Jim%20Schroeder/9Aand9B
 %20Spencer%20Circuit.pdf">Spencer Circuit & Spencer Hilly</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20140813T010601Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot @ 39.15435\,-86.523
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Joe's Clay City "Almost A Century" - Leader: Jeremy Schott
