DESCRIPTION:Starting Location updated\n\nJoin us for this Fun and exciting 
  mini Death March training ride. We will start at the Blackwell horse camp 
 ( start of race) We will ride to the three mandatory check points. (Henders
 on Creek Church\, Fleetwood\, Robertson)\, shown in red on the linked map. 
 Just before the start of the ride\, we will draw out two other mandatory ch
 eck points and go to those as well. The route will then be determined by th
 e riders.\n\n<a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/Gravel_Rides/D
 eath%20March%202017%20Map.pdf">The Death March Cemetery Location Map<a/>\n\
 nCX bike or mountain Bike......\n\nMeet at the old K-Mart East parking lot 
 at 10:00 AM carpool to Blackwell Horse Camp for start around 10:45.
