UID:jal37dkmand787j5ab9ae2r8rs@google.com
CREATED:20150310T013938Z
DESCRIPTION:34 miles rated difficult. Thar's limestone in them\nthar hills!
  This route hits four stone quarries and\ntheir accompanying hills -- makin
 g it a stone belt\nde rigueur ride. The short option of 23 miles on\nHarmon
 y Road is not available this year due to\nI69 construction.  A short option
  on Tramway\nRoad is pretty much impassable too.  It is a\nshort ride\, so 
 long!\n\nRockport Road is also closed at SR37 due to\nI69 construction\, so
  we will cross SR 37 on\nFullerton Pike.  We also have to bypass\naround th
 e construction on Rockport Road\nback in town.  All of these revisions are\
 nshown in the GPS link below. \n\n<a href="http://www.bloomingtonbicycleclu
 b.org/private/BBCMaps/map_pack_2/limestone_tour.pdf">Limestone Tour</a>\n\n
 <a href="http://ridewithgps.com/routes/1031287">2015 Limestone Tour 34 GPS<
 /a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20150408T234427Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot @ 39.15435\,-86.523
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Limestone Tour (Kirksville & Stanford) - Leader: Yusuf Nur
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
