 ngle track (Nebo Ridge Bike\ntrail)\, and some pavement.\n\nMeet at Salt Cr
 eek Cycles at 10:00 to\ncarpool to Hickory Ridge.  Hunting season\nis on\, 
 so wear orange and bring a bell.\n\n<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes
 /17613843">Fun Grovel + Combs and Nebo 32<a/>
