 plete Terre Haute\nto Richmond route before the 30th official\nride. SAG su
 pport provided. We plan to\nleave Bloomington early in the morning\,\nride 
 the route\, and return to Bloomington\nfrom Richmond that evening. \n\nWe c
 ould use a couple more volunteer\nSAG drivers.  Contact John Bassett for\nd
 etails.\n\njbassett@bluemarble.net
