  or as otherwise\nannounced. Bring a lite - and a spare!!\n\n<a href="http:
 //ridewithgps.com/routes/11103566">Jackass to Yellowwood 24<a/>\n\nRIDE WIL
 L LEAVE FROM THE HUNTER\nCHECK IN AT THE INTERSECTION OF KENT\nROAD AND SR 
 46 EAST.\n
