 sonal. It's impressive!\n\nNote:  START TIME IS 8:00AM!\n\n<a href="http://
 www.bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/private/BBCMaps/map_pack_2/tulip_trestle.pdf
 ">Tulip Trestle</a>\n\n<a href="http://ridewithgps.com/routes/5835076">GPS 
 (Return via Fullerton and Rail Trail)<a/> 
