DESCRIPTION:This is our usual fist ride of the season\, and\nI hate to not 
 do it due to some bridge\nconstruction on Bottom Road.  So\, we'll\ndo a li
 ttle detour through the North High\nSchool campus and Maple Grove Road\nto 
 get out to the Muscatatuck Wildlife\nRefuge viewing stand.\n \nThe basic ro
 ute is a 30 mile out & back to\nthe wildlife viewing platform on Bottom\nRo
 ad.  An additional loop to\nthe north\, shown on the map\, \nmakes a nice 3
 8 mile ride.\n\n<a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/John_Basset
 t_Maps/Muscatatuck_Wildlife_Refuge_2017_Version_38.pdf">Muscatatuck Wildlif
 e Refuge & Beyond 2017 Version 38</a>\n\n<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/r
 outes/19261230">GPS Files<a/>
LAST-MODIFIED:20170317T204632Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot @ 39.15435\,-86.523
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Muscatuck & Beyond 2017 Version - Leader:  Mike Finger
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
