UID:qogsov3592vbr7pm034l21t510@google.com
CREATED:20160228T203947Z
DESCRIPTION:This is our usual fist ride of the season. \nThe basic route is
  a 28 mile out & back to\nthe wildlife viewing platform on Bottom\nRoad.  D
 ue to I69 construction this\nyear will need to take an alternate\nroute on 
 Maple Grove Road which adds\nsome hills and miles.  Additional loops to\nth
 e north provide 32 and 37 miles routes.\n\n<a href="http://www.bloomingtonb
 icycleclub.org/private/BBCMaps/map_pack_2/muscatatuck.pdf" target="_blank">
 Ride Map (pdf)</a>\n\n<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/12145726">Mus
 catatuck Wildlife Refuge & Beyond Kinser Pike is Closed Version 37</a>\n\nO
 r\, return to Bloomington via\nHindustan and Old SR 37 for a nice 39\nmile 
 loop.\n\n<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/12435387">Wildlife Refuge 
 + Hindustan 39</a>\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20160305T010026Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot @ 39.15435\,-86.523
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Muscatuck & Beyond - Leader:  Mike Finger
TRANSP:OPAQUE
