DESCRIPTION:CVS Parking Lot in Brownstown <a href="https://www.google.com/m
 aps/place//@38.876016\,-86.043195\,614m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0x0">ma
 p</a>\n\nWe have done this Drive & Ride century in the Fall\nthe last two y
 ears.  The main route is 102 miles\,\nand there are 68 and 47 mile shorter 
 options.  All\nthree versions leave from the CVS Parking Lot in\nBrownstown
  at 9:00AM.  Car pool from Bryan Park\nat 8:00AM.\n\nThe long route climbs 
 the Knobstone Escarpment\,\nthe most prominent topographic feature in India
 na\,\nthree times. Bring you climbing gears! \n\n<a href="http://ridewithgp
 s.com/routes/10301215">BySSM (Escarpment) - 102</a>\n\n<a href="http://ride
 withgps.com/routes/6144109">BySy - 68</a>\n\n<a href="http://ridewithgps.co
 m/routes/6144109">By - 47</a>\n\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20150910T002828Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:BySSM (Escarpment Ride) - Leader: John Bassett
TRANSP:OPAQUE
