UID:hbkvq9na563dj3fnmmia92iq40@google.com
CREATED:20170315T233055Z
DESCRIPTION:This ride is a take off on the Old Around\nBoltinghouse Cruise\
 , a short (22 mile) early\nseason route around the legendary hill on\nBolti
 nghouse Road.  We have offered this\nlonger version the last four years wit
 h the\noriginal ride as a shorter version.  Nobody\nhas opted for the old r
 ide the past four \nyears\, so this year we offer The Way\nAround Boltingho
 use Cruise as the featured\nride.\n\nYou can always shortcut on Anderson\nR
 oad for a nice\, shorter  28 mile loop.\nThere are usually a few intrepid s
 oles who\nturn left at Dolan and ride up the big hill just\nfor grins!\n\n<
 a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/John_Bassett_Maps/Way_Around
 _Boltinghouse_36.pdf">Way Around Boltinghouse 36<a/>\n\n<a href="http://rid
 ewithgps.com/routes/1000066">GPS Links</a>\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20170316T195828Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot @ 39.15435\,-86.523
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Way Around Boltinghouse 36 - Leader: Yusuf Nur
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
