DESCRIPTION:This 21-miler begins at the Blackwell Horse\nCamp on Tower Ridg
 e Road\, heads east\nto HNF Trail 19 and Maumee\, then circles\nback to the
  horse camp past the Maumee\nScout Camp.  The route is predominately\ngrave
 l with a 2-mile section of easy downhill\nsingle track on Trail 19 and a li
 ttle pavement\nin the Maumee area.  Route is suitable\nfor CX\, gravel bike
 \, or MTB.\n\nMeet at 5:30PM at the former K-Mart\nEast parking lot to car 
 pool.  The ride\nleaves from Blackwell Horse Camp\nabout 6:00PM.\n\nBRING L
 IGHTS!!\n \n<a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/Gravel_Rides/Bl
 ackwell%20Loop%20to%20HNF%20Trail%2019.pdf">Blackwell Loop to HNF Trail 19<
 a/>\n\n<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/10147577">GPS Files<a/>
LAST-MODIFIED:20161214T223747Z
LOCATION:Big K Parking Lot @ 39.162664\, -86.492045
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:GRR Blackwell Loop to Trail 19
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-APPLE-TRAVEL-ADVISORY-BEHAVIOR:AUTOMATIC
END:VEVENT
