 dvance that is posted on the ride calendar. This is a no drop ride\, but no
 t a beginner's ride. The OWLS often average 15 to 19 mph on flat roads\, an
 d typically have an overall average moving speed between 13 to 15 mph inclu
 ding hills.\n\n<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/4776768">The Pointe<
 /a> 23 miles.
