DESCRIPTION:Heltonville  <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/place//@38.93
 0182\,-86.375364\,585m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0x0">map</a>\n\nThis is 
 a 57 mile drive and ride beginning in\nHeltonville.  The ride is almost ent
 irely on\nrural roads on Lawrence County\, with a couple\nof short sections
  on SR 58 and US 50.\n\nIf you'd like to log a century\, head out early\nro
 m Bloomington and meet the crowd\nin the parking lot of the former \nHelton
 ville school on SR 58.\n\n<a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/L
 arry%20Limestone%20Tour.pdf">Larry Limestone Tour</a>\n\n<a href="http://ri
 dewithgps.com/routes/1558565">GPS<a/>
