BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART:20161203T150000Z
DTEND:20161203T200000Z
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:9mof7lljv46gfmvdaqpsvg4ge4@google.com
CREATED:20161115T011903Z
DESCRIPTION:Fat Bikes or Mountain Bikes are Welcome for this fun ride.\n\nM
 eet at Walmart parking lot ( behind the gas station ) at 8:30AM to carpool 
 to the Park\n\n\nIn 2014\, we did an urban ride in downtown Indianapolis. I
 n 2015\, we rode the Nebo Ridge Trail. For 2016\, let's visit a different p
 art of the state and check out Griffin Bike Park in Terre Haute\, IN!\n\nGr
 iffin Bike Park is newly opened this year and currently has about 10mi of t
 rails open and ready to ride. With the way the weather has been lately\, co
 nditions are likely to be decent\, but let's keep tabs in case things chang
 e.\n\nCome on out if you're a dedicated fatbike rider\, fat-curious\, or ju
 st want to take in a social pace group ride in a new riding destination in 
 Indiana.\n\nCheck out <a href=" https://griffinbikepark.com/">Griffin Bike 
 Park</a> or the Griffin Bike Park facebook page for details on the park and
  how to get there.
LAST-MODIFIED:20161203T172854Z
LOCATION:Griffin Bike Park\, 10700 Bono Rd\, Terre Haute\, IN 47802\, USA @
  39.336771\, -87.367721
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Global Fat Bike Day
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
X-APPLE-TRAVEL-ADVISORY-BEHAVIOR:AUTOMATIC
END:VEVENT
