X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20170114T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20170114T183000
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:b2o8p1ph6qbgdvrm396l4g4ubg@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20170114T100000
CREATED:20170104T195601Z
DESCRIPTION:This Road trip is a go!\n\nAll of the Rain have you wondering w
 here to ride?.. Come ride with us in the underground mountain bike park in 
 Louisville Ky.\n\nThe plan would be to meet in the Walmart ( behind the gas
  station ) parking lot 9:00AM Saturday. We will car pool to the Cavern. The
  cost to ride the day is $24.00 plus split the gas with whoever drives. We 
 will probably ride about 4 hours before returning to Btown \n\nSome freezin
 g  rain could be coming in Friday night so check here or the\n<a href="http
 s://www.facebook.com/bbcmtb/">mountain bike Facebook page</a>  Saturday mor
 ning at 8:00am for a go-no-go decision.\n\nBring your own Mountain Bike or 
 you can rent one\n\nAre you ready to experience a one of a kind Underground
  Bike Park? Over 320\,000 square feet including over 45 trails\, Jump Lines
 \, Pump Tracks\, Dual Slalom\, BMX\, Cross Country and Single Track all in 
 a former limestone cavern 100 feet sub-surface. Enjoy the comfort of our 60
  degree temperature year round. Come experience what the buzz is all about.
  You simply won’t believe what you see.\n\n<a href="http://www.louisvilleme
 gacavern.com/attractions/6/mega-underground-bike-park">Louisville Mega Cave
 rns</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20170128T145316Z
LOCATION:Louisville Mega Cavern\, 841 Taylor Avenue\, Louisville\, KY\, USA
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Louisville Mega Caverns This Road Trip is a go!
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-APPLE-TRAVEL-ADVISORY-BEHAVIOR:AUTOMATIC
