DESCRIPTION:Starts in the parking lot at Sherwood Oaks Christian Church: <a
  href="https://www.google.com/maps/place//@39.135188\,-86.500368\,1155m/dat
 a=!3m1!1e3!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0x0">Map</a>\n\nThe "Older\, Wiser\, and a Little 
 Slower" training group emphasizes moderate rides\, and a route planned in a
 dvance that is posted on the ride calendar. This is a no drop ride\, but no
 t a beginner's ride. The OWLS often average 15 mph or more on flat roads\, 
 and typically have an overall average moving speed between 13 to 15 mph inc
 luding hills.\n\n<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/197144">Fluck Mill
 </a> 19 miles.
LAST-MODIFIED:20160510T214624Z
LOCATION:Sherwood Oaks Christian Church\, 2700 East Rogers Road\, Bloomingt
 on\, IN 47401\, United States
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:OWLS Ride
