BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART:20190105T150000Z
DTEND:20190105T200000Z
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:0r0q0d1v29a2s3mudbnm4lejmm@google.com
CREATED:20181220T142945Z
DESCRIPTION:Our first Saturday off road ride of the year has something for 
 everyone..\n\nWe will assemble at the camp site just beside trail 19 in the
  Hoosier National Forrest.\nGo down tower ridge rd to the first road past t
 he tower. County Rd 1500 turn right. go approx\n1.50 miles to camp site on 
 left. \n\nWe will have a fire going. From this site you can do whatever you
  want to do. You can ride MTB trails. you can ride gravel\, you can hike tr
 ails or you can stay by the fire and enjoy good company and share stories. 
 Bring any snacks  and beverages to share that you wish.\n\nAll rides will b
 e impromptu. I hope you can join us for this fun day of  fellowship. \n\nMe
 et at old K-mart East 10:00 to car pool to campsite.\n\nBring chairs if you
  want to sit around the camp fire. \n\n   
LAST-MODIFIED:20190103T143900Z
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:First Saturday off road ride
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
