BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART:20200215T150000Z
DTEND:20200215T200000Z
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:4mjvfaia79g786vvgr4aeaqqmo@google.com
CREATED:20200106T140105Z
DESCRIPTION:This is a special one way gravel / trail ride&nbsp\;starting at
  Trailhead Pizza and finishing&nbsp\;at the Hollis Cabin on Berry Ridge Roa
 d&nbsp\;in Brown County.  The route is out&nbsp\;McGowan Road\, up Jack Ass
  Hill\, and over&nbsp\;on Gilmore Ridge to TC Steele.  The route then follo
 ws mostly double<br>track (Bartley Ridge and Miller Ridge)&nbsp\;and easy s
 ingle track (Trail D) southeast&nbsp\;to Blue Creek Road\, Elkinsville Road
 \,&nbsp\;&nbsp\;Story\, 135 South\, Mt Nebo Road\, and&nbsp\;finally Berry 
 Ridge Road to the Cabin.<br><br>The ride starts at Trailhead Pizza&nbsp\;(p
 ark across the street at the old log&nbsp\;church) located at the intersect
 ion of&nbsp\;SR 446 and Pine Grove Road. <br><br>Since this is a one way ri
 de we need to&nbsp\;carefully arrange transport back from&nbsp\;the Cabin. 
  Drivers will pack dry clothes&nbsp\;and any end-of-ride items you need to&
 nbsp\;Brown County.  We have a couple of&nbsp\;volunteers\, but more may be
  needed.<br><br>Join in for pizza at the newly remodeled Trailhead Pizza af
 ter we return to Bloomington!<br><br>Contact Warren or John B if you are in
 terested in&nbsp\;this adventure.<br><br><a href="mailto:bigredballons@msn.
 com">bigredballons@msn.com</a><br><br><a href="mailto:jbassett@bluemarble.n
 et">jbassett@bluemarble.net</a><br><br><a href="http://bloomingtonbicyclecl
 ub.org/maps/Gravel_Rides/Trail%20D%20to%20Cabin%2030.pdf">Trail D to the Ca
 bin 30</a><br><br><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/18235483">GPS Fil
 es</a><a></a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20200210T003345Z
LOCATION:Trailhead Pizzeria\, 4303 S State Rd 446\, Bloomington\, IN 47401\
 , USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Trail D to the Cabin 30
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
