UID:11mi5d6uv14kc5la6mgfnqslfg@google.com
CREATED:20180226T003131Z
DESCRIPTION:<br>This is our usual fist ride of the season\, and this year w
 e get to try out the new Bottom Road<br>Bridge.&nbsp\; The basic route is a
  pretty level 24 mile out &amp\; back to the Muscatatuck National Wildlife 
 Refuge viewing platform on Bottom Road. But why turn around there?&nbsp\; A
 n additional loop to&nbsp\;the north has a couple of fine hills and makes a
  nice 32 mile out and back from Bryan Park.<br><br><a href="https://www.goo
 gle.com/url?q=http%3A%2F%2Fbloomingtonbicycleclub.org%2Fmaps%2FJohn_Bassett
 _Maps%2FMuscatatuck_Wildlife_Refuge_-_Beyond__2018_Ver_32.pdf&amp\;sa=D&amp
 \;ust=1519879221672000&amp\;usg=AFQjCNHJJG5laqiDOZ_oW9KcRB2eZnz41w" target=
 "_blank">Muscatatuck Wildlife Refuge &amp\; Beyond 2018 Version 32</a><br><
 br><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fridewithgps.com%2Fro
 utes%2F26907106&amp\;sa=D&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AFQjCNFLkjzDJ7lfCxO7-hGdS8HdE
 sr28Q" target="_blank">GPS Files</a><a></a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20180302T014328Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot @ 39.15435\,-86.523
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Muscatatuck & Beyond 2018 Version - Leader:  Mike Finger
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
