DESCRIPTION:Join us for a fun gravel ride through<br>the enchanted Hoosier 
 National Forest.<br>The 21 mile route begins at the Hickory<br>Ridge Fire T
 ower on Tower Ridge<br>Road\, ventures south to Henderson<br>Creek Road and
  Norman\, and returns<br>to the fire tower via Hickory Grove<br>Church and 
 along the crest of<br>Hickory Ridge.<br><br>Route is entirely gravel and pa
 vement\,<br>no trail.<br><br>Meet at 5:30 pm at the former K-Mart<br>East p
 arking lot to car pool.  The ride<br>leaves from the fire tower about 6:00P
 M.<br><br>&nbsp\;<br>&nbsp\;<br><a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/
 maps/Gravel_Rides/Henderson%20Creek%20&amp\;%20Hickory%20Ridge%20from%20the
 %20Fire%20Tower%2021.pdf">Henderson Creek &amp\; Hickory Ridge from the Fir
 e Tower 21</a><a><br><br></a><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/178857
 26">GPS Files</a><a></a>
