  and will be somewhere <u>In Between</u> the OWLs and the Nice-n-Easy ride.
   The routes will be 18-28 miles and will chosen weekly from a scratch shee
 t of seven popular rides from last year.&nbsp\; Non-members will be require
 d to sign a liability waiver prior to participation.  Please print out\, si
 gn\, and bring the waiver along.<br><br><a href="http://bloomingtonbicyclec
 lub.org/maps/John_Bassett_Maps/In_Between_Fluck_Mill_20.pdf">In Between Flu
 ck Mill 20</a><br><br><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/10899369">GPS
  Files</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20180516T220412Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot @ 39.15435\,-86.523
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:In Between !  - Leader: Martina Allesee
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
