DESCRIPTION:<br>This is our usual fist ride of the season out to the Muscat
 atuck National Wildlife Refuge on Bottom Road.&nbsp\; The basic route is a 
 pretty level 24 mile out &amp\; back designed to be an easy ride to shake o
 ff the Winter cobwebs.&nbsp\; The route is easily extended to 32 miles with
  a loop to the north\, as show in the mapping\, or can be extended east acr
 oss I-69 via the Sample Road overpass for those who want some additional mi
 les.<br><br><a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/John_Bassett_Ma
 ps/Muscatatuck_Wildlife_Refuge_-_Beyond__2018_Ver_32.pdf" target="_blank">M
 uscatatuck Wildlife Refuge &amp\; Beyond 2018 Version 32</a><br><br><a href
 ="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/26907106" target="_blank">GPS Files</a><a>
 </a>
