DESCRIPTION:This is a fun 21-mile route through the Hoosier\nNational Fores
 t.  We start at the Fire Tower\non Tower Ridge Rd\, ride to Maumee\, up to\
 nHickory Grove Church\, down McPike Branch\nRd over to Hunters Creek Rd\, a
 nd\nback to the Fire Tower.  This is mostly gravel\,\nwith a little pavemen
 t.\n\nMeet at the East Side K-mart 5:30 to carpool\nor meet at Fire Tower 6
 :00PM.\n\n<a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/Gravel_Rides/Fun_
 Grovel_from_Hickory_Ridge_Fire_Tower_21.pdf">Fun Grovel from Hickory Ridge 
 Fire Tower 21<a/>\n\n<a href=" https://ridewithgps.com/routes/16829029">GPS
  Files</a>
