UID:1m3074r7t6ecf4724vdo2r87o0@google.com
CREATED:20200306T021628Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>BBC Saturday Touring Rides are scheduled every Saturday\, Ma
 rch-October\, except for RAIN and the Hilly Hundred.Start times will change
  from month to month with the availability of light andthe onset of Indiana
  heat and humidity. Most rides leave from the Bryan ParkPool parking lot un
 less a “Drive and Ride” is scheduled.  Mileages varies from about 30 to abo
 ut 100and increase during the season.  Shortoptions are available on most r
 outes.</p><p>Touring rides take cyclists tosurrounding counties and accommo
 date cyclists of a variety of abilities.Participants frequently break up in
 to multiple groups determined by pace. </p><p>We strive to have a designate
 dride leader each Saturday.  Ride leaders ensurethat no rider is completely
  dropped and all riders make it back to the startingpoint. On longer rides\
 , leaders designate regroup points and identify reststops for food and wate
 r. Touring rides are a great way to acquaint yourselfwith the area\, build 
 endurance\, and meet others who share your interest incycling.</p><p>Route 
 descriptions\, maps\, and gpslinks for each ride are posted in advance on t
 his calendar closer to the ridedate.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20200317T145414Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot @ 39.15435\,-86.523\, 
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:CANCELED Saturday Touring Ride
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
