DESCRIPTION:This is a beautiful ride with challenging hills down to the his
 toric Williams Covered Bridge on the East Fork White River.&nbsp\; The trad
 itional route is here:<br><br><a href="http://www.bloomingtonbicycleclub.or
 g/maps/BBCMaps/map_pack_1/williams_bridge.pdf" target="_blank">Williams Cov
 ered Bridge</a><br><br>Recently\, we have utilized an alternate route to Wi
 lliams following the&nbsp\;Milwaukee Trail (a stone dust rail trail)&nbsp\;
  southwest from Bedford to Williams\, and an alternate route back to Fayett
 eville from Williams on Ridge Road.&nbsp\; That route is here:&nbsp\;<br><b
 r><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=http%3A%2F%2Fridewithgps.com%2Frout
 es%2F9554436&amp\;sa=D&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AFQjCNGHqURVA62kInWw30c4xg9QD6-Q
 zQ" target="_blank">Williams Covered Bridge\, Ridge Road &amp\; Milwaukee T
 rail 73</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20180619T002819Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot @ 39.15435\,-86.523
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Williams Covered Bridge - Leader: TBD
