  fun little route\, borrowed from<br>Gnawbone Lefty\, that we did a couple<
 br>of evenings last Winter.  The ride<br>starts / ends at the Scarce-o-Fat 
 Trail<br>parking lot at the base of Yellowwood<br>Dam.  There are sections 
 of pavement<br>riding on South Shore Drive\, Lanam<br>Ridge\, Owl Creek Roa
 d\, and Helmsberg<br>Road.  The rest is gravel.<br><br>Approximately 20 mil
 es - no single track\,<br>suitable for MTB\, gravel\, or cyclocross<br>bike
 s.<br><br>&nbsp\;<a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/Gravel_Rid
 es/GRR%20Scarce-o-Fat%2020.pdf">Scarce-o-Fat 20</a><br><br><a href="https:/
 /ridewithgps.com/routes/11973231">GPS Files</a><a><br></a>
