DESCRIPTION:This ride is mostly gravel with a section of\nlevel-ish double 
 track across Bartley Ridge.\nPark at Belmont Chapel on Lower\nSchooner Road
 \, go up Crooked Creek\nRoad\, across Bartley Ridge to TC Steele\nRoad\, ou
 t Gilmore Ridge\, down Jackass\nHill\, out to Kent Road and back to Belmont
 \nChapel.\n\nRoute is suitable for MTB\, cyclocross\,\nand gravel bikes.\n\
 nMeet at former Kmart East parking lot\n@ 5:30 to car pool to Belmont.  Rid
 e\nleaves from Belmont about 6:00pm. \n\n<a href="http://bloomingtonbicycle
 club.org/maps/Gravel_Rides/GRR%20TC%20Steele%20Ridge%20Ride%2018.pdf">GRR T
 C Steel Ridge Ride 18<a/>\n\n<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/696883
 5">GPS Files</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20171114T015519Z
LOCATION:Former K-Mart East Parking Lot @39.163177\, -86.49139
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:TC Steele Ridge Ride 18
