DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/25779028">Upper Birdie 
 Galyan and Back</a> 20 miles<br><br>The "Older\, Wiser\, and a Little Slowe
 r" training group emphasizes moderate rides\, and a route planned in advanc
 e that is posted on the ride calendar. This is a no drop ride\, but not a b
 eginner's ride. The OWLS often average 15 to 19 mph on flat roads\, and typ
 ically have an overall average moving speed between 12 and 15 mph including
  hills. Distances vary from 20 to 30 miles\, depending partly on available 
 light. Early season rides will be somewhat shorter and slower.<br><br>Quest
 ions? Contact<a href="mailto:allan.edmonds@gmail.com" target="_blank"> Alla
 n Edmonds</a>&nbsp\;or <a href="mailto:gail.morell@gmail.com" target="_blan
 k">Gail Morell</a><br><br>Starts in the parking lot of Sherwood Oaks Christ
 ian Church.
LAST-MODIFIED:20180919T201914Z
LOCATION:Sherwood Oaks Christian Church\, 2700 E Rogers Rd\, Bloomington\, 
 IN 47401\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:OWLS Upper Birdie Galyan
TRANSP:OPAQUE
