BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART:20190713T113000Z
DTEND:20190714T003000Z
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:6cu3c7s0v7qi1eefcufrqeckj6@google.com
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20190709T011738Z
DESCRIPTION:Our Pre-RAIN ride has grown into a recent tradition that allows
  our club day-of RAIN volunteers to experience all 160 hot gritty miles of 
 the RAIN ride in a small group setting before the event.  We leave Blooming
 ton early in the morning\, drive to SWMC in West Terre Haute and hit the ro
 ute about 7:30AM.  We try to have SAG support\, and provide transport from 
 Richmond back to Bloomington late Saturday evening.<br><br>In recent years 
 a group has driven over bright and early to beat the traffic and the heat.&
 nbsp\; So far\, we have one sag car committed ( three bikes) but could use 
 a second car ( and bike rack) with driver to support riders. Not interested
  in the full 160 miles?  Try a half and half with a riding buddy!<br><br>Co
 ntact Jennifer Miers (<a href="mailto:jenmiers2003@yahoo.com">jenmiers2003@
 yahoo.com</a>) for more details and to be included in the planning process.
 <br><br>&nbsp\;&nbsp\;
LAST-MODIFIED:20190709T012246Z
LOCATION:St Mary-Of-The-Woods to Richmond\, IN
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Pre RAIN
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
