 0-miler begins at the Blackwell Horse<br>Camp on Tower Ridge Road\, heads t
 o<br>Hickory Grove Church\, and then circles<br>back to the horse camp via 
 McPike Branch<br>Road and Dutch Ridge Road.  The route is<br>predominately 
 gravel with a little bit of <br>pavement\, and no trail.  Route is suitable
 <br>for CX\, gravel bike\, or MTB.<br><br>Meet at 5:30PM at the former K-Ma
 rt<br>East parking lot to car pool.  The ride<br>leaves from Blackwell Hors
 e Camp<br>about 6:00PM.<br><br>BRING LIGHTS!!<br>&nbsp\;<br><a href="http:/
 /bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/Gravel_Rides/All%20Around%20Yellowstone%20
 20.pdf">All Around Yellowstone 20</a><a><br><br></a><a href="https://ridewi
 thgps.com/routes/18155202">GPS Files</a><a></a>
