DESCRIPTION:This is a Figure-of-Eight loop from the\nKent Road Hunter Check
  In just off SR 46\neast of Bloomington.  We will decide on the\nfly which 
 way we want to do it\, either up\nJack Ass Hill or down Jack Ass Hill.  Eit
 her\nway\, you get a monster gravel hill to climb!!\n\nRide is mostly grave
 l\, with some pavement\nand a nice stretch of level double track\nalong Bar
 tley Ridge in Yellowwood State\nForest.\n\nMeet at Salt Creek Cycles @ 5:30
 \nif you want to car pool to Kent Road. \n\nBRING LIGHTS!! BRING LIGHTS!!\n
 \n<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/16959985">The Either Way You Get 
 a Monster Gravel Hill Loop 23<a/>
