 uckle descent down Lanam Ridge Hill and two good climbs up Helmsburg Hill a
 nd Bear Wallow Hill.&nbsp\; The 33 mile short option cuts off all this good
  stuff.<br><br><a href="http://www.bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/BBCMaps/
 map_pack_1/nashville_old_hilly.pdf" id="ow1730" __is_owner="true">Hilly Rou
