DESCRIPTION:<br>Join in for the first off pavement / gravel ride of the sea
 son!&nbsp\;<br><br>This 20-miler begins at the Blackwell Horse<br>Camp on T
 ower Ridge Road\, heads to<br>Hickory Grove Church\, and then circles<br>ba
 ck to the horse camp via McPike Branch<br>Road and Dutch Ridge Road.  The r
 oute is<br>predominately gravel with a little bit of <br>pavement\, and no 
 trail.  Route is suitable<br>for CX\, gravel bike\, or MTB.<br><br>Meet at 
 5:30PM at the former K-Mart<br>East parking lot to car pool.  The ride<br>l
 eaves from Blackwell Horse Camp<br>about 6:00PM.<br>&nbsp\;<br><a href="htt
 p://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/Gravel_Rides/All%20Around%20Yellowstone
 %2020.pdf" target="_blank">All Around Yellowstone 20</a><a><br><br></a><a h
 ref="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/18155202" target="_blank">GPS Files</a>
 <a></a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20180820T232847Z
LOCATION:Big K Parking Lot @ 39.162664\, -86.492045
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Gravel Ride:  All Around Yellowstone 20
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART:20200122T223000Z
DTEND:20200123T013000Z
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:20kp19v1pj4n1rp26bdiq843f3@google.com
CREATED:20200113T133515Z
DESCRIPTION:<br>The BBC will be doing the Scarce-O-Fat ride that we have do
 ne so many times with&nbsp\;<a href="https://www.facebook.com/gnawbonelefty
 ?fref=gs&amp\;__tn__=%2CdK-R-R&amp\;eid=ARA68-aNg_zIiRYUZrN6QyDKB0Rq5k3hEO4
 oFL87L5KcmHhyqjD_aIbk4E1dyxqBgkqNyPIp7niRqeC5&amp\;dti=130310323787924&amp\
 ;hc_location=group">Gnawbone Lefty</a>&nbsp\;We would like for as may of yo
 u to join us as possible. This ride will be in memory of Lefty. Let me know
  if you want to come and need a bike or lights or a jump stat... we will ma
 ke it happen&nbsp\;&nbsp\;<br><br><br>Car pool at 5:30 from Big K Parking L
 ot <br>&nbsp\;<br>The is a fun little route\, borrowed from<br>Gnawbone Lef
 ty\, that we did a couple<br>of evenings last Winter.  The ride<br>starts /
  ends at the Scarce-o-Fat Trail<br>parking lot at the base of Yellowwood<br
 >Dam.  There are sections of pavement<br>riding on South Shore Drive\, Lana
 m<br>Ridge\, Owl Creek Road\, and Helmsberg<br>Road.  The rest is gravel.<b
 r><br>Approximately 20 miles - no single track\,<br>suitable for MTB\, grav
 el\, or cyclocross<br>bikes.<br><br>&nbsp\;<a href="http://bloomingtonbicyc
 leclub.org/maps/Gravel_Rides/GRR%20Scarce-o-Fat%2020.pdf">Scarce-o-Fat 20</
 a><br><br><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/11973231">GPS Files</a><a
 ><br></a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20200114T001820Z
LOCATION:Big K Parking Lot @ 39.162664\, -86.492045
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Scarce-o-Fat 20
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART:20200618T123000Z
DTEND:20200618T143000Z
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:4df97qaslbudef09ogppg4p2ki@google.com
CREATED:20200622T003600Z
DESCRIPTION:Description:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/33026561">L
 ong Russell</a> 22 miles<br>Note modification of the initial part of the ri
 de to avoid road work at Moores Pike and 446.<br><br><br>8:30am at Sherwood
  Oaks Church<br><br>Watch the calendar for future morning rides.<br><br><i>
 Please observe social distancing norms as we gather and ride. We plan no fo
 rmal leader. EVERYONE is a leader. Familiarize yourself with the ride befor
 e heading out. We will ride in small groups. People in the last group will 
 endeavor to sweep the route and assist others as needed.</i><br><ul><li>Be 
 SAFE. Don't blow through stop signs. Consider bike lights.<br></li><li>Be C
 OURTEOUS: Single up in traffic<br></li><li>Be PREDICTABLE: Signal your inte
 ntions to cars and fellow riders.</li></ul>This branch of the OWLS training
  group also emphasizes somewhat slower\, moderate rides\, and a route plann
 ed in advance that is posted on the ride calendar. This is a no drop ride\,
  but not a beginner's ride. Expect an overall average moving speed 11 - 15 
 mph including hills. Distances vary from 20 to 30 miles. Early season rides
  will be somewhat shorter and slower. Rides depart promptly at 8:30am.<br><
 br>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered
 .com/get_information.php?event_id=133776">free trial membership</a>\, good 
 for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing a liabili
 ty waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.<br><br>Questions? Contact <a href
 ="mailto:allan.edmonds@gmail.com">Allan Edmonds</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20200622T003713Z
LOCATION:Sherwood Oaks Christian Church\, 2700 E Rogers Rd\, Bloomington\, 
 IN 47401\, USA\, 
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Early Bird Ride
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
