DESCRIPTION:This 20-miler begins at the Blackwell Horse\nCamp on Tower Ridg
 e Road\, heads to\nHickory Grove Church\, and then circles\nback to the hor
 se camp via McPike Branch\nRoad and Dutch Ridge Road.  The route is\npredom
 inately gravel with a little bit of \npavement\, and no trail.  Route is su
 itable\nfor CX\, gravel bike\, or MTB.\n\nMeet at 5:30PM at the former K-Ma
 rt\nEast parking lot to car pool.  The ride\nleaves from Blackwell Horse Ca
 mp\nabout 6:00PM.\n\nBRING LIGHTS!!\n \n<a href="http://bloomingtonbicyclec
 lub.org/maps/Gravel_Rides/All%20Around%20Yellowstone%2020.pdf">All Around Y
 ellowstone 20<a/>\n\n<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/18155202">GPS 
 Files<a/>
LAST-MODIFIED:20180226T132728Z
LOCATION:Big K Parking Lot @ 39.162664\, -86.492045
SEQUENCE:3
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:All Around Yellowstone 20
