 asizes moderate rides\, and a route planned in advance that is posted on th
 e ride calendar. This is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride. The OW
 LS often average 15 to 19 mph on flat roads\, and typically have an overall
  average moving speed between 13 and 15 mph including hills. Early season r
 ides will be somewhat shorter and slower.\n\nStarts in the parking lot at S
 herwood Oaks Christian Church: <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/place//
 @39.135188\,-86.500368\,1155m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0x0">Map</a>\n
