DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:6gloev3bked22g2b4knkki0u3v@google.com
CREATED:20200302T150145Z
DESCRIPTION:<br><ul><li>Be SAFE. Don't blow through stop signs. Consider bi
 ke lights.<br></li><li>Be COURTEOUS: Single up in traffic<br></li><li>Be PR
 EDICTABLE: Signal your intentions to cars and fellow riders.</li></ul>The "
 Older\, Wiser\, and a Little Slower" training group emphasizes moderate rid
 es\, and a route planned in advance that is posted on the ride calendar. Th
 is is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride. The OWLS often average 15
  to 19 mph on flat roads\, and typically have an overall average moving spe
 ed between 12 and 15 mph including hills. Distances vary from 20 to 30 mile
 s\, depending partly on available light. Early season rides will be somewha
 t shorter and slower. Rides depart promptly at 5:45.<br><br>Non-members wil
 l be required to sign a <a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1jDxK92FPg
 pyvj2cCT7vV2S8RZTWDR_RH/view">liability waiver</a> prior to participation.<
 br><br>Questions? Contact <a href="mailto:allan.edmonds@gmail.com">Allan Ed
 monds</a> or <a href="mailto:gail.morell@gmail.com">Gail Morell</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20200614T124519Z
LOCATION:Sherwood Oaks Christian Church\, 2700 E Rogers Rd\, Bloomington\, 
 IN 47401\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:OWLS Ride
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART:20190615T130000Z
DTEND:20190615T180000Z
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:4jta6o4v7r5tu24jo10r6sj7li@google.com
CREATED:20180603T140357Z
DESCRIPTION:<br>This is a little loop invented by the OWLs a while back\, a
 nd features a couple of roads west of SR 37 that we do not travel very ofte
 n\, as well as descent of "Big Judah".<br><br>Despite the name\, we will st
 art and finish from Bryan Park.&nbsp\; Also\, since the Trailhead Pizza\, l
 ocated at SR 446 and Pine Grove Road\, does not open until 4 PM\, we are pl
 anning to stop at the Cabin across the street from Trailhead for some food 
 and drink toward the end of the ride.&nbsp\; From the Cabin\, it is a short
  ride back into town.<br><br>Since South Rogers is currently closed to thru
  traffic at Gordon Pike\, we will access SR 37 South via Cardinal Glen / Fa
 irfax / Church Lane going out of town.<br><br><a href="https://bloomingtonb
 icycleclub.org/maps/John_Bassett_Maps/Long_Way_to_Trailhead_Pizza_49.pdf" t
 arget="_blank">Long Way to Trailhead Pizza 49</a><br><br><a href="https://r
 idewithgps.com/routes/26905088" target="_blank">GPS Files</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20190610T010535Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot @ 39.15435\,-86.523
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Long Way to Trailhead Pizza 49 - Leader: Gail Morell & Mark Gehlhau
 sen
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
