DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/25139570">Up Koontz and
  Back Ison</a> 25 miles.\n\nThe "Older\, Wiser\, and a Little Slower" train
 ing group emphasizes moderate rides\, and a route planned in advance that i
 s posted on the ride calendar. This is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner'
 s ride. The OWLS often average 15 to 19 mph on flat roads\, and typically h
 ave an overall average moving speed between 13 and 15 mph including hills. 
 Early season rides will be somewhat shorter and slower.\n\nStarts in the pa
 rking lot at Sherwood Oaks Christian Church: <a href="https://www.google.co
 m/maps/place//@39.135188\,-86.500368\,1155m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0x0
 ">Map</a>\n
