CREATED:20180126T150359Z
DESCRIPTION:&nbsp\;THIS RIDE IS CANCELED FOR TODAY CHECK BACK FOR UPDATES<b
 r><br><br>This is a special one way gravel / trail ride<br>starting at Trai
 lhead Pizza and finishing<br>at the Hollis Cabin on Berry Ridge Road<br>in 
 Brown County.  The route is out<br>McGowan Road\, up Jack Ass Hill\, and ov
 er<br>on Gilmore Ridge to TC Steele.  The <br>route then follows mostly dou
 ble<br>track (Bartley Ridge and Miller Ridge)<br>and easy single track (Tra
 il D) southeast<br>to Blue Creek Road\, Elkinsville Road\, <br>Story\, 135 
 South\, Mt Nebo Road\, and<br>finally Berry Ridge Road to the Cabin.<br><br
 >The ride starts at Trailhead Pizza<br>(park across the street at the old l
 og<br>church) located at the intersection of<br>SR 446 and Pine Grove Road.
  <br><br>Since this is a one way ride we need to<br>carefully arrange trans
 port back from<br>the Cabin.  Drivers will pack dry clothes<br>and any end-
 of-ride items you need to<br>Brown County.  We have a couple of<br>voluntee
 rs\, but more may be needed.<br><br>Contact Warren or John B if you are int
 erested in<br>this adventure.<br><a href="http://www.google.com/url?q=http%
 3A%2F%2Fgoog_662095407&amp\;sa=D&amp\;sntz=1&amp\;usg=AFQjCNEI4Hz5R8FgKHKs1
 x4o3jmE0-TkrA" target="_blank"><br></a><br><a href="mailto:bigredballons@ms
 n.com" target="_blank">bigredballons@msn.com</a><br><br><a href="mailto:jba
 ssett@bluemarble.net" target="_blank">jbassett@bluemarble.net</a><br><br><a
  href="https://www.google.com/url?q=http%3A%2F%2Fbloomingtonbicycleclub.org
 %2Fmaps%2FGravel_Rides%2FTrail%2520D%2520to%2520Cabin%252030.pdf&amp\;sa=D&
 amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AFQjCNF8s6UOgK7JEhmRkuPVkjIwGrbsEw" target="_blank">Tra
 il D to the Cabin 30</a><br><br><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https
 %3A%2F%2Fridewithgps.com%2Froutes%2F18235483&amp\;sa=D&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=
 AFQjCNHS9WrJuBjzrnM6qyVXMCEdvXpO8Q" target="_blank">GPS Files</a><a></a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20180127T191242Z
LOCATION:Trailhead Pizzeria\, 4303 S State Rd 446\, Bloomington\, IN 47401\
 , USA
