UID:2rdu19hvql7losu6ieetu2hka7@google.com
CREATED:20190515T112701Z
DESCRIPTION:Have you ever wanted to learn more about mountain biking? If th
 e answer is yes\, then this class is for you. This is an introductory class
  that is being offered free to all BBC members.\n\nThe class would be held 
 on Sunday June 9th.  It will be held here in Btown at RCA park.. If you hav
 e a mountain bike please bring it. If you do not have one please let me kno
 w and I will try to see that you have one for the day. \n\nThe class will c
 over things like.\n\nBike set up\, Vision\, small obstacles\, trail scan\, 
 pedal wheelie/coaster wheelie\, cornering\, and switch backs. More if time 
 permits.\n\nClass size is limited to 12. The class would run from 10:00 AM 
 until 4:00PM. The goal is to make this fun and interesting with hopes to se
 e you on a mountain bike enjoying the trails soon. Please let me know if yo
 u are interested.\n\ncontact Warren Smith\nbigredballoons@msn.com
LAST-MODIFIED:20190515T112702Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Mountain Bike Class
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
