CREATED:20200527T005711Z
DESCRIPTION:We thought we would try this relatively easy ride for the secon
 d ride in our Saturdary restart series.&nbsp\; Historically\, the Paragon R
 ide crossed SR 37 at Turkey Track Road / Pine Road.  With the advent of I-6
 9 that crossing no longer exists\, so we add a mile or two and use Godsey R
 oad east of Paragon to cross I-69 at the Liberty Church Road exit.  From th
 ere we’ll take a new access road and SR 37 straight back to Bloomington for
  a total of about 47 miles.  Be sure to check out the bike path to nowhere 
 just beyond the Hacker Creek turnoff about Mile 29 on the route.<br><br><a 
 href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/John_Bassett_Maps/Paragon_Ride
 _2018_Version_47.pdf">Paragon Ride 2018 Version 47</a><br><br><a href="http
 s://ridewithgps.com/routes/28782934">GPS Files</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20200527T010011Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Paragon Ride - Ride Leader: Everyone
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
