 sell</a> 27 miles.\n\nThe "Older\, Wiser\, and a Little Slower" training gr
 oup emphasizes moderate rides\, and a route planned in advance that is post
 ed on the ride calendar. This is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride
 . The OWLS often average 15 to 19 mph on flat roads\, and typically have an
  overall average moving speed between 13 and 15 mph including hills. Early 
 season rides will be somewhat shorter and slower.\n\nStarts in the parking 
 lot at Sherwood Oaks Christian Church: <a href="https://www.google.com/maps
 /place//@39.135188\,-86.500368\,1155m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0x0">Map<
 /a>\n
