DTSTART:20180707T113000Z
DTEND:20180708T003000Z
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:5r3i531gp4pm1g7ke148ljtado@google.com
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20180625T234152Z
DESCRIPTION:\nOur Pre-RAIN ride has grown into a recent tradition that allo
 ws our club day-of RAIN volunteers to experience all 160 hot gritty miles o
 f the RAIN ride in a small group setting before the event.  We leave Bloomi
 ngton early in the morning\, drive to SWMC in West Terre Haute and hit the 
 route about 7:30AM.  We try to have SAG support\, and provide transport fro
 m Richmond back to Bloomington late Saturday evening.  Not interested in th
 e full 160 miles?  Try a half and half with a riding buddy!  Contact John B
  (jbassett@bluemarble.net) for more details and to be included in the plann
 ing process.\n\n  
LAST-MODIFIED:20180625T234152Z
LOCATION:St Mary-Of-The-Woods to Richmond\, IN
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Pre RAIN
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
