 son progresses\, and pace is anticipated to be 15-17 mph.  The rides will s
 tart promptly at 5:45 with or without a scheduled leader.  Riders are expec
 ted to look out for each other during the ride. Ride maps and GPS links wil
 l be posted here in advance.  Riders unfamiliar with the route should bring
  along a copy of the map. Non-members should download and bring a signed co
 py of the liability waiver to the ride.<br><br><a href="http://bloomingtonb
 icycleclub.org/maps/iRides/Ellettsville_Loop_iRide_Long_29.pdf" id="ow299" 
 __is_owner="true">Ellettsville Loop iRide Long 29</a><br><br><br><a href="h
 ttps://ridewithgps.com/routes/28448443" id="ow311" __is_owner="true">GPS Fi
 les</a>
