CREATED:20170208T175811Z
DESCRIPTION:Join in for a fun gravel ride through\nthe enchanted Hoosier Na
 tional Forest.\nThe 21 mile route begins at the Hickory\nRidge Fire Tower o
 n Tower Ridge\nRoad\, ventures south to Henderson\nCreek Road and Norman\, 
 and returns\nto the fire tower via Hickory Grove\nChurch and along the cres
 t of\nHickory Ridge.\n\nRoute is entirely gravel and pavement\n- no trail.\
 n\nMeet at 5:30PM at the former K-Mart\nEast parking lot to car pool. The r
 ide\nleaves from the fire tower about 6:10PM.\nBRING LIGHTS!!\n\n<a href="h
 ttp://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/Gravel_Rides/Henderson%20Creek%20&%20
 Hickory%20Ridge%20from%20the%20Fire%20Tower%2021.pdf">Henderson Creek and H
 ickory Ridge 21</a>\n\n<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/17885726">GP
 S Files</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20171023T003252Z
LOCATION:Big K Parking Lot @ 39.162664\, -86.492045
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:GRR Henderson Creek and Hickory Ridge Fire Tower 21
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-APPLE-TRAVEL-ADVISORY-BEHAVIOR:AUTOMATIC
END:VEVENT
