DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/22787948">Harmony Hills
 </a> 27 miles<br><br>The "Older\, Wiser\, and a Little Slower" training gro
 up emphasizes moderate rides\, and a route planned in advance that is poste
 d on the ride calendar. This is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride.
  The OWLS often average 15 to 19 mph on flat roads\, and typically have an 
 overall average moving speed between 12 and 15 mph including hills. Distanc
 es vary from 20 to 30 miles\, depending partly on available light. Early se
 ason rides will be somewhat shorter and slower.<br><br>Questions? Contact<a
  href="mailto:allan.edmonds@gmail.com" target="_blank"> Allan Edmonds</a>&n
 bsp\;or <a href="mailto:gail.morell@gmail.com" target="_blank">Gail Morell<
 /a><br><br>Starts in the parking lot of Sherwood Oaks Christian Church.
