 k Rd\, and<br>back to the Fire Tower.  This is mostly gravel\,<br>with a li
 ttle pavement.<br><br>Meet at the East Side K-mart 5:30 to carpool<br>or me
 et at Fire Tower 6:00PM.<br><br><a href="https://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org
