BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART:20171018T213000Z
DTEND:20171019T010000Z
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:feg3tmf3rp74btk6mkk841qclc@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID:19700101T000000Z
CREATED:20160825T135222Z
DESCRIPTION:This is a Ride not to miss.. The fall foliage is at it's peak. 
 This will be the last week for extended daylight hours so we what to take a
 dvantage of the time & light.\n\nWe will sart at the Crooked Creek Boat Ram
 p go up Elkinsville Rd across lake Monroe\n(No water to deal with this year
  it's gravel crosssing ) to Elkinsville\, up Combs Rd to the Nebo Connector
 \, and down Nebo to the North parking lot. Then it's up Blue Creek Rd to Tr
 ail D\, up Trail D to Miller Ridge\, and down the water bars to Crooked Cre
 ek Rd back to the parking lot - a total of 18.4 beautiful miles.\n\nPLEASE 
 DON'T MISS THIS ONE.\nMeet at Big K parking lot @ 5:30 to car pool to grave
 l ride\n\nBRING LIGHTS! BRING LIGHTS! BRING LIGHTS!\n\n<a href="http://bloo
 mingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/Gravel_Rides/Reverse%20Blue%20Creek%20Elkinsvil
 le%20Loop%20Plus%20Trail%20D%2018.pdf">Reverse Blue Creek Elkinsville Loop 
 + Trail D<a/>\n<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/17463607">GPS Files"
 <a/>
LAST-MODIFIED:20171129T223437Z
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Best Off Road Ride Ever!
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
X-APPLE-TRAVEL-ADVISORY-BEHAVIOR:AUTOMATIC
