DESCRIPTION:The BBC Saturday Touring rides vary from 24 to about 100 miles\
 , and are intended for riders in reasonable physical condition who enjoy ri
 ding in a group setting.  Routes are posted here in advance as printable PD
 F maps and queue sheets with links to GPS files for navigation.  We endeavo
 r to have a leader for each of these rides.  Unless otherwise posted\, all 
 rides leave from the pool parking lot on the east side of Bryan Park\, Bloo
 mington.  Start times vary from 1:00 PM in March to 8:00 AM during the warm
 er summer months.  These rides are a great opportunity to engage with your 
 fellow club members in a relaxed touring pace cycling format. 
