CREATED:20200306T013748Z
DESCRIPTION:This series will restart our Tuesday / Thursday evening evening
  club rides and will last for a couple of weeks. This will be a no-drop\, m
 ixed-group ride with riders of various abilities.  It is anticipated that t
 he ride will split into various groups by speed as the ride progresses and 
 a staggered start may be employed to limit riders in a group to manageable 
 numbers.  The rides will start promptly at 5:45 from Bryan Park.  Riders ar
 e expected to look out for each other during the ride.&nbsp\; Ride maps and
  GPS links will be posted here in advance.&nbsp\; Non-members should sign u
 p for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?eve
 nt_id=133776">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and 
