DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/31260886">15.5 Shadysid
 e</a>.&nbsp\; Optional addition: Down the hill to the Moores Creek Boat Ram
 p<br>STAY TUNED FOR ANY CLUB DECISIONS ABOUT CANCELLING RIDES<br><ul><li>Be
  SAFE. Don't blow through stop signs. Consider bike lights.<br></li><li>Be 
 COURTEOUS: Single up in traffic<br></li><li>Be PREDICTABLE: Signal your int
 entions to cars and fellow riders.</li></ul>The "Older\, Wiser\, and a Litt
 le Slower" training group emphasizes moderate rides\, and a route planned i
 n advance that is posted on the ride calendar. This is a no drop ride\, but
  not a beginner's ride. The OWLS often average 15 to 19 mph on flat roads\,
  and typically have an overall average moving speed between 12 and 15 mph i
 ncluding hills. Distances vary from 20 to 30 miles\, depending partly on av
 ailable light. Early season rides will be somewhat shorter and slower. Ride
 s depart promptly at 5:45.<br><br>Non-members should sign up for a <a href=
 "https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=133776">fr
 ee trial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes e
 lectronically signing a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.<br
 ><br>Questions? Contact <a href="mailto:allan.edmonds@gmail.com">Allan Edmo
 nds</a> or <a href="mailto:gail.morell@gmail.com">Gail Morell</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20200614T124519Z
LOCATION:Sherwood Oaks Christian Church\, 2700 E Rogers Rd\, Bloomington\, 
 IN 47401\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:CANCELED OWLS Ride
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
