DESCRIPTION:Join us for this last official Death March Training ride.<br><b
 r>We will start out at Blackwell horse camp\, ride East on Tower Ridge\, to
  Robinson\, out to Houston then back to Maumee\, up to Hichory Grove<br>and
  down the ridge to 446. West to the new check points at Bartlettsville\, ba
 ck to start. About 46 Miles. CX bike or MTB. If trails stay wet we will opt
  for all road.<br><br>We will get together after the ride at Scenic-view Re
 staurant on 446 for some season end libations....<br><br>Meet at old Karmar
 t parking lot 10:00AM to carpool to Blackwell or meet at Blackwell for a 10
 :45AM Start.<br><br><br><br><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/2694514
 0" target="_blank">Death March Training V4.1</a>
