DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/31260886">15.5 Shadysid
 e</a>.&nbsp\; Optional addition: Down the hill to the Moores Creek Boat Ram
 p<br><ul><li>Be SAFE. Don't blow through stop signs. Consider bike lights.<
 br></li><li>Be COURTEOUS: Single up in traffic<br></li><li>Be PREDICTABLE: 
 Signal your intentions to cars and fellow riders.</li></ul>The "Older\, Wis
 er\, and a Little Slower" training group emphasizes moderate rides\, and a 
 route planned in advance that is posted on the ride calendar. This is a no 
 drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride. The OWLS often average 15 to 19 mph 
 on flat roads\, and typically have an overall average moving speed between 
 12 and 15 mph including hills. Distances vary from 20 to 30 miles\, dependi
 ng partly on available light. Early season rides will be somewhat shorter a
 nd slower. Rides depart promptly at 5:45.<br><br>Non-members should sign up
  for a&nbsp\;<a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.ph
 p?event_id=133776">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\,
  and which includes electronically signing a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior
  to participation.<br><br>Questions? Contact <a href="mailto:allan.edmonds@
 gmail.com">Allan Edmonds</a> or <a href="mailto:gail.morell@gmail.com">Gail
  Morell</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20200614T124519Z
LOCATION:Sherwood Oaks Christian Church\, 2700 E Rogers Rd\, Bloomington\, 
 IN 47401\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:OWLS Ride
TRANSP:OPAQUE
