 bsp\; STAY TUNED\, WE MAY TRY SUNDAY!<br><br>This has been a very popular r
 ide since its inception three years ago\, and we again have the pleasure of
  its inventor\, Bob DeGroff\, serving as ride leader.&nbsp\; We'll take the
  new Kinser Pike / I69 bridge to Bottom Road to get out in the county.&nbsp
 \; We make a big loop up north crossing I69 at Godsey Road. We continue nor
 th to Martinsville\, and return to Bloomington via Low Gap and Anderson Roa
 ds\, for a total distance of about 55 miles.<br><br><a href="https://www.go
 ogle.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fbloomingtonbicycleclub.org%2Fmaps%2FJohn_Basse
