BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART:20200118T180000Z
DTEND:20200118T230000Z
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:2dm4bb9q7bs7q7qcu8km4ke34p@google.com
CREATED:20200113T175013Z
DESCRIPTION:<br><b>THIS RIDE IS MOVED TO A 1:45 START. MEET AT OLD K-MART 1
 :00 PM TO CARPOOL TO HARD TRUTH</b><br><b><br></b>Join in for a fun Brown C
 ounty gravel ride starting and ending at Hard Truth in Nashville.&nbsp\; Th
 is is a loop ride borrowed from Jeff Fetterer and has its fair share of ups
  and downs.&nbsp\; With the exception of Covered Bridge Road the clockwise 
 loop generally goes down the steep grades and up the gentler grades.&nbsp\;
  Get to near the top of Bear Wallow Hill without ever being on Bear Wallow 
 Hill Road. And\, finish up with a great gravel decent on Wallow Hollow.<br>
 <br><br>Route is entirely gravel and pavement&nbsp\;- no trail.&nbsp\;<br>&
 nbsp\;<br><br>Stick around at Hard Truth after the ride for some great Big 
 Woods food and beverages.<br><br>Meet at 1:00 PM at the former K-Mart&nbsp\
 ;East parking lot to car pool to Nashville.&nbsp\; &nbsp\;The ride&nbsp\;le
 aves from Hard Truth about 1:45.<br><br><a href="https://bloomingtonbicycle
 club.org/maps/Gravel_Rides/Jeff-s_Salmeron_-_Wallow_Hollow_Loop_from_Hard_T
 ruth_29.pdf">PDF Map and Queue Sheet</a><br><br><a href="https://ridewithgp
 s.com/routes/31648043">GPS Files</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20200118T123922Z
LOCATION:Big K Parking Lot @ 39.162664\, -86.492045
SEQUENCE:6
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Jeff's Salmeron / Wallow Hollow Loop from Hard Truth 29man 
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
