 ute planned in advance that is posted on the ride calendar. This is a no dr
 op ride\, but not a beginner's ride. The OWLS often average 15 to 19 mph on
  flat roads\, and typically have an overall average moving speed between 13
  and 15 mph including hills. Early season rides will be somewhat shorter an
 d slower.\n\nStarts in the parking lot at Sherwood Oaks Christian Church: <
