  scattered on the west side\nof the road.\n\nWe will bypass all of the SR 3
 7 construction\nand add a little spice to our lives by taking\nLiberty Loop
  and Hacker Creek Road back to\nBloomington.  Yes\, this includes the infam
 ous\nHacker Creek Hill heading up into Morgan\nMonroe from the lowlands  !!
  \n\n<a href="http://www.bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/private/BBCMaps/map_pac
 k_2/low_gap_touchables.pdf">Low Gap to Martinsville ("The Touchables")</a>\
