DESCRIPTION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot  <a href="https://www.google.com/ma
 ps/place//@39.1543611\,-86.523\,15z">map</a><br><br>Pretty hilly either way
  you cut it-- 54 miles standard\, or 43 mile short option (Solsberry and ba
 ck). Find relief on either route at&nbsp\;Yoho's Grocery in Solsberry. Do t
 ake the county<br>road down from the new observation platform&nbsp\;to see 
 the railroad trestle up close and personal.&nbsp\;&nbsp\;It's impressive!<b
 r><br>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregiste
 red.com/get_information.php?event_id=133776">free trial membership</a>\, go
 od for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing a liab
 ility waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.&nbsp\;&nbsp\;<br><br><a href="
 http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/John_Bassett_Maps/Tulip_Trestle_2017
 _Version_54.pdf">Tulip Trestle 2017 Version 54</a><br><br><a href="https://
 ridewithgps.com/routes/24710235">GPS Files</a><a> </a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20200616T014005Z
