 res the 2019 West of 446 Check points for the <br>Death March. It Starts an
 d finishes at Blackwell Horse camp<br><br>Route is entirely gravel and pave
 ment\,<br>no trail.<br><br>Meet at 5:30 pm at the former K-Mart<br>East par
 king lot to car pool.  The ride<br>leaves from Blackwell horse camp  about 
 6:00PM.<br><br>Bring Lights!<br><br><br><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/ro
 utes/31605414" target="_blank">Death March West CP&#39\;S</a>
