DESCRIPTION:This is a fun\, moderate 60 mile ride that incorporates some fa
 st flats and just a few healthy climbs.&nbsp\; We'll do a couple of modific
 ations to the traditional route to accommodate the new traffic patterns res
 ultant from I-69 and bypass some climbs on busy SR 45 on the return route.<
 br><br>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregist
 ered.com/get_information.php?event_id=133776">free trial membership</a>\, g
 ood for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing a lia
 bility waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.&nbsp\;&nbsp\;<br><br><a href=
 "http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/John_Bassett_Maps/M_-_M_-Martinsvil
 le-Mahalasville-_via_South_Shore_60.pdf">M&amp\;M Ride (Martinsville-Mahala
 sville) via South Shore</a><br><br><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/
 27498299">GPS Files</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20200609T132635Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot @ 39.15435\,-86.523\, 
