UID:6493lo23hltp408cpb9auek9gu_R20180503T214500@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20181025T174500
CREATED:20180302T015448Z
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/28617545">Swartz Ridge 
 Loop</a> 16 miles<br><br>The "Older\, Wiser\, and a Little Slower" training
  group emphasizes moderate rides\, and a route planned in advance that is p
 osted on the ride calendar. This is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's r
 ide. The OWLS often average 15 to 19 mph on flat roads\, and typically have
  an overall average moving speed between 12 and 15 mph including hills. Dis
 tances vary from 20 to 30 miles\, depending partly on available light. Earl
 y season rides will be somewhat shorter and slower.<br><br>Questions? Conta
 ct<a href="mailto:allan.edmonds@gmail.com" target="_blank"> Allan Edmonds</
 a>&nbsp\;or <a href="mailto:gail.morell@gmail.com" target="_blank">Gail Mor
 ell</a><br><br>Starts in the parking lot of Sherwood Oaks Christian Church.
LAST-MODIFIED:20191030T025558Z
LOCATION:Sherwood Oaks Christian Church\, 2700 E Rogers Rd\, Bloomington\, 
 IN 47401\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:OWLS Swartz Ridge Loop
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
