 urch Over to Trail 15 out to Callahan up trail 16 to Cornett over to Thomps
 on out to Houston over to Robinson and Back to Blackwell.&nbsp\;<br><br>We 
 will get together after the ride at Scenic-View Restaurant on 446 for some 
 season end libations....<br><br>Meet at old K-Mart parking lot 10:00AM to c
 arpool to Blackwell or meet at Blackwell for a 10:30 AM Start.<br><br><br><
 a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/Gravel_Rides/Blackwell_to_Ca
 llahan_to_Houston_36.pdf" target="_blank">Blackwell to Callahan to Houston 
 36</a><br><br><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/29406201" target="_bl
 ank">GPS Files with Death March Checkpoints</a>
