 dvance that is posted on the ride calendar. This is a no drop ride\, but no
 t a beginner's ride. The OWLS often average 15 to 19 mph on flat roads\, an
 d typically have an overall average moving speed between 12 and 15 mph incl
 uding hills. Distances vary from 20 to 30 miles\, depending partly on avail
 able light. Early season rides will be somewhat shorter and slower.</span><
 br><br><span><br></span><br><span>Starts in the parking lot of Sherwood Oak
 s Christian Church.</span>
