 ps/place//@39.1543611\,-86.523\,15z">map</a><br><br>See Lake Monroe from ev
 ery angle without benefit of a boat ! Spoil the normally pleasant ride arou
 nd Lak Monroe by descending &amp\; climbing all the boat ramps. There are n
 ine of them\, plus many assorted hills in between! &nbsp\;<br>Monster versi
 on (all ramps and hills): 70 miles&nbsp\;<br><br>Wimp version:  44 miles<br
 ><br>After the ride enjoy a pot luck cookout at the Powers residence\, foll
 owing our recent tradition.&nbsp\; Details to follow!<br><br><a href="http:
 //bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/John_Bassett_Maps/Tour_de_Ramps_-_JP_70.p
 df">Tour de Ramps - JP 70</a><br><br><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/route
 s/25055413">GPS Files</a><a></a>
