 f the liability waiver to the ride.<br><br>NOTE:&nbsp\; To avoid constructi
 on in Lower Cascades Park\, return route should follow Business 37 up the h
 ill into town.&nbsp\; Business 37 has wide shoulders\, a bike lane\, and a 
