CREATED:20180520T002718Z
DESCRIPTION:<br><br>RESCHEDULED FROM SATURDAY !<br><br>This has been a very
  popular ride since its inception three years ago\, and we again have the p
 leasure of its inventor\, Bob DeGroff\, serving as ride leader.&nbsp\; We'l
 l take the new Kinser Pike / I69 bridge to Bottom Road to get out in the co
 unty.&nbsp\; We make a big loop up north crossing I69 at Godsey Road. We co
 ntinue north to Martinsville\, and return to Bloomington via Low Gap and An
 derson Roads\, for a total distance of about 55 miles.<br><br><a href="http
 s://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fbloomingtonbicycleclub.org%2Fmaps%2F
 John_Bassett_Maps%2FGodsey_Ride_55.pdf&amp\;sa=D&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AFQjCN
 E2s8AnjkkF_a9UiLDsO8-cG3RLQw" target="_blank">Godsey Ride 55</a><br><br><a 
 href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fridewithgps.com%2Froutes%2
 F27424466&amp\;sa=D&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AFQjCNE8jvF_RfMbOeP6-PbpkS4Qs8Xq9A"
  target="_blank"><u></u>GPS<u></u><u></u> <u></u>Links<u></u><u></u></a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20180520T002719Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot @ 39.15435\,-86.523
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Godsey Ride - Leader: Bob DeGroff
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
