DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/22503400">Dam Overlook 
 and Moores Creek</a> 29 miles\, 1293 feet climbing\, max grade 7.7%. Short 
 option omits the Stipp-Moores Creek loop at the end.\n\nThe "Older\, Wiser\
 , and a Little Slower" training group emphasizes moderate rides\, and a rou
 te planned in advance that is posted on the ride calendar. This is a no dro
 p ride\, but not a beginner's ride. The OWLS often average 15 to 19 mph on 
 flat roads\, and typically have an overall average moving speed between 13 
 and 15 mph including hills. Early season rides will be somewhat shorter and
  slower.\n\nStarts in the parking lot at Sherwood Oaks Christian Church: <a
  href="https://www.google.com/maps/place//@39.135188\,-86.500368\,1155m/dat
 a=!3m1!1e3!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0x0">Map</a>\n
