DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/578589">Up the Dam Hill
 </a> 26 miles.Re-do after last week's washout.\n\nThe "Older\, Wiser\, and 
 a Little Slower" training group emphasizes moderate rides\, and a route pla
 nned in advance that is posted on the ride calendar. This is a no drop ride
 \, but not a beginner's ride. The OWLS often average 15 to 19 mph on flat r
 oads\, and typically have an overall average moving speed between 13 and 15
  mph including hills. Early season rides will be somewhat shorter and slowe
 r.\n\nStarts in the parking lot at Sherwood Oaks Christian Church: <a href=
 "https://www.google.com/maps/place//@39.135188\,-86.500368\,1155m/data=!3m1
 !1e3!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0x0">Map</a>\n
