DESCRIPTION:<br>The BBC's historic Paragon Ride is one of those that was hi
 ghly impacted by I-69 construction.  So\, Joe Anderson has suggested this n
 ew\, modified route which adds a little bit of distance and some new roads.
   The route goes first to Paragon\, then north a little before returning so
 uth through Gosport.  Joe will personally lead this one\, and we are pretty
  excited about that.<br><br>We have both a home IU football game and constr
 uction in Lower Cascades Park to work around\, so the start of the ride lik
 ely change from the version posted here.&nbsp\; We'll let Joe figure that o
 ut.&nbsp\; Just follow him\; he knows the way!<br><br><a href="https://bloo
 mingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/John_Bassett_Maps/Joes_Paragon_and_Gosport_Ride
 _57.pdf" id="ow468" __is_owner="true">Joe's Paragon and Gosport Ride 57</a>
 <br><br><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/31135553" id="ow506" __is_o
 wner="true">GPS Files</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20190924T000119Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot @ 39.15435\,-86.523
SEQUENCE:8
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Joe's Paragon and Gosport Ride 57 - Leader:  Joe Anderson
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
