DESCRIPTION:This 20-miler begins at the Blackwell Horse<br>Camp on Tower Ri
 dge Road\, heads to<br>Hickory Grove Church\, and then circles<br>back to t
 he horse camp via McPike Branch<br>Road and Dutch Ridge Road.  The route is
 <br>predominately gravel with a little bit of <br>pavement\, and no trail. 
  Route is suitable<br>for CX\, gravel bike\, or MTB.<br><br>Meet at 5:30PM 
 at the former K-Mart<br>East parking lot to car pool.  The ride<br>leaves f
 rom Blackwell Horse Camp<br>about 6:00PM.<br>&nbsp\;<br><a href="http://blo
 omingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/Gravel_Rides/All%20Around%20Yellowstone%2020.p
 df">All Around Yellowstone 20</a><a><br><br></a><a href="https://ridewithgp
 s.com/routes/18155202">GPS Files</a><a></a>
