DESCRIPTION:<br>Join us on this training run for the March 9th<br>Death Mar
 ch! The route is a mix of<br>one-third gravel in and around the<br>Hoosier 
 National Forest and two-thirds<br>pavement with a short stretch along<br>13
 5. Suitable for MTB<br>and CX bikes.<br><br>Meet at the former Big K parkin
 g lot<br>on East Third Street at 10:00 to car<br>pool. Ride will leave from
  the Hickory<br>Ridge Fire Tower on Tower Ridge Road<br>about 10:40.<br><br
 ><br><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/29323390" id="ow745" __is_owne
 r="true"> Gravel Grovel New Check Points</a>
