DESCRIPTION:Meet at Hesitation Point Parking Lot in\nBC Park for a delightf
 ul reprise run down\nthe Hobbs Hollow Flow Trail.  If we can\nswing it\, we
  will do a self-shuttle down\nto the North Parking Lot\, and a one-way\nrid
 e including Hobbs\, Green Valley\, North\nTower Connector\, and Pine.  Othe
 rwise\,\nwe can return to Hesitation Point via the\nHesitation Point Trail.
 \n\nMeet at former K-mart East 5:30 to car pool to\nBrown County State Park
 .  Adventure will\nleave from the Hesitation Point about 6:00 PM.\n\nMTB On
 ly.  Bring park pass and Trail\nPermit. \n\nBring lights! Bring lights! Bri
 ng Lights!\n\n<a href="https://www.mtbproject.com/">Trail maps for GPS or p
 hone<a/>
LAST-MODIFIED:20181021T161927Z
LOCATION:Brown County State Park\, Hesitation Point Parking Lot @39.169441\
 , -86.237076
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Brown County State Park MTB
TRANSP:OPAQUE
