 ower on Tower Ridge<br>Road\, ventures south to Henderson<br>Creek Road and
  Norman\, and returns<br>to the fire tower via Hickory Grove<br>Church and 
 along the crest of<br>Hickory Ridge.<br><br>Route is entirely gravel and pa
 vement<br>- no trail.<br><br>Meet at 10:0AM&nbsp\; at the former K-Mart<br>
 East parking lot to car pool. The ride<br>leaves from the fire tower about 
 10:45.<br>&nbsp\;<br><br><br><a href="https://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/ma
 ps/Gravel_Rides/Henderson%20Creek%20&%20Hickory%20Ridge%20from%20the%20Fire
 %20Tower%2021.pdf">PDF Map and Queue Sheet</a><br><br><a href="https://ride
 withgps.com/routes/31412541">Fire Tower to Norman</a>
