  nor sleet nor snow nor roving bands of scary monsters will keep us from th
 e streets! If you can ride on this day\, you can ride any day.<br><br>Satur
 day\,February 24 meet at 9:45am ride at 10am Starts &amp\; ends at Lennie’s
  1795 E. 10th St.<br><br>All ages welcome! 3 or 8 mile routes through Bloom
 ington.<br><br>After-ride brunch at Lennie’s! Ride participants will enjoy 
