DESCRIPTION:<font color="#000000" face="Times New Roman" size="3"></font><p
 ><font color="#000000" face="Calibri" size="3">Join in for a pleasant early
  season jaunt over to Ellettsville and back.&nbsp\; With the completion of 
 the Kinser Pike Bridge over future I-69 and the new county bridge over Bean
 blossom Creek we are able to do this ride pretty much as it was originally 
 laid out.</font></p><p><font color="#b00000" face="Calibri" size="3"><u><a 
