 ><font color="#000000" face="Calibri" size="3">The Saturday touring ride ha
 s a mix of terrain\, mileage\, and pace.<span>&nbsp\; </span>Mileage varies
  from about 30 to 96\, and tends to increase in the prime Summer months of 
 June-August.<span>&nbsp\; </span>Most rides leave from Bryan Park\, but a f
 ewdrive and ride events will be scheduled.<span>&nbsp\;</span>Start time va
 ries from 1 PM early in the season to 8 AM in July andAugust\, to 10 AM in 
 October.<span>&nbsp\; </span>A briefride description and links to pdf maps\
 , queue sheets\, and gps files will beposted here in advance of the ride.</
 font></p>
