DESCRIPTION:<br>The iRide is a no-drop Intermediate level ride of moderate 
 pace and distance with regrouping points.  Mileage will increase as the sea
 son progresses\, and pace is anticipated to be 15-17 mph.  The rides will s
 tart promptly at 5:45 with or without a scheduled leader.  Riders are expec
 ted to look out for each other during the ride. Ride maps and GPS links wil
 l be posted here in advance.  Riders unfamiliar with the route should bring
  along a copy of the map. Non-members should download and bring a signed co
 py of the liability waiver to the ride.<br><br>NOTE:&nbsp\; Return via Eagl
 eview and Falcon to avoid construction at South Rogers and Fullerton.<br><b
 r><a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/iRides/Circle_West_Rev_1_
 33.pdf">Circle West Rev 1 33.pdf</a><br><br><a href="https://ridewithgps.co
 m/routes/23981175">GPS Files</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20190722T215855Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot @ 39.15435\,-86.523
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:iRide
TRANSP:OPAQUE
