CREATED:20200306T013748Z
DESCRIPTION:This series will restart our Tuesday Thursday evening evening c
 lub rides and will last for a couple of weeks. This will be a no-drop\, mix
 ed-group ride with riders of various abilities.  It is anticipated that the
  ride will split into various groups by speed as the ride progresses and a 
 staggered start may be employed to limit riders in a group to manageable nu
 mbers.  The rides will start promptly at 5:45 from Bryan Park.  Riders are 
 expected to look out for each other during the ride. Ride maps and GPS link
 s will be posted here in advance.  Riders unfamiliar with the route should 
 bring along a copy of the map. Non-members should download and bring a sign
 ed copy of the liability waiver to the ride.
LAST-MODIFIED:20200527T010546Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot @ 39.15435\,-86.523\, 
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Tuesday Thursday Restart
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
