DESCRIPTION:<br>first Wed Night ride of the New year....<br><br>Join us for
  a fun gravel ride through<br>the enchanted Hoosier National Forest.<br>The
  21 mile route begins at the Hickory<br>Ridge Fire Tower on Tower Ridge<br>
 Road\, ventures south to Henderson<br>Creek Road and Norman\, and returns<b
 r>to the fire tower via Hickory Grove<br>Church and along the crest of<br>H
 ickory Ridge.<br><br>Route is entirely gravel and pavement\,<br>no trail.<b
 r><br>Meet at 5:30 pm at the former K-Mart<br>East parking lot to car pool.
   The ride<br>leaves from the fire tower about 6:00PM.<br><br>&nbsp\;<br>&n
 bsp\;<br><a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/Gravel_Rides/Hende
 rson%20Creek%20&amp\;%20Hickory%20Ridge%20from%20the%20Fire%20Tower%2021.pd
 f" target="_blank">Henderson Creek &amp\; Hickory Ridge from the Fire Tower
  21</a><a><br><br></a><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/17885726" tar
 get="_blank">GPS Files</a><a></a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20190102T012755Z
LOCATION:Big K Parking Lot @ 39.162664\, -86.492045
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Henderson Creek & Hickory Ridge from the Fire Tower 21
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
