DESCRIPTION: We may do this ride in reverse...........\n\nThis 20-miler beg
 ins at the Bunk House on 446 &   \nTower Ridge Road\, extends\ndown Dutch R
 idge Road\, and loops\nback to Blackwell via Henderson Creek\,\nHickory Gro
 ve\, and Tower Ridge.  The\nroute is a mix of one-half HNF gravel and\none-
 half paved county road.  There is\nno single or double track.\nCross Bikes 
 or MTB is fine\n\nMeet at 5:30PM at the former K-Mart\nEast parking lot to 
 car pool.  The ride\nleaves from the bunk house\non Tower Ridge Road about 
 6:00PM.\n\nBRING LIGHTS !!\n \n<a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/m
 aps/Gravel_Rides/Going%20Dutch%20Ridge%2020.pdf">Going Dutch Ridge 20<a/>\n
 \n<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/17995313">GPS Files<a/>
LAST-MODIFIED:20170905T215012Z
LOCATION:Big K Parking Lot @ 39.162664\, -86.492045
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:GRR Dutch Ridge 20
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-APPLE-TRAVEL-ADVISORY-BEHAVIOR:AUTOMATIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
