DTSTART:20190224T150000Z
DTEND:20190224T200000Z
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:5gfpnj94igeh77o82o2d64v5re@google.com
CREATED:20190222T130806Z
DESCRIPTION:This is a special one way gravel / trail ride&nbsp\;to the Holl
 is Cabin on Berry Ridge Road\, Brown County.<br>We will adapt the usual rou
 te due to current flooding along McGowan and Friendship Roads.&nbsp\; We an
 ticipate starting at the Stillwater Marsh Entrance on Kent Road\, or the St
 illwater Marsh Overlook on McGowan Road.&nbsp\; We will take Kent Road over
  to T.C. Steele Road to bypass the floodwaters on downstream McGowan.&nbsp\
 ;&nbsp\;The route then follows mostly double&nbsp\;track (Bartley Ridge and
  Miller Ridge)&nbsp\;and easy single track (Trail D) southeast&nbsp\;to Blu
 e Creek Road\, Elkinsville Road\, Story\, 135 South\, Mt Nebo Road\, and&nb
 sp\;finally Berry Ridge Road to the Cabin.&nbsp\; Hot and cold beverages an
 d some snacks will await us as the Cabin.<br><br>Since this is a one way ri
 de we need to&nbsp\;carefully arrange transport back from&nbsp\;the Cabin. 
 Drivers will pack dry clothes&nbsp\;and any end-of-ride items you need to&n
 bsp\;Brown County. We have a couple of<br>volunteers\, but more may be need
 ed.<br><br>After the ride\, we intend to return to Bloomington and treat ou
 r shuttle drivers to pizza at Trailhead Pizza on Pine Grove Road.&nbsp\; Th
 is should be about 4PM.<br><br>Contact Warren or John B if you are interest
 ed in&nbsp\;this adventure.&nbsp\; DUE TO THE UNCERTAIN START LOCATION AT T
 HIS TIME\, PLEASE PLAN ON MEETING AT THE OLD K-MART EAST PARKING LOT AT 10:
 00 TO TRANSFER GEAR AND CARPOOL TO THE START LOCATION.<br><br><a href="mail
 to:bigredballons@msn.com" target="_blank">bigredballons@msn.com</a><br><br>
 <a href="mailto:jbassett@bluemarble.net" target="_blank">jbassett@bluemarbl
 e.net</a><br><br><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/18235217" target="
 _blank">Trail D to the Cabin Roads are Flooded Version 22</a><br><br><a></a
 >
LAST-MODIFIED:20190222T134038Z
LOCATION:Former K-Mart East Parking Lot @39.163177\, -86.4913
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Trail D to Cabin Roads are Flooded Version 22
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
