DESCRIPTION:<br><a href="https://goo.gl/sb46Z4">Short Russell</a>&nbsp\;18 
 miles<br>The "Older\, Wiser\, and a Little Slower" training group emphasize
 s moderate rides\, and a route planned in advance that is posted on the rid
 e calendar. This is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride. The OWLS of
 ten average 15 to 19 mph on flat roads\, and typically have an overall aver
 age moving speed between 12 and 15 mph including hills. Distances vary from
  20 to 30 miles\, depending partly on available light. Early season rides w
 ill be somewhat shorter and slower.<br><br>Questions? Contact<a href="mailt
 o:allan.edmonds@gmail.com" target="_blank"> Allan Edmonds</a>&nbsp\;or <a h
 ref="mailto:gail.morell@gmail.com" target="_blank">Gail Morell</a><br><br>S
 tarts in the parking lot of Sherwood Oaks Christian Church.
