DESCRIPTION:Join us Saturday December 16th at 4:00PM\nfor the 2nd annual Sa
 nta Ride\n\nMeet at the Country Club Trail head of the B-Line\n\nThis Ride 
 is for all ages. We will ride to the end of the B-line\, (about 6 miles)\na
 nd turn around and come back to the parking lot.\nDecorate your Bike with l
 ights or other Christmas decorations. Dress up\nin your favorite Santa or E
 lf suit.\n\nWe will have snacks at the beginning and the end to keep warm a
 nd smiling\n\nAll are welcome please pass the word. We would love to see a 
 big turnout for this holiday ride\n\n\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20171206T121520Z
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Santa Ride
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-APPLE-TRAVEL-ADVISORY-BEHAVIOR:AUTOMATIC
END:VEVENT
