 ps/place//@39.1543611\,-86.523\,15z">map</a>\n\nThe featured attraction of 
 this ride is the quaint\nlittle covered bridge southwest of Bloomfield\non 
 Plummer Creek.  Ride to the bridge\, turn\naround\, do a lunch break in Blo
 omfield\, and\nreturn home via Springville.\n\nNOTE: The Bloomfield IGA is 
 now closed.\nSo plan on lunch at the Subway on SR 54\,\nseven blocks west o
 f the Courthouse.\n\n<a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/private/BBC
 Maps/map_pack_1/bloomfield_bridge.pdf">Bloomfield Covered Bridge 82</a>\n\n
 <a href="http://ridewithgps.com/routes/5530963">GPS<a/>
