DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://goo.gl/Fn87bN">Airport Ride</a> 25 miles<br><b
 r>The "Older\, Wiser\, and a Little Slower" training group emphasizes moder
 ate rides\, and a route planned in advance that is posted on the ride calen
 dar. This is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride. The OWLS often ave
 rage 15 to 19 mph on flat roads\, and typically have an overall average mov
 ing speed between 12 and 15 mph including hills. Distances vary from 20 to 
 30 miles\, depending partly on available light. Early season rides will be 
 somewhat shorter and slower.<br><br>Questions? Contact<a href="mailto:allan
 .edmonds@gmail.com" target="_blank"> Allan Edmonds</a>&nbsp\;or <a href="ma
 ilto:gail.morell@gmail.com" target="_blank">Gail Morell</a><br><br>Starts i
 n the parking lot of Sherwood Oaks Christian Church.
