DESCRIPTION:This is an off pavement ride you do not<br>want to miss!!  We d
 id it a couple of years ago as a<br>surprise inaugural ride on the HNF Trai
 l D.<br>It is not a surprise anymore\, but we kept<br>the ride name anyway.
 <br><br>We will start at the Upper Handicapped Parking<br>Lot at the top of
  the big hill on Crooked Creek<br>Road\, ride down the Miller Ridge and Tra
 il D<br>doubletrack / singletrack to Old Blue Creek<br>Road\, ride over the
  big dirt hill on Old Blue<br>Creek\, through Lake Monroe\, and return to<b
 r>the parking lot via Crooked Creek Road\,<br>Crooked Creek Dam\, and the d
 ouble track<br>back up to Miller Ridge.<br><br>5:30 Meet at the former Big 
 K parking lot on East<br>Third Street to car pool. The ride will leave<br>f
 rom the Upper Handicapped Parking Lot<br>about 6 PM.<br><br>MTB\, CX\, or G
 ravel / Adventure Bike<br><br>BRING LIGHTS!!<br><br><a href="https://ridewi
 thgps.com/trips/17745779" id="ow3440" __is_owner="true">Trail D Fun</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20190929T132407Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Trail D Fun
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
