DESCRIPTION:The iRide is a no-drop Intermediate level ride of moderate pace
  and distance with regrouping points.  Mileage will increase as the season 
 progresses\, and pace is anticipated to be 15-17 mph.  The rides will start
  promptly at 5:45 with or without a scheduled leader.  Riders are expected 
 to look out for each other during the ride. Ride maps and GPS links will be
  posted here in advance.  Riders unfamiliar with the route should bring alo
 ng a copy of the map. Non-members should download and bring a signed copy o
 f the liability waiver to the ride.<br><br>NOTE:&nbsp\; RETURN TO BLOOMINGT
 ON VIA BUSINESS 37 TO AVOID CONSTRUCTION IN LOWER CASCADES PARK<br><br><a h
 ref="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/iRides/Circle_North_v2_26.pdf">
 Circle North v2 26</a><br><br><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/28593
 038">GPS Files</a>
