UID:1c4rc3fslhqkeegmi1qcruueqj@google.com
CREATED:20191117T130308Z
DESCRIPTION:Car pool at 5:30 from Big K Parking Lot <br> <br>The is a fun l
 ittle route\, borrowed from<br>Gnawbone Lefty\, that we did a couple<br>of 
 evenings last Winter.  The ride<br>starts / ends at the Scarce-o-Fat Trail<
 br>parking lot at the base of Yellowwood<br>Dam.  There are sections of pav
 ement<br>riding on South Shore Drive\, Lanam<br>Ridge\, Owl Creek Road\, an
 d Helmsberg<br>Road.  The rest is gravel.<br><br>Approximately 20 miles - n
 o single track\,<br>suitable for MTB\, gravel\, or cyclocross<br>bikes.<br>
