UID:46rq37v9k5lg8nfv3qg17r6eae@google.com
CREATED:20180208T013409Z
DESCRIPTION:This is a special one way gravel / trail ride<br>starting at Tr
 ailhead Pizza and finishing<br>at the Hollis Cabin on Berry Ridge Road<br>i
 n Brown County.  The route is out<br>McGowan Road\, up Jack Ass Hill\, and 
 over<br>on Gilmore Ridge to TC Steele.  The <br>route then follows mostly d
 ouble<br>track (Bartley Ridge and Miller Ridge)<br>and easy single track (T
 rail D) southeast<br>to Blue Creek Road\, Elkinsville Road\, <br>Story\, 13
 5 South\, Mt Nebo Road\, and<br>finally Berry Ridge Road to the Cabin.<br><
 br>The ride starts at Trailhead Pizza<br>(park across the street at the old
  log<br>church) located at the intersection of<br>SR 446 and Pine Grove Roa
 d. <br><br>Since this is a one way ride we need to<br>carefully arrange tra
 nsport back from<br>the Cabin.  Drivers will pack dry clothes<br>and any en
 d-of-ride items you need to<br>Brown County.  We have a couple of<br>volunt
 eers\, but more may be needed.<br><br>Contact Warren or John B if you are i
 nterested in<br>this adventure.<br><a href="http://www.google.com/url?q=htt
 p%3A%2F%2Fgoog_662095407&amp\;sa=D&amp\;sntz=1&amp\;usg=AFQjCNEI4Hz5R8FgKHK
 s1x4o3jmE0-TkrA" target="_blank"><br></a><br><a href="mailto:bigredballons@
 msn.com" target="_blank">bigredballons@msn.com</a><br><br><a href="mailto:j
 bassett@bluemarble.net" target="_blank">jbassett@bluemarble.net</a><br><br>
 <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=http%3A%2F%2Fbloomingtonbicycleclub.o
 rg%2Fmaps%2FGravel_Rides%2FTrail%2520D%2520to%2520Cabin%252030.pdf&amp\;sa=
 D&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AFQjCNF8s6UOgK7JEhmRkuPVkjIwGrbsEw" target="_blank">T
 rail D to the Cabin 30</a><br><br><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=htt
 ps%3A%2F%2Fridewithgps.com%2Froutes%2F18235483&amp\;sa=D&amp\;usd=2&amp\;us
 g=AFQjCNHS9WrJuBjzrnM6qyVXMCEdvXpO8Q" target="_blank">GPS Files</a><a></a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20180208T013612Z
LOCATION:Trailhead Pizzeria\, 4303 S State Rd 446\, Bloomington\, IN 47401\
 , USA
