 ge will increase as the season\nprogresses\, and pace is anticipated to be\
 n15-16 mph.  The rides will start promptly at 5:45\nwith or without a sched
 uled leader.  Riders are\nexpected to look out for each other during the\nr
 ide. Ride maps with regrouping points and GPS\nlinks will be posted here in
  advance.  Riders\nunfamiliar with the route should bring along a\ncopy of 
 the map.  Non-members will be required\nto sign a liability waiver prior to
  participation.\n\nWE STILL HAVE GOOD DAYLIGHT\, SO LET'S\nGO AROUND THE LA
 KE AGAIN!\n\n<a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/FOWLS_Ride_Map
 s/Around%20Lake%20Monroe%2023-37.5%20miles.pdf">Around Lake Monroe 37<a/>\n
