X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART:20170913T220000Z
DTEND:20170914T000000Z
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:6u6r7kq290r0bled6557adkjcp@google.com
CREATED:20170907T015712Z
DESCRIPTION: With the rain we have had today we will not ride this trail to
 night.\nWe WILL ride gravel\, double track and some pavement. The infamous 
 "either way you get a monster gravel  hill"\n\nThis is an off pavement ride
  you do not\nwant to miss!!  We did it last year as a\nsurprise inaugural r
 ide on the HNF Trail D.\nIt is not a surprise anymore\, but we kept\nthe ri
 de name anyway.\n\nWe will start at the Upper Handicapped Parking\nLot at t
 he top of the big hill on Crooked Creek\nRoad\, ride down the Miller Ridge 
 and Trail D\ndoubletrack / singletrack to Old Blue Creek\nRoad\, ride over 
 the big dirt hill on Old Blue\nCreek\, through Lake Monroe\, and return to\
 nthe parking lot via Crooked Creek Road\,\nCrooked Creek Dam\, and the doub
 le track\nback up to Miller Ridge.\n\n5:30 Meet at the former Big K parking
  lot on East\nThird Street to car pool. The ride will leave\nfrom the Upper
  Handicapped Parking Lot\nabout 6 PM.\n\nMTB\, CX\, or Gravel / Adventure B
 ike\n\nBRING LIGHTS!! \n   \n<a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/map
 s/Gravel_Rides/The_Either_Way_You_Get_a_Monster_Gravel_Hill_Loop_23.pdf">Th
 e Either Way You Get a Monster Gravel Hill Loop 23<a/>\n\n<a href=" https:/
 /ridewithgps.com/routes/16959985">GPS Files<a/>
LAST-MODIFIED:20170913T202800Z
LOCATION:Big K Parking Lot @ 39.162664\, -86.492045
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Off Pavement Ride:  Trail D Inaugural Ride
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
