DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://goo.gl/gXqwct">South Shore Shuffle</a>  - 27.8
 <br><br>The "Older\, Wiser\, and a Little Slower" training group emphasizes
  moderate rides\, and a route planned in advance that is posted on the ride
  calendar. This is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride. The OWLS oft
 en average 15 to 19 mph on flat roads\, and typically have an overall avera
 ge moving speed between 12 and 15 mph including hills. Distances vary from 
 20 to 30 miles\, depending partly on available light. Early season rides wi
 ll be somewhat shorter and slower.<br><br>Questions? Contact<a href="mailto
 :allan.edmonds@gmail.com" target="_blank"> Allan Edmonds</a>&nbsp\;or <a hr
 ef="mailto:gail.morell@gmail.com" target="_blank">Gail Morell</a><br><br>St
 arts in the parking lot of Sherwood Oaks Christian Church.
