CREATED:20191103T143851Z
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a merry jaunt along mostly<br>gravel roads followin
 g about one-half<br>of the course of the upcoming Gravel<br>Grovel Dino Rac
 e.  There is a short<br>section of easy single track along<br>Trail 21 in t
 he HNF.  This could be<br>bypassed on pavement and gravel.<br>Ride starts/e
 nds at Hickory Ridge fire<br>tower on Tower Ridge Road.<br><br>Suitable for
  gravel and<br>and cyclocross bikes plus MTB.<br><br>Shorter routes are ava
 ilable. <br>&nbsp\;<br>Meet at Old Kmart at 10:00am  on East Third Street t
 o<br>carpool.  Ride leaves from the fire tower<br>about 10:30.<br><br><a hr
 ef="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/Gravel_Rides/About%20Half%20of%2
