UID:3k5gvkpvgneaqkk3cqlq6q3a1p@google.com
CREATED:20181011T174654Z
DESCRIPTION:This is a Ride not to miss.. The fall foliage is looking fabulo
 us&nbsp\; &nbsp\;<br><br>We will sart at the Crooked Creek Boat Ramp go up 
 Elkinsville Rd across Lake Monroe (yes you will get your feet wet but much 
 not much more ) to Elkinsville\, up Combs Rd to the Nebo Connector\, and do
 wn Nebo to the North parking lot. Then it's up Blue Creek Rd to Trail D\, u
 p Trail D to Miller Ridge\, down the water bars to Crooked Creek Rd\, and b
 ack to the parking lot - a total of 18.4 beautiful miles.<br><br>PLEASE DON
 'T MISS THIS ONE.<br><br>Meet at Big K parking lot @ 5:30 to car pool to gr
 avel ride<br><br>BRING LIGHTS! BRING LIGHTS! BRING LIGHTS!<br><br><a href="
 http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/Gravel_Rides/Reverse%20Blue%20Creek%
 20Elkinsville%20Loop%20Plus%20Trail%20D%2018.pdf" target="_blank">Reverse B
 lue Creek Elkinsville Loop + Trail D</a><br><a><font color="#212121"><br></
 font></a><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/17463607" target="_blank">
 GPS Files</a><a></a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20181015T232443Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Best Off Road Ride Ever!
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
