DESCRIPTION:Let's try to restart our 2020 Saturday touring ride season with
  a local favorite.&nbsp\; This ride is lot shorter than we normally do this
  time of year\, but it should serve to get us back together on the road aga
 in without a lot of stress.&nbsp\; We will leave Bloomington via the Vernal
  Pike overpass and return via the&nbsp\;Rockport Road overpass and That&nbs
 p\;Road.  In between are some beautiful&nbsp\;western Monroe and eastern Gr
 eene&nbsp\;County roadways.<br><br><a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.o
 rg/maps/John_Bassett_Maps/Hendricksville_Ride_to_Rosies_2017_Version.pdf">H
 endricksville Ride to Rosie's 2017 Version</a><a><br><br></a><a href="https
 ://ridewithgps.com/routes/19326775">GPS Links</a><br><br>For those who have
  been hard at this the last couple of months\, there are numerous opportuni
 ties for extending this ride to the south from Gardner Road.&nbsp\; A sugge
 stion\, modified from an old iRide is here:<br><br><a href="https://ridewit
 hgps.com/routes/32665204" id="ow2150" __is_owner="true">Reverse Ring Around
  Rosies 39</a>
