  Norman\, and returns<br>to the fire tower via Hickory Grove<br>Church and 
 along the crest of<br>Hickory Ridge.<br><br>Route is entirely gravel and pa
 vement\,<br>no trail.<br><br>Meet at 10:00 AM at the former K-Mart<br>East 
 parking lot to car pool.  The ride<br>leaves from the fire tower about 10:3
 0 AM .<br><br>&nbsp\;<br>&nbsp\;<br><a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.
 org/maps/Gravel_Rides/Henderson%20Creek%20&amp\;%20Hickory%20Ridge%20from%2
 0the%20Fire%20Tower%2021.pdf" target="_blank">Henderson Creek &amp\; Hickor
 y Ridge from the Fire Tower 21</a><a><br><br></a><a href="https://ridewithg
 ps.com/routes/17885726" target="_blank">GPS Files</a><a></a>
