DESCRIPTION:We are moving into that part of the season when the rides get l
 onger and more challenging\, but we will still try to keep viable shorter o
 ptions.&nbsp\; This classic lake ride is 80 miles\, but has a short option 
 of 50 miles if you dare venture over Bear Wallow Hill.&nbsp\; But\, those 3
 0 extra miles are worth it with some great scenery up the lake country of n
 orthern Brown County.&nbsp\; The Cordry-Sweetwater Bermuda Triangle has swa
 llowed some riders so bring a map and try to keep other riders in sight.<br
 ><br><a href="http://www.bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/BBCMaps/map_pack_1
 /cordry_sweetwater.pdf" target="_blank">Cordry-Sweetwater Lakes</a><br><br>
 <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=http%3A%2F%2Fridewithgps.com%2Froutes
 %2F1530307&amp\;sa=D&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AFQjCNE7MBWjegzuKNAT81zZdJRfEIZhMw
 " target="_blank">GPS</a><a></a>
