 >Boltinghouse Road.  We have offered this<br>longer version the last fiver 
 years with the<br>original ride as a shorter version.  Nobody<br>has opted 
 for the old ride the past five&nbsp\;<br>years\, so we offer The Way<br>Aro
 und Boltinghouse Cruise as the featured<br>ride.<br><br>You can always shor
 tcut on Anderson<br>Road for a nice\, shorter  28 mile loop.<br>There are u
 sually a few intrepid soles who<br>turn left at Dolan and ride up the big h
 ill just<br>for grins!<br><br><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=http%3A
 %2F%2Fbloomingtonbicycleclub.org%2Fmaps%2FJohn_Bassett_Maps%2FWay_Around_Bo
