BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20180106T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20180106T150000
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:b2o8p1ph6qbgdvrm396l4g4ubg@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20170107T100000
CREATED:20170104T195601Z
DESCRIPTION:01/06/18 This Ride is a go! We will have a fire to keep you war
 m Between Rides....<br><br>Come one Come all! Join us for this first Saturd
 ay Ride of the New Year!<br>We will ride in the beautiful snow covered hill
 s of Brown County State Park. Road bike\, Mountain bikes\, Fat bikes\, Cros
 s Bikes you bring it you ride it. You can ride road or trails.<br><br>We wi
 ll gather at the North (Upper) Shelter house just up the hill from the Nort
 h parking lot where the mountain bike trail parking lot is. We will have a 
 little fire and hot chocolate before during or after the ride. Come if you 
 want to ride or just mind the fire...All are welcome.<br><br>Bring your 201
 8 park &amp\; trail pass or you can buy them the day of the ride. You do no
 t need a trail pass just to ride beginner trails.<br><br>We will keep an ey
 e on trail conditions and the weather. Check here or the Facebook MTB page 
 for updates.. <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.faceb
 ook.com%2Fbbcmtb%2F&amp\;sa=D&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AFQjCNGMV0MkdEQwbxlJlOqCK
 p2iWEm-XQ" target="_blank">https://www.facebook.com/bbcmtb/</a><br><br><br>
 Meet at Old K- Mart East at 10:00AM to carpool or meet at Shelter house at 
 10:30am<br><br>Please bring any snacks or firewood you would like to share 
 with the group
LAST-MODIFIED:20180101T184715Z
LOCATION: Brown County State Park Upper Shelterhouse @39.189036\, -86.21877
 5
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:First Saturday Ride of the New Year
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-APPLE-TRAVEL-ADVISORY-BEHAVIOR:AUTOMATIC
