 nt.  Ride<br>leaves from Belmont about 6:00pm. <br><br><a href="http://bloo
 mingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/Gravel_Rides/GRR%20TC%20Steele%20Ridge%20Ride%2
 018.pdf" target="_blank">GRR TC Steel Ridge Ride 18</a><a></a><br><br><a hr
 ef="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/6968835" target="_blank">GPS Files</a>
