DESCRIPTION:<p>Join us for a fun gravel ride through<br>the enchanted Hoosi
 er National Forest.<br>The 25 mile route begins at Blackwell<br>Horse Camp 
 on Tower Ridge<br>Road\, ventures south to Henderson<br>Creek Road and Norm
 an\, and returns<br>to Blackwell via Hickory Grove<br>Church and along the 
 crest of<br>Hickory Ridge and Tower Ridge Road.</p><br><p>Route is entirely
  gravel and pavement\,<br>no trail.</p><p>Meet at 10:00 AM at the former K-
 Mart<br>East parking lot to car pool. The ride<br>leaves from the Blackwell
  horse Camp about 10:30 AM .</p><p><br></p><p><a href="https://ridewithgps.
 com/routes/26738159" target="_blank">Henderson Creek Ride</a><br></p><p><br
 ></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20200201T190332Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Norman 25
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
