CREATED:20170116T001356Z
DESCRIPTION:This 20-miler begins at the Blackwell Horse\nCamp on Tower Ridg
 e Road\, extends\ndown Dutch Ridge Road\, and loops\nback to Blackwell via 
 Henderson Creek\,\nHickory Grove\, and Tower Ridge.  The\nroute is a mix of
  one-half HNF gravel and\none-half paved county road.  There is\nno single 
 or double track.\nXC or MTB are fine.\n\nMeet at 5:30PM at the former K-Mar
 t\nEast parking lot to car pool.  The ride\nleaves from Blackwell Horse Cam
 p\non Tower Ridge Road about 6:00PM.\n\nBRING LIGHTS !!\n \n<a href="http:/
 /bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/Gravel_Rides/Going%20Dutch%20Ridge%2020.pd
 f">Going Dutch Ridge 20<a/>\n\n<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/1799
 5313">GPS Files<a/>
LAST-MODIFIED:20180204T175854Z
LOCATION:Big K Parking Lot @ 39.162664\, -86.492045
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:GRR Going Dutch Ridge 20
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-APPLE-TRAVEL-ADVISORY-BEHAVIOR:AUTOMATIC
END:VEVENT
