DESCRIPTION:Join in for a fun gravel ride through<br>the enchanted Hoosier 
 National Forest.<br>The 21 mile route begins at the Hickory<br>Ridge Fire T
 ower on Tower Ridge<br>Road\, ventures south to Henderson<br>Creek Road and
  Norman\, and returns<br>to the fire tower via Hickory Grove<br>Church and 
 along the crest of<br>Hickory Ridge.<br><br>Route is entirely gravel and pa
 vement<br>- no trail.<br><br>Meet at 5:30PM at the former K-Mart<br>East pa
 rking lot to car pool. The ride<br>leaves from the fire tower about 6:10PM.
 <br>BRING LIGHTS!!<br><br><br><a href="https://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/m
 aps/Gravel_Rides/Henderson%20Creek%20&%20Hickory%20Ridge%20from%20the%20Fir
 e%20Tower%2021.pdf">PDF Map and Queue Sheet</a><br><br><a href="https://rid
 ewithgps.com/routes/31412541" id="ow323" __is_owner="true">Fire Tower to No
 rman</a>
