DESCRIPTION:With Rain coming in Wednesday we are moving this ride up to Tue
 sday&nbsp\;<br>Join in for this&nbsp\; fun ride!&nbsp\;<br><br>This 20-mile
 r begins at the Blackwell Horse<br>Camp on Tower Ridge Road\, heads to<br>H
 ickory Grove Church\, and then circles<br>back to the horse camp via McPike
  Branch<br>Road and Dutch Ridge Road.  The route is<br>predominately gravel
  with a little bit of <br>pavement\, and no trail.  Route is suitable<br>fo
 r CX\, gravel bike\, or MTB.<br><br>Meet at 5:30PM at the former K-Mart<br>
 East parking lot to car pool.  The ride<br>leaves from Blackwell Horse Camp
 <br>about 6:00PM.<br>&nbsp\;<br><a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/
 maps/Gravel_Rides/All%20Around%20Yellowstone%2020.pdf" target="_blank">All 
 Around Yellowstone 20</a><a><br><br></a><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/ro
 utes/18155202" target="_blank">GPS Files</a><a></a>
