DESCRIPTION:Join  us for this pre Thanksgiving treat<br><br>This 20-miler b
 egins at the Blackwell Horse<br>Camp on Tower Ridge Road\, heads to<br>Hick
 ory Grove Church\, and then circles<br>back to the horse camp via McPike Br
 anch<br>Road and Dutch Ridge Road.  The route is<br>predominately gravel wi
 th a little bit of <br>pavement\, and no trail.  Route is suitable<br>for C
 X\, gravel bike\, or MTB.<br><br>Meet at 5:30PM at the former K-Mart<br>Eas
 t parking lot to car pool.  The ride<br>leaves from Blackwell Horse Camp<br
 >about 6:00PM.<br> <br><a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/Grav
 el_Rides/All%20Around%20Yellowstone%2020.pdf" target="_blank">All Around Ye
 llowstone 20</a><a><br><br></a><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/1815
 5202" target="_blank">GPS Files</a><a></a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20191117T130859Z
