DESCRIPTION:<font></font><p><font>Join in for a pleasant early season jaunt
  over to Ellettsville and back.&nbsp\; With the completion of the Kinser Pi
 ke Bridge over future I-69 and the new county bridge over Beanblossom Creek
  we are able to do this ride pretty much as it was originally laid out.</fo
 nt></p><p>The ride back through Lower Cascades Park should be vehicle free 
 thanks to the new City of Bloomington pilot project to close the road to mo
 tor vehicle traffic. But\, watch out - there may be some new road furniture
  in that area!</p><p><font><u><a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/ma
 ps/John_Bassett_Maps/Ellettsville_Ride_23.pdf">Ellettsville Ride 23</a></u>
 </font></p><p><font><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/4024893">GPS Fi
 les</a><br></font></p>
