  last Winter.  The ride\nstarts / ends at the Scarce-o-Fat Trail\nparking l
 ot at the base of Yellowwood\nDam.  There are sections of pavement\nriding 
 on South Shore Drive\, Lanam\nRidge\, Owl Creek Road\, and Helmsberg\nRoad.
   The rest is gravel.\n\nApproximately 20 miles - no single track\,\nsuitab
 le for MTB\, gravel\, or cyclocross\nbikes.\n\nBRING LIGHTS!  BRING LIGHTS!
