 p Jack Ass Hill\, and\nout to the end of Axom Branch Road at\nLake Monroe. 
  The ride starts and ends at\nTrailhead Pizza (park across the street\nat t
 he old log church) located at the\nintersection of SR 446 and Pine Grove\nR
 oad.  Stick around at Trailhead for a\nbite to eat and beer after the ride!
 \n\n<a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/Gravel_Rides/GRR_Pizza_
 Anyone_32mi.pdf">GRR Pizza Anyone? 32<a/>\n\n<a href="https://ridewithgps.c
 om/routes/6285210">GPS Files</a>
