BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART:20180602T130000Z
DTEND:20180602T210000Z
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:333or87j9hsc0j3q37a4e33f0g@google.com
CREATED:20180505T231612Z
DESCRIPTION:<br>This is a drive and ride was a big success<br>the last two 
 years\, and is back by by popular demand. <br><br>The entire route is 96 mi
 les and begins and<br>ends at Spring Mill State Park.  Start there<br>becau
 se a century ride will get you to the Ohio<br>River and back.  Shorter opti
 ons include turning<br>back north at Marengo for a 63 mile loop\, or<br>tur
 ning right at the famous Crawford County<br>Shoe Tree for about 82 miles.  
 Tour some of<br>the best southern Indiana has to offer\, and<br>enjoy the s
 pectacular view of the Ohio River<br>at the Leavenworth Overlook\, the poin
 t where<br>we turn back north.<br><br>As a bonus this year\, I am told that
  there will<br>be up to 15 miles of new pavement on Orange<br>County Tater 
 Road - the long north south road we<br>pick up at US 150 about Mill 77 on t
 he way back north.<br><br>Car pool leaving Bryan Park at 7:30\, or meet<br>
 at Spring Mill State Park Inn (Parking<br>Garage) at 9:00.  Bring your park
  pass.<br>This is a good one.<br><br><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=
 http%3A%2F%2Fbloomingtonbicycleclub.org%2Fmaps%2FJohn_Bassett_Maps%2FSpring
 +Mill+Leavenworth+96+revised.pdf&amp\;sa=D&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AFQjCNGKT0WV
 rZZjX8a6MSr-Qc5ncLrxOw" target="_blank">Spring Mill to Leavenworth</a><br><
 br><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=http%3A%2F%2Fridewithgps.com%2Frou
 tes%2F2970469&amp\;sa=D&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AFQjCNGofkwh2vF1kvn6khK60Z8ynPH
 xWw" target="_blank">GPS Links</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20180528T232454Z
LOCATION:Spring Mill State Park\, Mitchell\, IN @ 38.735030\, -86.414270
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Spring Mill to Leavenworth 96 - Leader: John Bassett
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
