DESCRIPTION:This is a Figure-of-Eight loop from the<br>Kent Road Hunter Che
 ck In just off SR 46<br>east of Bloomington.  We will decide on the<br>fly 
 which way we want to do it\, either up<br>Jack Ass Hill or down Jack Ass Hi
 ll.  Either<br>way\, you get a monster gravel hill to climb!!<br><br>Ride i
 s mostly gravel\, with some pavement<br>and a nice stretch of level double 
 track<br>along Bartley Ridge in Yellowwood State<br>Forest.<br><br>Meet at 
 Old K-Mart @ 5:30<br>if you want to car pool to Kent Road. <br><br>BRING LI
 GHTS!! BRING LIGHTS!!<br><br><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/169599
 85">The Either Way You Get a Monster Gravel Hill Loop 23</a><a></a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20180902T131729Z
LOCATION: 
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Gravel Road Ride - The Either Way You Get a Monster Gravel Hill Loo
 p 
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
