 </a> 26 miles.\n\nThe "Older\, Wiser\, and a Little Slower" training group 
 emphasizes moderate rides\, and a route planned in advance that is posted o
 n the ride calendar. This is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride. Th
 e OWLS often average 15 to 19 mph on flat roads\, and typically have an ove
 rall average moving speed between 13 and 15 mph including hills. Early seas
 on rides will be somewhat shorter and slower.\n\nStarts in the parking lot 
 at Sherwood Oaks Christian Church: <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/pla
 ce//@39.135188\,-86.500368\,1155m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0x0">Map</a>\
 n
