 ate pace and distance with regrouping points.  Mileage will increase as the
  season progresses\, and pace is anticipated to be 15-17 mph.  The rides wi
 ll start promptly at 5:45 with or without a scheduled leader.  Riders are e
 xpected to look out for each other during the ride. Ride maps and GPS links
  will be posted here in advance.  Riders unfamiliar with the route should b
 ring along a copy of the map. Non-members should download and bring a signe
 d copy of the liability waiver to the ride.<br><br><a href="http://blooming
 tonbicycleclub.org/maps/John_Bassett_Maps/Hendricksville_Ride_to_Rosies_201
 7_Version.pdf">Hendricksville Ride to Rosies 2017 Version</a><br><br><a hre
 f="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/19326775">GPS Files</a>
