  Death March !<br>The route is a mix of gravel\, pavement\,<br>double track
  (Combs Rd)\, and single<br>track (Nebo Trail).  Suitable for MTB<br>and CX
  bikes.<br><br>Meet at the former Big K parking lot<br>on East Third Street
  at 10:00 to car<br>pool. Ride will leave from the Hickory<br>Ridge Fire To
 wer on Tower Ridge Road<br>about 10:40.<br><br><a href="http://bloomingtonb
 icycleclub.org/maps/Gravel_Rides/Death_March_Training_No-_2_-__33.pdf">Deat
 h March Training No. 2 -33<br><br></a><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/rout
 es/18816738">GPS files</a>
