 ot of the former \nHeltonville school on SR 58.\n\n<a href="http://blooming
 tonbicycleclub.org/maps/Larry%20Limestone%20Tour.pdf">Larry Limestone Tour<
 /a>\n\n<a href="http://ridewithgps.com/routes/1558565">GPS<a/>
