X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20200625T174500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20200625T194500
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:9p45m8hkqk5cb1cv973v44b00o@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20200625T174500
CREATED:20200302T150145Z
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/33087813" id="ow3597" _
 _is_owner="true">Shuffle Creek\, back SR 45</a>&nbsp\; 26.6 miles<br><br>Pl
 ease observe social distancing norms as we gather and ride. We plan no form
 al leader. EVERYONE is a leader. Familiarize yourself with the ride before 
 heading out. We will ride in small groups.People in the last group will end
 eavor to sweep the route and assist others as needed.<br><ul><li>Be SAFE. D
 on't blow through stop signs. Consider bike lights.<br></li><li>Be COURTEOU
 S: Single up in traffic<br></li><li>Be PREDICTABLE: Signal your intentions 
 to cars and fellow riders.</li></ul>The "Older\, Wiser\, and a Little Slowe
 r" training group emphasizes moderate rides\, and a route planned in advanc
 e that is posted on the ride calendar. This is a no drop ride\, but not a b
 eginner's ride. The OWLS often average 15 to 19 mph on flat roads\, and typ
 ically have an overall average moving speed between 12 and 15 mph including
  hills. Distances vary from 20 to 30 miles\, depending partly on available 
 light. Early season rides will be somewhat shorter and slower. Rides depart
  promptly at 5:45.<br><br>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https:/
 /secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=133776">free trial
  membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electroni
 cally signing a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.<br><br>Que
 stions? Contact <a href="mailto:allan.edmonds@gmail.com">Allan Edmonds</a> 
 or <a href="mailto:gail.morell@gmail.com">Gail Morell</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20200625T174909Z
LOCATION:Sherwood Oaks Christian Church\, 2700 E Rogers Rd\, Bloomington\, 
 IN 47401\, USA
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:OWLS Ride
TRANSP:OPAQUE
