CREATED:20191122T224435Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>Due to foretasted rain this ride is being moved to Sunday&nb
 sp\;&nbsp\;</p><p>Join us for a fun gravel ride through<br>the enchanted Ho
 osier National Forest.<br>The 25 mile route begins at Blackwell<br>Horse Ca
 mp on Tower Ridge<br>Road\, ventures south to Henderson<br>Creek Road and N
 orman\, and returns<br>to Blackwell via Hickory Grove<br>Church and along t
 he crest of<br>Hickory Ridge and Tower Ridge Road.</p><br><p>Route is entir
 ely gravel and pavement\,<br>no trail.</p><p>Meet at 10:00 AM at the former
  K-Mart<br>East parking lot to car pool. The ride<br>leaves from the Blackw
 ell horse Camp about 10:30 AM .</p><p><br></p><p><a href="https://ridewithg
 ps.com/routes/26738159">Henderson Creek Ride</a><br></p><p><br></p><p><br><
 /p><p><br></p><p><br></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20191122T224435Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Ride To Norman
TRANSP:OPAQUE
