DESCRIPTION:<br>RIDE RESCHEDULED FROM 3/17!!<br><br>This ride is a take off
  on the Old Around<br>Boltinghouse Cruise\, a short (22 mile) early<br>seas
 on route around the legendary hill on<br>Boltinghouse Road.  We have offere
 d this<br>longer version the last four years with the<br>original ride as a
  shorter version.  Nobody<br>has opted for the old ride the past four <br>y
 ears\, so this year we offer The Way<br>Around Boltinghouse Cruise as the f
 eatured<br>ride.<br><br>You can always shortcut on Anderson<br>Road for a n
 ice\, shorter  28 mile loop.<br>There are usually a few intrepid soles who<
 br>turn left at Dolan and ride up the big hill just<br>for grins!<br><br><a
  href="https://www.google.com/url?q=http%3A%2F%2Fbloomingtonbicycleclub.org
 %2Fmaps%2FJohn_Bassett_Maps%2FWay_Around_Boltinghouse_36.pdf&amp\;sa=D&amp\
 ;usd=2&amp\;usg=AFQjCNGTQbusGbrbyOVPKNR1sEgsdhHh9Q" target="_blank">Way Aro
 und Boltinghouse 36</a><a><br><br></a><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q
