DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/578723">Robinson Road</
 a> 25 miles.\n\nThe "Older\, Wiser\, and a Little Slower" training group em
 phasizes moderate rides\, and a route planned in advance that is posted on 
 the ride calendar. This is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride. The 
 OWLS often average 15 to 19 mph on flat roads\, and typically have an overa
 ll average moving speed between 13 and 15 mph including hills. Early season
  rides will be somewhat shorter and slower.\n\nStarts in the parking lot at
  Sherwood Oaks Christian Church: <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/place
 //@39.135188\,-86.500368\,1155m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0x0">Map</a>\n
