 e fast flats and just a few healthy climbs.&nbsp\; We'll do a couple of mod
 ifications to the traditional route to accommodate the new traffic patterns
  resultant from I-69 and bypass some climbs on busy SR 45 on the return rou
 te.<br><br><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=http%3A%2F%2Fbloomingtonbi
 cycleclub.org%2Fmaps%2FJohn_Bassett_Maps%2FM_-_M_-Martinsville-Mahalasville
 -_via_South_Shore_60.pdf&amp\;sa=D&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AFQjCNFpqjGusW26_qGV
 mbuEMffI4dqe1w" target="_blank">M&amp\;M Ride (Martinsville-Mahalasville) v
 ia South Shore</a><br><br><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F
 %2Fridewithgps.com%2Froutes%2F27498299&amp\;sa=D&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AFQjCN
 FDdd-2RO83xI1e_czRFmB0NzYIpA" target="_blank">GPS Files</a>
