DTSTART:20200711T120000Z
DTEND:20200711T190000Z
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:2dn9goc7217kjne7ciiijutr07@google.com
CREATED:20200705T230448Z
DESCRIPTION:This classic lake ride is 80 miles\, but has a short option of 
 50 miles if you dare venture over Bear Wallow Hill.&nbsp\; But\, those 30 e
 xtra miles are worth it with some great scenery up into the lake country of
  northern Brown County.&nbsp\; The Cordry-Sweetwater Bermuda Triangle has s
 wallowed some riders so bring a map and try to keep other riders in sight.<
 br><br>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregist
 ered.com/get_information.php?event_id=133776">free trial membership</a>\, g
 ood for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing a lia
