 horse camp via McPike Branch<br>Road and Dutch Ridge Road.  The route is<br
 >predominately gravel with a little bit of <br>pavement\, and no trail.  Ro
 ute is suitable<br>for CX\, gravel bike\, or MTB.<br><br>Meet at 5:30PM at 
 the former K-Mart<br>East parking lot to car pool.  The ride<br>leaves from
  Blackwell Horse Camp<br>about 6:00PM.<br> <br><a href="http://bloomingtonb
 icycleclub.org/maps/Gravel_Rides/All%20Around%20Yellowstone%2020.pdf" targe
 t="_blank">All Around Yellowstone 20</a><a><br><br></a><a href="https://rid
 ewithgps.com/routes/18155202" target="_blank">GPS Files</a><a></a>
