DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/7712566">Two Creeks\, a
  Mountain\, and a Lake</a> 27 miles\, 1138 feet of climbing\, maximum grade
  7.8%.\n\nThe "Older\, Wiser\, and a Little Slower" training group emphasiz
 es moderate rides\, and a route planned in advance that is posted on the ri
 de calendar. This is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride. The OWLS o
 ften average 15 to 19 mph on flat roads\, and typically have an overall ave
 rage moving speed between 13 and 15 mph including hills. Early season rides
  will be somewhat shorter and slower.\n\nStarts in the parking lot at Sherw
 ood Oaks Christian Church: <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/place//@39.
 135188\,-86.500368\,1155m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0x0">Map</a>\n
