  There are sections of pavement<br>riding on South Shore Drive\, Lanam<br>R
 idge\, Owl Creek Road\, and Helmsberg<br>Road.  The rest is gravel.<br><br>
 Approximately 20 miles - no single track\,<br>suitable for MTB\, gravel\, o
 r cyclocross<br>bikes.<br><br>&nbsp\;<a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub
 .org/maps/Gravel_Rides/GRR%20Scarce-o-Fat%2020.pdf">Scarce-o-Fat 20</a><br>
