DESCRIPTION:Meet Across from Bryan Park Pool (<a href="https://bloomingtonb
 icycleclub.org/gmaps/bbcmaps.php/?lat=39.154581234&amp\;lng=-86.522427&amp\
 ;zoom=16&amp\;map=ROADMAP&amp\;message=Ride%20Start&lt\;br&gt\;Across%20fro
 m&lt\;br&gt\;Bryan%20Park%20Pool" id="ow431" __is_owner="true">map</a>)<br>
 <br>This is a ride to the Bloomfield Rd overpass that crosses I-69.<br><br>
 <a href="https://www.bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/gmaps/overpass.html" id="ow
 444" __is_owner="true">Overpass Ride</a> (9 miles)<br><br>By going on this 
 ride\, you will bolster a project that will make it easier for bicycles and
  pedestrians to cross I-69.  When passing over this interchange eight cross
 walks are traversed.  Help advance a ramp tunnels design which can eliminat
 e the use of the cross walks.  All support is welcome.
