CREATED:20181015T234842Z
DESCRIPTION:<br>For those who missed out\, this year’s version of the Parag
 on Ride uses some of the Hilly Hundred Saturday and Sunday routes.  Histori
 cally\, the Paragon Ride crossed SR 37 at Turkey Track Road / Pine Road.  W
 ith the advent of I-69 that crossing no longer exists\, so we will add a mi
 le or two and use Godsey Road east of Paragon to cross I-69 at the Liberty 
 Church Road exit.  From there we’ll take a new access road and SR 37 straig
 ht back to Bloomington for a total of about 47 miles.  Be sure to check out
  the bike path to nowhere just beyond the Hacker Creek turnoff about Mile 2
 9 on the route.<br><br><a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/John
 _Bassett_Maps/Paragon_Ride_2018_Version_47.pdf">Paragon Ride 2018 Version 4
 7</a><br><br><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/28782934">GPS Files</a
 >
LAST-MODIFIED:20181016T000038Z
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Paragon Ride - Ride Leader: TBD
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
