 ut the only place left to cross it !!\nThe complete route is a little longe
 r at 56\nmiles\, but as this is a loop around town\nthere are numerous opti
 ons for returning\nhome early on familiar roads we have\nridden all year.\n
 \n<a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/John_Bassett_Maps/Ride_Ar
 ound_Bloomington_2017_Version.pdf">Ride Around Bloomington 2017Version<a/>\
 n\n<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/26385717">GPS Files</a>\n\n
