 locross bikes plus MTB.\n\nShorter routes are available. \n \nMeet at Old K
 mart at 10:00am  on East Third Street to\ncarpool.  Ride leaves from the fi
 re tower\nabout 10:30.\n\n<a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/G
