DESCRIPTION:The Weekend of June 8-10\, the Brown County Women's Mountain Bi
 ke Clinic is taking place at Brown County State Park. As part of this speci
 al weekend Gnawbone Lefty will lead a BBC club ride on the BC trails\, espe
 cially inviting spouses and companions of the clinic attendees to attend.  
 The fun will start at 9:00 am at the Brown County State Park Upper North Sh
 elter House.  This will be a casual no drop / regroup often ride. Post ride
  refreshments will be provided.  Come join and show the trails to our out o
 f town guests.  Non-BBC-members will be required to sign a liability waiver
  prior to participation.
