 ter Check-In<br>just off SR 46 east of Bloomington.  We<br>will decide on t
 he fly which way we want<br>to do it\, either up Jack Ass Hill or down<br>J
 ack Ass Hill.  Either way\, you get a<br>monster gravel hill to climb!!<br>
 <br>Ride is mostly gravel\, with some pavement<br>and a nice stretch of lev
 el double track<br>along Bartley Ridge in Yellowwood State<br>Forest.<br><b
 r>Meet at former K-Mart @ 5:30<br>if you want to car pool to Kent Road.<br>
 The ride leaves from the Kent Road<br>Hunter Check-In about 6:00PM.<br><br>
 BRING LIGHTS!! BRING LIGHTS!!<br><br><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=
 http%3A%2F%2Fbloomingtonbicycleclub.org%2Fmaps%2FGravel_Rides%2FThe_Either_
 Way_You_Get_a_Monster_Gravel_Hill_Loop_23.pdf&amp\;sa=D&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg
