RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20200616T174500
CREATED:20200302T150145Z
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/578685" id="ow385" __is
 _owner="true">Dam Overlook</a> 25 miles<br>(Changed to avoid repair work on
  446.)<br><br><i>Please observe social distancing norms as we gather and ri
 de. We plan no formal leader. EVERYONE is a leader. Familiarize yourself wi
 th the ride before heading out. We will ride in small groups. People in the
  last group will endeavor to sweep the route and assist others as needed.</
 i><br><ul><li>Be SAFE. Don't blow through stop signs. Consider bike lights.
 <br></li><li>Be COURTEOUS: Single up in traffic<br></li><li>Be PREDICTABLE:
  Signal your intentions to cars and fellow riders.</li></ul>The "Older\, Wi
 ser\, and a Little Slower" training group emphasizes moderate rides\, and a
  route planned in advance that is posted on the ride calendar. This is a no
  drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride. The OWLS often average 15 to 19 mph
  on flat roads\, and typically have an overall average moving speed between
  12 and 15 mph including hills. Distances vary from 20 to 30 miles\, depend
 ing partly on available light. Early season rides will be somewhat shorter 
 and slower. Rides depart promptly at 5:45.<br><br>Non-members should sign u
 p for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?eve
 nt_id=133776">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and 
 which includes electronically signing a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to p
 articipation.<br><br>Questions? Contact <a href="mailto:allan.edmonds@gmail
 .com">Allan Edmonds</a> or <a href="mailto:gail.morell@gmail.com">Gail More
 ll</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20200618T142128Z
LOCATION:Sherwood Oaks Christian Church\, 2700 E Rogers Rd\, Bloomington\, 
 IN 47401\, USA
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:OWLS Dam Overlook
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
