DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/3450520">Bridge Out</a>
  18 miles. Out and back\, from when the bridge really was closed.<br><br>Th
 e "Older\, Wiser\, and a Little Slower" training group emphasizes moderate 
 rides\, and a route planned in advance that is posted on the ride calendar.
  This is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride. The OWLS often average
  15 to 19 mph on flat roads\, and typically have an overall average moving 
 speed between 12 and 15 mph including hills. Distances vary from 20 to 30 m
 iles\, depending partly on available light. Early season rides will be some
 what shorter and slower.<br><br>Questions? Contact<a href="mailto:allan.edm
 onds@gmail.com" target="_blank"> Allan Edmonds</a>&nbsp\;or <a href="mailto
 :gail.morell@gmail.com" target="_blank">Gail Morell</a><br><br>Starts in th
 e parking lot of Sherwood Oaks Christian Church.
LAST-MODIFIED:20181009T111025Z
LOCATION:Sherwood Oaks Christian Church\, 2700 E Rogers Rd\, Bloomington\, 
 IN 47401\, USA
