DESCRIPTION:<br><p>As we move into stage 5 of Back on track Indiana\, we wo
 uld like to invite you to help celebrate this 4<sup>th</sup> of July Indepe
 ndence Day with this special ride&nbsp\;</p><p>Please join us for a causal 
 ride over to McCormick’s Creek State Park. We will be stopping by the Canyo
 n Inn for breakfast.&nbsp\; They are open now for breakfast\, just not the 
 standard buffet yet. This is a no drop ride and all are welcome.<br></p><p>
 In the event of inclement weather I will post updates on the BBC Facebook p
 age and on the ride calendar.</p>&nbsp\;Meet at Bryan Park at 8:00 AM.&nbsp
 \;&nbsp\;<br><br><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/30428504">McCormic
 k's Creek Breakfast Ride</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20200629T124317Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Breakfast ride to McCormick's Creek State Park Ride Leader Warren S
 mith
TRANSP:OPAQUE
