DESCRIPTION:This 20-miler begins at the Blackwell Horse<br>Camp on Tower Ri
 dge Road\, extends<br>down Dutch Ridge Road\, and loops<br>back to Blackwel
 l via Henderson Creek\,<br>Hickory Grove\, and Tower Ridge.  The<br>route i
 s a mix of one-half HNF gravel and<br>one-half paved county road.  There is
 <br>no single or double track.<br>XC or MTB are fine.<br><br>Meet at 5:30PM
  at the former K-Mart<br>East parking lot to car pool.  The ride<br>leaves 
 from Blackwell Horse Camp<br>on Tower Ridge Road about 6:00PM.<br><br>BRING
  LIGHTS !!<br>&nbsp\;<br><a id="ow255" href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.
 org/maps/Gravel_Rides/Reverse_Going_Dutch_Ridge_20.pdf" target="_blank" __i
 s_owner="true">Reverse Going Dutch Ridge 20</a><br><br><a id="ow241" href="
 https://ridewithgps.com/routes/29143047" target="_blank" __is_owner="true">
 GPS Files</a><a id="ow251" __is_owner="true"></a>
