UID:7sp3jbp0h4ehsslsknhhku9v06@google.com
CREATED:20181214T232737Z
DESCRIPTION:\nDue to rain this event is moved to Sunday\n3nd annual Christm
 as Bike Ride Saturday\, December 15th @ 5:00 p.m.\n\nA year has passed sinc
 e Santa was last seen on his cruiser bike in Bloomington. That means it's t
 ime to dust off your Christmas spirit and your bicycle and parade it down t
 he Bline.\n\nDecorate your bike and yourself (lights encouraged) for a shor
 t holiday cruise. We will meet at the Country Club Trail Head for a spin no
 rth. Cookies and hot chocolate (hot schnackalaks for the adults) to be serv
 ed when we all return. It's your annual opportunity to display your ugliest
  holiday sweater\, favorite Christmas morning pj’s\, killer bike light disp
 lay\, pine bough arrangement expertise\, or whatever other weird holiday mo
 jo you want to share with the unsuspecting pedestrians of our little burg. 
  \n\nBring your bike (of course).\nBring the kids. \nBring a helmet. \nLeav
 e  your sense of dignity at home.
LAST-MODIFIED:20181214T232737Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Santa Ride
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
