DESCRIPTION:Meet Across from Bryan Park Pool (<a href="https://bloomingtonb
 icycleclub.org/gmaps/bbcmaps.php/?lat=39.154581234&lng=-86.522427&zoom=16&m
 ap=ROADMAP&message=Ride%20Start%3Cbr%3EAcross%20from%3Cbr%3EBryan%20Park%20
 Pool">map</a>)<br><br>This is a ride to the Bloomfield Rd overpass that cro
 sses I-69.  On the way back we will stop at Cresent Doughnuts for a snack.<
 br><br><a href="https://www.bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/gmaps/overpass.html"
 >Doughnut Ride</a> (9 miles)<br><br>By going on this ride\, you will bolste
 r a project that will make it easier for bicycles and pedestrians to cross 
 I-69.  When passing over this interchange eight crosswalks are traversed.  
 Help advance a ramp tunnels design which can eliminate the use of the cross
  walks.  All support is welcome.
