DESCRIPTION:The "Older\, Wiser\, and a Little Slower" training group emphas
 izes moderate rides\, and a route planned in advance that is posted on the 
 ride calendar. This is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride. The OWLS
  often average 15 to 19 mph on flat roads\, and typically have an overall a
 verage moving speed between 12 and 15 mph including hills. Distances vary f
 rom 20 to 30 miles\, depending partly on available light. Early season ride
 s will be somewhat shorter and slower.<br><br>Questions? Contact<a href="ma
 ilto:allan.edmonds@gmail.com" target="_blank"> Allan Edmonds</a>&nbsp\;or <
 a href="mailto:gail.morell@gmail.com" target="_blank">Gail Morell</a><br><b
 r>Starts in the parking lot of Sherwood Oaks Christian Church.
LAST-MODIFIED:20181030T214304Z
LOCATION:Sherwood Oaks Christian Church\, 2700 E Rogers Rd\, Bloomington\, 
 IN 47401\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:OWLS Ride
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
