DESCRIPTION:Join us for this last official Death March Training ride.&nbsp\
 ; This is a mix of gravel roads and pavement riding.<br><br>We will start o
 ut at Blackwell Horse Camp\, ride over to Dutch Ridge Rd. Chrisley-Hillenbu
 rg then&nbsp\; Ride out to Norman then over to Hanner. Ride to Cornett then
  over to Robinson. Up to the Fire Tower and Back to Blackwell.&nbsp\; Aprox
 . 30 miles<br><br>We will get together after the ride at Scenic-View Restau
 rant on 446 for some season end libations....<br><br>Meet at old K-Mart par
 king lot 12:00 Noon to carpool to Blackwell or meet at Blackwell for a 12:3
 0 PM Start.<br><br><a href="https://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/Gravel_
 Rides/Death_March_3-0.pdf" id="ow328" __is_owner="true">Ride Map and Queue 
 Sheet</a><br><br><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/32062659">Death Ma
 rch 3.0</a>
