DESCRIPTION:This ride is a take off on the Old Around Boltinghouse Cruise\,
  a short (22 mile) early season route around the legendary hill on Boltingh
 ouse Road.  We have offered this longer version the last few years with the
  original ride as a shorter version\, and the longer version has&nbsp\; bec
 ome the most popular version of the ride.&nbsp\;<br>You can always shortcut
  on Anderson Road for a nice\, shorter  28 mile loop. There are usually a f
 ew intrepid soles who turn left at Dolan and ride up the big hill just for 
 grins!<br><br><a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/John_Bassett_
 Maps/Way_Around_Boltinghouse_36.pdf" target="_blank">Way Around Boltinghous
 e 36</a><a><br><br></a><a href="http://ridewithgps.com/routes/1000066" targ
 et="_blank">GPS Links</a>
