DESCRIPTION:This route&nbsp\; explores the New 2019 West of 446 Check point
 s for the March 9th<br>Death March. It Starts and finishes at Blackwell Hor
 se camp<br><br>Route is entirely gravel and pavement\,<br>no trail.<br><br>
 Meet at 5:30 pm at the former K-Mart<br>East parking lot to car pool.  The 
 ride<br>leaves from Blackwell horse camp&nbsp\; about 6:00PM.<br><br>Bring 
 Lights!<br><br><br><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/31605414" id="ow
 309" __is_owner="true">Death March West CP'S</a>
