CREATED:20190116T212353Z
DESCRIPTION:<br>THIS RIDE MAYBE MODIFIED ACCORDING TO WEATHER<br><br>This r
 ide is mostly gravel with a section of<br>level-ish double track across Bar
 tley Ridge.<br>Park at Belmont Chapel on Lower<br>Schooner Road\, go up Cro
 oked Creek<br>Road\, across Bartley Ridge to TC Steele<br>Road\, out Gilmor
 e Ridge\, down Jackass<br>Hill\, out to Kent Road and back to Belmont<br>Ch
 apel.<br><br>Route is suitable for MTB\, cyclocross\,<br>and gravel bikes.<
