 \,Tram\, and Schacht</a> 26 miles<br><br>Re-do of last Thursday's rainout r
 ide.<br><br><br>The "Older\, Wiser\, and a Little Slower" training group em
 phasizes moderate rides\, and a route planned in advance that is posted on 
 the ride calendar. This is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride. The 
 OWLS often average 15 to 19 mph on flat roads\, and typically have an overa
 ll average moving speed between 12 and 15 mph including hills. Distances va
 ry from 20 to 30 miles\, depending partly on available light. Early season 
 rides will be somewhat shorter and slower.<br><br>Questions? Contact<a href
 ="mailto:allan.edmonds@gmail.com" target="_blank"> Allan Edmonds</a>&nbsp\;
 or <a href="mailto:gail.morell@gmail.com" target="_blank">Gail Morell</a><b
 r><br>Starts in the parking lot of Sherwood Oaks Christian Church.
