UID:3o4alig38fo5t9tigcdc2qjtol@google.com
CREATED:20180314T232452Z
DESCRIPTION:<br>You have a couple of distance options on this one.&nbsp\; T
 he short option is 27 pretty hilly miles down south to the Cedar Buff Natur
 e Preserve.  The road may&nbsp\;be rough in spots\, but the roiling hills o
 f Ketchum Road down the Clear Creek valley to Harrodsburg are gorgeous in t
 he Spring.<br><br>There will be an optional 50 mile version&nbsp\;extending
  a little farther south from the Nature Preserve\, and winding back north t
 hrough Avoca.&nbsp\; it is usually split about 50-50 each route.<br><br><a 
 href="https://www.google.com/url?q=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.bloomingtonbicycleclub.
 org%2Fprivate%2FBBCMaps%2Fmap_pack_2%2Fcedar_bluff.pdf&amp\;sa=D&amp\;usd=2
 &amp\;usg=AFQjCNHDCaF0C7rnTNwwL2zwmsakDhrTcg" target="_blank">Cedar Bluff N
 ature Preserve</a><br><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=http%3A%2F%2Fbl
 oomingtonbicycleclub.org%2Fmaps%2FJohn_Bassett_Maps%2FCedar_Bluff_50_Mile_O
 ption_2016.pdf&amp\;sa=D&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AFQjCNHLePEX1YZJ0p2YFGi9Iqcqia
 iTpA" target="_blank">Cedar Bluff 50 Mile Option</a><br><a href="https://ww
 w.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fridewithgps.com%2Froutes%2F4264004&amp\;sa
 =D&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AFQjCNECGh1iGaApubQ6zM-jt313OhEryw" target="_blank">
 GPS Files Cedar Bluff</a><br><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A
 %2F%2Fridewithgps.com%2Froutes%2F12625168&amp\;sa=D&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AFQ
 jCNGSXn1kki4iVJ9CKpCcpf2lztFi0w" target="_blank">GPS Files 50 Mile Option</
 a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20190401T231531Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot @ 39.15435\,-86.523
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Cedar Bluff Nature Preserve - Leader: Yusuf Nur
