DTSTART:20180804T120000Z
DTEND:20180804T190000Z
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:0527e4d7fpjknejofpdu7roheq@google.com
CREATED:20170727T164957Z
DESCRIPTION:<br><br>This year's version of the ride will likely be a one-of
 f route.&nbsp\; The "classic" Wilbur route crossed SR 37 on the way north a
 t Pine Avenue.&nbsp\; This crossing is now permanently closed by I-69 const
 ruction.&nbsp\; A likely route in the future will be to use an access road 
 on the west side of I-69 for part of the route north.&nbsp\; However\, this
  access road is not yet complete.&nbsp\; So\, rather than go out and back a
  considerable distance on Old 37\, our route this year will go north on the
  west side of I-69 on Bottom\, Dittemore\, and Buskirk before going the cla
 ssic route on Paragon Road.&nbsp\; This adds a couple of hills\, but shorte
 ns the distance a little.&nbsp\; The rest of the route is unchanged.<br><br
 ><br>See pdf map /queue sheet and RWGPS mapping below for details on this r
 oute revision.<br>A Wild 76 miles?&nbsp\; Depends on who shows up.&nbsp\; A
 nd\, you get the Hacker Creek Hill on the way home!<br><br><a href="http://
 bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/BBCMaps/map_pack_2/wild_wilbur.pdf" target=
 "_blank">Wild Ride to Wilbur 78</a><br><br><a href="https://ridewithgps.com
 /routes/28203203" target="_blank">GPS Files</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20180801T224929Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot @ 39.15435\,-86.523
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Wild Ride to Wilbur - Leader: Yusuf Nur
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-APPLE-TRAVEL-ADVISORY-BEHAVIOR:AUTOMATIC
END:VEVENT
