 ubaix type pavement on Rock East<br>Road we will detour our route right ont
 o<br>Carmichael Road rather than go through<br>Hobbieville.<br><br>The rout
 e is a fairly hilly 45 miles and is<br>shown on the map and and GPS links b
 elow.<br>See the other Cincinnati. Visit the<br>historic\, refurbished Yoho
  Grocery in<br>Solsberry.  Laugh in the face of Whitehall<br>Hill and take 
 a sharp right at its base.<br><br><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=htt
 p%3A%2F%2Fbloomingtonbicycleclub.org%2Fmaps%2FJohn_Bassett_Maps%2FNot_Hobbi
