DESCRIPTION:<br><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/35253192" id="ow521
 " __is_owner="true">Karst Park</a> 20 miles<br><br>Watch the calendar for w
 eather-related updates and for future rides.<br><br><i>Please observe socia
 l distancing norms as we gather and ride. We plan no formal leader. EVERYON
 E is a leader. Familiarize yourself with the ride before heading out. We wi
 ll ride in small groups. People in the last group will endeavor to sweep th
 e route and assist others as needed.</i><ul><li>Be SAFE. Don't blow through
  stop signs. Consider bike lights.<br></li><li>Be COURTEOUS: Single up in t
 raffic<br></li><li>Be PREDICTABLE: Signal your intentions to cars and fello
 w riders.</li></ul>This branch of the OWLS training group also emphasizes s
 omewhat slower\, moderate rides\, and a route planned in advance that is po
 sted on the ride calendar. This is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ri
 de. Expect an overall average moving speed 11 - 15 mph including hills. Dis
 tances vary from 20 to 30 miles. Early season rides will be somewhat shorte
 r and slower. Rides depart promptly at 9:30am.<br><br>Non-members should si
 gn up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php
 ?event_id=133776">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, 
 and which includes electronically signing a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior 
 to participation.<br><br>Questions? Contact <a href="mailto:allan.edmonds@g
 mail.com">Allan Edmonds</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20210320T153924Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Parking Lot\, S Woodlawn Ave\, Bloomington\, IN 47401\,
  USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Afternoon Ride - Karst Park
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
