 <br><br>The BBC's historic Paragon Ride is one of those that was highly imp
 acted by I-69 construction.  So\, a couple of years ago Joe Anderson sugges
 ted this new\, modified route which adds a little bit of distance and some 
 new roads. It was a big hit\, so we do it again.&nbsp\; The route goes firs
 t to Paragon\, then north a little before returning south through Gosport. 
  Joe will personally lead this one\, and we are pretty excited about that.<
 br><br>Non-members should sign up for a&nbsp\;<a href="https://secure.getme
 registered.com/get_information.php?event_id=133776">free trial membership</
 a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing
  a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.
