DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/13171655" id="ow518" __
 is_owner="true">Shuffle Creek</a> 26 miles<br><br>Please observe social dis
 tancing norms as we gather and ride.&nbsp\;<ul><li>Be SAFE. Don't blow thro
 ugh stop signs. Consider bike lights.<br></li><li>Be COURTEOUS: Single up i
 n traffic<br></li><li>Be PREDICTABLE: Signal your intentions to cars and fe
 llow riders.</li></ul>The "Older\, Wiser\, and a Little Slower" training gr
 oup emphasizes moderate rides\, and a route planned in advance that is post
 ed on the ride calendar. This is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride
 . The OWLS often average 15 to 19 mph on flat roads\, and typically have an
  overall average moving speed between 12 and 15 mph including hills. Distan
 ces vary from 20 to 30 miles\, depending partly on available light. Early s
 eason rides will be somewhat shorter and slower. Rides depart promptly at 5
 :45.<br><br>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmer
 egistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=133776">free trial membership</a
 >\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing 
 a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.<br><br>Questions? Contac
 t&nbsp\;<a href="mailto:gail.morell@gmail.com">Gail Morell</a>.
LAST-MODIFIED:20211014T010756Z
LOCATION:Sherwood Oaks Christian Church\, 2700 E Rogers Rd\, Bloomington\, 
 IN 47401\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:OWLS Ride - Shuffle Creek
