CREATED:20211125T024021Z
DESCRIPTION:<b><br></b>&nbsp\;<br>Join in for a fun Brown County gravel rid
 e starting and ending at Hard Truth in Nashville.&nbsp\; This is a loop rid
 e borrowed from Jeff Fetterer and has its fair share of ups and downs.&nbsp
 \; With the exception of Covered Bridge Road the clockwise loop generally g
 oes down the steep grades and up the gentler grades.&nbsp\; Get to near the
  top of Bear Wallow Hill without ever being on Bear Wallow Hill Road. And\,
  finish up with a great gravel decent on Wallow Hollow.<br><br>Route is ent
 irely gravel and pavement&nbsp\;- no trail.&nbsp\;<br><br>Shorter options a
 re possible&nbsp\;<br><br><b>No formal car pooling will be offered</b><br><
 br><a href="https://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/Gravel_Rides/Jeff-s_Sal
 meron_-_Wallow_Hollow_Loop_from_Hard_Truth_29.pdf">PDF Map and Queue Sheet<
 /a><br><br><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/31648043">GPS Files</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20211125T024222Z
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Jeff's Salmeron / Wallow Hollow Loop from Hard Truth 29man 
TRANSP:OPAQUE
