 t_Maps/iRide_Fluck_Mill_22.pdf" id="ow381" __is_owner="true">iRide Fluck Mi
 ll 22</a></p><p><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/24437959" id="ow385
 " __is_owner="true">GPS Files</a><br></p><p>The iRide is a no-drop Intermed
 iate level ride of moderate pace and distance with regrouping points.&nbsp\
 ; Pace is anticipated to be 15-17 mph.</p><p>The tRide is an advanced level
  ride of high pace and moderate distance that may or may not include regrou
 ping points. &nbsp\;Pace is anticipated to be 18+ mph. Expect occasional sp
 rint or Strava segments\, pace line riding at high speed\, intervals\, and 
 fewer regrouping stops.</p><p>The iRide and tRide will start at the same pl
 ace and will ride the same scheduled route\, but the start of these two gro
 ups will be staggered with the tRide starting first at 5:45 and the iRide j
 ust behind them. Mileages will increase as the season progresses.&nbsp\; </
 p><p>Riders are expected to look out for each other during the rides.&nbsp\
 ; Ride maps and GPS links will be posted here in advance. Riders unfamiliar
  with the route should bring along a copy of the map.</p>Non-members should
  sign up for a&nbsp\;<a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_inform
 ation.php?event_id=133776">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to three
  rides\, and which includes electronically signing a liability waiver\,&nbs
 p\;prior to participation.<br><br>&nbsp\;<br><br>&nbsp\;&nbsp\;
