 uffle\, Brummett</a></p><p>Ready for a high spirited ride? BV Ride is an in
 termediate/ advanced ride and moderate distance that may or may not include
  regrouping points.  Pace is anticipated to be 17+ mph. Expect occasional s
 print or Strava segments\, pace line riding at high speed\, intervals\, and
  fewer regrouping stops.</p><p>The BV Ride will start at the Parking lot ac
 ross from the Bryan Park Pool on Woodlawn at 5:45. Mileages will increase a
 s the season progresses. If you keep coming we will make you faster!</p><p>
 Riders are expected to look out for each other during the rides.  Ride maps
  and GPS links will be posted here in advance. Riders unfamiliar with the r
 oute should bring along a copy of the map.</p>Non-members should sign up fo
 r a <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://secure.getmeregistered.co
 m/get_information.php?event_id%3D133776&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\
 ;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw2j50-2uvBSoK9EgtVBL-h8" target="_blank">free trial me
 mbership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronical
 ly signing a liability waiver\, prior to participation.
