 oomingtonbicycleclub.org/gmaps/BryanParkPool.html">map</a>)<br><br>Nice N E
 asy rides cater to those who want to take it easy and to beginning riders. 
 These Sunday rides feature lower mileage (19-26 miles) and slower paces. Th
 ey use Bloomington area low traffic roads.<br><br>West Side. (22 miles) <a 
 href="https://www.bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/niceneasy/?6" id="ow539" __is_
 owner="true">West Side Map</a>.<br><br>Non-members should\, prior to partic
 ipation\, sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_inf
 ormation.php?event_id=132872">free trial membership</a>\, which includes el
 ectronically signing a liability waiver.</html-blob>
