DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/John_Bassett_M
 aps/Joes_Paragon_and_Gosport_Ride_57.pdf" target="_blank">Joe&#39\;s Parago
 n and Gosport Ride 57</a><br><br><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/31
 135553" target="_blank">GPS Files</a><br><br>The BBC&#39\;s historic Parago
 n Ride is one of those that was highly impacted by I-69 construction.  So\,
  last year Joe Anderson has suggested this new\, modified route which adds 
 a little bit of distance and some new roads. It was a big hit\, so we will 
 do it again.  The route goes first to Paragon\, then north a little before 
 returning south through Gosport.  Joe will personally lead this one\, and w
 e are pretty excited about that.<br><br>Non-members should sign up for a <a
  href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=1337
 76" target="_blank">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\
 , and which includes electronically signing a liability waiver\, prior to p
 articipation.
