CREATED:20211213T213756Z
DESCRIPTION:Our first Saturday off road ride of the year has something for 
 everyone..<br><br>We will assemble at the camp site just beside trail 19 in
  the Hoosier National Forrest.<br>Go down tower ridge rd to the first road 
 past the tower. County Rd 1500 turn right. go approx<br>1.50 miles to camp 
 site on left. <br><br>We will have a fire going. From this site you can do 
 whatever you want to do. You can ride MTB trails. you can ride gravel\, you
  can hike trails or you can stay by the fire and enjoy good company and sha
 re stories. Bring any snacks  and beverages to share that you wish.<br><br>
 All rides will be impromptu. I hope you can join us for this fun day of  fe
 llowship. <br><br><b>no formal car pooling will be offered</b><br><br>Bring
  chairs if you want to sit around the camp fire.
LAST-MODIFIED:20220106T233523Z
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:First Saturday off road ride
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
