DESCRIPTION:\n\nCome one Come all! Join us for this fun night in BCSP\n\nWe
  will ride in the beautiful snow covered hills of Brown County State Park. 
 Road bike\, Mountain bikes\, Fat bikes\, Cross Bikes\, hiking.. you bring i
 t you use it. You can ride the  road or trails or hike\, cross country ski 
 or snow shoe.....\n\nWe will gather at the North (Upper) Shelter house just
  up the hill from the North parking lot where the mountain bike trail parki
 ng lot is. We will have a little fire or warming station. Come if you want 
 to participate  or just mind the fire...All are welcome.\n\nBring your 2021
  park & trail pass or you can buy them the day of the ride. You do not need
  a trail pass just to ride beginner trails.\n\n\nNo formal car pooling will
  be offered due to Covid-19
LAST-MODIFIED:20210216T223655Z
LOCATION: Brown County State Park Upper Shelterhouse @39.189036\, -86.21877
 5
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:BCSP FUN NIGHT
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
