CREATED:20210624T232309Z
DESCRIPTION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot  <a href="https://www.google.com/ma
 ps/place//@39.1543611\,-86.523\,15z" target="_blank">map</a><br><br>The fea
 tured attraction of this ride is the quaint little covered bridge southwest
  of Bloomfield on Plummer Creek.  Ride to the bridge\, turn around\, do a l
 unch break in Bloomfield\, and return home via Springville.<br>  <br>Note: 
 The Bloomfield IGA is now closed.  So plan on lunch at the Subway on SR 54\
 , seven blocks west of the Courthouse.  The route there is shown on the RWG
 PS map below.<br><br><a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/BBCMap
 s/map_pack_1/bloomfield_bridge.pdf" target="_blank">Bloomfield Covered Brid
 ge 82</a><br><br><a href="http://ridewithgps.com/routes/5530963" target="_b
 lank">GPS</a><a></a>
