 s.&nbsp\; Pace is anticipated to be 15-17 mph.<br></p><p>The tRide is an ad
 vanced level ride of high pace and moderate distance that may or may not in
 clude regrouping points. &nbsp\;Pace is anticipated to be 18+ mph. Expect o
 ccasional sprint or Strava segments\, pace line riding at high speed\, inte
 rvals\, and fewer regrouping stops.</p><p>The iRide and tRide will start at
  the same place and will ride the same scheduled route\, but the start of t
 hese two groups will be staggered with the tRide starting first at 5:45 and
  the iRide just behind them. Mileages will increase as the season progresse
 s.&nbsp\; </p><p>Riders are expected to look out for each other during the 
