DESCRIPTION:<p><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.strava.com
 /routes/2912143551812062356&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;ust=1649539
 890002802&amp\;usg=AOvVaw2GEYaqBJz7o3DoCEs--_39" target="_blank">29 Old 37\
 , Mel Curry\, Frontage\, Dittemore\, Bottom</a></p><p>Ready for a high spir
 ited ride? BV Ride is an intermediate/ advanced ride and moderate distance 
 that may or may not include regrouping points.  Pace is anticipated to be 1
 7+ mph. Expect occasional sprint or Strava segments\, pace line riding at h
 igh speed\, intervals\, and fewer regrouping stops.</p><p>The BV Ride will 
 start at the Parking lot across from the Bryan Park Pool on Woodlawn at 5:4
 5. Mileages will increase as the season progresses. If you keep coming we w
 ill make you faster!</p><p>Riders are expected to look out for each other d
 uring the rides.  Ride maps and GPS links will be posted here in advance. R
 iders unfamiliar with the route should bring along a copy of the map.</p>No
 n-members should sign up for a <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https:
 //secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id%3D133776&amp\;sa=
 D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;ust=1649539890002802&amp\;usg=AOvVaw2NYp1jBQmUC
 j-gzk3raLXC" target="_blank">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to thr
 ee rides\, and which includes electronically signing a liability waiver\, p
 rior to participation.
