 t 5:45. Mileages will increase as the season progresses. If you keep coming
  we will make you faster!</p><p>Riders are expected to look out for each ot
 her during the rides.  Ride maps and GPS links will be posted here in advan
 ce. Riders unfamiliar with the route should bring along a copy of the map.<
