 ments\, pace line riding at high speed\, intervals\, and fewer regrouping s
 tops.</p><p>The BV Ride will start at the Parking lot across from the Bryan
  Park Pool on Woodlawn at 5:45. Mileages will increase as the season progre
 sses. If you keep coming we will make you faster!</p><p>Riders are expected
  to look out for each other during the rides.  Ride maps and GPS links will
  be posted here in advance. Riders unfamiliar with the route should bring a
 long a copy of the map.</p>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https:
 //secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=133776" target="_
 blank">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which i
 ncludes electronically signing a liability waiver\, prior to participation.
