DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/33437095">Robinson Road
 </a>&nbsp\;27 miles<br><br>Watch the calendar for weather-related updates a
 nd for future morning rides.<br><br><i>Please observe social distancing nor
 ms as we gather and ride. We plan no formal leader. EVERYONE is a leader. F
 amiliarize yourself with the ride before heading out. We will ride in small
  groups. People in the last group will endeavor to sweep the route and assi
 st others as needed.</i><br><ul><li>Be SAFE. Don't blow through stop signs.
  Consider bike lights.<br></li><li>Be COURTEOUS: Single up in traffic<br></
 li><li>Be PREDICTABLE: Signal your intentions to cars and fellow riders.</l
 i></ul>This branch of the OWLS training group also emphasizes somewhat slow
 er\, moderate rides\, and a route planned in advance that is posted on the 
 ride calendar. This is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride. Expect a
 n overall average moving speed 11 - 15 mph including hills. Distances vary 
 from 20 to 30 miles. Early season rides will be somewhat shorter and slower
 . Rides depart promptly at 8:30am.<br><br>Non-members should sign up for a 
 <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=13
 3776">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which in
 cludes electronically signing a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participa
 tion.<br><br>Questions? Contact <a href="mailto:allan.edmonds@gmail.com">Al
 lan Edmonds</a>
