CREATED:20211125T134553Z
DESCRIPTION:<b>Note Time Change to 1:00PM<br></b> <br>Join in for a fun Bro
 wn County gravel ride starting and ending at Hard Truth in Nashville.  This
  is a loop ride borrowed from Jeff Fetterer and has its fair share of ups a
 nd downs.  With the exception of Covered Bridge Road the clockwise loop gen
 erally goes down the steep grades and up the gentler grades.  Get to near t
 he top of Bear Wallow Hill without ever being on Bear Wallow Hill Road. And
 \, finish up with a great gravel decent on Wallow Hollow.<br><br>Route is e
 ntirely gravel and pavement - no trail. <br><br>D<b>ue to Covid-19 No forma
 l car pooling will be offered</b><br><br><a href="https://bloomingtonbicycl
 eclub.org/maps/Gravel_Rides/Jeff-s_Salmeron_-_Wallow_Hollow_Loop_from_Hard_
 Truth_29.pdf" target="_blank">PDF Map and Queue Sheet</a><br><br><a href="h
 ttps://ridewithgps.com/routes/31648043" target="_blank">GPS Files</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20211125T134553Z
LOCATION:Big K Parking Lot @ 39.162664\, -86.492045
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Jeff's Salmeron / Wallow Hollow Loop from Hard Truth 29man 
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
