DESCRIPTION:The ride name says it all.&nbsp\; Join this little tour on the 
 back roads over to Nashville.&nbsp\; The 55 mile option features a white kn
 uckle descent down Lanam Ridge Hill and two good climbs up Helmsburg Hill a
 nd Bear Wallow Hill.&nbsp\; The 33 mile short option cuts off all this good
  stuff.<br><br><a href="http://www.bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/BBCMaps/
 map_pack_1/nashville_old_hilly.pdf">Hilly Route to Nashville</a><br><br><a 
 href="http://ridewithgps.com/routes/1102778">GPS</a><a id="ow1794" __is_own
 er="true"></a><br><br>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://sec
 ure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=133776">free trial mem
 bership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronicall
 y signing a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&
 nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;
