DESCRIPTION:Join in for the last off pavement / gravel ride of the season!&
 nbsp\;<br><br>This 20-miler begins at the Blackwell Horse<br>Camp on Tower 
 Ridge Road\, heads to<br>Hickory Grove Church\, and then circles<br>back to
  the horse camp via McPike Branch<br>Road and Dutch Ridge Road.  The route 
 is<br>predominately gravel with a little bit of <br>pavement\, and no trail
 .  Route is suitable<br>for CX\, gravel bike\, or MTB.Ride starts promptly<
 br>at 6:00<br><br>&nbsp\;We will not offer a formal car pool this year&nbsp
 \;<br>due to COVID-19 concerns.&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;<br>&nbsp\;<br><a href=
 "http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/Gravel_Rides/All%20Around%20Yellows
 tone%2020.pdf">All Around Yellowstone 20</a><a><br><br></a><a href="https:/
 /ridewithgps.com/routes/18155202">GPS Files</a><a></a>
