DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/30686375" id="ow366" __
 is_owner="true">Harmony Bridge</a> 25 miles<br><br>Please observe social di
 stancing norms as we gather and ride. We plan no formal leader. EVERYONE is
  a leader. Familiarize yourself with the ride before heading out. We will r
 ide in small groups.People in the last group will endeavor to sweep the rou
 te and assist others as needed.<br><ul><li>Be SAFE. Don't blow through stop
  signs. Consider bike lights.<br></li><li>Be COURTEOUS: Single up in traffi
 c<br></li><li>Be PREDICTABLE: Signal your intentions to cars and fellow rid
 ers.</li></ul>The "Older\, Wiser\, and a Little Slower" training group emph
 asizes moderate rides\, and a route planned in advance that is posted on th
 e ride calendar. This is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride. The OW
 LS often average 15 to 19 mph on flat roads\, and typically have an overall
  average moving speed between 12 and 15 mph including hills. Distances vary
  from 20 to 30 miles\, depending partly on available light. Early season ri
 des will be somewhat shorter and slower. Rides depart promptly at 5:45.<br>
 <br>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistere
 d.com/get_information.php?event_id=133776">free trial membership</a>\, good
  for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing a liabil
 ity waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.<br><br>Questions? Contact <a hre
 f="mailto:allan.edmonds@gmail.com">Allan Edmonds</a> or <a href="mailto:gai
 l.morell@gmail.com">Gail Morell</a>
