CREATED:20210314T144013Z
DESCRIPTION:Description:<p><a href="https://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps
 /iRides/A_New_eeeee-Harmony_Ver4_27.pdf">A New eeeee-Harmony Ver4 27</a><br
 ></p><p><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/36148937">GPS Files</a></p>
 <p>The iRide is a no-drop Intermediate level ride of moderate pace and dist
 ance with regrouping points.&nbsp\; Pace is anticipated to be 15-17 mph.<br
 ></p><p>The tRide is an advanced level ride of high pace and moderate dista
 nce that may or may not include regrouping points. &nbsp\;Pace is anticipat
 ed to be 18+ mph. Expect occasional sprint or Strava segments\, pace line r
 iding at high speed\, intervals\, and fewer regrouping stops.</p><p>The iRi
 de and tRide will start at the same place and will ride the same scheduled 
 route\, but the start of these two groups will be staggered with the tRide 
 starting first at 5:45 and the iRide just behind them. Mileages will increa
 se as the season progresses.&nbsp\; </p><p>Riders are expected to look out 
 for each other during the rides.&nbsp\; Ride maps and GPS links will be pos
 ted here in advance. Riders unfamiliar with the route should bring along a 
 copy of the map.</p>Non-members should sign up for a&nbsp\;<a href="https:/
 /secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=133776">free trial
  membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electroni
 cally signing a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.
LAST-MODIFIED:20220614T150520Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot @ 39.15435\,-86.523
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:iRide / tRide - A New eeeee-Harmony Ver4 27
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
