DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/John_Bassett_M
 aps/The_Limestone_Tour_with_Limestone_Trail_33.pdf">The Limestone Tour with
  Limestone Trail 33</a><br><br><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/3539
 9475">GPS Files</a><br><br>This ride is a scenic 33 mile tour of southweste
 rn Monroe County - with and lots of hills.<br>Thar's limestone in them thar
  hills!&nbsp\; This route hits four stone quarries and their accompanying h
 ills -- making it a stone belt de rigueur ride.<br><br>The short option of 
 23 miles on Harmony Road crosses over the impressive new high bridge over I
 -69.<br><br>Non-members should sign up for a&nbsp\;<a href="https://secure.
 getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=133776">free trial members
 hip</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically si
 gning a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.<br>&nbsp\;&nbsp\;
