 m<br>Gnawbone Lefty.&nbsp\;The ride<br>starts / ends at the Scarce-o-Fat Tr
 ail<br>parking lot at the base of Yellowwood<br>Dam.  There are sections of
  pavement<br>riding on South Shore Drive\, Lanam<br>Ridge\, Owl Creek Road\
 , and Helmsberg<br>Road.  The rest is gravel.<br><br>Approximately 20 miles
  - no single track\,<br>suitable for MTB\, gravel\, or cyclocross<br>bikes<
 b>.</b><br><b><br></b><br><b>Ride starts promptly<br>at 6:00<br><br>&nbsp\;
 We will not offer a formal car pool this year&nbsp\;<br></b>&nbsp\;<br>&nbs
 p\;<a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/Gravel_Rides/GRR%20Scarc
 e-o-Fat%2020.pdf">Scarce-o-Fat 20</a><br><br><a href="https://ridewithgps.c
 om/routes/11973231">GPS Files</a><a><br></a>
