 rogresses. If you keep coming we will make you faster!</p><p>Riders are exp
 ected to look out for each other during the rides.  Ride maps and GPS links
  will be posted here in advance. Riders unfamiliar with the route should br
 ing along a copy of the map.</p>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="h
 ttps://www.google.com/url?q=https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_informat
