DESCRIPTION:Description:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/33800384">E
 xtended Ellettsville Ride</a> 26 miles. Visit the covered bridge on Delap R
 oad.<br><br>Start from Bryan Park at 1:30pm.<br><br>Watch the calendar for 
 weather-related updates and for future morning rides.<br><br><i>Please obse
 rve social distancing norms as we gather and ride. We plan no formal leader
 . EVERYONE is a leader. Familiarize yourself with the ride before heading o
 ut. We will ride in small groups. People in the last group will endeavor to
  sweep the route and assist others as needed.</i><br><ul><li>Be SAFE. Don't
  blow through stop signs. Consider bike lights.<br></li><li>Be COURTEOUS: S
 ingle up in traffic<br></li><li>Be PREDICTABLE: Signal your intentions to c
 ars and fellow riders.</li></ul>This branch of the OWLS training group also
  emphasizes somewhat slower\, moderate rides\, and a route planned in advan
 ce that is posted on the ride calendar. This is a no drop ride\, but not a 
 beginner's ride. Expect an overall average moving speed 11 - 15 mph includi
 ng hills. Distances vary from 20 to 30 miles. Early season rides will be so
 mewhat shorter and slower. Rides depart promptly at 9:30am.<br><br>Non-memb
 ers should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_in
 formation.php?event_id=133776">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to t
 hree rides\, and which includes electronically signing a liability waiver\,
 &nbsp\;prior to participation.<br><br>Questions? Contact <a href="mailto:al
 lan.edmonds@gmail.com">Allan Edmonds</a>
