DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/26907106" id="ow1622" _
 _is_owner="true">Muscatatuck</a> 24/32 miles...<br><br>Weather looks very i
 ffy.<br><br>Watch the calendar for weather-related updates and for future r
 ides.&nbsp\;<ul><li>Be SAFE. Don't blow through stop signs. Consider bike l
 ights.<br></li><li>Be COURTEOUS: Single up in traffic<br></li><li>Be PREDIC
 TABLE: Signal your intentions to cars and fellow riders.</li></ul>This bran
 ch of the OWLS training group also emphasizes somewhat slower\, moderate ri
 des\, and a route planned in advance that is posted on the ride calendar. T
 his is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride. Expect an overall averag
 e moving speed 11 - 15 mph including hills. Distances vary from 20 to 30 mi
 les. Early season rides will be somewhat shorter and slower. Rides depart p
 romptly at 9:30am.<br><br>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https:/
 /secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=133776">free trial
  membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electroni
 cally signing a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.<br><br>Que
 stions? Contact <a href="mailto:allan.edmonds@gmail.com">Allan Edmonds</a>
