DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/31170317" id="ow457" __
 is_owner="true">Reverse Fluck Mill</a> 21 miles<br>Please observe social di
 stancing norms as we gather and ride.&nbsp\;<ul><li>Be SAFE. Don't blow thr
 ough stop signs. Consider bike lights.<br></li><li>Be COURTEOUS: Single up 
 in traffic<br></li><li>Be PREDICTABLE: Signal your intentions to cars and f
 ellow riders.</li></ul>The "Older\, Wiser\, and a Little Slower" training g
 roup emphasizes moderate rides\, and a route planned in advance that is pos
 ted on the ride calendar. This is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's rid
 e. The OWLS often average 15 to 19 mph on flat roads\, and typically have a
 n overall average moving speed between 12 and 15 mph including hills. Dista
 nces vary from 20 to 30 miles\, depending partly on available light. Early 
 season rides will be somewhat shorter and slower. Rides depart promptly at 
 5:45.<br><br>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getme
 registered.com/get_information.php?event_id=133776">free trial membership</
 a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing
  a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.<br><br>Questions? Conta
 ct&nbsp\;<a href="mailto:gail.morell@gmail.com">Gail Morell</a>.
