DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/33523179" id="ow2528" _
 _is_owner="true">Reverse Long Leonard</a>&nbsp\;26 miles<br><br>Watch the c
 alendar for weather-related updates and for future morning rides.<br><br><i
 >Please observe social distancing norms as we gather and ride. We plan no f
 ormal leader. EVERYONE is a leader. Familiarize yourself with the ride befo
 re heading out. We will ride in small groups. People in the last group will
  endeavor to sweep the route and assist others as needed.</i><br><ul><li>Be
  SAFE. Don't blow through stop signs. Consider bike lights.<br></li><li>Be 
 COURTEOUS: Single up in traffic<br></li><li>Be PREDICTABLE: Signal your int
 entions to cars and fellow riders.</li></ul>This branch of the OWLS trainin
 g group also emphasizes somewhat slower\, moderate rides\, and a route plan
 ned in advance that is posted on the ride calendar. This is a no drop ride\
 , but not a beginner's ride. Expect an overall average moving speed 11 - 15
  mph including hills. Distances vary from 20 to 30 miles. Early season ride
 s will be somewhat shorter and slower. Rides depart promptly at 8:30am.<br>
 <br>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistere
 d.com/get_information.php?event_id=133776">free trial membership</a>\, good
  for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing a liabil
 ity waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.<br><br>Questions? Contact <a hre
 f="mailto:allan.edmonds@gmail.com">Allan Edmonds</a>
