 de regrouping points.  Pace is anticipated to be 17+ mph. Expect occasional
  sprint or Strava segments\, pace line riding at high speed\, intervals\, a
 nd fewer regrouping stops.</p><p>The BV Ride will start at the Parking lot 
 across from the Bryan Park Pool on Woodlawn at 5:45. Mileages will increase
  as the season progresses. If you keep coming we will make you faster!</p><
 p>Riders are expected to look out for each other during the rides.  Ride ma
 ps and GPS links will be posted here in advance. Riders unfamiliar with the
  route should bring along a copy of the map.</p>Non-members should sign up 
