DESCRIPTION:<a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/John_Bassett_Ma
 ps/Paragon_Ride_2018_Version_47.pdf">Paragon Ride 2018 Version 47</a><br><b
 r><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/28782934">GPS Files</a><br><br>Hi
 storically\, the Paragon Ride crossed SR 37 at Turkey Track Road / Pine Roa
 d.  With the advent of I-69 that crossing no longer exists\, so we will add
  a mile or two and use Godsey Road east of Paragon to cross I-69 at the Lib
 erty Church Road exit.  From there we’ll take a new access road and SR 37 s
 traight back to Bloomington for a total of about 47 miles.<br><br>&nbsp\;No
 n-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/
 get_information.php?event_id=133776">free trial membership</a>\, good for u
 p to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing a liability wa
 iver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.&nbsp\;&nbsp\;
