 st<br>side from Maumee to the Boy<br>Scout Camp.<br><br>Route is suitable f
 or CX\, MTB\, or<br>Gravel bikes.<br><br>&nbsp\;<b>We will not offer a form
 al car pool this year&nbsp\;<br>due to COVID-19 concerns.&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbs
 p\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;</b><br><br><b>Ride will leave from the Blackwell<br>Horse
  Camp on Tower Ridge Road<br>promptly at 6:00PM</b><br><br>BRING LIGHTS !!<
 br><br><a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/Gravel_Rides/Blackwe
 ll%20Loop%20to%20HNF%20Trail%2019.pdf">Blackwell Loop to HNF Trail 19</a><b
