BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20210325T174500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20210325T194500
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:3ec6lbtuh6edcbf846ib8c4r0n@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20210325T174500
CREATED:20210314T144013Z
DESCRIPTION:<p><a href="https://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/iRides/Pine
 _Grove_Loop_21.pdf">Pine Grove Loop 21</a><br></p><p><a href="https://ridew
 ithgps.com/routes/17377718" id="ow907" __is_owner="true">GPS Files</a><br><
 /p><p>The iRide is a no-drop Intermediate level ride of moderate pace and d
 istance with regrouping points.&nbsp\; Pace is anticipated to be 15-17 mph.
 <br></p><p>The tRide is an advanced level ride of high pace and moderate di
 stance that may or may not include regrouping points. &nbsp\;Pace is antici
 pated to be 18+ mph. Expect occasional sprint or Strava segments\, pace lin
 e riding at high speed\, intervals\, and fewer regrouping stops.</p><p>The 
 iRide and tRide will start at the same place and will ride the same schedul
 ed route\, but the start of these two groups will be staggered with the tRi
 de starting first at 5:45 and the iRide just behind them. Mileages will inc
 rease as the season progresses.&nbsp\; </p><p>Riders are expected to look o
 ut for each other during the rides.&nbsp\; Ride maps and GPS links will be 
 posted here in advance. Riders unfamiliar with the route should bring along
  a copy of the map.</p>Non-members should sign up for a&nbsp\;<a href="http
 s://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=133776">free tr
 ial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electr
 onically signing a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.
LAST-MODIFIED:20210321T225705Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot @ 39.15435\,-86.523
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:iRide / tRide - Pine Grove Loop 21
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART:20211006T220000Z
DTEND:20211007T010000Z
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:0qp6cr7ga11ef88d0v0l6g49ql@google.com
CREATED:20211004T123549Z
DESCRIPTION:<b>You can also park at the Yellowwood office parking lot</b>&n
 bsp\;<br><br><br>This is a fun little route\, borrowed from<br>Gnawbone Lef
 ty.&nbsp\;The ride<br>starts / ends at the Scarce-o-Fat Trail<br>parking lo
 t at the base of Yellowwood<br>Dam.  There are sections of pavement<br>ridi
