 a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/20392457" id="ow367" __is_owner="tru
 e">GPS Files</a><br></p><p>The iRide is a no-drop Intermediate level ride o
 f moderate pace and distance with regrouping points.&nbsp\; Pace is anticip
 ated to be 15-17 mph.</p><p>The tRide is an advanced level ride of high pac
 e and moderate distance that may or may not include regrouping points. &nbs
 p\;Pace is anticipated to be 18+ mph. Expect occasional sprint or Strava se
 gments\, pace line riding at high speed\, intervals\, and fewer regrouping 
 stops.</p><p>The iRide and tRide will start at the same place and will ride
  the same scheduled route\, but the start of these two groups will be stagg
 ered with the tRide starting first at 5:45 and the iRide just behind them. 
 Mileages will increase as the season progresses.&nbsp\; </p><p>Riders are e
 xpected to look out for each other during the rides.&nbsp\; Ride maps and G
 PS links will be posted here in advance. Riders unfamiliar with the route s
 hould bring along a copy of the map.</p>Non-members should sign up for a&nb
 sp\;<a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_i
 d=133776">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and whic
 h includes electronically signing a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to parti
 cipation.<br><br>&nbsp\;<br><br>&nbsp\;&nbsp\;
