DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><a href="https://www.bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps
 /BBCMaps/map_pack_2/low_gap_touchables.pdf">Low Gap to Martinsville ("The T
 ouchables")</a><br><br><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/28325235">GP
 S Files</a><br><br>51 moderate miles with a 26 mile short option.&nbsp\; Th
 is route takes riders through Morgan Monroe State Forest and past "The Touc
 hables" Sculpture Garden.&nbsp\; Consider coasting and taking a gander at t
 he unique pieces scattered on the west side of the road.<br><br>We will tak
 e the new Old 37 connector on the east side of I-69 from the Liberty Church
  interchange down to Old 37\, more or less duplicating the original mapping
  of this ride.&nbsp\; But\, you always have the option to spice up your lif
 e and take Hacker Creek Road back to Forest Road junction.&nbsp\; Of course
 \, that means climbing the infamous Hacker Creek Hill.<br><br><b>Current in
 formation (July 19) is that Southview Drive at Mahalasville Road will be op
 en in time for the ride.&nbsp\; Stay tuned for more information on this and
  an updated GPS link\, if needed.</b><br><br>Non-members should sign up for
  a&nbsp\;<a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?ev
 ent_id=136627" id="ow2751" __is_owner="true">free trial membership</a>\, go
 od for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing a liab
 ility waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.</html-blob>
LAST-MODIFIED:20220518T200026Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot @ 39.15435\,-86.523
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Low Gap to Martinsville (Touchables) - Leader: TBD
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
