DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/34911042">Mu
 scatatuck</a> 25 miles</html-blob><br><html-blob>High in the 50s?!</html-bl
 ob><br><html-blob><br></html-blob><br><html-blob>Watch the calendar for wea
 ther-related updates and for future rides.&nbsp\;<ul><li>Be SAFE. Don't blo
 w through stop signs. Consider bike lights.<br></li><li>Be COURTEOUS: Singl
 e up in traffic<br></li><li>Be PREDICTABLE: Signal your intentions to cars 
 and fellow riders.</li></ul>This branch of the OWLS training group also emp
 hasizes somewhat slower\, moderate rides\, and a route planned in advance t
 hat is posted on the ride calendar. This is a no drop ride\, but not a begi
 nner's ride. Expect an overall average moving speed 11 - 15 mph including h
 ills. Distances vary from 20 to 30 miles. Early season rides will be somewh
 at shorter and slower.During cold weather the ride departs at 1:30pm.<br><b
 r>Non-members should sign up for a&nbsp\;<a href="https://secure.getmeregis
 tered.com/get_information.php?event_id=133776">free trial membership</a>\, 
 good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing a li
 ability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.<br><br>Questions? Contact&nb
 sp\;<a href="mailto:allan.edmonds@gmail.com">Allan Edmonds</a></html-blob>
