DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/34271873" id="ow1842" _
 _is_owner="true">Tramway</a> 19 miles<br><br>Please observe social distanci
 ng norms as we gather and ride. We plan no formal leader. EVERYONE is a lea
 der. Familiarize yourself with the ride before heading out. We will ride in
  small groups.People in the last group will endeavor to sweep the route and
  assist others as needed.<br><ul><li>Be SAFE. Don't blow through stop signs
 . Consider bike lights.<br></li><li>Be COURTEOUS: Single up in traffic<br><
 /li><li>Be PREDICTABLE: Signal your intentions to cars and fellow riders.</
 li></ul>The "Older\, Wiser\, and a Little Slower" training group emphasizes
  moderate rides\, and a route planned in advance that is posted on the ride
  calendar. This is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride. The OWLS oft
 en average 15 to 19 mph on flat roads\, and typically have an overall avera
 ge moving speed between 12 and 15 mph including hills. Distances vary from 
 20 to 30 miles\, depending partly on available light. Early season rides wi
 ll be somewhat shorter and slower. Rides depart promptly at 5:45.<br><br>No
 n-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/
 get_information.php?event_id=133776">free trial membership</a>\, good for u
 p to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing a liability wa
 iver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.<br><br>Questions? Contact <a href="mai
 lto:allan.edmonds@gmail.com">Allan Edmonds</a> or <a href="mailto:gail.more
 ll@gmail.com">Gail Morell</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20201008T210410Z
LOCATION:Sherwood Oaks Christian Church\, 2700 E Rogers Rd\, Bloomington\, 
 IN 47401\, USA
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:OWLS - Tramway
TRANSP:OPAQUE
