DESCRIPTION:<span><span><u></u><u></u><u></u><p><a href="https://www.google
 .com/url?q=https://www.strava.com/routes/2912134121167090028&amp\;sa=D&amp\
 ;source=calendar&amp\;ust=1651944005937187&amp\;usg=AOvVaw0N7-9PC0CRdIziA7Y
 lQI0J">33 SR45\, South Shore\, Robinson</a></p><p>Ready for a high spirited
  ride? BV Ride is an intermediate/ advanced ride and moderate distance that
  may or may not include regrouping points.  Pace is anticipated to be 17+ m
 ph. Expect occasional sprint or Strava segments\, pace line riding at high 
 speed\, intervals\, and fewer regrouping stops.</p><p>The BV Ride will star
 t at the Parking lot across from the Bryan Park Pool on Woodlawn at 5:45. M
 ileages will increase as the season progresses. If you keep coming we will 
 make you faster!</p><p>Riders are expected to look out for each other durin
 g the rides.  Ride maps and GPS links will be posted here in advance. Rider
 s unfamiliar with the route should bring along a copy of the map.</p>Non-me
 mbers should sign up for a <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://se
 cure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id%3D133776&amp\;sa=D&am
 p\;source=calendar&amp\;ust=1651944005937187&amp\;usg=AOvVaw1pZ3rYk5cSEljZ0
 hQFFxCk">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which
  includes electronically signing a liability waiver\, prior to participatio
 n.<u></u><u></u><u></u></span></span>
LAST-MODIFIED:20220502T175015Z
