DESCRIPTION:<p><a href="https://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/iRides/Hend
 ricksville_Elwren_Koontz_32.pdf" id="ow374" __is_owner="true">Hendricksvill
 e Elwren Koontz 32</a><br></p><p><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/55
 26571" id="ow385" __is_owner="true">GPS Files</a><br></p><p>The iRide is a 
 no-drop Intermediate level ride of moderate pace and distance with regroupi
 ng points.&nbsp\; Pace is anticipated to be 15-17 mph.<br></p><p>The tRide 
 is an advanced level ride of high pace and moderate distance that may or ma
 y not include regrouping points. &nbsp\;Pace is anticipated to be 18+ mph. 
 Expect occasional sprint or Strava segments\, pace line riding at high spee
 d\, intervals\, and fewer regrouping stops.</p><p>The iRide and tRide will 
 start at the same place and will ride the same scheduled route\, but the st
 art of these two groups will be staggered with the tRide starting first at 
 5:45 and the iRide just behind them. Mileages will increase as the season p
 rogresses.&nbsp\; </p><p>Riders are expected to look out for each other dur
 ing the rides.&nbsp\; Ride maps and GPS links will be posted here in advanc
 e. Riders unfamiliar with the route should bring along a copy of the map.</
 p>Non-members should sign up for a&nbsp\;<a href="https://secure.getmeregis
 tered.com/get_information.php?event_id=133776">free trial membership</a>\, 
 good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing a li
 ability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.
