 illy Route to Nashville</a><br><br><a href="http://ridewithgps.com/routes/1
 102778">GPS</a><br><br>The ride name says it all.&nbsp\; Join this little t
 our on the back roads over to Nashville.&nbsp\; The 55 mile option features
  a white knuckle descent down Lanam Ridge Hill and two good climbs up Helms
 burg Hill and Bear Wallow Hill.&nbsp\; The 33 mile short option cuts off al
 l this good stuff.<br><br>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https:/
 /secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=136627" id="ow1657
 " __is_owner="true">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\
 , and which includes electronically signing a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prio
 r to participation.</html-blob>
