DESCRIPTION:Popcorn-Rockport 33 miles https://ridewithgps.com/routes/198751
 6\n\n    * Be SAFE. Don't blow through stop signs. Consider bike lights.\n 
    * Be COURTEOUS: Single up in traffic\n    * Be PREDICTABLE: Signal your 
 intentions to cars and fellow riders.\nThe "Older\, Wiser\, and a Little Sl
 ower" training group emphasizes moderate rides\, and a route planned in adv
 ance that is posted on the ride calendar. This is a no drop ride\, but not 
 a beginner's ride. The OWLS often average 15 to 19 mph on flat roads\, and 
 typically have an overall average moving speed between 12 and 15 mph includ
 ing hills. Distances vary from 20 to 30 miles\, depending partly on availab
 le light. Early season rides will be somewhat shorter and slower. Rides dep
 art promptly at 5:45.\n\nNon-members will be required to sign a liability w
 aiver (https://drive.google.com/file/d/1jDxK92FPgpyvj2cCT7vV2S8RZTWDR_RH/vi
 ew) prior to participation.\n\nQuestions? Contact Allan Edmonds (mailto:all
 an.edmonds@gmail.com) or Gail Morell (mailto:gail.morell@gmail.com)
LAST-MODIFIED:20201031T121354Z
LOCATION:Sherwood Oaks Christian Church\, 2700 E Rogers Rd\, Bloomington\, 
 IN 47401\, USA
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:OWLS Ride
TRANSP:OPAQUE
