DESCRIPTION:<u></u><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=http://bloomington
 bicycleclub.org/maps/John_Bassett_Maps/Tour_de_Ramps_-_JP_70.pdf&amp\;sa=D&
 amp\;source=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw1xB_d-Njfzdz7-C_FppgRe" targ
 et="_blank">Tour de Ramps - JP 70</a><br><br><a href="https://www.google.co
 m/url?q=https://ridewithgps.com/routes/25055413&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calen
 dar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw22cuvd7RKkHSFxpTBrp78R" target="_blank">GPS F
 iles</a><br><br>This has become a traditional Fall ride for the BBC after t
 he summer Lake Monroe boat traffic dies down a bit.  See Lake Monroe from e
 very angle without benefit of a boat! Spoil the normally pleasant ride arou
 nd Lake Monroe by descending &amp\; climbing all the boat ramps. There are 
 nine of them\, plus many assorted hills in between!  <br>  <br>Monster vers
 ion (all ramps and hills): 70 miles <br><br>Wimp version:  44 miles<br><br>
 Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=http
 s://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id%3D136627&amp\;s
 a=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw0_5cJvz8z3KUY7Yt6t47kW" 
 target="_blank">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, an
 d which includes electronically signing a liability waiver\, prior to parti
 cipation.  <br><br><a></a><u></u>
