DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/38678526" id
 ="ow1212" __is_owner="true">Fish Road</a> 28 miles</html-blob><br><html-blo
 b>Out Old 37 to Hindustan\, then explore Fish Road down to Anderson\, befor
 e heading back to town on Old 37.</html-blob><br><html-blob><br></html-blob
 ><br><html-blob>Watch the calendar for weather-related updates and for futu
 re rides.&nbsp\;<ul><li>Be SAFE. Don't blow through stop signs. Consider bi
 ke lights.<br></li><li>Be COURTEOUS: Single up in traffic<br></li><li>Be PR
 EDICTABLE: Signal your intentions to cars and fellow riders.</li></ul>This 
 branch of the OWLS training group also emphasizes somewhat slower\, moderat
 e rides\, and a route planned in advance that is posted on the ride calenda
 r. This is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride. Expect an overall av
 erage moving speed 11 - 15 mph including hills. Distances vary from 20 to 3
 0 miles. Early season rides will be somewhat shorter and slower.During cold
  weather the ride departs at 1:30pm.<br><br>Non-members should sign up for 
 a&nbsp\;<a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?eve
 nt_id=133776">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and 
 which includes electronically signing a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to p
 articipation.<br><br>Questions? Contact&nbsp\;<a href="mailto:allan.edmonds
 @gmail.com">Allan Edmonds</a></html-blob>
