DESCRIPTION:<ol><li><b>&nbsp\;start time is 10:00am</b><br></li></ol><html-
 blob><br><br>Join us for a fun gravel ride through&nbsp\;the enchanted Hoos
 ier National Forest.&nbsp\;&nbsp\;The 32 mile route begins at Blackwell hor
 se camp and goes out&nbsp\; Tower Ridge Road\,&nbsp\;ventures south to Hick
 ory Grove Church\,&nbsp\;then out to Norman and back Henderson Creek&nbsp\;
 to Hunters Creek to the Blackwell.&nbsp\;Route is entirely gravel and pavem
 ent\,&nbsp\;no trail.<br><br><b>Ride starts promptly&nbsp\;at 10:00 am<br><
 br>We will not offer a formal car pool this year&nbsp\;<br></b><br><a href=
 "https://ridewithgps.com/routes/34758217">Norman 32</a><u></u></html-blob>
