DESCRIPTION:<a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/John_Bassett_Ma
 ps/Muscatatuck_Wildlife_Refuge_-_Beyond__2018_Ver_32.pdf" target="_blank">M
 uscatatuck Wildlife Refuge &amp\; Beyond 2018 Version 32</a><br><br><a href
 ="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/26907106" target="_blank">GPS Files</a><br
 ><br>This is our usual fist ride of the season out to the Muscatatuck Natio
 nal Wildlife Refuge on Bottom Road.  The basic route is a pretty level 24 m
 ile out &amp\; back designed to be an easy ride to shake off the Winter cob
 webs.  The route is easily extended to 32 miles with a loop to the north\, 
 as show in the mapping\, or can be extended east across I-69 via the Sample
  Road overpass for those who want some additional miles.  You could even ri
 de a little gravel over to the new covered bridge on Maple Grove Road and r
 eturn to Bottom Road and Bloomington via Maple Grove (North-South) and Mapl
 e Grove (East-West).<br><br>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https
 ://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=133776" target="
 _blank">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which 
 includes electronically signing a liability waiver\, prior to participation
 .  <br><br><a></a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20220228T180634Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot @ 39.15435\,-86.523
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Muscatatuck & Beyond 2018 Version - Leader: TBD
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
