CREATED:20200622T002811Z
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/5693541">Two Creeks and
  a Lake</a>&nbsp\;25 miles<br><br>Watch the calendar for weather-related up
 dates and for future morning rides.<br><br><i>Please observe social distanc
 ing norms as we gather and ride. We plan no formal leader. EVERYONE is a le
 ader. Familiarize yourself with the ride before heading out. We will ride i
 n small groups. People in the last group will endeavor to sweep the route a
 nd assist others as needed.</i><br><ul><li>Be SAFE. Don't blow through stop
  signs. Consider bike lights.<br></li><li>Be COURTEOUS: Single up in traffi
 c<br></li><li>Be PREDICTABLE: Signal your intentions to cars and fellow rid
 ers.</li></ul>This branch of the OWLS training group also emphasizes somewh
 at slower\, moderate rides\, and a route planned in advance that is posted 
 on the ride calendar. This is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride. E
 xpect an overall average moving speed 11 - 15 mph including hills. Distance
 s vary from 20 to 30 miles. Early season rides will be somewhat shorter and
  slower. Rides depart promptly at 8:30am.<br><br>Non-members should sign up
  for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?even
 t_id=133776">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and w
 hich includes electronically signing a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to pa
 rticipation.<br><br>Questions? Contact <a href="mailto:allan.edmonds@gmail.
 com">Allan Edmonds</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20200916T183754Z
LOCATION:Sherwood Oaks Christian Church\, 2700 E Rogers Rd\, Bloomington\, 
 IN 47401\, USA\, 
