 ll.  Either<br>way\, you get a monster gravel hill to climb!!<br><br>Ride i
 s mostly gravel\, with some pavement<br>and a nice stretch of level double 
 track<br>along Bartley Ridge in Yellowwood State<br>Forest.<br><br><b>Ride 
 starts promptly&nbsp\;at 6:00PM<br><br>We will not offer a formal car pool 
 this year&nbsp\;<br></b><br>BRING LIGHTS!! BRING LIGHTS!!<br><br><a href="h
 ttp://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/Gravel_Rides/The_Either_Way_You_Get_a
 _Monster_Gravel_Hill_Loop_22.pdf">The Either Way You Get a Monster Gravel H
 ill Loop 22</a><br><br><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/16959985">GP
 S Files</a><br><br><br><a></a>
