DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><u></u><p><a href="https://www.strava.com/routes/291
 2153185215168660" id="ow6837" __is_owner="true"> 35 SR 45\, Tunnel\, Shilo\
 , Bean Blossom\, Old 37</a></p><p>Ready for a high spirited ride? BV Ride i
 s an intermediate/ advanced ride and moderate distance that may or may not 
 include regrouping points. &nbsp\;Pace is anticipated to be 17+ mph. Expect
  occasional sprint or Strava segments\, pace line riding at high speed\, in
 tervals\, and fewer regrouping stops.</p><p>The BV Ride will start at the P
 arking lot across from the Bryan Park Pool on Woodlawn at 5:45. Mileages wi
 ll increase as the season progresses. If you keep coming we will make you f
 aster!</p><p>Riders are expected to look out for each other during the ride
 s.&nbsp\; Ride maps and GPS links will be posted here in advance. Riders un
 familiar with the route should bring along a copy of the map.</p>Non-member
 s should sign up for a&nbsp\;<a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/ge
 t_information.php?event_id=133776">free trial membership</a>\, good for up 
 to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing a liability waiv
 er\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.<u></u></html-blob>
