DESCRIPTION:<p><a href="https://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/iRides/Rock
 crusher_26.pdf" id="ow365" __is_owner="true">Rockcrusher 26</a><br></p><p><
 a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/4530274" id="ow375" __is_owner="true
 ">GPS Files</a><br></p><p>The iRide is a no-drop Intermediate level ride of
  moderate pace and distance with regrouping points.&nbsp\; Pace is anticipa
 ted to be 15-17 mph.<br></p><p>The tRide is an advanced level ride of high 
 pace and moderate distance that may or may not include regrouping points. &
 nbsp\;Pace is anticipated to be 18+ mph. Expect occasional sprint or Strava
  segments\, pace line riding at high speed\, intervals\, and fewer regroupi
 ng stops.</p><p>The iRide and tRide will start at the same place and will r
 ide the same scheduled route\, but the start of these two groups will be st
 aggered with the tRide starting first at 5:45 and the iRide just behind the
 m. Mileages will increase as the season progresses.&nbsp\; </p><p>Riders ar
 e expected to look out for each other during the rides.&nbsp\; Ride maps an
 d GPS links will be posted here in advance. Riders unfamiliar with the rout
 e should bring along a copy of the map.</p>Non-members should sign up for a
 &nbsp\;<a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?even
 t_id=133776">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and w
 hich includes electronically signing a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to pa
 rticipation.<br><br>&nbsp\;<br><br>&nbsp\;&nbsp\;
