DESCRIPTION:<p><a href="https://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/iRides/Roun
 d_Robinson_v1_23.pdf" id="ow563" __is_owner="true">Round Robinson v1 23</a>
 </p><p><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/16848058" id="ow579" __is_ow
 ner="true">GPS Files</a><br></p><p>The iRide is a no-drop Intermediate leve
 l ride of moderate pace and distance with regrouping points.&nbsp\; Pace is
  anticipated to be 15-17 mph.<br></p><p>The tRide is an advanced level ride
  of high pace and moderate distance that may or may not include regrouping 
 points. &nbsp\;Pace is anticipated to be 18+ mph. Expect occasional sprint 
 or Strava segments\, pace line riding at high speed\, intervals\, and fewer
  regrouping stops.</p><p>The iRide and tRide will start at the same place a
 nd will ride the same scheduled route\, but the start of these two groups w
 ill be staggered with the tRide starting first at 5:45 and the iRide just b
 ehind them. Mileages will increase as the season progresses.&nbsp\; </p><p>
 Riders are expected to look out for each other during the rides.&nbsp\; Rid
 e maps and GPS links will be posted here in advance. Riders unfamiliar with
  the route should bring along a copy of the map.</p>Non-members should sign
  up for a&nbsp\;<a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information
 .php?event_id=133776">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to three ride
 s\, and which includes electronically signing a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;pr
 ior to participation.
