DESCRIPTION:Join us for this Thanksgiving eve fun ride<br><br>This 20-miler
  begins at the Blackwell Horse<br>Camp on Tower Ridge Road\, heads to<br>Hi
 ckory Grove Church\, and then circles<br>back to the horse camp via McPike 
 Branch<br>Road and Dutch Ridge Road.  The route is<br>predominately gravel 
 with a little bit of <br>pavement\, and no trail.  Route is suitable<br>for
  CX\, gravel bike\, or MTB.Ride starts promptly<br>at 6:00<br><br>&nbsp\;We
  will not offer a formal car pool this year&nbsp\;<br><br>&nbsp\;<br><a hre
 f="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/Gravel_Rides/All%20Around%20Yello
 wstone%2020.pdf">All Around Yellowstone 20</a><a><br><br></a><a href="https
 ://ridewithgps.com/routes/18155202">GPS Files</a><a></a>
