DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><u></u><u></u><u></u><u></u><a href="http://blooming
 tonbicycleclub.org/maps/John_Bassett_Maps/M_-_M_-Martinsville-Mahalasville-
 _via_South_Shore_60.pdf">M&amp\;M Ride (Martinsville-Mahalasville) via Sout
 h Shore</a><br><br><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/39450137">Revise
 d GPS Files</a><br><br>The route has been revised for 2022 due to the closu
 re of Burton Ln in Martinsville as part of the I-69 completion.&nbsp\; From
  Burton Ln&nbsp\; the new route turns right and follows Southview Dr. along
  the south side of I-69 to Mahalasville Rd.&nbsp\; Since the Marathon gas s
 tation on Burton Ln is no longer accessable\, turn left on Mahalasville and
  go under I-69 to the Kroger gas station for drinks and snacks. After the r
 est stop\, the route continues south on Mahalasville as before.&nbsp\;&nbsp
 \;&nbsp\;<br><br>This is a fun\, moderate 60 mile ride that incorporates so
 me fast flats and just a few healthy climbs.&nbsp\; We do a couple of modif
 ications to the traditional route to accommodate the new traffic patterns r
 esultant from I-69 and bypass some climbs on busy SR 45 on the return route
 .<br><br>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregi
 stered.com/get_information.php?event_id=136627" id="ow588" __is_owner="true
 ">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includ
 es electronically signing a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation
 .&nbsp\;&nbsp\;<u></u><u></u><u></u><u></u><u></u></html-blob>
LAST-MODIFIED:20220520T212521Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot @ 39.15435\,-86.523
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:M&M Ride (Martinsville-Mahalasville) - Leader: Jeremy Schott
TRANSP:OPAQUE
