 oomingtonbicycleclub.org/gmaps/BryanParkPool.html">map</a>)<br><br>Nice N E
 asy rides cater to those who want to take it easy and to beginning riders. 
 These Sunday rides feature lower mileage (19-26 miles) and slower paces. Th
 ey use Bloomington area low traffic roads.<br><br>East Side\, Trailhead. (2
 3 miles) <a href="https://www.bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/niceneasy/?3" id="
 ow472" __is_owner="true">East Side Map</a>.<br><br>Non-members should\, pri
 or to participation\, sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered
 .com/get_information.php?event_id=132872">free trial membership</a>\, which
  includes electronically signing a liability waiver.</html-blob>
