DESCRIPTION:<html-blob>This 20-miler begins at the Blackwell Horse<br>Camp 
 on Tower Ridge Road\, extends<br>down Dutch Ridge Road\, and loops<br>back 
 to Blackwell via Henderson Creek\,<br>Hickory Grove\, and Tower Ridge.  The
 <br>route is a mix of one-half HNF gravel and<br>one-half paved county road
 .  There is<br>no single or double track.<br>XC or MTB are fine.<br><b><br>
 </b>The ride&nbsp\;leaves from Blackwell Horse Camp<br>on Tower Ridge Road 
 <b>promptly at&nbsp\; 6:00PM.</b><br><br><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/r
 outes/38717456" id="ow496" __is_owner="true">Going Dutch Ridge</a><a id="ow
 506" __is_owner="true"></a></html-blob>
