CREATED:20200622T002811Z
DESCRIPTION:Watch the calendar for weather-related updates and for future m
 orning rides.<br><br><i>Please observe social distancing norms as we gather
  and ride. We plan no formal leader. EVERYONE is a leader. Familiarize your
 self with the ride before heading out. We will ride in small groups. People
  in the last group will endeavor to sweep the route and assist others as ne
 eded.</i><br><ul><li>Be SAFE. Don't blow through stop signs. Consider bike 
 lights.<br></li><li>Be COURTEOUS: Single up in traffic<br></li><li>Be PREDI
 CTABLE: Signal your intentions to cars and fellow riders.</li></ul>This bra
 nch of the OWLS training group also emphasizes somewhat slower\, moderate r
 ides\, and a route planned in advance that is posted on the ride calendar. 
 This is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride. Expect an overall avera
 ge moving speed 11 - 15 mph including hills. Distances vary from 20 to 30 m
 iles. Early season rides will be somewhat shorter and slower. Rides depart 
 promptly at 8:30am.<br><br>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https:
 //secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=133776">free tria
 l membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electron
 ically signing a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.<br><br>Qu
 estions? Contact <a href="mailto:allan.edmonds@gmail.com">Allan Edmonds</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20200916T183754Z
LOCATION:Sherwood Oaks Christian Church\, 2700 E Rogers Rd\, Bloomington\, 
 IN 47401\, USA\, 
