DESCRIPTION:<p><a id="ow3080" __is_owner="true" href="https://bloomingtonbi
 cycleclub.org/maps/iRides/Circle_West_Rev_1_33.pdf">Circle West Rev 1 33</a
 ><br></p><p><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/23981175">GPS Files</a>
 <br></p><p>The iRide is a no-drop Intermediate level ride of moderate pace 
 and distance with regrouping points.&nbsp\; Pace is anticipated to be 15-17
  mph.</p><p>The tRide is an advanced level ride of high pace and moderate d
 istance that may or may not include regrouping points. &nbsp\;Pace is antic
 ipated to be 18+ mph. Expect occasional sprint or Strava segments\, pace li
 ne riding at high speed\, intervals\, and fewer regrouping stops.</p><p>The
  iRide and tRide will start at the same place and will ride the same schedu
 led route\, but the start of these two groups will be staggered with the tR
 ide starting first at 5:45 and the iRide just behind them. Mileages will in
 crease as the season progresses.&nbsp\; </p><p>Riders are expected to look 
 out for each other during the rides.&nbsp\; Ride maps and GPS links will be
  posted here in advance. Riders unfamiliar with the route should bring alon
 g a copy of the map.</p>Non-members should sign up for a&nbsp\;<a href="htt
 ps://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=133776">free t
 rial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes elect
 ronically signing a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.<br><br
 >&nbsp\;<br><br>&nbsp\;&nbsp\;
LAST-MODIFIED:20200719T180651Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot @ 39.15435\,-86.523\, 
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
