 here is a short<br>section of easy single track along<br>Trail 21 in the HN
 F.  This could be<br>bypassed on pavement and gravel.<br>Ride starts/ends a
 t Hickory Ridge fire<br>tower on Tower Ridge Road.<br><br>Suitable for grav
 el and<br>and cyclocross bikes plus MTB.<br><br>Shorter routes are availabl
 e.&nbsp\;<br><b>&nbsp\;No formal car pooling will be offered</b><br><br>&nb
 sp\;Ride leaves from the fire tower promptly at<br>10:00AM<br><br><a href="
 http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/Gravel_Rides/About%20Half%20of%20the
 %20Gravel%20Grovel%2032.pdf">About Half of the Gravel Grovel 32</a><a></a><
