DESCRIPTION:<b>This ride is a GO!</b><br><b><br></b><br><b>Dress for the co
 ld. If you are not feeling adventurous&nbsp\;then it might be time to consi
 der that quilting bee you have been thinking about&nbsp\; joining :)&nbsp\;
 </b><br><br>Join us for this official Death March Training ride.&nbsp\; Thi
 s is a mix of gravel roads\, single track horse trail\, and pavement riding
 .<br><br>We will start out at Blackwell Horse Camp\, ride east on Tower Rid
 ge to&nbsp\; the Fire Tower\, then out to&nbsp\; Hickory Grove Church Over 
 to Trail 15 out to Callahan up trail 16 to Cornett over to Thompson out to 
 Houston over to Robinson and Back to Blackwell.&nbsp\;<br><br><br>Due to Co
 vid-19 no formal car pooling will be offered&nbsp\;<br><br><a href="http://
 bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/Gravel_Rides/Blackwell_to_Callahan_to_Houst
 on_36.pdf">Blackwell to Callahan to Houston 36</a><br><br><a href="https://
 ridewithgps.com/routes/29406201">GPS Files with Death March Checkpoints</a>
