 he OWLS often average 15 to 19 mph on flat roads\, and typically have an ov
 erall average moving speed between 12 and 15 mph including hills. Distances
  vary from 20 to 30 miles\, depending partly on available light. Early seas
 on rides will be somewhat shorter and slower. Rides depart promptly at 5:45
 .<br><br>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregi
 stered.com/get_information.php?event_id=133776">free trial membership</a>\,
