DESCRIPTION:<p><a href="https://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/iRides/Dela
 p_2018_Version_Short_26.pdf">Delap 2018 Version Short 26</a><br></p><p><a h
 ref="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/27659729">GPS Files</a></p><p>The iRide
  is an intermediate level ride of moderate pace and distance with regroupin
 g points.&nbsp\; Pace is anticipated to be 15-17 mph.<br></p><p>The tRide i
 s an advanced level ride of high pace and moderate distance that may or may
  not include regrouping points. &nbsp\;Pace is anticipated to be 18+ mph. E
 xpect occasional sprint or Strava segments\, pace line riding at high speed
 \, intervals\, and fewer regrouping stops.</p><p>The iRide and tRide will s
 tart at the same place and will ride the same scheduled route\, but the sta
 rt of these two groups will be staggered with the tRide starting first at 5
 :45 and the iRide just behind them. Mileages will increase as the season pr
 ogresses.&nbsp\; </p><p>Riders are expected to look out for each other duri
 ng the rides.&nbsp\; Ride maps and GPS links will be posted here in advance
 . Riders unfamiliar with the route should bring along a copy of the map.</p
 >Non-members should sign up for a&nbsp\;<a href="https://secure.getmeregist
 ered.com/get_information.php?event_id=133776">free trial membership</a>\, g
 ood for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing a lia
 bility waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.
