 id="ow5530" __is_owner="true">31 Robinson\, Tunnel\, Shuffle\, Brummett</a>
 </p><p>Ready for a high spirited ride? BV Ride is an intermediate/ advanced
  ride and moderate distance that may or may not include regrouping points. 
 &nbsp\;Pace is anticipated to be 17+ mph. Expect occasional sprint or Strav
 a segments\, pace line riding at high speed\, intervals\, and fewer regroup
 ing stops.</p><p>The BV Ride will start at the Parking lot across from the 
 Bryan Park Pool on Woodlawn at 5:45. Mileages will increase as the season p
 rogresses. If you keep coming we will make you faster!</p><p>Riders are exp
 ected to look out for each other during the rides.&nbsp\; Ride maps and GPS
  links will be posted here in advance. Riders unfamiliar with the route sho
 uld bring along a copy of the map.</p>Non-members should sign up for a&nbsp
 \;<a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=
 133776">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which 
 includes electronically signing a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to partici
 pation.
