 s.<br><br>Valley View Farms\, Strangers Hill Organics\, Eco Logic. (22 mile
 s) <a href="https://www.bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/niceneasy/?7">ValleyView
  Map</a>.<br><br>Non-members should\, prior to participation\, sign up for 
 a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=
