BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART:20210724T120000Z
DTEND:20210724T200000Z
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:0k6f7n1qh6fufj1l4m1lq6gpt6@google.com
CREATED:20210603T232344Z
DESCRIPTION:<a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/John_Bassett_Ma
 ps/Spring%20Mill%20Leavenworth%2096%20revised.pdf">Spring Mill to Leavenwor
 th</a><br><br><a href="http://ridewithgps.com/routes/2970469">GPS Links</a>
 <br><br>This is a drive and ride has been very well attended the last sever
 al years\, and&nbsp\;is back by by popular demand. The entire route is 96 m
 iles and begins and&nbsp\;ends at Spring Mill State Park.  Start there&nbsp
 \;because a century ride will get you to the Ohio&nbsp\;River and back.  Sh
 orter options include turning&nbsp\;back north at Marengo for a 63 mile loo
 p\, or&nbsp\;turning right at the famous Crawford County&nbsp\;Shoe Tree fo
 r about 82 miles.  Tour some of&nbsp\;the best southern Indiana has to offe
 r\, and&nbsp\;enjoy the spectacular view of the Ohio River&nbsp\;at the Lea
 venworth Overlook\, the point where&nbsp\;we turn back north.<br><br>The fi
 rst part of the ride is relatively flat with several miles of new pavement 
 on SR 337\; the middle part is hilly\, and the last part is flat again on a
  lot of newish&nbsp\; pavement north of US 150.&nbsp\; See Lost River\, Mar
 engo\, the Blue River at Milltown\, the world famous Shoe Tree\, Wyandotte 
 Cave\, the Leavenworth Overlook\, idyllic Amish countryside in Orange Count
 y\, and the "Knob" you have to go right over the top of.&nbsp\;&nbsp\;<br><
 br>Meet&nbsp\;at Spring Mill State Park Inn (upper level of the parking gar
 age) at 8:00.&nbsp\; Bring your park pass.&nbsp\;This is a good one.<br><br
 >Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.c
 om/get_information.php?event_id=133776">free trial membership</a>\, good fo
 r up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing a liability
  waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.
LAST-MODIFIED:20210721T225454Z
LOCATION:Spring Mill Parking Garage @38.734265\, -86.414427
SEQUENCE:3
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Spring Mill to Leavenworth 96 - Leader:  John Bassett
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
