 49294">GPS Files</a><br><br><b>NOTE:&nbsp\; REPEAT OF SATURDAY RIDE\, WITH 
 HOPEFULLY DRYER WEATHER.</b><br><b><br></b><br><b>The last Saturday road ri
 de of the season will be a redo of our rainout on October 2.</b><br><br>Get
  a good close view of&nbsp\;the hills and Fall color of Greene County and i
 nclude a&nbsp\;stop at Yoho's Grocery in Solsberry.  It is&nbsp\;a hilly\, 
 but scenic 49 miles with a viable&nbsp\;42 mile shortish option directly do
 wn SR 43&nbsp\;from Whitehall to Solsberry.<br><br>Non-members should sign 
 up for a&nbsp\;<a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.
 php?event_id=133776">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides
 \, and which includes electronically signing a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;pri
 or to participation.&nbsp\;&nbsp\;<br><br><a></a>
