DESCRIPTION:<u></u><u></u><p><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://
 www.strava.com/routes/2912148700198821094&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&am
 p\;ust=1649548131287898&amp\;usg=AOvVaw1JZNt_6_bU5PFHunJFGLMY" target="_bla
 nk"> 33 Forest Loop</a></p><p>Ready for a high spirited ride? BV Ride is an
  intermediate/ advanced ride and moderate distance that may or may not incl
 ude regrouping points.  Pace is anticipated to be 17+ mph. Expect occasiona
 l sprint or Strava segments\, pace line riding at high speed\, intervals\, 
 and fewer regrouping stops.</p><p>The BV Ride will start at the Parking lot
  across from the Bryan Park Pool on Woodlawn at 5:45. Mileages will increas
 e as the season progresses. If you keep coming we will make you faster!</p>
 <p>Riders are expected to look out for each other during the rides.  Ride m
 aps and GPS links will be posted here in advance. Riders unfamiliar with th
 e route should bring along a copy of the map.</p>Non-members should sign up
  for a <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://secure.getmeregistered
 .com/get_information.php?event_id%3D133776&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&a
 mp\;ust=1649548131287898&amp\;usg=AOvVaw2Y6WvQP8KA24iDy4aKYScN" target="_bl
 ank">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which inc
 ludes electronically signing a liability waiver\, prior to participation.<u
 ></u><u></u>
