CREATED:20220302T004752Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>The family of Dave Tanner would like toinvite you to his lon
 g awaited&nbsp\; memorialservice. It will be this coming Saturday. I know t
 his may interfere with thepopcorn ride but we can always ride Sunday. Come 
 help celebrate the life of awonderful man. Hawaiian shirts are encouraged</
 p><p>&nbsp\;Helloeveryone\,</p><p>Thememorial service is all set for next S
 aturday\, April 30 at St. Mark's UnitedMethodist Church in Bloomington at 1
 :00 in the afternoon. &nbsp\;There will be areception following the service
  with refreshments and an open mic for us toshare Dave stories. &nbsp\;It s
 hould be a great time of remembrance of a greatman. &nbsp\;Martha and I loo
 k forward to seeing you there. &nbsp\;If it is notpossible to attend\, you 
 may view the service live or recorded by going to thechurch web site and cl
 icking the "Livestream" button. &nbsp\;Masks areno longer required in the c
 hurch but certainly encouraged if you are morecomfortable wearing one.&nbsp
 \;&nbsp\;</p><p><br></p><p>Joe Tanner</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20220425T151406Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Tannerdave memorial 
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
