DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/Gravel_Rides/R
 everse%20Blue%20Creek%20Elkinsville%20Loop%20Plus%20Trail%20D%2018.pdf">Rev
 erse Blue Creek Elkinsville Loop Plus Trail D 18</a><br>&nbsp\;<br><a href=
 "https://ridewithgps.com/routes/17463607">GPS Files</a><br><br>This is a ri
 de not to miss. The fall foliage is looking fabulous.&nbsp\; &nbsp\;<br><br
 >We will start at the Crooked Creek Boat Ramp go up Elkinsville Rd across L
 ake Monroe (you<u> will not </u>get your feet wet this year) to Elkinsville
 \, up Combs Rd to the Nebo Connector\, and down Nebo to the North parking l
 ot. Then it's up Blue Creek Rd to Trail D\, up Trail D to Miller Ridge\, do
 wn the water bars to Crooked Creek Rd\, and back to the parking lot - a tot
 al of 18.4 beautiful miles.<br><br>PLEASE DON'T MISS THIS ONE.<br><br><b>Ri
 de leaves promptly at 6:00PM</b><br><br>No formal car pooling id being offe
 red do co Covid-19<br><br><b>BRING LIGHTS! BRING LIGHTS! BRING LIGHTS!</b>
