DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/34300541" id="ow402" __
 is_owner="true">Robinson Road</a> 25 miles<br>MEET AT BRYAN PARK POOL PARKI
 NG LOT!<br><br><br>Watch the calendar for weather-related updates and for f
 uture morning rides.<br><br><i>Please observe social distancing norms as we
  gather and ride. We plan no formal leader. EVERYONE is a leader. Familiari
 ze yourself with the ride before heading out. We will ride in small groups.
  People in the last group will endeavor to sweep the route and assist other
 s as needed.</i><br><ul><li>Be SAFE. Don't blow through stop signs. Conside
 r bike lights.<br></li><li>Be COURTEOUS: Single up in traffic<br></li><li>B
 e PREDICTABLE: Signal your intentions to cars and fellow riders.</li></ul>T
 his branch of the OWLS training group also emphasizes somewhat slower\, mod
 erate rides\, and a route planned in advance that is posted on the ride cal
 endar. This is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride. Expect an overal
 l average moving speed 11 - 15 mph including hills. Distances vary from 20 
 to 30 miles. Early season rides will be somewhat shorter and slower. Rides 
 depart promptly at 8:30am.<br><br>Non-members should sign up for a <a href=
 "https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=133776">fr
 ee trial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes e
 lectronically signing a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.<br
 ><br>Questions? Contact <a href="mailto:allan.edmonds@gmail.com">Allan Edmo
 nds</a>
