DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><u></u><u></u><u></u><br><a href="https://bloomingto
 nbicycleclub.org/maps/John_Bassett_Maps/Wild_Ride_to_Wilbur_2019_Version_3.
 pdf">Wild Ride to Wilbur 2019 Version 3</a><br><br><a href="https://ridewit
 hgps.com/routes/40635778" id="ow637" __is_owner="true">GPS Files</a><br><br
 >The "classic" 78 mile route north to Wilbur crossed SR 37 at Pine Avenue.&
 nbsp\; This crossing is now permanently closed by I-69\, forever altering t
 he original 78 mile Wilbur route.&nbsp\; We have done a couple of alternati
 ves since the highway construction\, and this one seems the best.&nbsp\; &n
 bsp\;We take Bottom\, Simpson Chapel\, and Burma on the way north to Parago
 n where we rejoin the original Wild Wilbur route.&nbsp\; On the way back to
  Bloomington we try the&nbsp\;the new I-69 access road to Old SR 37.&nbsp\;
 <br><br>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregis
 tered.com/get_information.php?event_id=136627">free trial membership</a>\, 
 good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing a li
 ability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.<u></u><u></u><u></u></html-b
 lob>
