DESCRIPTION:<p>The iRide is a no-drop Intermediate level ride of moderate p
 ace and distance with regrouping points.&nbsp\; Pace is anticipated to be 1
 5-17 mph.</p><p>The tRide is an advanced level ride of high pace and modera
 te distance that may or may not include regrouping points. &nbsp\;Pace is a
 nticipated to be 18+ mph. Expect occasional sprint or Strava segments\, pac
 e line riding at high speed\, intervals\, and fewer regrouping stops.</p><p
 >The iRide and tRide will start at the same place and will ride the same sc
 heduled route\, but the start of these two groups will be staggered with th
 e tRide starting first at 5:45 and the iRide just behind them. Mileages wil
 l increase as the season progresses.&nbsp\; </p><p>Riders are expected to l
 ook out for each other during the rides.&nbsp\; Ride maps and GPS links wil
 l be posted here in advance. Riders unfamiliar with the route should bring 
 along a copy of the map.</p>Non-members should sign up for a&nbsp\;<a href=
 "https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=133776">fr
 ee trial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes e
 lectronically signing a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.<br
 ><br>&nbsp\;<br><br>&nbsp\;&nbsp\;
