 ith regrouping points.&nbsp\; Pace is anticipated to be 15-17 mph.</p><p>Th
 e tRide is an advanced level ride of high pace and moderate distance that m
 ay or may not include regrouping points. &nbsp\;Pace is anticipated to be 1
 8+ mph. Expect occasional sprint or Strava segments\, pace line riding at h
 igh speed\, intervals\, and fewer regrouping stops.</p><p>The iRide and tRi
 de will start at the same place and will ride the same scheduled route\, bu
 t the start of these two groups will be staggered with the tRide starting f
 irst at 5:45 and the iRide just behind them. Mileages will increase as the 
 season progresses.&nbsp\; </p><p>Riders are expected to look out for each o
 ther during the rides.&nbsp\; Ride maps and GPS links will be posted here i
 n advance. Riders unfamiliar with the route should bring along a copy of th
