 60172">GPS Files</a><br></p><p>The iRide is a no-drop Intermediate level ri
 de of moderate pace and distance with regrouping points.&nbsp\; Pace is ant
 icipated to be 15-17 mph.</p><p>The tRide is an advanced level ride of high
  pace and moderate distance that may or may not include regrouping points. 
 &nbsp\;Pace is anticipated to be 18+ mph. Expect occasional sprint or Strav
 a segments\, pace line riding at high speed\, intervals\, and fewer regroup
 ing stops.</p><p>The iRide and tRide will start at the same place and will 
 ride the same scheduled route\, but the start of these two groups will be s
 taggered with the tRide starting first at 5:45 and the iRide just behind th
 em. Mileages will increase as the season progresses.&nbsp\; </p><p>Riders a
 re expected to look out for each other during the rides.&nbsp\; Ride maps a
 nd GPS links will be posted here in advance. Riders unfamiliar with the rou
 te should bring along a copy of the map.</p>Non-members should sign up for 
 a&nbsp\;<a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?eve
 nt_id=133776">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and 
 which includes electronically signing a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to p
 articipation.<br><br>&nbsp\;<br><br>&nbsp\;&nbsp\;
