 com/routes/38714012">GPS Files</a></font></p><p><font>Join in for a pleasan
 t early season jaunt over to Ellettsville and back.&nbsp\; This is a pretty
  easy ride with only hilly Maple Grove Road to contend with.</font></p><p>D
 ue to the roundabout construction at Woodyard Road and Curry Pike\, the rou
 te this year will continue on out Vernal Pike past Woodyard to the Karst Fa
 rm Greenway and up the Greenway back to Woodyard Road.&nbsp\; This route is
  shown in the linked GPS files above.</p><p>This would also be a great oppo
 rtunity to explore the new\, recently completed\, north section of the Kars
 t Greenway extending up to Ellettsville.</p><p><font>Non-members should sig
 n up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?
 event_id=136627" id="ow391" __is_owner="true">free trial membership</a>\, g
 ood for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing a lia
 bility waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.&nbsp\;<br></font></p><p><font
 ><br></font></p><u></u><u></u><u></u></html-blob>
