DESCRIPTION:<br><b>This ride is a go but start time is 12 NOON<br></b><br><
 br>Join us for a fun gravel ride through&nbsp\;the enchanted Hoosier Nation
 al Forest.&nbsp\;&nbsp\;The 32 mile route begins at Blackwell horse camp an
 d goes out&nbsp\; Tower Ridge Road\,&nbsp\;ventures south to Hickory Grove 
 Church\,&nbsp\;then out to Norman and back Henderson Creek&nbsp\;to Hunters
  Creek to the Blackwell.&nbsp\;Route is entirely gravel and pavement\,&nbsp
 \;no trail.<br><br><b>Ride starts promptly&nbsp\;at 12:00 NOON&nbsp\;<br><b
 r>We will not offer a formal car pool this year&nbsp\;<br>due to COVID-19 c
 oncerns.&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b><br><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/rou
 tes/34758217">Norman 32</a>
