DESCRIPTION:<p><a href="https://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/iRides/Char
 lie-s_Orchard_Loop_30.pdf" id="ow379" __is_owner="true">Charlie's Orchard L
 oop 30</a><br></p><p><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/28158817" id="
 ow390" __is_owner="true">GPS Files</a><br></p><p>The iRide is a no-drop Int
 ermediate level ride of moderate pace and distance with regrouping points.&
 nbsp\; Pace is anticipated to be 15-17 mph.<br></p><p>The tRide is an advan
 ced level ride of high pace and moderate distance that may or may not inclu
 de regrouping points. &nbsp\;Pace is anticipated to be 18+ mph. Expect occa
 sional sprint or Strava segments\, pace line riding at high speed\, interva
 ls\, and fewer regrouping stops.</p><p>The iRide and tRide will start at th
 e same place and will ride the same scheduled route\, but the start of thes
 e two groups will be staggered with the tRide starting first at 5:45 and th
 e iRide just behind them. Mileages will increase as the season progresses.&
 nbsp\; </p><p>Riders are expected to look out for each other during the rid
 es.&nbsp\; Ride maps and GPS links will be posted here in advance. Riders u
 nfamiliar with the route should bring along a copy of the map.</p>Non-membe
 rs should sign up for a&nbsp\;<a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/g
 et_information.php?event_id=133776">free trial membership</a>\, good for up
  to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing a liability wai
 ver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.
