CREATED:20200906T144607Z
DESCRIPTION:This is a Figure-of-Eight loop from the<br>Kent Road Hunter Che
 ck In just off SR 46<br>east of Bloomington.  We will decide on the<br>fly 
 which way we want to do it\, either up<br>Jack Ass Hill or down Jack Ass Hi
 ll.  Either<br>way\, you get a monster gravel hill to climb!!<br><br>Ride i
 s mostly gravel\, with some pavement<br>and a nice stretch of level double 
 track<br>along Bartley Ridge in Yellowwood State<br>Forest.<br><br><b>Ride 
 starts promptly&nbsp\;at 6:00PM<br><br>We will not offer a formal car pool 
 this year&nbsp\;<br>due to COVID-19 concerns.&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&n
 bsp\;</b><br><br>BRING LIGHTS!! BRING LIGHTS!!<br><br><a href="http://bloom
 ingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/Gravel_Rides/The_Either_Way_You_Get_a_Monster_Gr
 avel_Hill_Loop_22.pdf">The Either Way You Get a Monster Gravel Hill Loop 22
 </a><br><br><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/16959985">GPS Files</a>
 <br><br><br><a></a>
