 TjKd6F0PjDDkp" target="_blank">GPS Files</a><br><br>This ride is a scenic 3
 3 mile tour of southwestern Monroe County - with and lots of hills.<br>Thar
 &#39\;s limestone in them thar hills!  This route hits four stone quarries 
