DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><u></u><a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/ma
 ps/John_Bassett_Maps/Paragon_Ride_2018_Version_47.pdf">Paragon Ride 2018 Ve
 rsion 47</a><br><br><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/28782934">GPS F
 iles</a><br><br>Historically\, the Paragon Ride crossed SR 37 at Turkey Tra
 ck Road / Pine Road.  With the advent of I-69 that crossing no longer exist
 s\, so we will add a mile or two and use Godsey Road east of Paragon to cro
 ss I-69 at the Liberty Church Road exit.  From there we’ll take a new acces
 s road and old SR 37 straight back to Bloomington for a total of about 47 m
 iles.<br><br>&nbsp\;Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secur
 e.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=136627" id="ow2701" __is
 _owner="true">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and 
 which includes electronically signing a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to p
 articipation.&nbsp\;&nbsp\;<u></u></html-blob>
