X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20201110T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20201110T120000
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;WKST=SU;UNTIL=20201103T045959Z;BYDAY=TH,TU
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:2pntoombj7hon08g1qgr5kfu68@google.com
CREATED:20201108T202000Z
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/34612703" id="ow633" __
 is_owner="true">Bottom-Sample-Meyers-Griffy</a> 26 miles<br><br><br>Watch t
 he calendar for weather-related updates and for future morning rides.<br><b
 r><i>Please observe social distancing norms as we gather and ride. We plan 
 no formal leader. EVERYONE is a leader. Familiarize yourself with the ride 
 before heading out. We will ride in small groups. People in the last group 
 will endeavor to sweep the route and assist others as needed.</i><br><ul><l
 i>Be SAFE. Don't blow through stop signs. Consider bike lights.<br></li><li
 >Be COURTEOUS: Single up in traffic<br></li><li>Be PREDICTABLE: Signal your
  intentions to cars and fellow riders.</li></ul>This branch of the OWLS tra
 ining group also emphasizes somewhat slower\, moderate rides\, and a route 
 planned in advance that is posted on the ride calendar. This is a no drop r
 ide\, but not a beginner's ride. Expect an overall average moving speed 11 
 - 15 mph including hills. Distances vary from 20 to 30 miles. Early season 
 rides will be somewhat shorter and slower. Rides depart promptly at 9:30am.
 <br><br>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregis
 tered.com/get_information.php?event_id=133776">free trial membership</a>\, 
 good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing a li
 ability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.<br><br>Questions? Contact <a
  href="mailto:allan.edmonds@gmail.com">Allan Edmonds</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20201108T202000Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Parking Lot\, S Woodlawn Ave\, Bloomington\, IN 47401\,
  USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Early Birds - Bottom-Sample                       
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
