DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><b>You can also park at the Yellowwood office parkin
 g lot</b>&nbsp\;<br><br><br>This is a fun little route\, borrowed from<br>G
 nawbone Lefty.&nbsp\;The ride<br>starts / ends at the Scarce-o-Fat Trail<br
 >parking lot at the base of Yellowwood<br>Dam.  There are sections of pavem
 ent<br>riding on South Shore Drive\, Lanam<br>Ridge\, Owl Creek Road\, and 
 Helmsberg<br>Road.  The rest is gravel.<br><br>Approximately 20 miles - no 
 single track\,<br>suitable for MTB\, gravel\, or cyclocross<br>bikes<b>.</b
 ><br><b><br>Bring Lights!&nbsp\; Bring Lights!&nbsp\; Bring lights!<br></b>
 <br><b>Ride starts promptly<br>at 6:00<br><br>&nbsp\;We will not offer a fo
 rmal car pool this year&nbsp\;<br></b>&nbsp\;<br>&nbsp\;<a href="http://blo
 omingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/Gravel_Rides/GRR%20Scarce-o-Fat%2020.pdf" id="
 ow1389" __is_owner="true">Scarce-o-Fat 20</a><br><br><a href="https://ridew
 ithgps.com/routes/11973231">GPS Files</a><a><br></a></html-blob>
