DESCRIPTION:<p>The iRide is a no-drop Intermediate level ride of moderate p
 ace and distance with regrouping points.&nbsp\; Pace is anticipated to be 1
 5-17 mph.<br></p><p>The tRide is an advanced level ride of high pace and mo
 derate distance that may or may not include regrouping points. &nbsp\;Pace 
 is anticipated to be 18+ mph. Expect occasional sprint or Strava segments\,
  pace line riding at high speed\, intervals\, and fewer regrouping stops.</
 p><p>The iRide and tRide will start at the same place and will ride the sam
 e scheduled route\, but the start of these two groups will be staggered wit
 h the tRide starting first at 5:45 and the iRide just behind them. Mileages
  will increase as the season progresses.&nbsp\; </p><p>Riders are expected 
 to look out for each other during the rides.&nbsp\; Ride maps and GPS links
  will be posted here in advance. Riders unfamiliar with the route should br
 ing along a copy of the map.</p>Non-members should sign up for a&nbsp\;<a h
 ref="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=133776
 ">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includ
 es electronically signing a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation
 .
LAST-MODIFIED:20210314T144013Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot @ 39.15435\,-86.523
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:iRide / tRide 
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
