DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/34678424" id="ow400" __
 is_owner="true">Griffy-Boltinghouse-Up Lentz Back via Miller and Anderson</
 a> 27 miles<br>Short option 22 miles returns via Robinson Rd.<br><br>Watch 
 the calendar for weather-related updates and for future morning rides.<br><
 br><i>Please observe social distancing norms as we gather and ride. We plan
  no formal leader. EVERYONE is a leader. Familiarize yourself with the ride
  before heading out. We will ride in small groups. People in the last group
  will endeavor to sweep the route and assist others as needed.</i><br><ul><
 li>Be SAFE. Don't blow through stop signs. Consider bike lights.<br></li><l
 i>Be COURTEOUS: Single up in traffic<br></li><li>Be PREDICTABLE: Signal you
 r intentions to cars and fellow riders.</li></ul>This branch of the OWLS tr
 aining group also emphasizes somewhat slower\, moderate rides\, and a route
  planned in advance that is posted on the ride calendar. This is a no drop 
 ride\, but not a beginner's ride. Expect an overall average moving speed 11
  - 15 mph including hills. Distances vary from 20 to 30 miles. Early season
  rides will be somewhat shorter and slower. Rides depart promptly at 9:30am
 .<br><br>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregi
 stered.com/get_information.php?event_id=133776">free trial membership</a>\,
  good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing a l
 iability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.<br><br>Questions? Contact <
 a href="mailto:allan.edmonds@gmail.com">Allan Edmonds</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20201118T010816Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Parking Lot\, S Woodlawn Ave\, Bloomington\, IN 47401\,
  USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Earlyish Birds - Up Lentz Etc
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
