DESCRIPTION:<p><a href="https://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/iRides/Elle
 ttsville_Loop_iRide_Long_29.pdf" id="ow946" __is_owner="true">Ellettsville 
 Loop iRide Long 29</a><br></p><p><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/28
 448443" id="ow966" __is_owner="true">GPS Files</a><br></p><p>The iRide is a
  no-drop Intermediate level ride of moderate pace and distance with regroup
 ing points.&nbsp\; Pace is anticipated to be 15-17 mph.</p><p>The tRide is 
 an advanced level ride of high pace and moderate distance that may or may n
 ot include regrouping points. &nbsp\;Pace is anticipated to be 18+ mph. Exp
 ect occasional sprint or Strava segments\, pace line riding at high speed\,
  intervals\, and fewer regrouping stops.</p><p>The iRide and tRide will sta
 rt at the same place and will ride the same scheduled route\, but the start
  of these two groups will be staggered with the tRide starting first at 5:4
 5 and the iRide just behind them. Mileages will increase as the season prog
 resses.&nbsp\; </p><p>Riders are expected to look out for each other during
  the rides.&nbsp\; Ride maps and GPS links will be posted here in advance. 
 Riders unfamiliar with the route should bring along a copy of the map.</p>N
 on-members should sign up for a&nbsp\;<a href="https://secure.getmeregister
 ed.com/get_information.php?event_id=133776">free trial membership</a>\, goo
 d for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing a liabi
 lity waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.<br><br>&nbsp\;<br><br>&nbsp\;&n
 bsp\;
LAST-MODIFIED:20200805T005756Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot @ 39.15435\,-86.523\, 
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:iRide / tRide - Ellettsville Loop iRide Long 29
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
