  Tower Ridge Road\, extends<br>down Dutch Ridge Road\, and loops<br>back to
  Blackwell via Henderson Creek\,<br>Hickory Grove\, and Tower Ridge.  The<b
 r>route is a mix of one-half HNF gravel and<br>one-half paved county road. 
  There is<br>no single or double track.<br>XC or MTB are fine.<br><br><b>Du
 e to covid-19 no formal carpooling will be offered&nbsp\;</b><br><br>&nbsp\
 ;The ride&nbsp\;leaves from Blackwell Horse Camp<br>on Tower Ridge Road<b> 
 promptly&nbsp\; 6:00PM.</b><br><br>BRING LIGHTS !!<br>&nbsp\;<br><a href="h
 ttp://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/Gravel_Rides/Going%20Dutch%20Ridge%20
 20.pdf">Going Dutch Ridge 20</a><a></a><br><br><a href="https://ridewithgps
 .com/routes/17995313">GPS Files</a><a></a>
