 es/28824508" id="ow648" __is_owner="true">GPS Files</a><br><br>Join us for 
 the Dave Tanner memorial ride.&nbsp\; As many of you would have seen tanner
 dave all around Btown&nbsp\; we decided to do this ride in his memory. It w
 ill be the traditional Ride Around Bloomington.&nbsp\; The complete route i
 s a modest 54 miles\, but as this is a loop around town there are numerous 
 options for returning home early on familiar roads we have ridden all year.
 &nbsp\; This will not be a fast paced ride... We will want to share stories
  and memories of Dave.<p>Non-members should sign up for a&nbsp\;<a href="ht
 tps://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=133776">free 
 trial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes elec
 tronically signing a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.<br></
 p><p><br></p>
