 s a mix of one-half HNF gravel and<br>one-half paved county road.  There is
 <br>no single or double track.<br>XC or MTB are fine.<br><b><br></b><br><b>
 no formal carpooling will be offered</b><br><br>The ride&nbsp\;leaves from 
 Blackwell Horse Camp<br>on Tower Ridge Road <b>promptly at&nbsp\; 6:00PM.</
 b><br><br><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/17995313" id="ow572" __is
 _owner="true">Going Dutch Ridge</a><a id="ow582" __is_owner="true"></a>
