DESCRIPTION:<u></u><u></u><u></u><p><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=h
 ttps://www.strava.com/routes/2912154859389059302&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=cale
 ndar&amp\;ust=1649549578303469&amp\;usg=AOvVaw2zllsJOHcGEHNpQ28IN52f" targe
 t="_blank"> 36 Bottom\, Burma\, Frontage\, Sample\, Old 37</a></p><p>Ready 
 for a high spirited ride? BV Ride is an intermediate/ advanced ride and mod
 erate distance that may or may not include regrouping points.  Pace is anti
 cipated to be 17+ mph. Expect occasional sprint or Strava segments\, pace l
 ine riding at high speed\, intervals\, and fewer regrouping stops.</p><p>Th
 e BV Ride will start at the Parking lot across from the Bryan Park Pool on 
 Woodlawn at 5:45. Mileages will increase as the season progresses. If you k
 eep coming we will make you faster!</p><p>Riders are expected to look out f
 or each other during the rides.  Ride maps and GPS links will be posted her
 e in advance. Riders unfamiliar with the route should bring along a copy of
  the map.</p>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://www.google.c
 om/url?q=https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id%3D
 133776&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;ust=1649549578303469&amp\;usg=AO
 vVaw1BncPZFLXu86HcPivGM012" target="_blank">free trial membership</a>\, goo
 d for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing a liabi
 lity waiver\, prior to participation.<u></u><u></u><u></u>
