DESCRIPTION:Join in for a fun gravel ride through<br>the&nbsp\; Hoosier Nat
 ional Forest.<br><br>This 33 mile route begins at the Blackwell horse camp<
 br>and goes out Tower Ridge&nbsp\;Road\, ventures out to Polk Patch<br>and 
 returns to the fire tower via Dutch Ridge road<br>Route is entirely gravel 
 and pavement<br>- no trail.<br><br>Ride leaves&nbsp\; promptly at 10:00am<b
 r><br>MTB or Gravel bike<br><br><b>Due to covid-19 no formal carpooling wil
 l be offered</b><br><b><br></b><br><b><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/rout
 es/34757811" id="ow766" __is_owner="true">Polk Patch 33</a><br></b>
