DESCRIPTION:<html-blob>This 20-miler begins at the Blackwell Horse<br>Camp 
 on Tower Ridge Road\, heads to<br>Hickory Grove Church\, and then circles<b
 r>back to the horse camp via McPike Branch<br>Road and Dutch Ridge Road.  T
 he route is<br>predominately gravel with a little bit of <br>pavement\, and
  no trail.  Route is suitable<br>for CX\, gravel bike\, or MTB.Ride starts 
 promptly<br>at 6:00<br><br>&nbsp\;We will not offer a formal car pool this 
 year&nbsp\;<br><br>&nbsp\;<br><a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/ma
 ps/Gravel_Rides/All%20Around%20Yellowstone%2020.pdf">All Around Yellowstone
  20</a><a><br><br></a><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/38610854" id=
 "ow401" __is_owner="true">GPS Files</a><a id="ow411" __is_owner="true"></a>
 </html-blob>
