CREATED:20201026T203223Z
DESCRIPTION:<p><a href="https://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/iRides/The_
 Shortest_iRide_19.pdf">The Shortest iRide 19</a><br></p><p><a href="https:/
 /ridewithgps.com/routes/6312136" id="ow4027" __is_owner="true">GPS Files</a
 ><br></p><p>The iRide is a no-drop Intermediate level ride of moderate pace
  and distance with regrouping points.&nbsp\; Pace is anticipated to be 15-1
 7 mph.</p><p>The tRide is an advanced level ride of high pace and moderate 
 distance that may or may not include regrouping points. &nbsp\;Pace is anti
 cipated to be 18+ mph. Expect occasional sprint or Strava segments\, pace l
 ine riding at high speed\, intervals\, and fewer regrouping stops.</p><p>Th
 e iRide and tRide will start at the same place and will ride the same sched
 uled route\, but the start of these two groups will be staggered with the t
 Ride starting first at 5:45 and the iRide just behind them. Mileages will i
 ncrease as the season progresses.&nbsp\; </p><p>Riders are expected to look
  out for each other during the rides.&nbsp\; Ride maps and GPS links will b
 e posted here in advance. Riders unfamiliar with the route should bring alo
 ng a copy of the map.</p>Non-members should sign up for a&nbsp\;<a href="ht
 tps://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=133776">free 
 trial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes elec
 tronically signing a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.
LAST-MODIFIED:20201026T203910Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot @ 39.15435\,-86.523
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:iRide / tRide - The Shortest iRide 19
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
