DESCRIPTION:This 20-miler begins at the Blackwell Horse<br>Camp on Tower Ri
 dge Road\, extends<br>down Tower ridge Road\, and loops<br>back to Blackwel
 l via&nbsp\;Hickory Grove\,&nbsp\;<br>and&nbsp\;Henderson Creek\,&nbsp\;and
  back up Dutch Ridge road.<br>The route is a mix of one-half HNF gravel and
 <br>one-half paved county road.  There is<br>no single or double track.<br>
 XC or MTB are fine.<br><br><b>&nbsp\;no formal carpooling will be offered</
 b><br><br>The ride&nbsp\;leaves from Blackwell Horse Camp<br>on Tower Ridge
  Road <b>promptly at&nbsp\; 6:00PM.</b><br><br>BRING LIGHTS !!<br>&nbsp\;<b
 r><a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/Gravel_Rides/Reverse_Goin
 g_Dutch_Ridge_20.pdf">Reverse Going Dutch Ridge 20</a><br><br><a href="http
 s://ridewithgps.com/routes/29143047">GPS Files</a><a></a>
