 ife Refuge &amp\; Beyond 2018 Version 32</a><br><br><a href="https://ridewi
 thgps.com/routes/26907106" id="ow1911" __is_owner="true">GPS Files</a><br><
 br>This is our usual fist ride of the season out to the Muscatatuck Nationa
 l Wildlife Refuge on Bottom Road.&nbsp\; The basic route is a pretty level 
 24 mile out &amp\; back designed to be an easy ride to shake off the Winter
  cobwebs.&nbsp\; The route is easily extended to 32 miles with a loop to th
 e north\, as show in the mapping\, or can be extended east across I-69 via 
 the Sample Road overpass for those who want some additional miles.&nbsp\; Y
 ou could even ride a little gravel over to the new covered bridge on Maple 
 Grove Road and return to Bottom Road and Bloomington via Maple Grove (North
 -South) and Maple Grove (East-West).<br><br>Non-members should sign up for 
 a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=
 133776">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which 
 includes electronically signing a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to partici
 pation.&nbsp\;&nbsp\;<br><br><a></a>
