 /b><br /></p><p>Ready for a high spirited ride? BV Ride is an intermediate/
  advanced ride and moderate distance that may or may not include regrouping
  points.  Pace is anticipated to be 17+ mph. Expect occasional sprint or St
 rava segments\, pace line riding at high speed\, intervals\, and fewer regr
 ouping stops.</p><p>The BV Ride will start at the Parking lot across from t
 he Bryan Park Pool on Woodlawn at 5:45. Mileages will increase as the seaso
 n progresses. If you keep coming we will make you faster!</p><p>Riders are 
 expected to look out for each other during the rides.  Ride maps and GPS li
 nks will be posted here in advance. Riders unfamiliar with the route should
  bring along a copy of the map.</p>Non-members should sign up for a <a href
 ="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=133776">f
 ree trial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes 
 electronically signing a liability waiver\, prior to participation.<u></u><
 u></u><u></u></span></span></span></span></span>
