 ion. The alternate route continues south on Peerless Rd. into Bedford and t
 hen turns west over to Lincoln Ave./Oolitic Rd. and then back north to Ooli
 tic.&nbsp\; The "GPS Files" link above shows the alternate route.&nbsp\; &n
 bsp\;<br><html-blob><br>A difficult 57 miles but worth the trip. Limestone 
 for the Empire State building was quarried at Oolitic.&nbsp\; Have your pic
  taken with the Joe Palooka statue.&nbsp\; Test your legs on Patton Hill Rd
 . The short option (39 miles) sends you home early on friendly Old SR 37.<b
 r><br>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregiste
 red.com/get_information.php?event_id=136627">free trial membership</a>\, go
 od for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing a liab
 ility waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.&nbsp\;&nbsp\;<br><br><a></a><u
 ></u></html-blob>
