DESCRIPTION:<p><a href="https://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/John_Basset
 t_Maps/2X_Upland_v2_50_-_50.pdf" id="ow449" __is_owner="true">2X Upland v2 
 50 - 50.pdf</a><br></p><p><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/35962286"
  id="ow460" __is_owner="true">GPS Files</a><br></p><p>Toreplace the RAIN ri
 de this year\, we plan to ride to Upland in Columbus\, havelunch and possib
 ly a beer and ride back to Bloomington. &nbsp\;We have done mostsegments of
  this route on other BBC rides\, so it will be familiar to many.&nbsp\; The
  route has a few less miles and a few more hills than RAIN. &nbsp\;The map 
 shows theroute starts and finishes at Bryan Park\, but the ride leader plan
 s to finish atthe Bloomington Upland - so it is a 2X Upland ride!</p><p></p
 ><p>Do one half of the this for 50 miles and plan a pickup in Columbus\, or
  do the whole deal for a century and visit Upland twice!&nbsp\;</p><p>Non-m
 embers should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get
 _information.php?event_id=133776">free trial membership</a>\, good for up t
 o three rides\, and which includes electronically signing a liability waive
 r\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.&nbsp\;&nbsp\;</p>
