 Trail 21 in the HNF.  This could be<br>bypassed on pavement and gravel.<br>
 Ride starts/ends at Hickory Ridge fire<br>tower on Tower Ridge Road.<br><br
 >Suitable for gravel and<br>and cyclocross bikes plus MTB.<br><br>Shorter r
 outes are available.&nbsp\;<br><br>&nbsp\;Ride leaves from the fire tower p
 romptly at<br>12 Noon<br><br><a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/map
 s/Gravel_Rides/About%20Half%20of%20the%20Gravel%20Grovel%2032.pdf" id="ow12
 01" __is_owner="true">About Half of the Gravel Grovel 32</a><a></a><br><br>
