 r>This 20-miler begins at the Blackwell Horse<br>Camp on Tower Ridge Road\,
  extends<br>down Tower ridge Road\, and loops<br>back to Blackwell via&nbsp
 \;Hickory Grove\,&nbsp\;<br>Henderson Creek\,&nbsp\;and back up Dutch Ridge
  road.<br>The route is a mix of one-half HNF gravel and<br>one-half paved c
 ounty road.  There is<br>no single or double track.<br>XC or MTB are fine.<
 br><br><b>&nbsp\;no formal carpooling will be offered</b><br><br>The ride&n
 bsp\;leaves from Blackwell Horse Camp<br>on Tower Ridge Road <b>promptly at
 &nbsp\; 6:00PM.</b><br><br>BRING LIGHTS !!<br>&nbsp\;<br><a href="http://bl
 oomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/Gravel_Rides/Reverse_Going_Dutch_Ridge_20.pdf
 ">Reverse Going Dutch Ridge 20</a><br><br><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/
 routes/29143047">GPS Files</a><a></a>
