DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><u></u><u></u><p><a href="https://bloomingtonbicycle
 club.org/maps/John_Bassett_Maps/Joes_Cemetery_Ride_74.pdf">Joe's Cemetery R
 ide 74</a></p><p><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/40876564">GPS File
 s</a><br></p><br>The past two years the BBC September Cemetery Ride was hel
 d on the anniversary of the 09 / 11 attack. This year we are off by one day
 \, but it’s still appropriate to honor the memory of the first responders a
 nd the nearly three thousand civilians who lost their lives that day.<br><b
 r>The route is slightly altered this year to use less traveled and newly pa
 ved Mt Gilead to Unionville and Egbert / Morgan St / Ohio St going into Mar
 tinsville.<p>Services are available at miles 28 and 50 of the route.</p><p>
 Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.co
 m/get_information.php?event_id=136627" id="ow427" __is_owner="true">free tr
 ial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electr
 onically signing a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.&nbsp\;&
 nbsp\;<br></p><u></u><u></u></html-blob>
LAST-MODIFIED:20220909T165723Z
