DESCRIPTION:<p><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.strava.com
 /routes/2912194098535143654&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;ust=1651947
 750334626&amp\;usg=AOvVaw21v8dxz0ny9mTifrjjtCQp">31 Robinson\, Tunnel\, Shu
 ffle\, Brummett</a></p><p>Ready for a high spirited ride? BV Ride is an int
 ermediate/ advanced ride and moderate distance that may or may not include 
 regrouping points.  Pace is anticipated to be 17+ mph. Expect occasional sp
 rint or Strava segments\, pace line riding at high speed\, intervals\, and 
 fewer regrouping stops.</p><p>The BV Ride will start at the Parking lot acr
 oss from the Bryan Park Pool on Woodlawn at 5:45. Mileages will increase as
  the season progresses. If you keep coming we will make you faster!</p><p>R
 iders are expected to look out for each other during the rides.  Ride maps 
 and GPS links will be posted here in advance. Riders unfamiliar with the ro
 ute should bring along a copy of the map.</p>Non-members should sign up for
  a <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://secure.getmeregistered.com
 /get_information.php?event_id%3D133776&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;
 ust=1651947750334626&amp\;usg=AOvVaw2Eu_dHpTL70-BujFy5Mzsm">free trial memb
 ership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically
  signing a liability waiver\, prior to participation.
