 n_Bassett_Maps/Joes_Paragon_and_Gosport_Ride_57.pdf">Joe's Paragon and Gosp
 ort Ride 57</a><br><br><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/31135553">GP
 S Files</a><br><br>The BBC's historic Paragon Ride is one of those that was
  highly impacted by I-69 construction.  So\, a couple of years ago Joe Ande
 rson suggested this new\, modified route which adds a little bit of distanc
 e and some new roads. It was a big hit\, so we do it again.&nbsp\; The rout
 e goes first to Paragon\, then north a little before returning south throug
 h Gosport.  Joe will personally lead this one\, and we are pretty excited a
 bout that.<br><br>Non-members should sign up for a&nbsp\;<a href="https://s
 ecure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=136627" id="ow3716" 
 __is_owner="true">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, 
 and which includes electronically signing a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior 
 to participation.</html-blob>
