DESCRIPTION:<u></u><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=http://www.bloomin
 gtonbicycleclub.org/maps/BBCMaps/map_pack_1/bartlettsville.pdf&amp\;sa=D&am
 p\;source=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw3h14b6sAr3nRTSMdvqWPeQ" target
 ="_blank">Bartlettsville Squared 52</a><a><br><br></a><a href="https://www.
 google.com/url?q=http://ridewithgps.com/routes/1832583&amp\;sa=D&amp\;sourc
 e=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw0GTS9ELv9m_4Ahgt32LX0Z" target="_blank
 ">GPS Files</a><br><br>Tour scenic Lawrence County for some nice early Fall
  color on this moderate 52 mile ride.  Not only do you get to go to Bartlet
 tsville\, you get to go to Bartlettsville twice in the same ride!<br><br>Ye
 s\, there are some hills.  Or\, do a short option for only 44 miles.  Eithe
 r way\, you will have a great time!<br><br>Non-members should sign up for a
  <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://secure.getmeregistered.com/g
 et_information.php?event_id%3D136627&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;us
 d=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw0_5cJvz8z3KUY7Yt6t47kW" target="_blank">free trial membe
 rship</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically 
 signing a liability waiver\, prior to participation.<u></u>
