DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><u></u><u></u><br><b><a href="https://ridewithgps.co
 m/routes/38885110">Way Around Boltinghouse 3</a>7<a><br><br></a></b><br>Thi
 s ride is a take off on the old Around Boltinghouse Cruise\, a short (22 mi
 le) early season route around the legendary hill on Boltinghouse Road.  We 
 have offered this longer version the last few years with the original ride 
 as a shorter version\, and the longer version has&nbsp\; become the most po
 pular version of the ride.<br>&nbsp\;<br>You can always shortcut on Anderso
 n Road for a nice\, shorter  28 mile loop. There are usually a few intrepid
  soles who turn left at Dolan and ride up the big hill just for grins!<br><
 br>Non-members should sign up for a free trial membership\, good for up to 
 three rides\, and which includes electronically signing a liability waiver\
 ,&nbsp\;prior to participation.&nbsp\;&nbsp\;<u></u><u></u><u></u><u></u><u
 ></u></html-blob>
