DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><u></u><a href="https://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/m
 aps/John_Bassett_Maps/Tour_de_Ville_via_Lanam_Ridge_64.pdf">Tour de Ville v
 ia Lanam Ridge 64</a><br><br><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/309011
 11">GPS Files</a><br><br>See the "ville's" (with a "burg" thrown in for goo
 d measure)!  64 miles with two short options (but the shortest\, 55 miles\,
  includes Bear Wallow Hill - ouch)!?<br><br>And\, the ride leader wants to 
 avoid backtracking on SR 45\, so we'll use Lanam Ridge Road on the way to H
 elmsburg and Beanblossom.<br><br>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="
 https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=136627" id=
 "ow829" __is_owner="true">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to three 
 rides\, and which includes electronically signing a liability waiver\,&nbsp
 \;prior to participation.&nbsp\;&nbsp\;<br><br><a></a><u></u></html-blob>
