BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20211019T174500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20211019T191500
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:3ec6lbtuh6edcbf846ib8c4r0n@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20211019T174500
CREATED:20210314T144013Z
DESCRIPTION:<p><a href="https://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/John_Basset
 t_Maps/iRide_Fluck_Mill_22.pdf">iRide Fluck Mill 22.pdf</a><br></p><p><a hr
 ef="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/24437959">GPS Files</a></p><p>The iRide 
 is an intermediate level ride of moderate pace and distance with regrouping
  points.&nbsp\; Pace is anticipated to be 15-17 mph.<br></p><p>The tRide is
  an advanced level ride of high pace and moderate distance that may or may 
 not include regrouping points. &nbsp\;Pace is anticipated to be 18+ mph. Ex
 pect occasional sprint or Strava segments\, pace line riding at high speed\
 , intervals\, and fewer regrouping stops.</p><p>The iRide and tRide will st
 art at the same place and will ride the same scheduled route\, but the star
 t of these two groups will be staggered with the tRide starting first at 5:
 45 and the iRide just behind them. Mileages will increase as the season pro
 gresses.&nbsp\; </p><p>Riders are expected to look out for each other durin
 g the rides.&nbsp\; Ride maps and GPS links will be posted here in advance.
  Riders unfamiliar with the route should bring along a copy of the map.</p>
 Non-members should sign up for a&nbsp\;<a href="https://secure.getmeregiste
 red.com/get_information.php?event_id=133776">free trial membership</a>\, go
 od for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing a liab
 ility waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.
LAST-MODIFIED:20220614T150545Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot @ 39.15435\,-86.523
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:iRide / tRide - iRide Fluck Mill 22
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
