DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/30161829">Long Leonard 
 Springs</a> 26 miles<br><br>Watch the calendar for weather-related updates 
 and for future morning rides.<br><br><i>Please observe social distancing no
 rms as we gather and ride. We plan no formal leader. EVERYONE is a leader. 
 Familiarize yourself with the ride before heading out. We will ride in smal
 l groups. People in the last group will endeavor to sweep the route and ass
 ist others as needed.</i><br><ul><li>Be SAFE. Don't blow through stop signs
 . Consider bike lights.<br></li><li>Be COURTEOUS: Single up in traffic<br><
 /li><li>Be PREDICTABLE: Signal your intentions to cars and fellow riders.</
 li></ul>This branch of the OWLS training group also emphasizes somewhat slo
 wer\, moderate rides\, and a route planned in advance that is posted on the
  ride calendar. This is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride. Expect 
 an overall average moving speed 11 - 15 mph including hills. Distances vary
  from 20 to 30 miles. Early season rides will be somewhat shorter and slowe
 r. Rides depart promptly at 8:30am.<br><br>Non-members should sign up for a
  <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=1
 33776">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which i
 ncludes electronically signing a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to particip
 ation.<br><br>Questions? Contact <a href="mailto:allan.edmonds@gmail.com">A
 llan Edmonds</a>
