DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/John_Bassett_M
 aps/Joes_Paragon_and_Gosport_Ride_57.pdf">Joe's Paragon and Gosport Ride 57
 </a><br><br><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/31135553">GPS Files</a>
 <br><br>The BBC's historic Paragon Ride is one of those that was highly imp
 acted by I-69 construction.  So\, last year Joe Anderson has suggested this
  new\, modified route which adds a little bit of distance and some new road
 s. It was a big hit\, so we will do it again.&nbsp\; The route goes first t
 o Paragon\, then north a little before returning south through Gosport.  Jo
 e will personally lead this one\, and we are pretty excited about that.<br>
 <br>Non-members should sign up for a&nbsp\;<a href="https://secure.getmereg
 istered.com/get_information.php?event_id=133776">free trial membership</a>\
 , good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing a 
 liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.&nbsp\;&nbsp\;
