LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot @ 39.15435\,-86.523
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Joe's Cemetery Ride 74 - Leader: TBD
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
