DESCRIPTION:This is a Ride not to miss.. The fall foliage is looking fabulo
 us   <br><br>We will sart at the Crooked Creek Boat Ramp go up Elkinsville 
 Rd across Lake Monroe ( you<u> will not </u>get your feet wet this year. ) 
 to Elkinsville\, up Combs Rd to the Nebo Connector\, and down Nebo to the N
 orth parking lot. Then it's up Blue Creek Rd to Trail D\, up Trail D to Mil
 ler Ridge\, down the water bars to Crooked Creek Rd\, and back to the parki
 ng lot - a total of 18.4 beautiful miles.<br><br>PLEASE DON'T MISS THIS ONE
 .<br><br><b>Ride leaves promptly at 6:00PM</b><br><br>No formal car pooling
  id being offered do co Covid-19<br><br><b>BRING LIGHTS! BRING LIGHTS! BRIN
 G LIGHTS!</b><br><br><a href="https://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/Grave
 l_Rides/Reverse%20Blue%20Creek%20Elkinsville%20Loop%20Plus%20Trail%20D%2018
 .pdf">Blue Creek Elkinsville Loop Plus Trail D 18</a><br>&nbsp\;<br><a href
 ="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/17463607">GPS Files</a>
