 des\, and a route planned in advance that is posted on the ride calendar. T
 his is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride. Expect an overall averag
 e moving speed 11 - 15 mph including hills. Distances vary from 20 to 30 mi
 les. Early season rides will be somewhat shorter and slower.During cold wea
 ther the ride departs at 1:30pm.<br><br>Non-members should sign up for a&nb
 sp\;<a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_i
 d=133776">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and whic
 h includes electronically signing a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to parti
