DESCRIPTION:<b>Monroe County roads still has Tower Ridge road as being clos
 ed.</b><br><b>You will have to come in Hunter Creek to get to the Fire Towe
 r</b><br><br>Join us for a fun gravel ride through&nbsp\;the enchanted Hoos
 ier National Forest.&nbsp\;&nbsp\;The 21 mile route begins at the Hickory&n
 bsp\;Ridge Fire Tower on Tower Ridge Road\,&nbsp\;ventures south to Hickory
  Grove Church\,&nbsp\;then out to Norman and back Henderson Creek&nbsp\;to 
 Hunters Creek to the Fire Tower.<br><br>Route is entirely gravel and paveme
 nt\,&nbsp\;no trail.<br><br><b>Ride starts promptly&nbsp\;at 6:00PM<br><br>
 We will not offer a formal car pool this year&nbsp\;<br>due to COVID-19 con
 cerns.&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;</b><br><br><b>BRING LIGHTS! BRING
  LIGHTS! BRING LIGHTS!</b><br><b><br></b><br>Reverse Hendersen Creek &amp\;
  Hickory Ridge from Fire Tower 21<br><br><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/r
 outes/33934059" id="ow356" __is_owner="true">GPS Files</a><br><a><br></a><a
 ></a>
