DESCRIPTION:<u></u><u></u><u></u><p><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=h
 ttps://www.strava.com/routes/2912138405322619244&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=cale
 ndar&amp\;ust=1649543332040023&amp\;usg=AOvVaw0w2doi7REzsLYdQhe63E3S" targe
 t="_blank"> 29 Vernal\, 43\, Gardner\, Eller</a></p><p>Ready for a high spi
 rited ride? BV Ride is an intermediate/ advanced ride and moderate distance
  that may or may not include regrouping points.  Pace is anticipated to be 
 17+ mph. Expect occasional sprint or Strava segments\, pace line riding at 
 high speed\, intervals\, and fewer regrouping stops.</p><p>The BV Ride will
  start at the Parking lot across from the Bryan Park Pool on Woodlawn at 5:
 45. Mileages will increase as the season progresses. If you keep coming we 
 will make you faster!</p><p>Riders are expected to look out for each other 
 during the rides.  Ride maps and GPS links will be posted here in advance. 
