DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/Gravel_Rides/R
 everse_Hendersen_Creek_-_Hickory_Ridge_from_Fire_Tower_21.pdf">Reverse Hend
 ersen Creek &amp\; Hickory Ridge from Fire Tower 21</a><br><br><a href="htt
 ps://ridewithgps.com/routes/33934059">GPS Files</a><br><br>Join us for a fu
 n gravel ride through&nbsp\;the enchanted Hoosier National Forest.&nbsp\;&n
 bsp\;The 21 mile route begins at the Hickory&nbsp\;Ridge Fire Tower on Towe
 r Ridge Road\,&nbsp\;ventures south to Hickory Grove Church\,&nbsp\;then ou
 t to Norman and back Henderson Creek&nbsp\;to Hunters Creek to the Fire Tow
 er.<br><br>Route is entirely gravel and pavement\,&nbsp\;no trail.<br><br><
 b>Ride starts promptly&nbsp\;at 6:00PM<br><br>We will not offer a formal ca
 r pool this year&nbsp\;<br>due to COVID-19 concerns.&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&n
 bsp\;&nbsp\;</b><br><br><b>BRING LIGHTS! BRING LIGHTS! BRING LIGHTS!</b><br
 ><a><br></a><a></a>
