BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART:20220611T130000Z
DTEND:20220611T180000Z
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:55suoboamr8ckks8ugkgnak5l1@google.com
CREATED:20220518T152648Z
DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><u></u><u></u><u></u><u></u><u></u><u></u><u></u><a 
 href="https://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/John_Bassett_Maps/Godsey_Ride
 _55.pdf">Godsey Ride 55</a><br><br><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/
 39473330"><u></u>GPS<u></u><u></u>&nbsp\;<u></u>Links</a><u></u><br><u></u>
 <br><u></u>Two sections of the route near Martinsville have been revised fo
 r 2022.&nbsp\;<br><u></u><br><u></u>Liberty Church Rd has been closed just 
 south of Martinsville for bridge replacement at Jordan Creek. The detour th
 at's in place is a good way around the construction.&nbsp\; Coming from the
  west on Godsey Rd turn right on Hacker Creek after crossing over I-69. Tur
 n left on Liberty Loop and follow it back to Jordan Road.&nbsp\; Click the 
 GPS Link above to view and download the modified route on the "Ride with GP
 S" website.&nbsp\; &nbsp\;<br><br><u></u>Since Burton Ln no longer crosses 
 I-69 turn right and follow Southview Dr. along the south side of I-69 to Ma
 halasville Rd.&nbsp\; Turn left on Mahalasville and go under I-69 to the Kr
 oger gas station for drinks and snacks. After the rest stop\, the route con
 tinues south on Mahalasville as before.&nbsp\;<br><u></u><br><u></u>This ha
 s been a very popular ride since its inception a few years ago.&nbsp\; We'l
 l take the new Kinser Pike / I69 bridge to Bottom Road to get out in the co
 unty.&nbsp\; We make a big loop up north crossing I69 at Godsey Road. We co
 ntinue north to Martinsville\, and return to Bloomington via Low Gap and An
 derson Roads\, for a total distance of about 59 miles.<br><br>Non-members s
 hould sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_informa
 tion.php?event_id=136627">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to three 
 rides\, and which includes electronically signing a liability waiver\,&nbsp
 \;prior to participation.&nbsp\; &nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;<u></u><u></u><u></u>
 <u></u><u></u><u></u><u></u></html-blob>
LAST-MODIFIED:20220608T155649Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot @ 39.15435\,-86.523
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Godsey Ride 59 - Leader: TBD
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
