DESCRIPTION:<u></u><u></u><p><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://
 www.strava.com/routes/2912134121167090028&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&am
 p\;ust=1649543140358613&amp\;usg=AOvVaw3TfjVMJJuomT1c2GZZhglk" target="_bla
 nk">33 SR45\, South Shore\, Robinson</a></p><p>Ready for a high spirited ri
 de? BV Ride is an intermediate/ advanced ride and moderate distance that ma
 y or may not include regrouping points.  Pace is anticipated to be 17+ mph.
  Expect occasional sprint or Strava segments\, pace line riding at high spe
 ed\, intervals\, and fewer regrouping stops.</p><p>The BV Ride will start a
 t the Parking lot across from the Bryan Park Pool on Woodlawn at 5:45. Mile
 ages will increase as the season progresses. If you keep coming we will mak
 e you faster!</p><p>Riders are expected to look out for each other during t
 he rides.  Ride maps and GPS links will be posted here in advance. Riders u
 nfamiliar with the route should bring along a copy of the map.</p>Non-membe
 rs should sign up for a <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://secur
