CREATED:20210314T144013Z
DESCRIPTION:<p><a href="https://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/iRides/Elle
 ttsville_Loop_iRide_23.pdf" id="ow386" __is_owner="true">Ellettsville Loop 
 iRide 23</a><br></p><p><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/27045941" id
 ="ow396" __is_owner="true">GPS Files</a><br></p><p>The iRide is a no-drop I
 ntermediate level ride of moderate pace and distance with regrouping points
 .&nbsp\; Pace is anticipated to be 15-17 mph.<br></p><p>The tRide is an adv
 anced level ride of high pace and moderate distance that may or may not inc
 lude regrouping points. &nbsp\;Pace is anticipated to be 18+ mph. Expect oc
 casional sprint or Strava segments\, pace line riding at high speed\, inter
 vals\, and fewer regrouping stops.</p><p>The iRide and tRide will start at 
 the same place and will ride the same scheduled route\, but the start of th
 ese two groups will be staggered with the tRide starting first at 5:45 and 
 the iRide just behind them. Mileages will increase as the season progresses
 .&nbsp\; </p><p>Riders are expected to look out for each other during the r
 ides.&nbsp\; Ride maps and GPS links will be posted here in advance. Riders
  unfamiliar with the route should bring along a copy of the map.</p>Non-mem
 bers should sign up for a&nbsp\;<a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com
 /get_information.php?event_id=133776">free trial membership</a>\, good for 
 up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing a liability w
 aiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.
LAST-MODIFIED:20210405T131042Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot @ 39.15435\,-86.523
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:iRide / tRide - Ellettsville Loop iRide 23
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
