DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/3105911" id="ow594" __i
 s_owner="true">Down Nehrt</a> 26 miles<br><ul><li>Be SAFE. Don't blow throu
 gh stop signs. Consider bike lights.<br></li><li>Be COURTEOUS: Single up in
  traffic<br></li><li>Be PREDICTABLE: Signal your intentions to cars and fel
 low riders.</li></ul>The "Older\, Wiser\, and a Little Slower" training gro
 up emphasizes moderate rides\, and a route planned in advance that is poste
 d on the ride calendar. This is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride.
  The OWLS often average 15 to 19 mph on flat roads\, and typically have an 
 overall average moving speed between 12 and 15 mph including hills. Distanc
 es vary from 20 to 30 miles\, depending partly on available light. Early se
 ason rides will be somewhat shorter and slower. Rides depart promptly at 5:
 45.<br><br>Non-members will be required to sign a <a href="https://drive.go
 ogle.com/file/d/1jDxK92FPgpyvj2cCT7vV2S8RZTWDR_RH/view" target="_blank">lia
 bility waiver</a> prior to participation.<br><br>Questions? Contact <a href
 ="mailto:allan.edmonds@gmail.com" target="_blank">Allan Edmonds</a> or <a h
 ref="mailto:gail.morell@gmail.com" target="_blank">Gail Morell</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20201031T121354Z
LOCATION:Sherwood Oaks Christian Church\, 2700 E Rogers Rd\, Bloomington\, 
 IN 47401\, USA
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:OWLS Ride
TRANSP:OPAQUE
