DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/33800384" id="ow1463" _
 _is_owner="true">Extended Ellettsville Ride</a> 26 miles. Start from Bryan 
 Park.<br><br>Watch the calendar for weather-related updates and for future 
 morning rides.<br><br><i>Please observe social distancing norms as we gathe
 r and ride. We plan no formal leader. EVERYONE is a leader. Familiarize you
 rself with the ride before heading out. We will ride in small groups. Peopl
 e in the last group will endeavor to sweep the route and assist others as n
 eeded.</i><br><ul><li>Be SAFE. Don't blow through stop signs. Consider bike
  lights.<br></li><li>Be COURTEOUS: Single up in traffic<br></li><li>Be PRED
 ICTABLE: Signal your intentions to cars and fellow riders.</li></ul>This br
 anch of the OWLS training group also emphasizes somewhat slower\, moderate 
 rides\, and a route planned in advance that is posted on the ride calendar.
  This is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride. Expect an overall aver
 age moving speed 11 - 15 mph including hills. Distances vary from 20 to 30 
 miles. Early season rides will be somewhat shorter and slower. Rides depart
  promptly at 9:30am.<br><br>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https
 ://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=133776">free tri
 al membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electro
 nically signing a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.<br><br>Q
 uestions? Contact <a href="mailto:allan.edmonds@gmail.com">Allan Edmonds</a
 >
LAST-MODIFIED:20201012T133805Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Parking Lot\, S Woodlawn Ave\, Bloomington\, IN 47401\,
  USA
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Early Bird - Extended Ellettsville
