DESCRIPTION:<p><a href="https://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/iRides/Sout
 hern_Loop_30_rev_1.pdf" id="ow392" __is_owner="true">Southern Loop 30 rev 1
 </a><br></p><p><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/21915821" id="ow403"
  __is_owner="true">GPS Files</a><br></p><p>The iRide is a no-drop Intermedi
 ate level ride of moderate pace and distance with regrouping points.&nbsp\;
  Pace is anticipated to be 15-17 mph.<br></p><p>The tRide is an advanced le
 vel ride of high pace and moderate distance that may or may not include reg
 rouping points. &nbsp\;Pace is anticipated to be 18+ mph. Expect occasional
  sprint or Strava segments\, pace line riding at high speed\, intervals\, a
 nd fewer regrouping stops.</p><p>The iRide and tRide will start at the same
  place and will ride the same scheduled route\, but the start of these two 
 groups will be staggered with the tRide starting first at 5:45 and the iRid
 e just behind them. Mileages will increase as the season progresses.&nbsp\;
  </p><p>Riders are expected to look out for each other during the rides.&nb
 sp\; Ride maps and GPS links will be posted here in advance. Riders unfamil
 iar with the route should bring along a copy of the map.</p>Non-members sho
 uld sign up for a&nbsp\;<a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_inf
 ormation.php?event_id=133776">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to th
 ree rides\, and which includes electronically signing a liability waiver\,&
 nbsp\;prior to participation.
