DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><u></u>This will be our last Wednesday off road ride
  of the 2021/2022 season<u></u><br><u></u><br><u></u><br><u></u>Join us for
  a <b><u>BLACKJACK</u></b> ride<u></u><br><u></u>Each rider will be given t
 wo playing cards along the ride to try and beat the dealer.<u></u><br><u></
 u>You could win fabulous cash and prizes...( not really but maybe the admir
 ation of other riders)&nbsp\; come out and join us as no lights are needed 
 for this ride......&nbsp\;<u></u><br><u></u><br>This 20-miler begins at the
  Blackwell Horse<br>Camp on Tower Ridge Road\, heads to<br>Hickory Grove Ch
 urch\, and then circles<br>back to the horse camp via McPike Branch<br>Road
  and Dutch Ridge Road.  The route is<br>predominately gravel with a little 
 bit of <br>pavement\, and no trail.  Route is suitable<br>for CX\, gravel b
 ike\, or MTB.Ride starts promptly<br>at 6:00<br>&nbsp\;<br><a href="http://
 bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/Gravel_Rides/All%20Around%20Yellowstone%202
 0.pdf">All Around Yellowstone 20</a><a><br><br></a><a href="https://ridewit
 hgps.com/routes/38610854" id="ow409" __is_owner="true">GPS Files</a><a></a>
 <u></u><u></u></html-blob>
LAST-MODIFIED:20220314T124836Z
