DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/31260886" id="ow3237" _
 _is_owner="true">Shady Side Out and Back</a> 15 miles<br><br>Please observe
  social distancing norms as we gather and ride. We plan no formal leader. E
 VERYONE is a leader. Familiarize yourself with the ride before heading out.
  We will ride in small groups.People in the last group will endeavor to swe
 ep the route and assist others as needed.<br><ul><li>Be SAFE. Don't blow th
 rough stop signs. Consider bike lights.<br></li><li>Be COURTEOUS: Single up
  in traffic<br></li><li>Be PREDICTABLE: Signal your intentions to cars and 
 fellow riders.</li></ul>The "Older\, Wiser\, and a Little Slower" training 
 group emphasizes moderate rides\, and a route planned in advance that is po
 sted on the ride calendar. This is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ri
 de. The OWLS often average 15 to 19 mph on flat roads\, and typically have 
 an overall average moving speed between 12 and 15 mph including hills. Dist
 ances vary from 20 to 30 miles\, depending partly on available light. Early
  season rides will be somewhat shorter and slower. Rides depart promptly at
  5:45.<br><br>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getm
 eregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=133776">free trial membership<
 /a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signin
 g a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.<br><br>Questions? Cont
 act <a href="mailto:allan.edmonds@gmail.com">Allan Edmonds</a> or <a href="
 mailto:gail.morell@gmail.com">Gail Morell</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20201012T224124Z
LOCATION:Sherwood Oaks Christian Church\, 2700 E Rogers Rd\, Bloomington\, 
 IN 47401\, USA
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:OWLS - Shadyside
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
