 r="true">Muscatatuck Map</a>.<br><br>Non-members should\, prior to particip
 ation\, sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_infor
 mation.php?event_id=132872">free trial membership</a>\, which includes elec
 tronically signing a liability waiver.
