 ps/John_Bassett_Maps/Hendricksville_Ride_to_Rosies_2017_Version.pdf" id="ow
 397" __is_owner="true">Hendricksville Ride to Rosie's 2022 Version</a><a><b
 r><br></a><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/38774666" id="ow372" __is
 _owner="true">GPS Links</a><br><br>This popular route was named after the l
 ittle diner in Hendricksville and provides a great tour of the hills in wes
 tern Monroe County.&nbsp\;&nbsp\;We will leave town via&nbsp\;Vernal Pike a
 nd return via&nbsp\;Rockport Road and That&nbsp\;Road.&nbsp\; In between ar
 e some beautiful&nbsp\;western Monroe and eastern Greene&nbsp\;County roadw
 ays.<br><br>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmer
 egistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=136627">free trial membership</a
 >\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing 
