DESCRIPTION:<span><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.strava.
 com/routes/2912148700198821094&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;ust=1651
 948141530409&amp\;usg=AOvVaw3FY3FpZ_22SofqTkJB4-VA"> 33 Forest Loop</a><spa
 n><span><span><u></u><u></u><u></u><p><br /><b>38 Northshore\, Southshore\,
  SR45</b><br /></p><p>Ready for a high spirited ride? BV Ride is an interme
 diate/ advanced ride and moderate distance that may or may not include regr
 ouping points.  Pace is anticipated to be 17+ mph. Expect occasional sprint
  or Strava segments\, pace line riding at high speed\, intervals\, and fewe
 r regrouping stops.</p><p>The BV Ride will start at the Parking lot across 
 from the Bryan Park Pool on Woodlawn at 5:45. Mileages will increase as the
  season progresses. If you keep coming we will make you faster!</p><p>Rider
 s are expected to look out for each other during the rides.  Ride maps and 
 GPS links will be posted here in advance. Riders unfamiliar with the route 
 should bring along a copy of the map.</p>Non-members should sign up for a <
 a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get
 _information.php?event_id%3D133776&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;ust=
 1651948141530409&amp\;usg=AOvVaw1zzFBSjA81XKoQmOnkVPPl">free trial membersh
 ip</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically sig
 ning a liability waiver\, prior to participation.<u></u><u></u><u></u></spa
 n></span></span></span>
LAST-MODIFIED:20220502T182927Z
