 gns. Consider bike lights.<br></li><li>Be COURTEOUS: Single up in traffic<b
 r></li><li>Be PREDICTABLE: Signal your intentions to cars and fellow riders
 .</li></ul>This branch of the OWLS training group also emphasizes somewhat 
