UID:1o8ek474md65uon7vi4a1pfqgf@google.com
CREATED:20210228T161501Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>BBC Saturday Touring Rides are scheduled every Saturday\, Ma
 rch-October\, except for RAIN and the Hilly Hundred. Start times will chang
 e from month to month with the availability of light and the onset of India
 na heat and humidity. Most rides leave from the Bryan Park Pool parking lot
  unless a “Drive and Ride” is scheduled.  Mileages varies from about 30 to 
 about 100 and increase during the season.  Short options are available on m
 ost routes.</p><p>Touring rides take cyclists to surrounding counties and a
 ccommodate cyclists of a variety of abilities. Participants frequently brea
 k up into multiple groups determined by pace. </p><p>We strive to have a de
 signated ride leader each Saturday.  Ride leaders ensure that no rider is c
 ompletely dropped and all riders make it back to the starting point. On lon
 ger rides\, leaders designate regroup points and identify rest stops for fo
 od and water. Touring rides are a great way to acquaint yourself with the a
 rea\, build endurance\, and meet others who share your interest in cycling.
 </p><p>Route descriptions\, maps\, and gps links for each ride are posted i
 n advance on this calendar closer to the ride date.</p><p> Non-members shou
 ld sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_informatio
 n.php?event_id=133776" target="_blank">free trial membership</a>\, good for
  up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing a liability 
 waiver\, prior to participation.  </p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20210228T161501Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot @ 39.15435\,-86.523
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Saturday Touring Ride
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
