 ater to those who want to take it easy and to beginning riders. These Sunda
 y rides feature lower mileage (19-26 miles) and slower paces. They use Bloo
 mington area low traffic roads.<br><br>Waterworks. (19 miles) <a href="http
 s://www.bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/niceneasy/?2" id="ow468" __is_owner="tru
 e">Waterworks Map</a>.<br><br>Non-members should\, prior to participation\,
  sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.
 php?event_id=132872">free trial membership</a>\, which includes electronica
 lly signing a liability waiver.
