UID:51fbhu12qh7ao1vo4p76umuh6t_R20200707T123000@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20200804T083000
CREATED:20200622T002811Z
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/30162001">Airport-Giffo
 rd-Duncan</a>&nbsp\;27 miles<br><br>Watch the calendar for weather-related 
 updates and for future morning rides.<br><br><i>Please observe social dista
 ncing norms as we gather and ride. We plan no formal leader. EVERYONE is a 
 leader. Familiarize yourself with the ride before heading out. We will ride
  in small groups. People in the last group will endeavor to sweep the route
  and assist others as needed.</i><br><ul><li>Be SAFE. Don't blow through st
 op signs. Consider bike lights.<br></li><li>Be COURTEOUS: Single up in traf
 fic<br></li><li>Be PREDICTABLE: Signal your intentions to cars and fellow r
 iders.</li></ul>This branch of the OWLS training group also emphasizes some
 what slower\, moderate rides\, and a route planned in advance that is poste
 d on the ride calendar. This is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride.
  Expect an overall average moving speed 11 - 15 mph including hills. Distan
 ces vary from 20 to 30 miles. Early season rides will be somewhat shorter a
 nd slower. Rides depart promptly at 8:30am.<br><br>Non-members should sign 
 up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?ev
 ent_id=133776">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and
  which includes electronically signing a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to 
 participation.<br><br>Questions? Contact <a href="mailto:allan.edmonds@gmai
 l.com">Allan Edmonds</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20200916T183754Z
LOCATION:Sherwood Oaks Christian Church\, 2700 E Rogers Rd\, Bloomington\, 
 IN 47401\, USA\, 
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Early Bird - Airport
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
