DESCRIPTION:<p><a href="https://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/iRides/A_Ne
 w_eeeee-Harmony_Ver4_27.pdf" id="ow451" __is_owner="true">A New eeeee-Harmo
 ny Ver4 27</a><br></p><p><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/36148937" 
 id="ow447" __is_owner="true">GPS Files</a><br></p><p>The iRide is a no-drop
  Intermediate level ride of moderate pace and distance with regrouping poin
 ts.&nbsp\; Pace is anticipated to be 15-17 mph.<br></p><p>The tRide is an a
 dvanced level ride of high pace and moderate distance that may or may not i
 nclude regrouping points. &nbsp\;Pace is anticipated to be 18+ mph. Expect 
 occasional sprint or Strava segments\, pace line riding at high speed\, int
 ervals\, and fewer regrouping stops.</p><p>The iRide and tRide will start a
 t the same place and will ride the same scheduled route\, but the start of 
 these two groups will be staggered with the tRide starting first at 5:45 an
 d the iRide just behind them. Mileages will increase as the season progress
 es.&nbsp\; </p><p>Riders are expected to look out for each other during the
  rides.&nbsp\; Ride maps and GPS links will be posted here in advance. Ride
 rs unfamiliar with the route should bring along a copy of the map.</p>Non-m
 embers should sign up for a&nbsp\;<a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.c
 om/get_information.php?event_id=133776">free trial membership</a>\, good fo
 r up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing a liability
  waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.
LAST-MODIFIED:20220614T150609Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot @ 39.15435\,-86.523
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:iRide / tRide - A New eeee-Harmony v4 27
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
