 e to 37 Maple Grove to Stinesville\, Mt Tabor\, Bottom\, Prather\, winding 
 back to Bottom</a></p><p>Ready for a high spirited ride? BV Ride is an inte
 rmediate/ advanced ride and moderate distance that may or may not include r
 egrouping points. &nbsp\;Pace is anticipated to be 17+ mph. Expect occasion
 al sprint or Strava segments\, pace line riding at high speed\, intervals\,
  and fewer regrouping stops.</p><p>The BV Ride will start at the Parking lo
 t across from the Bryan Park Pool on Woodlawn at 5:45. Mileages will increa
 se as the season progresses. If you keep coming we will make you faster!</p
 ><p>Riders are expected to look out for each other during the rides.&nbsp\;
  Ride maps and GPS links will be posted here in advance. Riders unfamiliar 
 with the route should bring along a copy of the map.</p>Non-members should 
 sign up for a&nbsp\;<a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_informa
 tion.php?event_id=133776">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to three 
 rides\, and which includes electronically signing a liability waiver\,&nbsp
 \;prior to participation.<u></u><u></u><u></u></html-blob>
