 m/routes/24710235">GPS Files</a><br><br>Pretty hilly either way you cut it-
 - 54 miles standard\, or 43 mile short option (Solsberry and back). Find re
 lief on either route at&nbsp\;Yoho's Grocery in Solsberry. Do take the coun
 ty&nbsp\;road down from the new observation platform&nbsp\;to see the railr
 oad trestle up close and personal.&nbsp\;&nbsp\;It's impressive!<br><br>Non
