DESCRIPTION:<p><a href="https://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/iRides/Reve
 rse_Triple_Creek.pdf" id="ow350" __is_owner="true">Reverse Triple Creek 25<
 /a><br></p><p><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/29664419" id="ow360" 
 __is_owner="true">GPS Files</a><br></p><p>The iRide is a no-drop Intermedia
 te level ride of moderate pace and distance with regrouping points.&nbsp\; 
 Pace is anticipated to be 15-17 mph.</p><p>The tRide is an advanced level r
 ide of high pace and moderate distance that may or may not include regroupi
 ng points. &nbsp\;Pace is anticipated to be 18+ mph. Expect occasional spri
 nt or Strava segments\, pace line riding at high speed\, intervals\, and fe
 wer regrouping stops.</p><p>The iRide and tRide will start at the same plac
 e and will ride the same scheduled route\, but the start of these two group
 s will be staggered with the tRide starting first at 5:45 and the iRide jus
 t behind them. Mileages will increase as the season progresses.&nbsp\; </p>
 <p>Riders are expected to look out for each other during the rides.&nbsp\; 
 Ride maps and GPS links will be posted here in advance. Riders unfamiliar w
 ith the route should bring along a copy of the map.</p>Non-members should s
 ign up for a&nbsp\;<a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_informat
 ion.php?event_id=133776">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to three r
 ides\, and which includes electronically signing a liability waiver\,&nbsp\
 ;prior to participation.<br><br>&nbsp\;<br><br>&nbsp\;&nbsp\;
LAST-MODIFIED:20200921T222109Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot @ 39.15435\,-86.523\, 
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:iRide / tRide - Reverse Triple Creek 25
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
