CREATED:20201129T165159Z
DESCRIPTION:This is a fun little route\, borrowed from<br>Gnawbone Lefty.&n
 bsp\;The ride<br>starts / ends at the Scarce-o-Fat Trail<br>parking lot at 
 the base of Yellowwood<br>Dam.  There are sections of pavement<br>riding on
  South Shore Drive\, Lanam<br>Ridge\, Owl Creek Road\, and Helmsberg<br>Roa
 d.  The rest is gravel.<br><br>Approximately 20 miles - no single track\,<b
 r>suitable for MTB\, gravel\, or cyclocross<br>bikes<b>.</b><br><b><br></b>
 <br><b>Ride starts promptly<br>at 6:00<br><br>&nbsp\;We will not offer a fo
 rmal car pool this year&nbsp\;<br>due to COVID-19 concerns.&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&n
 bsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;</b><br><br>&nbsp\;<a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclu
 b.org/maps/Gravel_Rides/GRR%20Scarce-o-Fat%2020.pdf">Scarce-o-Fat 20</a><br
