DESCRIPTION:<br><a href="https://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/John_Basse
 tt_Maps/Wild_Ride_to_Wilbur_2019_Version_3.pdf">Wild Ride to Wilbur 2019 Ve
 rsion 3</a><br><br><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/30698376">GPS Fi
 les</a><br><br>The "classic" 78 mile route north to Wilbur crossed SR 37 at
  Pine Avenue.&nbsp\; This crossing is now permanently closed by I-69\, fore
 ver altering the original 78 mile Wilbur route.&nbsp\; We have done a coupl
 e of alternatives since the highway construction\, and this one seems the b
 est.&nbsp\; &nbsp\;We take Bottom\, Simpson Chapel\, and Burma on the way n
 orth to Paragon where we rejoin the original Wild Wilbur route.&nbsp\; On t
 he way back to Bloomington we try the&nbsp\;the new I-69 access road to Old
  SR 37.&nbsp\;<br><br>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://sec
 ure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=133776">free trial mem
 bership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronicall
 y signing a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.
