DESCRIPTION:<p><a href="https://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/iRides/Over
 _the_Crest_34.pdf" id="ow426" __is_owner="true">Over the Crest 34</a></p><p
 ><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/22079401" id="ow431" __is_owner="t
 rue">GPS Files</a><br></p><p>The iRide is a no-drop Intermediate level ride
  of moderate pace and distance with regrouping points.&nbsp\; Pace is antic
 ipated to be 15-17 mph.<br></p><p>The tRide is an advanced level ride of hi
 gh pace and moderate distance that may or may not include regrouping points
 . &nbsp\;Pace is anticipated to be 18+ mph. Expect occasional sprint or Str
 ava segments\, pace line riding at high speed\, intervals\, and fewer regro
 uping stops.</p><p>The iRide and tRide will start at the same place and wil
 l ride the same scheduled route\, but the start of these two groups will be
  staggered with the tRide starting first at 5:45 and the iRide just behind 
 them. Mileages will increase as the season progresses.&nbsp\; </p><p>Riders
  are expected to look out for each other during the rides.&nbsp\; Ride maps
  and GPS links will be posted here in advance. Riders unfamiliar with the r
 oute should bring along a copy of the map.</p>Non-members should sign up fo
 r a&nbsp\;<a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?e
 vent_id=133776">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, an
 d which includes electronically signing a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to
  participation.
LAST-MODIFIED:20220614T150527Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot @ 39.15435\,-86.523
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:iRide / tRide - Over the Crest 34
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20211021T174500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20211021T194500
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:3e8t7furh3um5k4d1tipmc4scg_R20210413T214500@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20211021T174500
CREATED:20210308T150529Z
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/28613614">Kerr Creek Ge
 tty's Creek\, Mount Gilead</a>&nbsp\;16 miles<br><br>Please observe social 
 distancing norms as we gather and ride.&nbsp\;<ul><li>Be SAFE. Don't blow t
 hrough stop signs. Consider bike lights.<br></li><li>Be COURTEOUS: Single u
 p in traffic<br></li><li>Be PREDICTABLE: Signal your intentions to cars and
  fellow riders.</li></ul>The "Older\, Wiser\, and a Little Slower" training
  group emphasizes moderate rides\, and a route planned in advance that is p
 osted on the ride calendar. This is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's r
 ide. The OWLS often average 15 to 19 mph on flat roads\, and typically have
  an overall average moving speed between 12 and 15 mph including hills. Dis
 tances vary from 20 to 30 miles\, depending partly on available light. Earl
 y season rides will be somewhat shorter and slower. Rides depart promptly a
 t 5:45.<br><br>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.get
 meregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=133776">free trial membership
 </a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signi
 ng a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.<br><br>Questions? Con
 tact&nbsp\;<a href="mailto:gail.morell@gmail.com">Gail Morell</a>.
LAST-MODIFIED:20211014T010756Z
LOCATION:Sherwood Oaks Christian Church\, 2700 E Rogers Rd\, Bloomington\, 
 IN 47401\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:OWLS Ride - Kerr Creek to Mt Gilead
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
