DESCRIPTION:The BBC&#39\;s historic Paragon Ride is one of those that was h
 ighly impacted by I-69 construction.  So\, Joe Anderson has suggested this 
 new\, modified route which adds a little bit of distance and some new roads
 .  The route goes first to Paragon\, then north a little before returning s
 outh through Gosport.  Joe will personally lead this one\, and we are prett
 y excited about that.<br><br>We have both a home IU football game and const
 ruction in Lower Cascades Park to work around\, so the start of the ride li
 kely change from the version posted here.  We&#39\;ll let Joe figure that o
 ut.  Just follow him\; he knows the way!<br><br><a href="https://bloomingto
 nbicycleclub.org/maps/John_Bassett_Maps/Joes_Paragon_and_Gosport_Ride_57.pd
 f" target="_blank">Joe&#39\;s Paragon and Gosport Ride 57</a><br><br><a hre
 f="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/31135553" target="_blank">GPS Files</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20201005T235408Z
