UID:47s800li1l6v8qh4vm4355qufi@google.com
CREATED:20190617T000000Z
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/John_Bassett_M
 aps/Godsey_Ride_55.pdf">Godsey Ride 55</a><br><br><a href="https://ridewith
 gps.com/routes/36370359"><u></u>GPS<u></u><u></u>&nbsp\;<u></u>Links</a><br
 ><br><b>UPDATE 6/10/21:&nbsp\; As we did a few weeks ago and due to an I69 
 road closure on the east end of Southview Drive in Martinsville we will do 
 a slight detour from the pdf map\, as follows.</b><br><br><b>Approach Marti
 nsville on Burton Lane\, as normal.&nbsp\; Instead of turning right on Sout
 hview (no thru traffic sign here) proceed straight across SR37 (now closed)
  to the usual Marathon Convenience Store on the left.&nbsp\; We will refuel
  there. Upon leaving the Marathon\, turn left on Burton and proceed north t
 hree blocks to Duo Street.&nbsp\; Follow Duo east to Orange\, turn right on
  Orange\, go one block and turn east again on Bill's Blvd.&nbsp\; Follow Bi
 ll's Blvd. east to Ohio Street.&nbsp\; Turn right on Ohio and cross SR37 on
 to Mahalasville Road to rejoin the route.&nbsp\; Revised GPS files are prov
 ided above.</b><br><br>This has been a very popular ride since its inceptio
 n a few years ago.&nbsp\; We'll take the new Kinser Pike / I69 bridge to Bo
 ttom Road to get out in the county.&nbsp\; We make a big loop up north cros
 sing I69 at Godsey Road. We continue north to Martinsville\, and return to 
 Bloomington via Low Gap and Anderson Roads\, for a total distance of about 
 55 miles.<br><br>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.g
 etmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=133776">free trial membersh
 ip</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically sig
 ning a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.&nbsp\; &nbsp\;&nbsp
 \;&nbsp\;
LAST-MODIFIED:20220614T150552Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot @ 39.15435\,-86.523
SEQUENCE:3
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Godsey Ride 2021 Version 56 - Leader: TBD
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
