DESCRIPTION:<p>Description:</p><p><a href="https://bloomingtonbicycleclub.o
 rg/maps/iRides/Charlie-s_Orchard_Loop_30.pdf">Charlie's Orchard Loop 30</a>
 <br></p><p></p><p><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/28158817">GPS Fil
 es</a></p><p>The iRide is a no-drop Intermediate level ride of moderate pac
 e and distance with regrouping points.&nbsp\; Pace is anticipated to be 15-
 17 mph.<br></p><p>The tRide is an advanced level ride of high pace and mode
 rate distance that may or may not include regrouping points. &nbsp\;Pace is
  anticipated to be 18+ mph. Expect occasional sprint or Strava segments\, p
 ace line riding at high speed\, intervals\, and fewer regrouping stops.</p>
 <p>The iRide and tRide will start at the same place and will ride the same 
 scheduled route\, but the start of these two groups will be staggered with 
 the tRide starting first at 5:45 and the iRide just behind them. Mileages w
 ill increase as the season progresses.&nbsp\; </p><p>Riders are expected to
  look out for each other during the rides.&nbsp\; Ride maps and GPS links w
 ill be posted here in advance. Riders unfamiliar with the route should brin
 g along a copy of the map.</p>Non-members should sign up for a&nbsp\;<a hre
 f="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=133776">
 free trial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes
  electronically signing a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.
