 t.&nbsp\;&nbsp\;The 32 mile route begins at Blackwell horse camp and goes o
 ut&nbsp\; Tower Ridge Road\,&nbsp\;ventures south to Hickory Grove Church\,
 &nbsp\;then out to Norman and back Henderson Creek&nbsp\;to Hunters Creek t
 o the Blackwell.&nbsp\;Route is entirely gravel and pavement\,&nbsp\;no tra
 il.<br><br><b>Ride starts promptly&nbsp\;at 12:00 NOON&nbsp\;<br><br>We wil
 l not offer a formal car pool this year&nbsp\;<br></b><br><a href="https://
 ridewithgps.com/routes/34758217">Norman 32</a></html-blob>
