UID:3ec6lbtuh6edcbf846ib8c4r0n@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20210803T174500
CREATED:20210314T144013Z
DESCRIPTION:<p><a href="https://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/iRides/Dela
 p_2018_Version_Long_32.pdf">Delap 2018 Version Long 32</a><br></p><p></p><p
 ><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/27789843">GPS Files</a></p><p>The 
 iRide is a no-drop Intermediate level ride of moderate pace and distance wi
 th regrouping points.&nbsp\; Pace is anticipated to be 15-17 mph.<br></p><p
 >The tRide is an advanced level ride of high pace and moderate distance tha
 t may or may not include regrouping points. &nbsp\;Pace is anticipated to b
 e 18+ mph. Expect occasional sprint or Strava segments\, pace line riding a
 t high speed\, intervals\, and fewer regrouping stops.</p><p>The iRide and 
 tRide will start at the same place and will ride the same scheduled route\,
  but the start of these two groups will be staggered with the tRide startin
 g first at 5:45 and the iRide just behind them. Mileages will increase as t
 he season progresses.&nbsp\; </p><p>Riders are expected to look out for eac
 h other during the rides.&nbsp\; Ride maps and GPS links will be posted her
 e in advance. Riders unfamiliar with the route should bring along a copy of
  the map.</p>Non-members should sign up for a&nbsp\;<a href="https://secure
 .getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=133776">free trial member
 ship</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically s
 igning a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.
LAST-MODIFIED:20220614T150546Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot @ 39.15435\,-86.523
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:iRide / tRide - Delap 2018 Version Long 32
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
