UID:02b2h7sor1hvl7mf70tdbjioa8@google.com
CREATED:20210114T141048Z
DESCRIPTION:<b><br>Due to Icy Roads todays ride has been canceled</b><br><b
 r>Join in for a fun Brown County gravel ride starting and ending at Hard Tr
 uth in Nashville.&nbsp\; This is a loop ride borrowed from Jeff Fetterer an
 d has its fair share of ups and downs.&nbsp\; With the exception of Covered
  Bridge Road the clockwise loop generally goes down the steep grades and up
  the gentler grades.&nbsp\; Get to near the top of Bear Wallow Hill without
  ever being on Bear Wallow Hill Road. And\, finish up with a great gravel d
 ecent on Wallow Hollow.<br><br>Route is entirely gravel and pavement&nbsp\;
 - no trail.&nbsp\;<br><br>D<b>ue to Covid-19 No formal car pooling will be 
 offered</b><br><br><a href="https://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/Gravel_
 Rides/Jeff-s_Salmeron_-_Wallow_Hollow_Loop_from_Hard_Truth_29.pdf">PDF Map 
 and Queue Sheet</a><br><br><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/31648043
 ">GPS Files</a>
