 ="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/4608332">GPS Files</a><br><br>This one has
  become the iconic club ride.&nbsp\; At 90 miles\, and rated difficult\, th
 is "almost" century incorporates the best of what this area has to offer cy
 clists - big climbs\, rolling hills\, curves\, flats\, buccolic views\, biz
 arre town names (Zelma) and sites (the Stonehead). Ride this once and you'l
 l ride it again!<br><br>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://s
