CREATED:20210314T144013Z
DESCRIPTION:<p><a href="https://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/iRides/That
 -s_the_Point_v2_26.pdf">That's the Point v2 26</a><br></p><p><a href="https
 ://ridewithgps.com/routes/28613461">GPS Files</a></p><p>The iRide is an ite
 rmediate level ride of moderate pace and distance with regrouping points.&n
 bsp\; Pace is anticipated to be 15-17 mph.<br></p><p>The tRide is an advanc
 ed level ride of high pace and moderate distance that may or may not includ
 e regrouping points. &nbsp\;Pace is anticipated to be 18+ mph. Expect occas
 ional sprint or Strava segments\, pace line riding at high speed\, interval
 s\, and fewer regrouping stops.</p><p>The iRide and tRide will start at the
  same place and will ride the same scheduled route\, but the start of these
  two groups will be staggered with the tRide starting first at 5:45 and the
  iRide just behind them. Mileages will increase as the season progresses.&n
 bsp\; </p><p>Riders are expected to look out for each other during the ride
 s.&nbsp\; Ride maps and GPS links will be posted here in advance. Riders un
 familiar with the route should bring along a copy of the map.</p>Non-member
 s should sign up for a&nbsp\;<a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/ge
 t_information.php?event_id=133776">free trial membership</a>\, good for up 
 to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing a liability waiv
 er\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.
