DESCRIPTION:<br>Join us for a fun gravel ride through&nbsp\;the enchanted H
 oosier National Forest.&nbsp\;&nbsp\;The 21 mile route begins at the Hickor
 y&nbsp\;Ridge Fire Tower on Tower Ridge Road\,&nbsp\;ventures south to Hick
 ory Grove Church\,&nbsp\;then out to Norman and back Henderson Creek&nbsp\;
 to Hunters Creek to the Fire Tower.<br><br>Route is entirely gravel and pav
 ement\,&nbsp\;no trail.<br><br><b>Ride starts promptly&nbsp\;at 6:00PM<br><
 br>We will not offer a formal car pool this year&nbsp\;<br>due to COVID-19 
 concerns.&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;</b><br><br><b>BRING LIGHTS! BR
 ING LIGHTS! BRING LIGHTS!</b><br><b><br></b><br><a href="https://bloomingto
 nbicycleclub.org/maps/Gravel_Rides/Reverse_Hendersen_Creek_-_Hickory_Ridge_
 from_Fire_Tower_21.pdf">Reverse Hendersen Creek &amp\; Hickory Ridge from F
 ire Tower 21</a><br><br><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/33934059">G
 PS Files</a><br><a><br></a><a></a>
