 ow riders.</li></ul>The "Older\, Wiser\, and a Little Slower" training grou
 p emphasizes moderate rides\, and a route planned in advance that is posted
  on the ride calendar. This is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride.T
 he OWLS group welcomes a wide range of intermediate riders\, and typically 
