 Death March!&nbsp\;<br><br>The route is a mix of&nbsp\;one-third gravel in 
 and<br>around the&nbsp\;Hoosier National Forest and two-thirds<br>pavement 
 with a short stretch along<br>SR 58 at Norman. Suitable for MTB<br>and CX b
 ikes.<br><br>No formal car pooling will be offered due to covid -19<br><br>
 This ride will depart the fire tower&nbsp\;<br>on Tower Ridge Road promptly
  at 10:00 am<br>&nbsp\;<br><a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/
 Gravel_Rides/Death_March_Training_No-_1_-_33.pdf">Death March Training No. 
 1 - 33</a><br><br><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/18588500">GPS fil
 es</a>
