DESCRIPTION:<p><a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/iRides/Doubl
 e_Lake_Monroe_Creeks_30.pdf" id="ow376" __is_owner="true">Double Lake Monro
 e Creeks 30</a><br></p><p><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/15761897"
  id="ow386" __is_owner="true">GPS Files</a><br></p><p>The iRide is a no-dro
 p Intermediate level ride of moderate pace and distance with regrouping poi
 nts.&nbsp\; Pace is anticipated to be 15-17 mph.<br></p><p>The tRide is an 
 advanced level ride of high pace and moderate distance that may or may not 
 include regrouping points. &nbsp\;Pace is anticipated to be 18+ mph. Expect
  occasional sprint or Strava segments\, pace line riding at high speed\, in
 tervals\, and fewer regrouping stops.</p><p>The iRide and tRide will start 
 at the same place and will ride the same scheduled route\, but the start of
  these two groups will be staggered with the tRide starting first at 5:45 a
 nd the iRide just behind them. Mileages will increase as the season progres
 ses.&nbsp\; </p><p>Riders are expected to look out for each other during th
 e rides.&nbsp\; Ride maps and GPS links will be posted here in advance. Rid
 ers unfamiliar with the route should bring along a copy of the map.</p>Non-
 members should sign up for a&nbsp\;<a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.
 com/get_information.php?event_id=133776">free trial membership</a>\, good f
 or up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing a liabilit
 y waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.
LAST-MODIFIED:20220614T150631Z
