DTEND:20210123T230000Z
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:2670udtkfloq5goq5r9rorm20o@google.com
CREATED:20210121T164215Z
DESCRIPTION:<b>Note Time Change to 1:00PM<br></b>&nbsp\;<br>Join in for a f
 un Brown County gravel ride starting and ending at Hard Truth in Nashville.
 &nbsp\; This is a loop ride borrowed from Jeff Fetterer and has its fair sh
 are of ups and downs.&nbsp\; With the exception of Covered Bridge Road the 
 clockwise loop generally goes down the steep grades and up the gentler grad
 es.&nbsp\; Get to near the top of Bear Wallow Hill without ever being on Be
 ar Wallow Hill Road. And\, finish up with a great gravel decent on Wallow H
 ollow.<br><br>Route is entirely gravel and pavement&nbsp\;- no trail.&nbsp\
 ;<br><br>D<b>ue to Covid-19 No formal car pooling will be offered</b><br><b
 r><a href="https://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/Gravel_Rides/Jeff-s_Salm
 eron_-_Wallow_Hollow_Loop_from_Hard_Truth_29.pdf">PDF Map and Queue Sheet</
 a><br><br><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/31648043">GPS Files</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20210122T142555Z
LOCATION:Big K Parking Lot @ 39.162664\, -86.492045
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Jeff's Salmeron / Wallow Hollow Loop from Hard Truth 29man 
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
