 q5Vgv"> 36 Bottom\, Burma\, Frontage\, Sample\, Old 37</a></p><p>Ready for 
 a high spirited ride? BV Ride is an intermediate/ advanced ride and moderat
 e distance that may or may not include regrouping points.  Pace is anticipa
 ted to be 17+ mph. Expect occasional sprint or Strava segments\, pace line 
 riding at high speed\, intervals\, and fewer regrouping stops.</p><p>The BV
  Ride will start at the Parking lot across from the Bryan Park Pool on Wood
 lawn at 5:45. Mileages will increase as the season progresses. If you keep 
 coming we will make you faster!</p><p>Riders are expected to look out for e
 ach other during the rides.  Ride maps and GPS links will be posted here in
  advance. Riders unfamiliar with the route should bring along a copy of the
  map.</p>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://www.google.com/u
 rl?q=https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id%3D1337
 76&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;ust=1651946863257315&amp\;usg=AOvVaw
 1aExfN95mu3Y52zF9b5vuz">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to three ri
 des\, and which includes electronically signing a liability waiver\, prior 
 to participation.<u></u><u></u><u></u></span></span>
