 >predominately gravel with a little bit of <br>pavement\, and no trail.  Ro
 ute is suitable<br>for CX\, gravel bike\, or MTB.Ride starts promptly<br>at
  6:00<br><br> We will not offer a formal car pool this year <br>due to COVI
 D-19 concerns.   <br> <br><a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/G
 ravel_Rides/All%20Around%20Yellowstone%2020.pdf" target="_blank">All Around
