DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/35090723" id="ow520" __
 is_owner="true">Meander Around Bloomington</a> 13 miles<br>Conditions look 
 marginal. A good day for a short meander around town on a hybrid or mountai
 n bike.<br><br>Watch the calendar for weather-related updates and for futur
 e rides.<br><br><i>Please observe social distancing norms as we gather and 
 ride. We plan no formal leader. EVERYONE is a leader. Familiarize yourself 
 with the ride before heading out. We will ride in small groups. People in t
 he last group will endeavor to sweep the route and assist others as needed.
 </i><ul><li>Be SAFE. Don't blow through stop signs. Consider bike lights.<b
 r></li><li>Be COURTEOUS: Single up in traffic<br></li><li>Be PREDICTABLE: S
 ignal your intentions to cars and fellow riders.</li></ul>This branch of th
 e OWLS training group also emphasizes somewhat slower\, moderate rides\, an
 d a route planned in advance that is posted on the ride calendar. This is a
  no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride. Expect an overall average moving
  speed 11 - 15 mph including hills. Distances vary from 20 to 30 miles. Ear
 ly season rides will be somewhat shorter and slower. Rides depart promptly 
 at 9:30am.<br><br>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.
 getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=133776">free trial members
 hip</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically si
 gning a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.<br><br>Questions? 
 Contact <a href="mailto:allan.edmonds@gmail.com">Allan Edmonds</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20210211T164850Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Parking Lot\, S Woodlawn Ave\, Bloomington\, IN 47401\,
  USA
