LOCATION:Sherwood Oaks Christian Church\, 2700 E Rogers Rd\, Bloomington\, 
 IN 47401\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:OWLS Ride - Down Dam Hill
TRANSP:OPAQUE
