BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART:20201031T140000Z
DTEND:20201031T190000Z
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:3s2364ejtpptkiikn9i8qka442@google.com
CREATED:20191001T215202Z
DESCRIPTION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot  <a href="https://www.google.com/ma
 ps/place//@39.1543611\,-86.523\,15z">map</a><br><br><a href="http://bloomin
 gtonbicycleclub.org/maps/John_Bassett_Maps/Ride_Around_Bloomington_2018_Ver
 sion_54.pdf">Ride Around Bloomington 2018 Version 54</a><a><br></a><br><a h
 ref="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/28824508">GPS Files</a><br><br>For our 
 summer season finale\, we have the traditional Ride Around Bloomington.&nbs
 p\; The complete route is a modest 54 miles\, but as this is a loop around 
 town there are numerous options for returning home early on familiar roads 
 we have ridden all year.&nbsp\; Ride the roads you have been on all year\,&
 nbsp\; just do them in a different order this time !<br><br>NOTE: Tradition
 ally\, we celebrate the end of the road riding season with a pizza party. T
 hat willnot be happening this year. So instead\, stick around for a tailgat
 ing social event immediately after this ride in the Bryan Park parking lot.
  Show up even if you don’t ride. Most should complete the route by about 1:
 30 or so. IU football starts at 3:30 - so we can tailgate for that also.<br
 ><p>Drive to Bryan parkfor the ride\, or have your family meet you there.&n
 bsp\; Bring food\, drink\, warm clothes\, maybe a chair.&nbsp\; Eat\, drink
  and be merry 1:30 - 3:30\, socially distant in groups &lt\; 15.&nbsp\; Wea
 r costume if you like.</p><p>Non-members should sign up for a&nbsp\;<a href
 ="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=133776">f
 ree trial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes 
 electronically signing a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.<b
 r></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20201030T222216Z
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Ride Around Bloomington - Leader:  Jim Powers
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
