X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20210819T174500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20210819T194500
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:3ec6lbtuh6edcbf846ib8c4r0n@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20210819T174500
CREATED:20210314T144013Z
DESCRIPTION:<p><a href="https://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/iRides/Sout
 hern_Loop_30_rev_1.pdf" id="ow377" __is_owner="true">Southern Loop 30 rev1<
 /a><br></p><p><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/27914634" id="ow388" 
 __is_owner="true">GPS Files</a><br></p><p>The iRide is a no-drop Intermedia
 te level ride of moderate pace and distance with regrouping points.&nbsp\; 
 Pace is anticipated to be 15-17 mph.<br></p><p>The tRide is an advanced lev
 el ride of high pace and moderate distance that may or may not include regr
 ouping points. &nbsp\;Pace is anticipated to be 18+ mph. Expect occasional 
 sprint or Strava segments\, pace line riding at high speed\, intervals\, an
 d fewer regrouping stops.</p><p>The iRide and tRide will start at the same 
 place and will ride the same scheduled route\, but the start of these two g
 roups will be staggered with the tRide starting first at 5:45 and the iRide
  just behind them. Mileages will increase as the season progresses.&nbsp\; 
 </p><p>Riders are expected to look out for each other during the rides.&nbs
 p\; Ride maps and GPS links will be posted here in advance. Riders unfamili
 ar with the route should bring along a copy of the map.</p>Non-members shou
 ld sign up for a&nbsp\;<a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_info
 rmation.php?event_id=133776">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to thr
 ee rides\, and which includes electronically signing a liability waiver\,&n
 bsp\;prior to participation.
LAST-MODIFIED:20220614T150643Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot @ 39.15435\,-86.523
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:iRide / tRide - Southern Loop 30 rev 1
TRANSP:OPAQUE
