DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><u></u><u></u><a href="http://www.bloomingtonbicycle
 club.org/maps/BBCMaps/map_pack_2/cedar_bluff.pdf">Cedar Bluff Nature Preser
 ve</a><br><a href="https://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/John_Bassett_Map
 s/Cedar_Bluff_with_Limestone_Trail_50_Mile_Option.pdf2016.pdf">Cedar Bluff 
 with Limestone Trail 50 Mile Option</a><br><a href="https://ridewithgps.com
 /routes/4264004">GPS Files Cedar Bluff</a><br><a href="https://ridewithgps.
 com/routes/35400226">GPS Files 50 Mile Option</a><br><br>You have a couple 
 of distance options on this one.&nbsp\; The short option is 28 pretty hilly
  miles down south to the Cedar Buff Nature Preserve.  The road may&nbsp\;be
  rough in spots\, but the rolling hills of Ketchum Road down the Clear Cree
 k valley and the former Monon Railroad "Limestone Route" to Harrodsburg are
  gorgeous in the Spring.<br><br>There will be an optional 50 mile version&n
 bsp\;extending a little farther south from the Nature Preserve\, and windin
 g back north through Avoca.&nbsp\; it is usually split about 50-50 each rou
 te.<u></u><u></u><br><u></u><br><u></u><br><u></u>Non-members should sign u
 p for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?eve
 nt_id=136627" id="ow2298" __is_owner="true"><u>free trial membership</u></a
 >\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing 
 a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.&nbsp\;<br><u></u></html-
 blob>
