CREATED:20210314T153427Z
DESCRIPTION:<b>NOTE (4/1/21):&nbsp\; REVISED ROUTE MAP AND EXPLANATION BELO
 W</b><br><br><b><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/35566617">Way Aroun
 d Boltinghouse Cruise 2021 Version 41</a><a><br><br></a>Due to ongoing culv
 ert replacement and road closure on Old 37 the return route from Morgan Mon
 roe State Forest will follow Chambers Pike / Dittemore / Bottom Road back t
 o Bloomington from the Hindustan orchard.&nbsp\; Added distance is about 5 
 miles.&nbsp\; The shorter 28 mile option (Anderson Road) should still be av
 ailable.</b><br><br>This ride is a take off on the old Around Boltinghouse 
 Cruise\, a short (22 mile) early season route around the legendary hill on 
 Boltinghouse Road.  We have offered this longer version the last few years 
 with the original ride as a shorter version\, and the longer version has&nb
 sp\; become the most popular version of the ride.<br>&nbsp\;<br>You can alw
 ays shortcut on Anderson Road for a nice\, shorter  28 mile loop. There are
  usually a few intrepid soles who turn left at Dolan and ride up the big hi
 ll just for grins!<br><br>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https:/
 /secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=133776">free trial
  membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electroni
 cally signing a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.&nbsp\;&nbs
 p\;
LAST-MODIFIED:20210401T181756Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot @ 39.15435\,-86.523
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Way Around Boltinghouse Cruise 2021 Version 41 - Leader: John Basse
 tt
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
