DESCRIPTION:<u></u><u></u><p><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://
 www.strava.com/routes/2912148700198821094&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&am
 p\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw0S267zfEmiis5lV1PDNNMc" target="_blank"> 33 Forest 
 Loop</a></p><p>Ready for a high spirited ride? BV Ride is an intermediate/ 
 advanced ride and moderate distance that may or may not include regrouping 
 points.  Pace is anticipated to be 17+ mph. Expect occasional sprint or Str
 ava segments\, pace line riding at high speed\, intervals\, and fewer regro
 uping stops.</p><p>The BV Ride will start at the Parking lot across from th
 e Bryan Park Pool on Woodlawn at 5:45. Mileages will increase as the season
  progresses. If you keep coming we will make you faster!</p><p>Riders are e
 xpected to look out for each other during the rides.  Ride maps and GPS lin
 ks will be posted here in advance. Riders unfamiliar with the route should 
 bring along a copy of the map.</p>Non-members should sign up for a <a href=
 "https://www.google.com/url?q=https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_inform
 ation.php?event_id%3D133776&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;
 usg=AOvVaw2j50-2uvBSoK9EgtVBL-h8" target="_blank">free trial membership</a>
 \, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing a
  liability waiver\, prior to participation.<u></u><u></u>
LAST-MODIFIED:20220906T151238Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool\, 1020 S Woodlawn Ave\, Bloomington\, IN 47401\, U
 SA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:BV ride -  33 Forest Loop
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
