DESCRIPTION:<a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/John_Bassett_Ma
 ps/Tour_de_Ramps_-_JP_70.pdf" target="_blank">Tour de Ramps - JP 70</a><br>
 <br><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/25055413" target="_blank">GPS F
 iles</a><br><br>This has become a traditional Fall ride for the BBC after t
 he summer Lake Monroe boat traffic dies down a bit.  See Lake Monroe from e
 very angle without benefit of a boat! Spoil the normally pleasant ride arou
 nd Lake Monroe by descending &amp\; climbing all the boat ramps. There are 
 nine of them\, plus many assorted hills in between!  <br>  <br>Monster vers
 ion (all ramps and hills): 70 miles <br><br>Wimp version:  44 miles<br><br>
 Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.co
 m/get_information.php?event_id=133776" target="_blank">free trial membershi
 p</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically sign
 ing a liability waiver\, prior to participation.  <br><br><a></a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20210830T003435Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Parking Lot\, S Woodlawn Ave\, Bloomington\, IN 47401\,
  USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Tour de Ramps - Leader: Jim Powers
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
