DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/36141705" id="ow1058" _
 _is_owner="true">Reverse Harmony Bridge and Up Bolen</a> 27 miles<br><br>Pl
 ease observe social distancing norms as we gather and ride.&nbsp\;<ul><li>B
 e SAFE. Don't blow through stop signs. Consider bike lights.<br></li><li>Be
  COURTEOUS: Single up in traffic<br></li><li>Be PREDICTABLE: Signal your in
 tentions to cars and fellow riders.</li></ul>The "Older\, Wiser\, and a Lit
 tle Slower" training group emphasizes moderate rides\, and a route planned 
 in advance that is posted on the ride calendar. This is a no drop ride\, bu
 t not a beginner's ride. The OWLS often average 15 to 19 mph on flat roads\
 , and typically have an overall average moving speed between 12 and 15 mph 
 including hills. Distances vary from 20 to 30 miles\, depending partly on a
 vailable light. Early season rides will be somewhat shorter and slower. Rid
 es depart promptly at 5:45.<br><br>Non-members should sign up for a <a href
 ="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=133776">f
 ree trial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes 
 electronically signing a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.<b
 r><br>Questions? Contact&nbsp\;<a href="mailto:gail.morell@gmail.com">Gail 
 Morell</a>.
LAST-MODIFIED:20211014T010756Z
LOCATION:Sherwood Oaks Christian Church\, 2700 E Rogers Rd\, Bloomington\, 
 IN 47401\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:OWLS Ride - Reverse Harmony Bridge
TRANSP:OPAQUE
