DESCRIPTION:<p><a href="https://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/iRides/Roun
 d_Robinson_v1_23.pdf">Round Robinson v1 23</a></p><p><a href="https://ridew
 ithgps.com/routes/16848058">GPS Files</a></p><p>The iRide is an intermediat
 e level ride of moderate pace and distance with regrouping points.&nbsp\; P
 ace is anticipated to be 15-17 mph.<br></p><p>The tRide is an advanced leve
 l ride of high pace and moderate distance that may or may not include regro
 uping points. &nbsp\;Pace is anticipated to be 18+ mph. Expect occasional s
 print or Strava segments\, pace line riding at high speed\, intervals\, and
  fewer regrouping stops.</p><p>The iRide and tRide will start at the same p
 lace and will ride the same scheduled route\, but the start of these two gr
 oups will be staggered with the tRide starting first at 5:45 and the iRide 
 just behind them. Mileages will increase as the season progresses.&nbsp\; <
 /p><p>Riders are expected to look out for each other during the rides.&nbsp
 \; Ride maps and GPS links will be posted here in advance. Riders unfamilia
 r with the route should bring along a copy of the map.</p>Non-members shoul
 d sign up for a&nbsp\;<a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_infor
 mation.php?event_id=133776">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to thre
 e rides\, and which includes electronically signing a liability waiver\,&nb
 sp\;prior to participation.
LAST-MODIFIED:20220614T150606Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot @ 39.15435\,-86.523
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:iRide / tRide - Round Robinson v1 23
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART:20220906T214500Z
DTEND:20220906T233000Z
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:25dv9022qtorm6qgeribbq297d@google.com
CREATED:20220906T151225Z
DESCRIPTION:<p><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.strava.com
 /routes/2912132644450418836&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;
 usg=AOvVaw03owAvaP3AAMStazhxKPt_" target="_blank">36 Take the Lake (cw)</a>
 <br></p><p><br></p><p>Ready for a high spirited ride? BV Ride is an interme
 diate/ advanced ride and moderate distance that may or may not include regr
 ouping points.  Pace is anticipated to be 17+ mph. Expect occasional sprint
  or Strava segments\, pace line riding at high speed\, intervals\, and fewe
 r regrouping stops.</p><p>The BV Ride will start at the Parking lot across 
 from the Bryan Park Pool on Woodlawn at 5:45. Mileages will increase as the
  season progresses. If you keep coming we will make you faster!</p><p>Rider
 s are expected to look out for each other during the rides.  Ride maps and 
 GPS links will be posted here in advance. Riders unfamiliar with the route 
 should bring along a copy of the map.</p>Non-members should sign up for a <
 a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get
 _information.php?event_id%3D133776&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;usd=
 2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw2j50-2uvBSoK9EgtVBL-h8" target="_blank"><u>free trial memb
 ership</u></a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronic
 ally signing a liability waiver\, prior to participation.
LAST-MODIFIED:20220906T151225Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool\, 1020 S Woodlawn Ave\, Bloomington\, IN 47401\, U
 SA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:BV Ride 36 Take the Lake (cw)
