DESCRIPTION:<p><a href="https://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/iRides/Rock
 crusher_26.pdf" id="ow7924" __is_owner="true">Rockcrusher 26</a></p><p><a h
 ref="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/4530274" id="ow7928" __is_owner="true">
 GPS Files</a><br></p><p>The iRide is a no-drop Intermediate level ride of m
 oderate pace and distance with regrouping points.&nbsp\; Pace is anticipate
 d to be 15-17 mph.<br></p><p>The tRide is an advanced level ride of high pa
 ce and moderate distance that may or may not include regrouping points. &nb
 sp\;Pace is anticipated to be 18+ mph. Expect occasional sprint or Strava s
 egments\, pace line riding at high speed\, intervals\, and fewer regrouping
  stops.</p><p>The iRide and tRide will start at the same place and will rid
 e the same scheduled route\, but the start of these two groups will be stag
 gered with the tRide starting first at 5:45 and the iRide just behind them.
  Mileages will increase as the season progresses.&nbsp\; </p><p>Riders are 
 expected to look out for each other during the rides.&nbsp\; Ride maps and 
 GPS links will be posted here in advance. Riders unfamiliar with the route 
 should bring along a copy of the map.</p>Non-members should sign up for a&n
 bsp\;<a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_
 id=133776">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and whi
 ch includes electronically signing a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to part
 icipation.
