DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><ol><li><b>&nbsp\;start time is 12:00 NOON</b><br></
 li></ol><u></u><br><br>Join us for a fun gravel ride through&nbsp\;the ench
 anted Hoosier National Forest.&nbsp\;&nbsp\;The 32 mile route begins at Bla
 ckwell horse camp and goes out&nbsp\; Tower Ridge Road\,&nbsp\;ventures sou
 th to Hickory Grove Church\,&nbsp\;then out to Norman and back Henderson Cr
 eek&nbsp\;to Hunters Creek to the Blackwell.&nbsp\;Route is entirely gravel
  and pavement\,&nbsp\;no trail.<br><br><b>Ride starts promptly&nbsp\;at 12:
 00 Noon<br>We will not offer a formal car pool this year&nbsp\;<br></b><br>
 <a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/34758217">Norman 32</a><u></u><u></
 u></html-blob>
