DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/36091549" id="ow430" __
 is_owner="true">Down Gore and Back Ketcham</a> 28 miles<br><br>Watch the ca
 lendar for weather-related updates and for future rides. Rides will switch 
 to morning times as the weather warms.<br><br><i>Please observe social dist
 ancing norms as we gather and ride. We plan no formal leader. EVERYONE is a
  leader. Familiarize yourself with the ride before heading out. We will rid
 e in small groups. People in the last group will endeavor to sweep the rout
 e and assist others as needed.</i><ul><li>Be SAFE. Don't blow through stop 
 signs. Consider bike lights.<br></li><li>Be COURTEOUS: Single up in traffic
 <br></li><li>Be PREDICTABLE: Signal your intentions to cars and fellow ride
 rs.</li></ul>This branch of the OWLS training group also emphasizes somewha
 t slower\, moderate rides\, and a route planned in advance that is posted o
 n the ride calendar. This is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride. Ex
 pect an overall average moving speed 11 - 15 mph including hills. Distances
  vary from 20 to 30 miles. Early season rides will be somewhat shorter and 
 slower. Rides depart promptly at 1:30pm.<br><br>Non-members should sign up 
 for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event
 _id=133776">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and wh
 ich includes electronically signing a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to par
 ticipation.<br><br>Questions? Contact <a href="mailto:allan.edmonds@gmail.c
 om">Allan Edmonds</a>
