DESCRIPTION:<u><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/37805521" id="ow385"
  __is_owner="true">Fluck Mill - Clear Creek</a></u> 24 miles<br><br>Watch t
 he calendar for weather-related updates and for future rides.&nbsp\;<ul><li
 >Be SAFE. Don't blow through stop signs. Consider bike lights.<br></li><li>
 Be COURTEOUS: Single up in traffic<br></li><li>Be PREDICTABLE: Signal your 
 intentions to cars and fellow riders.</li></ul>This branch of the OWLS trai
 ning group also emphasizes somewhat slower\, moderate rides\, and a route p
 lanned in advance that is posted on the ride calendar. This is a no drop ri
 de\, but not a beginner's ride. Expect an overall average moving speed 11 -
  15 mph including hills. Distances vary from 20 to 30 miles. Early season r
 ides will be somewhat shorter and slower. Rides depart promptly at 9:30am.<
 br><br>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregist
 ered.com/get_information.php?event_id=133776">free trial membership</a>\, g
 ood for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing a lia
 bility waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.<br><br>Questions? Contact <a 
 href="mailto:allan.edmonds@gmail.com">Allan Edmonds</a>
