CREATED:20200302T150145Z
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/13171655" id="ow401" __
 is_owner="true">Shuffle Creek</a> 26 miles<br><br>Please observe social dis
 tancing norms as we gather and ride. We plan no formal leader. EVERYONE is 
 a leader. Familiarize yourself with the ride before heading out. We will ri
 de in small groups.People in the last group will endeavor to sweep the rout
 e and assist others as needed.<br><ul><li>Be SAFE. Don't blow through stop 
 signs. Consider bike lights.<br></li><li>Be COURTEOUS: Single up in traffic
 <br></li><li>Be PREDICTABLE: Signal your intentions to cars and fellow ride
 rs.</li></ul>The "Older\, Wiser\, and a Little Slower" training group empha
 sizes moderate rides\, and a route planned in advance that is posted on the
  ride calendar. This is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride. The OWL
 S often average 15 to 19 mph on flat roads\, and typically have an overall 
 average moving speed between 12 and 15 mph including hills. Distances vary 
 from 20 to 30 miles\, depending partly on available light. Early season rid
 es will be somewhat shorter and slower. Rides depart promptly at 5:45.<br><
 br>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered
 .com/get_information.php?event_id=133776">free trial membership</a>\, good 
 for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing a liabili
 ty waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.<br><br>Questions? Contact <a href
 ="mailto:allan.edmonds@gmail.com">Allan Edmonds</a> or <a href="mailto:gail
 .morell@gmail.com">Gail Morell</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20200825T002909Z
LOCATION:Sherwood Oaks Christian Church\, 2700 E Rogers Rd\, Bloomington\, 
 IN 47401\, USA
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:OWLS - Shuffle Creek
TRANSP:OPAQUE
