DESCRIPTION:<b><br></b><br><br>Join us for a fun gravel ride through&nbsp\;
 the enchanted Hoosier National Forest.&nbsp\;&nbsp\;The 32 mile route begin
 s at Blackwell horse camp and goes out&nbsp\; Tower Ridge Road\,&nbsp\;vent
 ures south to Hickory Grove Church\,&nbsp\;then out to Norman and back Hend
 erson Creek&nbsp\;to Hunters Creek to the Blackwell.&nbsp\;Route is entirel
 y gravel and pavement\,&nbsp\;no trail.<br><br>Shorter options are Availabl
 e&nbsp\;<br><br><b>Ride starts promptly&nbsp\;at&nbsp\;</b><br><b></b><b>10
 :00am&nbsp\;</b><br><b>&nbsp\;<br>We will not offer a formal car pool this 
 year&nbsp\;<br>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b><br><a href="https://ridewithgps.
 com/routes/34758217" id="ow849" __is_owner="true">Norman 32</a>
