UID:dic5dnfhjnpgu57s27u58h598c@google.com
CREATED:20120405T160049Z
DESCRIPTION:The Upland Brewing Co. is bringing the Gran Fondo cycling tradi
 tion to Louisville with three timed road courses that\, like Upland\, bring
  Indiana and Louisville together: the 100+ mile Gran Fondo\, a 50-60 mile M
 edio Fondo\, and a 30-40 mile Piccolo Fondo.\n\nAll routes begin and end at
  Thurman Hutchins Park. The Gran Fondo route crosses the river for a trip a
 round Floyds Knobs before crossing back into Kentucky and journeying throug
 h the city of Louisville\, Iroquois Park\, and Jefferson Memorial Forest. C
 heck back soon for maps of all the routes and details about the Medio Fondo
  and Piccolo Fondo.\n\nBut the experience isn't over when you finish your r
 ide. We have live music\, food\, and of course\, beer for you back at the p
 ark! (All included in your registration price.)\n\nRegistration for the Gra
 n Fondo and Medio Fondo is open now! Registration for the Piccolo Fondo wil
 l open soon. There are a limited number of spots available\, and the first 
 250 to register will receive a sweet Upland Gran Fondo of Louisville souven
 ir.\n\n<a href="http://granfondolouisville.com/">http://granfondolouisville
 .com/</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20230110T182356Z
LOCATION:Thurman Hutchins Park\, Louisville\, KY @ 38.284195\, -85.686758
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Upland Gran Fondo of Louisville
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
CATEGORIES:http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#event
END:VEVENT
