UID:87ij495mak18b1ai2sionaobp1_R20220726T133000@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20220906T093000
CREATED:20220103T154704Z
DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><p><u><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/390401
 42">Ellettsville via Karst Trail </a></u>24 miles</p><p>Those desiring a lo
 nger route are invited to loop further north\, keeping in mind that Simpson
  Chapel and Sample Road are closed.</p><u></u><br><u></u>Watch the calendar
  for weather-related updates and for future rides.&nbsp\;<ul><li>Be SAFE. D
 on't blow through stop signs. Consider bike lights.<br></li><li>Be COURTEOU
 S: Single up in traffic<br></li><li>Be PREDICTABLE: Signal your intentions 
 to cars and fellow riders.</li></ul>This branch of the OWLS training group 
 also emphasizes somewhat slower\, moderate rides\, and a route planned in a
 dvance that is posted on the ride calendar. This is a no drop ride\, but no
 t a beginner's ride. Expect an overall average moving speed 11 - 15 mph inc
 luding hills. Distances vary from 20 to 30 miles. Early season rides will b
 e somewhat shorter and slower.During cold weather the ride departs at 1:30p
 m.<br><br>Non-members should sign up for a&nbsp\;<a href="https://secure.ge
 tmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=136627">free trial membershi
 p</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically sign
 ing a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.<br><br>Questions? Co
 ntact&nbsp\;<a href="mailto:allan.edmonds@gmail.com">Allan Edmonds</a><u></
 u><u></u><u></u></html-blob>
LAST-MODIFIED:20221006T224643Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Parking Lot\, S Woodlawn Ave\, Bloomington\, IN 47401\,
  USA
SEQUENCE:3
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Early Birds - Ellettsville via Karst Trail
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
