DESCRIPTION:INDOT is taking public comment on the Draft Environmental Impac
 t Statement\, Tier 2\, Section 4.   This is the first of two sections that 
 come through Monroe County!  At the meeting\, INDOT’s presentation will beg
 in at 6:30.   \n\nDirections to Eastern Greene Middle School:\n\nFrom the i
 ntersection of SR 37 and SR 45 take SR 45 south and west to SR 445 (About 1
 1.4 miles). Stay to the right and follow SR 445 to SR 54 (it turns into SR 
 54). Eastern Middle School is on the right a short distance past the inters
 ection of 445 and 54. The mileage from SR37 to Eastern Greene Schools is 13
 .4 miles. \n\nTier 2 DEIS: www.i69indyevn.org \;\n INDOT’s announcement of 
 this meeting: http://www.in.gov/portal/news_events/56198.htm
LAST-MODIFIED:20230110T182427Z
