DESCRIPTION:The OWLS (Older Wiser Little Slower) group is dedicated to trai
 ning and touring rides typically in the 13-14 mph range. We keep an eye on 
 each other. We take time to enjoy the scenery\, even stop to take a picture
 . \nEmail bbcowls@me.com for more information\n\nThis ride may be shorter t
 han other OWLS rides but it will have two major hill climbs.  The hills are
  on Mt. Gilead and Russell Road.\n\nMap at: \nhttp://www.mapmyride.com/ride
 /united-states/in/bloomington/781123965034617944
