DESCRIPTION:Leader: Allan Edmonds. I will lead this ride as an OWLS Ride\, 
 of 35 miles\, skipping the out-and-back to the park. Those wanting longer o
 r faster options can add the loop through Spencer\, as shown on the club ma
 p\, and/or a loop out of Whitehall. Here is a link to my planned route: \nh
 ttp://www.mapmyride.com/route/us/in/bloomington/831124025159943757 \nIf you
 've been wanting to try a ride somewhat longer than the evening OWLS or Wom
 en's Rides\, this is a good opportunity. Hope to see a good group of modera
 te riders. -AE
