 own CVS around 9am.  Dana will be at Bryan Park at 8am for anyone else that
  wants to experience this fantastic century from Brownstown Lancaster to Cl
 ifty Falls State Park to Lexington\, Vienna\, Scottsburg\, and oh yes\, Roo
 ster Hill.  If anyone has state park passes\, bring it along - one pass is 
 good for 3 bicyclists.\n\n<a href="http://ridewithgps.com/routes/1112284/fu
 ll.png">http://ridewithgps.com/routes/1112284/full.png</a>
