DESCRIPTION:The Nice N  Easy Ride will join the Breaking Away Ride.\n\nIf y
 ou just can't get enough of The Little 500 (held this year April 20-21)\, t
 hen you should come ride the BBC Breaking Away Ride on Sunday\, April 15. I
 t's a nostalgic ride that visits many of the scenes in the classic 1979 mov
 ie Breaking Away. Ride by the Dave Stohler house and shout "Refund! Refund!
 " Many more landmarks will be called out by ride leader Jim Schroeder who h
 as seen the movie well over 100 times. The ride is only 31 miles and includ
 es one rest stop. See the movie before you go\, then ride the movie rich in
  local history. See you Sunday at Bryan Park Pool parking lot for a 1:30 p.
 m. departure. Ciao!\n\n<a href="http://www.bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/
 Jim%20Schroeder/Breaking_Away.pdf">Breaking Away Ride Map</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20230110T181630Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot @ 39.15435\,-86.523
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Nice N Easy Ride
TRANSP:OPAQUE
