 a href="http://www.gmap-pedometer.com/?r=4043622">Gmap of Ride</a><br><br>T
 his is a ride to prepare members to make informed comments to the I-69 Stud
 y in order to mitigate or improve the conditions for cycling in S.W. Monroe
  County to the best of our ability.<br><br>Ride leader Jean Smith<br>jean@b
 ikesmiths.net<br>BBC representative to the I-69 Citizen Advisory Commission
  section 4<br><br>Maps of the  proposed closures and grade separated crossi
 ngs:<br><br><a href="http://www.bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/I69/MonroeCntRdC
 losures01.jpg">Monroe County<br>Road Closures</a><br><br><a href="http://ww
 w.bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/I69/Greene_MonroeRdClosures01.jpg">Green-Monro
 e<br>Road Closures</a><br><br><a href="http://www.bloomingtonbicycleclub.or
 g/I69/GreeneCtRdClosures02.jpg">Greene County<br>Road Closures</a><br><br>
