DTSTART:20130907T130000Z
DTEND:20130907T210000Z
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:8375osbe1cc6f7v5dqao36fk6g@google.com
CREATED:20130424T154048Z
DESCRIPTION:I have spent a lot of time in southcentral Indiana\,\nand over 
 the years found three favorite off-the-\nbeaten path county roads.  Last ye
 ar\, I set about\ndesigning a bicycle route using all three.  It turned\nou
 t to be an easy task because a substantially\nsimilar route was already pos
 ted on Ride With\nGPS.  I did this last year with a group from First\nUnite
 d Church\, and we thoroughly enjoyed it.\nSo\, I offer it as a BBC ride thi
 s year\; it is a\ngood one.\n\nThe entire route is 96 miles and begins and\
 nends at Spring Mill State Park.  Start here\nbecause a century ride will g
 et you to the Ohio\nRiver and back.  Shorter options include turning\nback 
 north at Marengo for a 63 mile loop\, or\nturning right at the famous Crawf
 ord County\nShoe Tree for about 82 miles.  Tour God’s\nCounty on this new d
 rive and ride\, and enjoy a\nlunch at the Overlook Restaurant on the Ohio\n
 River.  Car pool leaving Bryan Park at 8:00\, or\nmet at Spring Mill State 
 Park at 9:00.  Bring\nyour park pass.  Think about a post ride buffet at\nt
 he park lodge.\n\n<a href="http://ridewithgps.com/routes/2970469">GPS</a>\n
 \n<a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/Special_Maps/Spring%20Mil
 l%20to%20Leavenworth%2096.pdf">Paper Map and Cue Sheet</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20230110T181526Z
LOCATION:Spring Mill State Park\, Mitchell\, IN
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Spring Mill to Leavenworth - Leader: John Bassett
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
