DESCRIPTION:Joe Anderson will be leading a ride to the Leavenworth Overlook
 .  Meet at Bryan Park to car pool at 7am.\n\n<a href="http://ridewithgps.co
 m/routes/1387329">Link to GPS Map</a>\n\n<b>Change (from Joe):</b> I have b
 een watching the weather forcast with temps of 100 degrees plus. I intend t
 o show up at Bryan Park at 7:00 am on my bicycle and we will start riding f
 rom there. We'll head north looking for cooler weather. I propose a ride to
  Martinsville and then on to Mooresville for lunch via Centerton and Brookl
 yn. The return trip will come back on Goat Hollow and Blue Bluff. We will r
 eturn from Martinsville via Hacker Creek to stay in the shade.
