CREATED:20220103T154704Z
DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><p><u><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/376956
 96">Little Flock</a></u> 29 miles</p><u></u>Watch the calendar for weather-
 related updates and for future rides.&nbsp\;<ul><li>Be SAFE. Don't blow thr
 ough stop signs. Consider bike lights.<br></li><li>Be COURTEOUS: Single up 
 in traffic<br></li><li>Be PREDICTABLE: Signal your intentions to cars and f
 ellow riders.</li></ul>This branch of the OWLS training group also emphasiz
 es somewhat slower\, moderate rides\, and a route planned in advance that i
 s posted on the ride calendar. This is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner'
 s ride. Expect an overall average moving speed 11 - 15 mph including hills.
  Distances vary from 20 to 30 miles. Early season rides will be somewhat sh
 orter and slower.During cold weather the ride departs at 1:30pm.<br><br>Non
 -members should sign up for a&nbsp\;<a href="https://secure.getmeregistered
 .com/get_information.php?event_id=136627">free trial membership</a>\, good 
 for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing a liabili
 ty waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.<br><br>Questions? Contact&nbsp\;<
 a href="mailto:allan.edmonds@gmail.com">Allan Edmonds</a><u></u><u></u></ht
 ml-blob>
LAST-MODIFIED:20221006T224643Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Parking Lot\, S Woodlawn Ave\, Bloomington\, IN 47401\,
  USA
SEQUENCE:3
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Early Birds - Little Flock
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
