CREATED:20120217T022714Z
DESCRIPTION:We don't schedule a touring ride for this weekend but we encour
 age all BBC members to support the Hilly by participating as a paid-up regi
 stered cyclist. Some of us like to add to the fun by riding out to the star
 t from Bloomington and back at the end of the day. On Sunday we take it eas
 y a little easy by riding out on Bottom Rd. and joining the official route 
 at the corner of Maple Grove and Bottom. Each day gets to be around 70 mile
 s on average\, and makes for a good weekend on the bike!
