DESCRIPTION:Double Century Starts at 6:00 a.m. from the West side of IU Mem
 orial football stadium. There are two sag vehicles who can carry a cooler f
 or you with lunch and snacks. The lunch break is at Turkey Run State Park. 
 There is an entrance fee to the park. The route is the <a href="http://www.
 bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/Turkey%20Run%20DC.pdf">Turkey Run Double Ce
 ntury</a>. There will be one detour (to be determined) from the route near 
 Mooresville due to construction. There is no registration fee or required d
 onation. However\, riders are encouraged to make a donation to the Backstre
 et Mission.
LAST-MODIFIED:20230110T181850Z
