BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20221026T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20221026T203000
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:32sjplfvo35sffcd3c9kcs716p@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20221026T180000
CREATED:20220822T224915Z
DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><u></u><p>This 21 mile ride starts at the Hickory Ri
 dge Fire Tower\, heads down Tower Ridge road to Maumee and then towards Hou
 ston.&nbsp\; From Houston\, get your climbing legs on as we'll head towards
  Mt Baldy 2 which will be a new experience for a lot of us in the dark!&nbs
 p\; We'll then head back towards Maumee and start the gradual climb up past
  the Scout Camp and back to the Fire Tower.&nbsp\; This will be a great rid
 e.</p><p>This ride is all Gravel and Pavement.</p><p>Bring Lights! Bring Li
 ghts! Bring lights!</p><p><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/41278111"
  id="ow452" __is_owner="true">21 - Mt Baldy 2 - A bike ride in Monroe Count
 y\, IN (ridewithgps.com)</a></p><p>These rides feature gravel roads\, singl
 e and double track trails\,&nbsp\; and just enough pavement to string the a
 forementioned together into fun\, woodsy adventure loops.&nbsp\; Rides begi
 n at 6PM through the Fall and Winter months as weather allows and typically
  last about two hours.&nbsp\; Lights are mandatory as we enter the Fall and
  Winter seasons.</p><p>Routes are suitable for mountain bike or gravel bike
 \, with some more turned to one or the other.&nbsp\; Rides begin at differe
 nt locations\, primarily associated with Yellowwood State Forest\, Brown Co
 unty State Park\, and the Hoosier National Forest in Monroe\, Lawrence\, an
 d Brown Counties. &nbsp\;Specific routes may be dictated by weather conditi
 ons\, but starting locations\, route maps\, and gps file links will be post
 ed here in advance.</p><p>Expect a lot of trees and few cars.&nbsp\;&nbsp\;
 </p><u></u></html-blob>
LAST-MODIFIED:20230102T144559Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Mt Baldy 2 - Off Road Adventure Ride
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
