DESCRIPTION:June Bicycle Rally at McCormick's Creek State Park: \n\nMcCormi
 ck's Creek State Park and Canyon Inn will host us in 2012. Enjoy two half-d
 ays and two full days of loop rides\, covering different territory than our
  September Escapade loops from McCormick's Creek State Park. June is Limest
 one Month in Monroe and Lawrence counties\, and our routes will highlight t
 he historical\, industrial and artistic significance of limestone in south 
 central Indiana. Stay at Canyon Inn or camp for this adventure. <a href="ht
 tp://www.triri.org/june_rally.html">Learn more about\nthe June Bicycle Rall
 y.</a>\n\n<a href="http://www.triri.org">www.triri.org</a>
