 and enjoy the climb back up to Bloomington.  Total climb is 1\,500'.\n\nVie
 w and print map at:\nhttp://www.trimbleoutdoors.com/ViewTrip.aspx?tripId=41
 1333\n\nView only at:\nhttp://www.mapmyride.com/ride/united-states/in/bloom
 ington/305123841868941556
