CREATED:20130827T024514Z
DESCRIPTION:West Kirkwood Ave is not being closed down. It is being opened 
 up to people (not cars) so that they may use it for walking\, bicycling\, d
 ancing\, playing\, and socializing. This event is an innovative way to achi
 eve environmental\, social\, economic\, and public health goals. It transfo
 rms a city street into an urban park. It will be as inclusive as possible\,
  so that everyone will feel welcome to participate.\n\n<a href="http://open
 streetsbloomington.com "> http://openstreetsbloomington.com </a>\n\nThe BBC
  is one of the sponsors and participants in this event. We will have an exh
 ibit table where we demonstrate some bicycle related activities.\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20230110T182904Z
LOCATION:Open Streets on West Kirkwood Ave @ 39.166564\, -86.536856
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Open Streets
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
