DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><u></u><u></u><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/route
 s/37695696" id="ow391" __is_owner="true">Little Flock 29</a><br><u></u><br>
 <u></u>Watch the calendar for weather-related updates and for future rides.
 &nbsp\;<ul><li>Be SAFE. Don't blow through stop signs. Consider bike lights
 .<br></li><li>Be COURTEOUS: Single up in traffic<br></li><li>Be PREDICTABLE
 : Signal your intentions to cars and fellow riders.</li></ul>This branch of
  the OWLS training group also emphasizes somewhat slower\, moderate rides\,
  and a route planned in advance that is posted on the ride calendar. This i
 s a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride. Expect an overall average mov
 ing speed 11 - 15 mph including hills. Distances vary from 20 to 30 miles. 
 Early season rides will be somewhat shorter and slower.During cold weather 
 the ride departs at 1:30pm.<br><br>Non-members should sign up for a&nbsp\;<
 a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=136
 627">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which inc
 ludes electronically signing a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participat
 ion.<br><br>Questions? Contact&nbsp\;<a href="mailto:allan.edmonds@gmail.co
 m">Allan Edmonds</a><u></u><u></u><u></u></html-blob>
