DESCRIPTION:This group is intended for riders with some experience in group
  rides but not those seeking high-intensity\, fast training rides. The pace
  and distance will be moderate. The ride leader will start promptly at the 
 announced time and set an appropriate pace. Riders are expected to assist t
 he leader by looking out for each other during the ride. Ride maps with reg
 rouping points will be posted in advance. Riders unfamiliar with the route 
 should bring along a copy of the map in the event they become separated fro
 m the group.\n\n<a href="http://www.bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/Tom_Rey
 nolds_iRides/Rockcrusher.pdf">Rockcrusher 26 miles</a>\n\n<a href="http://w
 ww.gmap-pedometer.com/?r=5305193">Gmap</a>
