DTEND:20090823T203000Z
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:cdh16sh2qj0dbci7kuph6292bs@google.com
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20090909T005747Z
DESCRIPTION:Weather permitting ...join Kathy Smith and Ralph Zuzolo as we r
 ide out on a wine tasting and picnic adventure to Oliver Winery on Sunday\,
  August 23rd.  This will be a Nice-&-Easy ride at a social pace departing f
 rom the Bryan Park pool lot at 1:30 with an estimated 4:30pm return.\n\nA S
 AG is being provided by Mark Napier for individuals who wish to bring a pic
 nic lunch or return with a few bottles or gifts from the winery.  The loadi
 ng and unloading of the SAG vehicle will take place at the Bryan Park pool 
 lot at the start and conclusion of the ride.\n\nBesides wine tasting\, Oliv
 er’s has snacks\, breads\, cheeses and meats available along with a scenic 
 picnic area.  Don’t forget to bring some cash.\n\nThe route includes three 
 climbs and two fast downhill runs.  Also\, four crossings of SR37.\n\nPleas
 e contact Ralph (rzuzolo@indiana.edu) with any questions
LAST-MODIFIED:20230110T182748Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot @ 39.15435\,-86.523
SEQUENCE:0
