  the participants.  We will use short and medium variations of standard clu
 b routes. All rides will have a leader\, and the more experienced riders wi
 ll serve as mentors for the beginners\, and no matter what your speed or ex
 perience\, no one will be dropped or left behind. Contact: Jodi Pope-Pfings
 ton <jpope@ivytech.edu>.
