DESCRIPTION:September Escapade™ (also known as "SE") will guide you to the 
 scenic and historic sites of southeastern Indiana\, with overnights at thre
 e state parks: Brown County (one night)\, Spring Mill (two nights)\, and Cl
 ifty Falls (two nights). Routes use rural\, hard-surfaced roads\, with stop
 s in small towns for services. Terrain ranges from rolling to hilly with so
 me challenging hills. Ridership is limited to 250 participants.<a href="htt
 p://www.triri.org/se.html">Learn more about the September Escapade.</a>\n\n
 <a href="http://www.triri.org">www.triri.org</a>
