X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20220922T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20220922T123000
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:87ij495mak18b1ai2sionaobp1_R20220726T133000@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20220922T093000
CREATED:20220103T154704Z
DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><p><u><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/400684
 72">Dam Overlook via Moore's Creek</a></u> 32 miles</p><p><span style="colo
 r: var(--on-surface)\; background-color: var(--textfield-surface)\;"><a hre
 f="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/40993718" id="ow2586" __is_owner="true">R
 amp Creek</a> 20 miles</span></p><u></u>&nbsp\;<br><u></u>Watch the calenda
 r for weather-related updates and for future rides.&nbsp\;<ul><li>Be SAFE. 
 Don't blow through stop signs. Consider bike lights.<br></li><li>Be COURTEO
 US: Single up in traffic<br></li><li>Be PREDICTABLE: Signal your intentions
  to cars and fellow riders.</li></ul>This branch of the OWLS training group
  also emphasizes somewhat slower\, moderate rides\, and a route planned in 
 advance that is posted on the ride calendar. This is a no drop ride\, but n
 ot a beginner's ride. Expect an overall average moving speed 11 - 15 mph in
 cluding hills. Distances vary from 20 to 30 miles. Early season rides will 
 be somewhat shorter and slower.During cold weather the ride departs at 1:30
 pm.<br><br>Non-members should sign up for a&nbsp\;<a href="https://secure.g
 etmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=136627">free trial membersh
 ip</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically sig
 ning a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.<br><br>Questions? C
 ontact&nbsp\;<a href="mailto:allan.edmonds@gmail.com">Allan Edmonds</a><u><
 /u><u></u><u></u></html-blob>
LAST-MODIFIED:20221006T224643Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Parking Lot\, S Woodlawn Ave\, Bloomington\, IN 47401\,
  USA
SEQUENCE:3
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Early Birds - Dam Overlook
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
