DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><u></u><u></u><p><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/ro
 utes/18155202">All Around Yellowstone 20 - A bike ride in Monroe County\, I
 N (ridewithgps.com)</a><br></p><p><span style="background-color: var(--text
 field-surface)\; color: var(--on-surface)\;">This 20-miler begins at the Bl
 ackwell HorseCamp on Tower Ridge Road\, heads toHickory Grove Church\, and 
 then circlesback to the horse camp via McPike BranchRoad and Dutch Ridge Ro
 ad.  The route ispredominately gravel with a little bit of pavement\, and n
 o trail.  Route is suitablefor CX\, gravel bike\, or MTB.&nbsp\;&nbsp\;</sp
 an></p><p><span style="background-color: var(--textfield-surface)\; color: 
 var(--on-surface)\;">BRING LIGHTS!!&nbsp\;</span><span style="background-co
 lor: var(--textfield-surface)\; color: var(--on-surface)\;">BRING LIGHTS!!&
 nbsp\;</span><span style="background-color: var(--textfield-surface)\; colo
 r: var(--on-surface)\;">BRING LIGHTS!!</span><br></p><p>These rides feature
  gravel roads\, single and double track trails\,&nbsp\; and just enough pav
 ement to string the aforementioned together into fun\, woodsy adventure loo
 ps.&nbsp\; Rides begin at 6PM through the Fall and Winter months as weather
  allows and typically last about two hours.&nbsp\; Lights are mandatory as 
 we enter the Fall and Winter seasons.</p><p>Routes are suitable for mountai
 n bike or gravel bike\, with some more turned to one or the other.&nbsp\; R
 ides begin at different locations\, primarily associated with Yellowwood St
 ate Forest\, Brown County State Park\, and the Hoosier National Forest in M
 onroe\, Lawrence\, and Brown Counties. &nbsp\;Specific routes may be dictat
 ed by weather conditions\, but starting locations\, route maps\, and gps fi
 le links will be posted here in advance.</p><p>Expect a lot of trees and fe
 w cars.&nbsp\;&nbsp\;</p><u></u><u></u></html-blob>
LAST-MODIFIED:20230102T144559Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:All Around Yellowstone - Off Road Adventure Ride
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
