BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20221011T174500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20221011T204500
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:2urp2bj3c2heeud8tg2cjsaoqf_R20220705T214500@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20221011T174500
CREATED:20220221T214100Z
DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><u></u><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/34394
 034" id="ow581" __is_owner="true">https://ridewithgps.com/routes/34394034</
 a><br><b><br></b></html-blob><br><html-blob><b>Route change due to Ramp Cre
 ek closure today for Culvert repair.</b><br><u></u><br><u></u><br><u></u>Pl
 ease observe social distancing norms as we gather and ride.&nbsp\;<ul><li>B
 e SAFE. Don't blow through stop signs. Consider bike lights.<br></li><li>Be
  COURTEOUS: Single up in traffic<br></li><li>Be PREDICTABLE: Signal your in
 tentions to cars and fellow riders.</li></ul>The "Older\, Wiser\, and a Lit
 tle Slower" training group emphasizes moderate rides\, and a route planned 
 in advance that is posted on the ride calendar. This is a no drop ride\, bu
 t not a beginner's ride.The OWLS group welcomes a wide range of intermediat
 e riders\, and typically breaks off into a faster and slower group with the
  former averaging an overall moving speed of 16-18 mph\, and the slower gro
 up averaging 13-15 mph (including hills).&nbsp\;Distances vary from 20 to 3
 0 miles\, depending partly on available light. Early season rides will be s
 omewhat shorter and slower. Rides depart promptly at 5:45.<br><br>Non-membe
 rs should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_inf
 ormation.php?event_id=136627">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to th
 ree rides\, and which includes electronically signing a liability waiver\,&
 nbsp\;prior to participation.<br><br>Questions? Contact&nbsp\;<a href="mail
 to:gail.morell@gmail.com">Gail Morell</a>.<u></u><u></u><u></u><u></u><u></
 u></html-blob>
LAST-MODIFIED:20221011T180050Z
LOCATION:Sherwood Oaks Christian Church\, 2700 E Rogers Rd\, Bloomington\, 
 IN 47401\, USA
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:OWLS Ride - 18 Bridge and Back
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART:20221013T214500Z
DTEND:20221013T231500Z
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:7dbotvi94vsbg18ic0lm6rd0di@google.com
CREATED:20221011T181506Z
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.strava.com/ro
 utes/2912126872135523692&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg
 =AOvVaw3VnTI_-5ExvDbpMB2wkf_o" target="_blank">26 Kerr\, Getty\, Robinson\,
  Firehouse</a><br><br>Ready for a high spirited ride? BV Ride is an interme
 diate/ advanced ride and moderate distance that may or may not include regr
 ouping points.  Pace is anticipated to be 17+ mph. Expect occasional sprint
  or Strava segments\, pace line riding at high speed\, intervals\, and fewe
 r regrouping stops.<p>The BV Ride will start at the Parking lot across from
  the Bryan Park Pool on Woodlawn at 5:45. Mileages will increase as the sea
 son progresses. If you keep coming we will make you faster!</p><p>Riders ar
 e expected to look out for each other during the rides.  Ride maps and GPS 
 links will be posted here in advance. Riders unfamiliar with the route shou
 ld bring along a copy of the map.</p>Non-members should sign up for a <a hr
 ef="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_inf
 ormation.php?event_id%3D133776&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;usd=2&am
 p\;usg=AOvVaw2j50-2uvBSoK9EgtVBL-h8" target="_blank">free trial membership<
 /a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signin
 g a liability waiver\, prior to participation.
LAST-MODIFIED:20221011T181506Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool\, 1020 S Woodlawn Ave\, Bloomington\, IN 47401\, U
 SA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:BV ride 26 Kerr\, Getty\, Robinson\, Firehouse 
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
