DESCRIPTION:For the most of us this will be a "drive and ride" event.  You 
 can either ride or drive to the Eagle Pointe Resort which is about 10 miles
  south just off Strain Ridge road.  We will meet in the parking lot closest
  to the road in front of the Eagle Pointe Resort club house at 5:30 pm. We 
 will take about a 12 mile ride which will take us down the dam hill to old 
 37.  We will then ride north on Old 37 to the Ketcham turn off and catch th
 e Smithville road back into Smithville.  From there we will ride south on S
 train Ridge back to the Pointe parking lot.  I will bring a few maps for th
 ose not familiar with the roads. The ride is a relatively easy ride with a 
 couple of moderate hills and some fun rollers.\n\nOur post ride social will
  take place at the Eagle Pointe restaurant.  We can sit inside or outside o
 n their large covered deck area depending on weather\, so bring a jacket in
  case it gets cool.  The Pointe restaurant has an all you can eat Taco & Sa
 lad bar on Mondays for $8.95.  They also have some drink specials for those
  that might be interested.  \n\nIt should be a fun evening.  If you have an
 y questions\, shoot me an email.  \n\n(ride leader – Dan Fowler)
LAST-MODIFIED:20230110T181856Z
LOCATION:Eagle Pointe Resort @ 39.032961\, -86.511079
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:UnRide
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
CATEGORIES:http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#event
END:VEVENT
