DESCRIPTION:<u></u><u></u><p><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://
 www.strava.com/routes/3004447672843945872&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&am
 p\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw33HsX8WAZ4nqOw9o5xZLQl" target="_blank">Judah Dam S
 train Ridge</a><br></p><p><b>Judah Dam Strain Ridge (ccw)</b></p><p>Ready f
 or a high spirited ride? BV Ride is an intermediate/ advanced ride and mode
 rate distance that may or may not include regrouping points.  Pace is antic
 ipated to be 17+ mph. Expect occasional sprint or Strava segments\, pace li
 ne riding at high speed\, intervals\, and fewer regrouping stops.</p><p>The
  BV Ride will start at the Parking lot across from the Bryan Park Pool on W
 oodlawn at 5:45. Mileages will increase as the season progresses. If you ke
 ep coming we will make you faster!</p><p>Riders are expected to look out fo
 r each other during the rides.  Ride maps and GPS links will be posted here
  in advance. Riders unfamiliar with the route should bring along a copy of 
 the map.</p>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://www.google.co
 m/url?q=https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id%3D1
 33776&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw2j50-2uvBSoK
 9EgtVBL-h8" target="_blank"><u>free trial membership</u></a>\, good for up 
 to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing a liability waiv
 er\, prior to participation.<u></u><u></u>
LAST-MODIFIED:20221011T181442Z
