UID:4v55rig51son6n9rri8stol29g@google.com
CREATED:20110804T121835Z
DESCRIPTION:Parking Lot Across from the Woodlawn Shelter  at Bryan Park\n\n
 We will bike to Cascades\, out Kinser\,  across Bottom Rd. and then venture
  part way up Mt. Pleasant. before returning. Those not wanting to do the wh
 ole route could pick up with us at Cascades\, or at the water treatment fac
 ility on Bottom Rd. for a flatter\, shorter experience. I think you could s
 horten your ride to around the 10 miles mark if you park at the water treat
 ment place on Bottom (but I won't pay if you get towed- yet no reason to th
 ink you would ). Please bring water due to the heat and humidity. If you ar
 en't eating much breakfast\, bring some quick carbs to get you over the hum
 p. We are slow on hills\, but if you are slower than us\, we will wait for 
 you to catch up.\n\nIf you could email me back to let me have an idea who t
 o look for that would be great\, but you can show up even if you don't emai
 l.\n\nDonna Getts\ngettsfamily@bluemarble.net
LAST-MODIFIED:20230110T181741Z
LOCATION:Parking\, Woodlawn Shelter\, Bryan Park @ 39.155693\, -86.522416
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Slow Spokes
TRANSP:OPAQUE
