BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20220816T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20220816T123000
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:87ij495mak18b1ai2sionaobp1_R20220726T133000@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20220816T093000
CREATED:20220103T154704Z
DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><u></u><u></u><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/route
 s/40068472" id="ow565" __is_owner="true">Dam Overlook via Moore's Creek</a>
  32 miles</html-blob><br><html-blob>Short option of 20 &nbsp\;miles turns t
 oward home at Smithville.<br><u></u><br><u></u>Watch the calendar for weath
 er-related updates and for future rides.&nbsp\;<ul><li>Be SAFE. Don't blow 
 through stop signs. Consider bike lights.<br></li><li>Be COURTEOUS: Single 
 up in traffic<br></li><li>Be PREDICTABLE: Signal your intentions to cars an
 d fellow riders.</li></ul>This branch of the OWLS training group also empha
 sizes somewhat slower\, moderate rides\, and a route planned in advance tha
 t is posted on the ride calendar. This is a no drop ride\, but not a beginn
 er's ride. Expect an overall average moving speed 11 - 15 mph including hil
 ls. Distances vary from 20 to 30 miles. Early season rides will be somewhat
  shorter and slower.During cold weather the ride departs at 1:30pm.<br><br>
 Non-members should sign up for a&nbsp\;<a href="https://secure.getmeregiste
 red.com/get_information.php?event_id=136627">free trial membership</a>\, go
