BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20220908T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20220908T123000
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:87ij495mak18b1ai2sionaobp1_R20220726T133000@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20220908T093000
CREATED:20220103T154704Z
DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><u></u><u></u><u></u><u></u><u></u><u></u><a href="h
 ttps://ridewithgps.com/routes/40866748" id="ow836" __is_owner="true">Harmon
 y Bridge</a>&nbsp\;via Koontz\, back via Rail Trail. 25 miles</html-blob><b
 r><br><html-blob>Longer option&nbsp\;<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/route
 s/35767560" id="ow829" __is_owner="true">Harmony Bridge</a> via Koontz\, ba
 ck via Smithville and Ramp Creek on the way back. 32 miles<br><u></u><br><u
 ></u>Watch the calendar for weather-related updates and for future rides.&n
 bsp\;<ul><li>Be SAFE. Don't blow through stop signs. Consider bike lights.<
 br></li><li>Be COURTEOUS: Single up in traffic<br></li><li>Be PREDICTABLE: 
 Signal your intentions to cars and fellow riders.</li></ul>This branch of t
 he OWLS training group also emphasizes somewhat slower\, moderate rides\, a
 nd a route planned in advance that is posted on the ride calendar. This is 
 a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride. Expect an overall average movin
 g speed 11 - 15 mph including hills. Distances vary from 20 to 30 miles. Ea
 rly season rides will be somewhat shorter and slower.During cold weather th
 e ride departs at 1:30pm.<br><br>Non-members should sign up for a&nbsp\;<a 
 href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=13662
 7">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which inclu
 des electronically signing a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participatio
 n.<br><br>Questions? Contact&nbsp\;<a href="mailto:allan.edmonds@gmail.com"
 >Allan Edmonds</a><u></u><u></u><u></u><u></u><u></u><u></u><u></u></html-b
 lob>
LAST-MODIFIED:20221006T224643Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Parking Lot\, S Woodlawn Ave\, Bloomington\, IN 47401\,
  USA
