UID:32sjplfvo35sffcd3c9kcs716p@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20221214T180000
CREATED:20220822T224915Z
DESCRIPTION:<u></u><p>This 22 mile ride starts at the&nbsp\;<span style="ba
 ckground-color: var(--textfield-surface)\; color: var(--on-surface)\;">Brya
 nt Creek Shelter and is a mix of pavement and gravel.</span></p><p><a href=
 "https://ridewithgps.com/routes/41585346" id="ow1015" __is_owner="true">Mor
 gan Monroe State Forest 22</a><br></p><p>These rides feature gravel roads\,
  single and double track trails\,&nbsp\; and just enough pavement to string
  the aforementioned together into fun\, woodsy adventure loops.&nbsp\; Ride
 s begin at 6PM through the Fall and Winter months as weather allows and typ
 ically last about two hours.&nbsp\; Lights are mandatory as we enter the Fa
 ll and Winter seasons.</p><p>Routes are suitable for mountain bike or grave
 l bike\, with some more turned to one or the other.&nbsp\; Rides begin at d
 ifferent locations\, primarily associated with Yellowwood State Forest\, Br
 own County State Park\, and the Hoosier National Forest in Monroe\, Lawrenc
 e\, and Brown Counties. &nbsp\;Specific routes may be dictated by weather c
 onditions\, but starting locations\, route maps\, and gps file links will b
 e posted here in advance.</p><p>Expect a lot of trees and few cars.&nbsp\;&
 nbsp\;</p><u></u>
