CREATED:20120507T184022Z
DESCRIPTION:Race Across America (RAAM) is one the most respected and longes
 t running endurance sports events in the world. RAAM is seen as a pinnacle 
 of athletic achievement not only in cycling circles but the greater sportin
 g community as well.\n\nBloomington\, Indiana - Time Station 39 (mile 2263)
 \n\nFrom Tuesday June 19 4pm till Saturday June 23 12noon\, these courageou
 s racers will be travelling through Bloomington at a time station in front 
 of CVS / O'Malias on College Mall Rd.  Bloomington is actually the largest 
 city that RAAM travels through.  This assures the crews many amenities and 
 they will spend a lot of time here in our community.  \n\nJim Schroeder cap
 tains this time station and will try to be there 24/7 or at least when the 
 riders come through.  Please consider helping out by just coming out or vol
 unteering for set-up or tear-down or a 4 hour stint.  E-mail Jim at jimmysc
 hweb@gmail.com\n\nThe riders and crews truly enjoy and appreciate all we do
  for them!
LAST-MODIFIED:20230110T182641Z
LOCATION:RAAM Time Station\, CVS on College Mall Rd @ 39.162157\, -86.49809
 1
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Race Across America (RAAM)
