CREATED:20220822T224915Z
DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><p>This ride starts at the Yellowwood Dam\, heads up
  Yellowwood Road and across Lanam Ridge to 45.&nbsp\; From there we will dr
 op down Greenbriar Lane and head across South Shore\, up Plum Creek back to
  Lanam Ridge and down Dubois / Marlett / Green Valley and then back to the 
 Dam.</p><p><span>Route is suitable for Gravel\, Cross or MTB.</span></p><p>
 <span>Bring lights!!&nbsp\;</span></p><p><span>GPS File:</span></p><table><
 tbody><tr><td><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/40981658"><u>https://
 ridewithgps.com/routes/40981658</u></a></td></tr></tbody></table><br><p>The
 se rides feature gravel roads\, single and double track trails\,&nbsp\; and
  just enough pavement to string the aforementioned together into fun\, wood
 sy adventure loops.&nbsp\; Rides begin at 6PM through the Fall and Winter m
 onths as weather allows and typically last about two hours.&nbsp\; Lights a
 re mandatory as we enter the Fall and Winter seasons.</p><p>Routes are suit
 able for mountain bike or gravel bike\, with some more turned to one or the
  other.&nbsp\; Rides begin at different locations\, primarily associated wi
 th Yellowwood State Forest\, Brown County State Park\, and the Hoosier Nati
 onal Forest in Monroe\, Lawrence\, and Brown Counties. &nbsp\;Specific rout
 es may be dictated by weather conditions\, but starting locations\, route m
 aps\, and gps file links will be posted here in advance.</p><p>Expect a lot
  of trees and few cars.&nbsp\;&nbsp\;</p><u></u><u></u><u></u></html-blob>
LAST-MODIFIED:20230102T144559Z
LOCATION:39.176845\, -86.340240
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Dam Plum Creek - Off Road Adventure Ride
TRANSP:OPAQUE
