BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20220928T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20220928T203000
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:32sjplfvo35sffcd3c9kcs716p@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20220928T180000
CREATED:20220822T224915Z
DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><u></u><p>This ride starts at the Yellowwood State F
 orest Office and incorporates a 'nice' climb up Crooked Creek\, double trac
 k across Bartley Ridge\, a white knuckle ride down Jackass Hill and then he
 ads back to the start via East Kent and Jackson Creek roads.</p><p>We will 
 be on 46 for about a mile as we head towards Crooked Creek</p><p>Suitable f
 or Mountain\, Cross or Gravel Bikes</p><p>Ride starts promptly at 6pm</p><p
 >Bring Lights!!</p><p>A coupe of club members will be camping at Yellowwood
  so there will be a camp fire and smores to enjoy after the ride.&nbsp\; Co
 me along and bring some snacks\, a cold drink and share your tall stories a
 nd exploits both on and off the bike.</p><p><a href="https://ridewithgps.co
 m/routes/41038346" id="ow524" __is_owner="true">Crooked Bartley Jackass - A
  bike ride in Brown County\, IN (ridewithgps.com)</a><br></p><p><span style
 ="background-color: var(--textfield-surface)\; color: var(--on-surface)\;">
 These rides feature gravel roads\, single and double track trails\,&nbsp\; 
 and just enough pavement to string the aforementioned together into fun\, w
 oodsy adventure loops.&nbsp\; Rides begin at 6PM through the Fall and Winte
 r months as weather allows and typically last about two hours.&nbsp\; Light
 s are mandatory as we enter the Fall and Winter seasons.</span><br></p><p>R
 outes are suitable for mountain bike or gravel bike\, with some more turned
  to one or the other.&nbsp\; Rides begin at different locations\, primarily
  associated with Yellowwood State Forest\, Brown County State Park\, and th
 e Hoosier National Forest in Monroe\, Lawrence\, and Brown Counties. &nbsp\
 ;Specific routes may be dictated by weather conditions\, but starting locat
 ions\, route maps\, and gps file links will be posted here in advance.</p><
 p>Expect a lot of trees and few cars.&nbsp\;&nbsp\;</p><u></u></html-blob>
LAST-MODIFIED:20230102T144559Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Crooked Bartley Jackass - Off Road Adventure Ride
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
