BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20221130T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20221130T203000
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:32sjplfvo35sffcd3c9kcs716p@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20221130T180000
CREATED:20220822T224915Z
DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><u></u><p>Hello All\,</p><p>This ride will start / f
 inish at the Fire Tower.</p><p><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/4152
 1137" id="ow526" __is_owner="true">Henderson Creek and Hickory Grove from F
 ire Tower 21</a><br></p><p>Bring Lights!!</p><p>These rides feature gravel 
 roads\, single and double track trails\,&nbsp\; and just enough pavement to
  string the aforementioned together into fun\, woodsy adventure loops.&nbsp
 \; Rides begin at 6PM through the Fall and Winter months as weather allows 
 and typically last about two hours.&nbsp\; Lights are mandatory as we enter
  the Fall and Winter seasons.</p><p>Routes are suitable for mountain bike o
 r gravel bike\, with some more turned to one or the other.&nbsp\; Rides beg
 in at different locations\, primarily associated with Yellowwood State Fore
 st\, Brown County State Park\, and the Hoosier National Forest in Monroe\, 
 Lawrence\, and Brown Counties. &nbsp\;Specific routes may be dictated by we
 ather conditions\, but starting locations\, route maps\, and gps file links
  will be posted here in advance.</p><p>Expect a lot of trees and few cars.&
 nbsp\;&nbsp\;</p><u></u></html-blob>
LAST-MODIFIED:20230102T144559Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Henderson Creek and Hickory Grove - Off Road Adventure Ride
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
