DESCRIPTION:Decorate your bike as bright as you can and light up the night 
 with fellow cyclists as we mosey around Bloomington. We will make stops all
  along the route to explore and admire some of Bloomington's glowing sites.
  Each bicycle must have\, at minimum\, white front lights and red rear ligh
 ts to participate. Reflective clothing and helmets are encouraged for all r
 iders. For ages 18 yrs. and up.\n\nParticipation is free - registration is 
 not required.
