DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:4ah2ib1u9kb6kau6sf6b5blc6m_R20230104T230000@google.com
CREATED:20220822T224915Z
DESCRIPTION:<u></u><p><br></p><p>These rides feature gravel roads\, single 
 and double track trails\,&nbsp\; and just enough pavement to string the afo
 rementioned together into fun\, woodsy adventure loops.&nbsp\; Rides begin 
 at 6PM through the Fall and Winter months as weather allows and typically l
 ast about two hours.&nbsp\; Lights are mandatory as we enter the Fall and W
 inter seasons.</p><p>Routes are suitable for mountain bike or gravel bike\,
  with some more turned to one or the other.&nbsp\; Rides begin at different
  locations\, primarily associated with Yellowwood State Forest\, Brown Coun
 ty State Park\, and the Hoosier National Forest in Monroe\, Lawrence\, and 
 Brown Counties. &nbsp\;Specific routes may be dictated by weather condition
 s\, but starting locations\, route maps\, and gps file links will be posted
  here in advance.</p><p>Expect a lot of trees and few cars.&nbsp\;&nbsp\;</
 p><u></u>
LAST-MODIFIED:20230102T144719Z
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Off Road Adventure
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
