CREATED:20120217T023903Z
DESCRIPTION:This one is not in the map packet but a familiar route for most
  of us. We work our way south out of town through Smithville\, and then dow
 n to Harrodsburg by way of Strain Ridge. Then up to Rockport on Popcorn Rd.
  Rockport all the way to Victor Pike and back into town through the neighbo
 rhoods. If it's not a familiar route\, we'll have plenty of help for you to
  keep you on the right roads.
LAST-MODIFIED:20230110T182654Z
