DESCRIPTION:This OWLS ride is one of the flattest rides we have.  It is a s
 imple out and back route which goes across the causeway and back into Cutri
 ght recreational area.  The only hill to challenge you is the ride back up 
 from the causeway on the return trip.  We will average 13-14 mph.  Come out
  and join us.  Total climb 900'.\n\nCheck out the map at:\nhttp://www.mapmy
 ride.com/ride/united-states/in/bloomington/346123896685789352
