DESCRIPTION:Tu/Thurs training rides are for those of us who like to challen
 ge ourselves in a cooperative group riding style. This is Not a no-drop rid
 e but we do stop to gather from time to time. Paceline riding with occasion
 al sprint zones. Routes are determined by those who gather after a brief di
 scussion. Take it easy on the way out of town\, ramp it up later. Early sea
 son averages around 16-17mph\, later in season 18-20mph.
