DESCRIPTION:It is a weeklong ride through west-central Indiana that visits 
 various Habitat Affiliates across the state. It serves as a fundraiser that
  would benefit our local Habitat affiliate – Monroe County Habitat for Huma
 nity.\n\n<a href="http://hfhcoverindiana.org/">http://hfhcoverindiana.org/<
 /a>
