BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20221119T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20221119T160000
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:76goke0o1n3k5j8qk81fu0sg83@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20221119T100000
CREATED:20220901T172010Z
DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><p>Hi Everyone\,</p><p>I've moved this back to start
  at 12 noon and hopefully avoid the morning forecast low teens windchill an
 d take advantage a few more degrees of 'warmth'&nbsp\;</p><p>This lumpy 29 
 mile ride will start/finish at the Belmont Church on Lower Schooner Road.&n
 bsp\; We will head up and over Yellowwood\, drop down to South Shore and th
 en head back up to Lanam via Salmeron. We will drop down Owl Creek and loop
  around to Green Valley and then take Bond Cemetery.&nbsp\; We get on 46 fo
 r about 3/4 of a mile and hit Crooked Creek and Bartley Ridge and finish wi
 th a nice downhill back to the church.</p><p><a href="https://ridewithgps.c
 om/routes/41456518" id="ow1034" __is_owner="true">Yellowwood Out Bond Back<
 /a></p><p>These rides feature gravel roads\, single and double track trails
 \,&nbsp\; and just enough pavement to string the aforementioned together in
 to fun\, woodsy adventure loops.&nbsp\; Rides begin at 10am through the Fal
 l and Winter months as weather allows and typically last about three to fou
 r hours.</p><p>Routes are suitable for mountain bike or gravel bike\, with 
 some more turned to one or the other.&nbsp\; Rides begin at different locat
 ions\, primarily associated with Yellowwood State Forest\, Brown County Sta
 te Park\, and the Hoosier National Forest in Monroe\, Lawrence\, and Brown 
 Counties. &nbsp\;Specific routes may be dictated by weather conditions\, bu
 t starting locations\, route maps\, and gps file links will be posted here 
 in advance.</p><p>Expect a lot of trees and few cars.</p></html-blob>
LAST-MODIFIED:20221117T154907Z
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Yellowwood Out Bond Back - Off Road Adventure
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
