DESCRIPTION:Calling all dashing chaps and lasses for the 3rd annual Bloomin
 gton Tweed Ride on Saturday\, April 6th! Bring your two-wheeled steel ride 
 and wear your most fabulous tweed outfit for a leisurely bike ride to remem
 ber. We’ll gather at 1:30 pm on the Courthouse Square\, and set off on our 
 adventure\, rain or shine. We’ll make stops for tea and jolly-good competit
 ions for the sporting types. The tour will continue through beautiful Bloom
 ington and the IU campus\, passing through our storied Sample Gates and con
 cluding with a celebratory pint at Max’s Place.
