DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><p>Long: <a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/397
 18154"><u>Harmony Hills</u></a> 31 miles</p><p>Short: <a href="https://ride
 withgps.com/routes/40681951" id="ow2527" __is_owner="true">Rockport-Bolin</
 a> 21 miles</p><u></u><br><u></u>Watch the calendar for weather-related upd
 ates and for future rides.&nbsp\;<ul><li>Be SAFE. Don't blow through stop s
 igns. Consider bike lights.<br></li><li>Be COURTEOUS: Single up in traffic<
 br></li><li>Be PREDICTABLE: Signal your intentions to cars and fellow rider
 s.</li></ul>This branch of the OWLS training group also emphasizes somewhat
  slower\, moderate rides\, and a route planned in advance that is posted on
  the ride calendar. This is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride. Exp
 ect an overall average moving speed 11 - 15 mph including hills. Distances 
 vary from 20 to 30 miles. Early season rides will be somewhat shorter and s
 lower.During cold weather the ride departs at 1:30pm.<br><br>Non-members sh
 ould sign up for a&nbsp\;<a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_in
 formation.php?event_id=136627">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to t
 hree rides\, and which includes electronically signing a liability waiver\,
 &nbsp\;prior to participation.<br><br>Questions? Contact&nbsp\;<a href="mai
 lto:allan.edmonds@gmail.com">Allan Edmonds</a><u></u><u></u><u></u></html-b
 lob>
