DESCRIPTION:This is a century ride in the mountainous terrain around Chatta
 nooga\, TN. A number of club members have done this ride regularly for the 
 past few years. It is a challenging\, but rewarding ride. Chattanooga is a 
 great city to visit. We usually go down there Friday\, ride Saturday\, stay
  Saturday night and return to Bton on Sunday. If there is interest\, talk i
 t up on Saturday or on midweek rides.
