BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20221005T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20221005T203000
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:32sjplfvo35sffcd3c9kcs716p@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20221005T180000
CREATED:20220822T224915Z
DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><u></u><p>This ride will start at the Crooked Creek 
 Boat Ramp go up Elkinsville Rd across Lake Monroe to Elkinsville\, up Combs
  Rd to the Nebo Connector\, and down Nebo to the North parking lot. Then it
 's up Blue Creek Rd before heading back towards the lake via Old Blue Creek
  Road - a total of 16.7 miles.<br><br>The last couple of rides have finishe
 d in the dark so please -&nbsp\;BRING LIGHTS! BRING LIGHTS! BRING LIGHTS<br
 ></p><p>GPS Files:</p><p><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/17204767" 
 id="ow430" __is_owner="true">Reverse Blue Creek Elkinsville Loop 17 - A bik
 e ride in Brown County\, IN (ridewithgps.com)</a><br></p><p>These rides fea
 ture gravel roads\, single and double track trails\,&nbsp\; and just enough
  pavement to string the aforementioned together into fun\, woodsy adventure
  loops.&nbsp\; Rides begin at 6PM through the Fall and Winter months as wea
 ther allows and typically last about two hours.&nbsp\; Lights are mandatory
  as we enter the Fall and Winter seasons.</p><p>Routes are suitable for mou
 ntain bike or gravel bike\, with some more turned to one or the other.&nbsp
 \; Rides begin at different locations\, primarily associated with Yellowwoo
 d State Forest\, Brown County State Park\, and the Hoosier National Forest 
 in Monroe\, Lawrence\, and Brown Counties. &nbsp\;Specific routes may be di
 ctated by weather conditions\, but starting locations\, route maps\, and gp
 s file links will be posted here in advance.</p><p>Expect a lot of trees an
 d few cars.&nbsp\;&nbsp\;</p><u></u></html-blob>
LAST-MODIFIED:20230102T144559Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Reverse Blue Creek Elkinsville Loop 17 - Off Road Adventure Ride
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
