BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART:20110730T120000Z
DTEND:20110730T140000Z
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:33idjcgm6g6sfmpr33ssa6jn00@google.com
CREATED:20110726T203533Z
DESCRIPTION:Our slow little group will be riding again this coming Saturday
 \, 8 a.m.\, parking lot across from the Woodlawn Shelter at Bryan Park Pool
 . We will do the same Muscatatuck route that we did last week. If you don't
  want to do the hills in Bloomington\, feel free to pick up with us in Casc
 ades Park when we roll through the golf course\, OR you can pick up with us
  at the Water Treatment Facility on Bottom Road. I don't know that you can 
 "officially" park there\, but it is closed and there is a space you could. 
 I doubt you would be towed (but I won't pay the fee if you are ...) We will
  bike 10-12 mph\, give or take as needed and you won't be dropped. I think 
 the total miles are around 24. Someone will hang with you and encourage you
  to keep pedaling. If you've been afraid to ride with a group because of yo
 ur abilities\, come on out and try to improve with us. Bring plenty of wate
 r. It is hot and the humidity is high.
LAST-MODIFIED:20230110T181412Z
LOCATION:Parking\, Woodlawn Shelter\, Bryan Park @ 39.155693\, -86.522416
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Slow Spokes
TRANSP:OPAQUE
CATEGORIES:http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#event
END:VEVENT
