DESCRIPTION:This ride will wander through Bloomington on lightly travelled 
 streets to get up to Griffey Lake.  Then we will go down fire station hill\
 , something we haven't done recently.  We will get to see Boltinghouse Hill
  and those that want a challenge are welcome to climb it.  The rest of us w
 ill climb out of the valley up Lentz Hill and return to town on Hwy 45.\n\n
 See map at:  http://www.trimbleoutdoors.com/ViewTrip.aspx?tripID=451203&mod
 e=TripMap
