DESCRIPTION:Tues/Thurs evening training rides. Gather @ Bryan Park for a br
 isk training ride. All are welcome. Average speed 17-19 mph for 30-45 miles
 . Not a no-drop ride but we do stop occasionally to gather-we try not to le
 ave anyone out there.\n\nLast training ride of the season-Daylight Saving T
 ime over at end of month-see you next year!
