DTSTART:20120211T000000Z
DTEND:20120211T020000Z
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:o8kk5q4v8vg60eg9p2aqal9j1s@google.com
CREATED:20120202T012400Z
DESCRIPTION:The Ride Planning Meeting will be held at my house on Friday Fe
 b 10th at 7pm. I live at 4500 Blackstone Ct.\, in Parkridge East. Take 3rd 
 St. east toward Nashville. At the top of the rise before you get to 446\, t
 ake a left onto Parkridge Rd. Follow Parkridge Rd. past Morningside\, the t
 ennis courts and Cambridge\, to Blackstone Ct. on the right. I'm down near 
 the the end of the deadend street\, on the right.\n\nThere are a number of 
 things to be discussed at the meeting\, but the main purpose is to set the 
 Saturday touring ride calendar for the season\, and to assign leaders for t
 hese rides as much as possible. We will discuss the rides for OWLS\, FOWLS 
 and the women's specific training rides\, as well as the traditional traini
 ng ride. We will get to talk about the new UnRides that will be on the cale
 ndar\, and many other things!\n\nPlease join us for this annual event. Ther
 e will be refreshments (beer) and snacks\, and good company!\n\nMike Finger
LAST-MODIFIED:20230110T182151Z
LOCATION:4500 Blackstone Ct.
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Ride Planning Meeting
TRANSP:OPAQUE
CATEGORIES:http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#event
END:VEVENT
