CREATED:20120217T024845Z
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy a hardy breakfast at McCormick's Creek on Memorial Day.  
 A short ride will start at 8:30am  Ellettsville Grade School\, while the lo
 nger ride will start at 8am at Bryan Park. Another option is for folks who 
 want to go slower to start a group at 7:30am from Bryan Park. Hopefully\, w
 e'll all meet up for grub at the same time!  Bring your state park pass and
 /or $ for admission and breakfast. Leader: Allan Edmonds. Contact him with 
 any questions at allan.edmonds@gmail.com.\n\nWe'll follow the basic <a href
 ="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/private/BBCMaps/map_pack_2/mccormicks_c
 reek_breakfast.pdf">Club Map</a>\, going in an out of town on the B-Line.
LAST-MODIFIED:20230110T182016Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park for long ride / Ellettsville Grade School\, Reeves Rd f
 or short ride @ 39.232160\, -86.642964
