CREATED:20100208T035107Z
DESCRIPTION:The A route is McVille\, Newark\, & Solsberry. There's pie at R
 osie's\, YooHoo's at YoHo's\, and a good Scottish name in MacVille for you 
 clans that want to slow down and enjoy.  No leader has stepped up.<br><br>\
 n\nShort 40 miles\, Long 45 miles\, <a href="http://www.bloomingtonbicyclec
 lub.org/private/BBCMaps/map_pack_2/mcville_newark_solsberry.pdf">Ride Map</
 a><br><br>\n\nFor the clans up for a challenge\, there's the 70mi B route t
 hat travels down to Cincinnati and Springville.  Then there's my featured 1
 00mi C route that will take you on a heavenly road through Walnut Grove\, o
 n the future I-69 overpass near Kolleen\, and the worst "paved" road of sou
 thern Indiana to Kentucky Ridge\, and finally the pilgrimage to Scotland.<b
 r><br>\n\nThe <a href="http://www.bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/McVilleBC
 .pdf">B and C</a> route. Leader:Jim Schroeder
LAST-MODIFIED:20230110T181900Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot @ 39.15435\,-86.523
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:McVille\, Newark and Solsberry
TRANSP:OPAQUE
CATEGORIES:http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#event
END:VEVENT
