DESCRIPTION:Have you ever noticed the little badges on the\nsleeves of some
  of our recent RAIN jerseys that\nsay “Historic National Road”?\nEver wonde
 r what the National Road was?\n\nJoe Frost\, Executive Director of the Indi
 ana\nNational Road Association\, will give a\npresentation on the history t
 he National Road\n(US 40 - the RAIN Route) from Terre Haute to\nRichmond.  
 Greg Midgley of the National Road\nHeritage Trail\, Inc.\, (NRHT) will also
  provide\nan update on the National Road Heritage Trail\ninitiative.\n\nNRH
 T supports Indiana's first cross-state multi-use\ntrail project\, envisione
 d to stretch 150 miles from\nTerre Haute to Richmond.
LAST-MODIFIED:20230110T181658Z
