DESCRIPTION:This is a short (22 mile) early season route around\nthe legend
 ary hill on Boltinghouse Road.  We'll ride\nthe route counter clockwise and
  make a stop at the\nbottom of the hill.  Those who want can get a\nmeasure
  of their Winter conditioning by doing a\nshort up and back to the top of t
 he hill.  This is fun\nto do early and late in the season to measure\nyour 
 progress.\n\nTwo longer options\, 27 and 36 miles\, will be\navailable.\n\n
 <a href="http://www.bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/private/BBCMaps/map_pack_1/a
 bc.pdf">Basic Ride Map PDF</a>\n<a href="http://ridewithgps.com/routes/9570
 52">Basic Ride Map GPS</a>\n<a href="http://ridewithgps.com/routes/1000073"
 >Ride Map 27 mile GPS</a>\n<a href="http://ridewithgps.com/routes/1000066">
 Ride Map 36 mile GPS</a>
