DESCRIPTION:The OWLS (Older or Wiser or a Little Slower) group is dedicated
  to training and touring rides at a moderate rate\, typically in the 13-14 
 mph range. We keep an eye on each other. We take time to enjoy the scenery\
 , even stop to take a picture. Week day rides will typically be in the 20-2
 5 mile range.\n\nEmail bbcowls@me.com for more information.\n\nfor the map\
 , go to: \nhttp://www.mapmyride.com/ride/united-states/in/bloomington/69812
 3880879552849
