UID:87ij495mak18b1ai2sionaobp1_R20220726T133000@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20220809T093000
CREATED:20220103T154704Z
DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><u></u><u></u><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/route
 s/40500734" id="ow984" __is_owner="true">Ellettsville-Karst-Fullerton</a> 2
 8 miles<br><u></u><br><u></u>Watch the calendar for weather-related updates
  and for future rides.&nbsp\;<ul><li>Be SAFE. Don't blow through stop signs
 . Consider bike lights.<br></li><li>Be COURTEOUS: Single up in traffic<br><
 /li><li>Be PREDICTABLE: Signal your intentions to cars and fellow riders.</
 li></ul>This branch of the OWLS training group also emphasizes somewhat slo
 wer\, moderate rides\, and a route planned in advance that is posted on the
  ride calendar. This is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride. Expect 
 an overall average moving speed 11 - 15 mph including hills. Distances vary
  from 20 to 30 miles. Early season rides will be somewhat shorter and slowe
 r.During cold weather the ride departs at 1:30pm.<br><br>Non-members should
  sign up for a&nbsp\;<a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_inform
 ation.php?event_id=136627">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to three
  rides\, and which includes electronically signing a liability waiver\,&nbs
 p\;prior to participation.<br><br>Questions? Contact&nbsp\;<a href="mailto:
 allan.edmonds@gmail.com">Allan Edmonds</a><u></u><u></u><u></u></html-blob>
LAST-MODIFIED:20221006T224643Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Parking Lot\, S Woodlawn Ave\, Bloomington\, IN 47401\,
  USA
SEQUENCE:3
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Early Birds - Ellettsville-Karst-Fullerton
TRANSP:OPAQUE
