DESCRIPTION:SIC's annual double century with this year's route going southw
 est to Odon\, Washington\, Vincennes\, Linton\, Clay City\, and Spencer.  I
 f only 100 miles is feasible\, pair up with another\, and help sag when not
  riding.  The doublers will pay for your gas.  Or drive to Odon at the Esse
 n Haus  and meet the doublers at 9am.  I have a very easy 93 miler that fol
 lows the double century for 80 miles before returning to Odon.  Questions\,
  e-mail jimmyschweb@gmail.com
