DESCRIPTION:Training rides allow participants to challenge\nthemselves in p
 ace lines with other strong riders.\nParticipants work to build speed and e
 ndurance.\nNo route sweep is provided\, so riders are\nexpected to keep up 
 with the group or be\nfamiliar with the area roads.  Participants\ndetermin
 e routes on the evening of the ride.\n\nPace: 17 mph + with sprints probabl
 e.\nRoutes up to 40 miles\ndepending on availability of light.
