UID:87ij495mak18b1ai2sionaobp1_R20220726T133000@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20220811T093000
CREATED:20220103T154704Z
DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><u></u><u></u>Short route: <a href="https://ridewith
 gps.com/routes/38530724" id="ow555" __is_owner="true">Griffy-Down Myers</a>
  17 miles</html-blob><br><html-blob>Long option: <a href="https://ridewithg
 ps.com/routes/40234715" id="ow571" __is_owner="true">Griffy-Shuffle</a> 29 
 miles<br><u></u><br><u></u>Watch the calendar for weather-related updates a
 nd for future rides.&nbsp\;<ul><li>Be SAFE. Don't blow through stop signs. 
 Consider bike lights.<br></li><li>Be COURTEOUS: Single up in traffic<br></l
 i><li>Be PREDICTABLE: Signal your intentions to cars and fellow riders.</li
 ></ul>This branch of the OWLS training group also emphasizes somewhat slowe
 r\, moderate rides\, and a route planned in advance that is posted on the r
 ide calendar. This is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride. Expect an
  overall average moving speed 11 - 15 mph including hills. Distances vary f
 rom 20 to 30 miles. Early season rides will be somewhat shorter and slower.
 During cold weather the ride departs at 1:30pm.<br><br>Non-members should s
 ign up for a&nbsp\;<a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_informat
 ion.php?event_id=136627">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to three r
 ides\, and which includes electronically signing a liability waiver\,&nbsp\
 ;prior to participation.<br><br>Questions? Contact&nbsp\;<a href="mailto:al
 lan.edmonds@gmail.com">Allan Edmonds</a><u></u><u></u><u></u></html-blob>
LAST-MODIFIED:20221006T224643Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Parking Lot\, S Woodlawn Ave\, Bloomington\, IN 47401\,
  USA
SEQUENCE:3
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Early Birds - Griffy and Beyond
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
