BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20221106T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20221106T140000
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:76goke0o1n3k5j8qk81fu0sg83@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20221105T100000
CREATED:20220901T172010Z
DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><u></u><br>Let's kick off the Saturday Winter rides 
 with a bang. (Moved to Sunday this week due to better weather)<br><br>Join 
 in for a fun Brown County gravel ride starting and ending at Hard Truth in 
 Nashville.&nbsp\; This is a loop ride borrowed from Jeff Fetterer and has i
 ts fair share of ups and downs.&nbsp\; With the exception of Covered Bridge
  Road the clockwise loop generally goes down the steep grades and up the ge
 ntler grades.&nbsp\; Get to near the top of Bear Wallow Hill without ever b
 eing on Bear Wallow Hill Road. And\, finish up with a great gravel decent o
 n Wallow Hollow.<br><br>Route is entirely gravel and pavement&nbsp\;- no tr
 ail.&nbsp\;<br><br>Shorter options are possible&nbsp\;<br><br><a href="http
 s://ridewithgps.com/routes/31648043"><u>Jeff's Salmeron / Wallow Hollow Loo
 p from Hard Truth 29</u></a><br><p>These rides feature gravel roads\, singl
 e and double track trails\,&nbsp\; and just enough pavement to string the a
 forementioned together into fun\, woodsy adventure loops.&nbsp\; Rides begi
 n at 10am through the Fall and Winter months as weather allows and typicall
 y last about three to four hours.</p><p>Routes are suitable for mountain bi
 ke or gravel bike\, with some more turned to one or the other.&nbsp\; Rides
  begin at different locations\, primarily associated with Yellowwood State 
 Forest\, Brown County State Park\, and the Hoosier National Forest in Monro
 e\, Lawrence\, and Brown Counties. &nbsp\;Specific routes may be dictated b
 y weather conditions\, but starting locations\, route maps\, and gps file l
 inks will be posted here in advance.</p><p>Expect a lot of trees and few ca
 rs.</p><u></u></html-blob>
LAST-MODIFIED:20221103T130425Z
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Jeff's Salmeron - Wallow Hollow Loop from Hard Truth - Off Road Adv
 enture
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
