DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:87ij495mak18b1ai2sionaobp1_R20220726T133000@google.com
CREATED:20220103T154704Z
DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><u></u>Rider Choice.<br><u></u><br><u></u>Watch the 
 calendar for weather-related updates and for future rides.&nbsp\;<ul><li>Be
  SAFE. Don't blow through stop signs. Consider bike lights.<br></li><li>Be 
 COURTEOUS: Single up in traffic<br></li><li>Be PREDICTABLE: Signal your int
 entions to cars and fellow riders.</li></ul>This branch of the OWLS trainin
 g group also emphasizes somewhat slower\, moderate rides\, and a route plan
 ned in advance that is posted on the ride calendar. This is a no drop ride\
 , but not a beginner's ride. Expect an overall average moving speed 11 - 15
  mph including hills. Distances vary from 20 to 30 miles. Early season ride
 s will be somewhat shorter and slower.During cold weather the ride departs 
 at 1:30pm.<br><br>Non-members should sign up for a&nbsp\;<a href="https://s
 ecure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=136627">free trial m
 embership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronica
 lly signing a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.<br><br>Quest
 ions? Contact&nbsp\;<a href="mailto:allan.edmonds@gmail.com">Allan Edmonds<
 /a><u></u><u></u></html-blob>
LAST-MODIFIED:20221006T224643Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Parking Lot\, S Woodlawn Ave\, Bloomington\, IN 47401\,
  USA
