DESCRIPTION:Back 2 School RIde is an annual one day\, 25\, 50\, and double 
 metric century (124 Miles) family-oriented bicycle ride. Riders will tour s
 ome of the most scenic areas of Jackson County on this gently rolling hill 
 ride. Organized by the Jackson County Bicycle CLub\, monies raised will be 
 used to finance the B2 Scholarship fund.\nFees\nIndividual $20.00 per perso
 n ($25.00 after 8/7/2008) Family $40.00 Student $15.00\nAddress\nSeymour Hi
 gh School Pool Parking Area\n1350 W. 2nd Street
