BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20220830T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20220830T123000
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:87ij495mak18b1ai2sionaobp1_R20220726T133000@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20220830T093000
CREATED:20220103T154704Z
DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><p><u><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/398956
 34">Down the Dam Hill and Back Ketcham</a></u> 33 miles.</p><p>Cut across o
 n Smithville Road for a short option that does a version of the reverse Flu
 ck Mill ride for about 24 miles.</p><u></u><br><u></u>Watch the calendar fo
 r weather-related updates and for future rides.&nbsp\;<ul><li>Be SAFE. Don'
 t blow through stop signs. Consider bike lights.<br></li><li>Be COURTEOUS: 
 Single up in traffic<br></li><li>Be PREDICTABLE: Signal your intentions to 
 cars and fellow riders.</li></ul>This branch of the OWLS training group als
 o emphasizes somewhat slower\, moderate rides\, and a route planned in adva
 nce that is posted on the ride calendar. This is a no drop ride\, but not a
  beginner's ride. Expect an overall average moving speed 11 - 15 mph includ
 ing hills. Distances vary from 20 to 30 miles. Early season rides will be s
 omewhat shorter and slower.During cold weather the ride departs at 1:30pm.<
 br><br>Non-members should sign up for a&nbsp\;<a href="https://secure.getme
 registered.com/get_information.php?event_id=136627">free trial membership</
 a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing
  a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participation.<br><br>Questions? Conta
 ct&nbsp\;<a href="mailto:allan.edmonds@gmail.com">Allan Edmonds</a><u></u><
 u></u><u></u></html-blob>
LAST-MODIFIED:20221006T224643Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Parking Lot\, S Woodlawn Ave\, Bloomington\, IN 47401\,
  USA
SEQUENCE:3
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Early Birds - Down the Dam Hill
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
