UID:76goke0o1n3k5j8qk81fu0sg83@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20221231T100000
CREATED:20220901T172010Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>Shorter ride this week for those who want to welcome in 2023
  and start the New year off with a ride.&nbsp\;&nbsp\;</p><p>We will start/
 finish at Yellowwood Dam and head out Green Valley and Oak Grove.&nbsp\; Th
 ere's a couple of punchy climbs as we make it Almost to Helmsburg before he
 ading back down through Yellowwood to the dam.</p><p><a href="https://ridew
 ithgps.com/routes/41503561" id="ow1045" __is_owner="true">Almost Helmsburg<
 /a></p><p>These rides feature gravel roads\, single and double track trails
 \,&nbsp\; and just enough pavement to string the aforementioned together in
 to fun\, woodsy adventure loops.&nbsp\; Rides begin at 10am through the Fal
 l and Winter months as weather allows and typically last about three to fou
 r hours.</p><p>Routes are suitable for mountain bike or gravel bike\, with 
 some more turned to one or the other.&nbsp\; Rides begin at different locat
 ions\, primarily associated with Yellowwood State Forest\, Brown County Sta
 te Park\, and the Hoosier National Forest in Monroe\, Lawrence\, and Brown 
 Counties. &nbsp\;Specific routes may be dictated by weather conditions\, bu
 t starting locations\, route maps\, and gps file links will be posted here 
 in advance.</p><p>Expect a lot of trees and few cars.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20221231T004642Z
SEQUENCE:3
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Almost to Helmsburg - Off Road Adventure
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
