DESCRIPTION:This Nice and Easy Ride will join the BBC Advocacy I-69 Comment
  Education Ride.<br><br>WE WILL MEET AT A DIFFERENT LOCATION\, the parking 
 lot of the Clear Creek Bike Trail at That Road.<br><br><a href="http://www.
 gmap-pedometer.com/?r=4043622">Gmap of Ride</a><br><br>This is a ride to pr
 epare members to make informed comments to the I-69 Study in order to mitig
 ate or improve the conditions for cycling in S.W. Monroe County to the best
  of our ability.<br><br>Ride leader Jean Smith<br>jean@bikesmiths.net<br>BB
 C representative to the I-69 Citizen Advisory Commission section 4<br><br>M
 aps of the proposed closures and grade separated crossings<br>are on the <a
  href="http://www.bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/advocacy.php">BBC Advocacy Pag
 e</a>.
