CREATED:20110826T124843Z
DESCRIPTION:Parking lot across from the Woodlawn Shelter  at Bryan Park \n\
 nWe will bike to Cascades\, out Kinser\,  across Bottom Rd. and then ventur
 e part way up Mt. Pleasant. Feel free to start at the park\, or pick up wit
 h us in Cascades by the lot next to the golf course on the right.  Faster r
 iders are free to bike ahead and loop back in order to work on speed and to
  get in more miles. Slower riders will have someone hanging with them throu
 ghout the right\, although that person will switch off with someone else fr
 om time to time. We all tend to take turns mixing up so we can socialize wh
 ile we ride\, but you won't be left alone out there.\n\nDonna Getts\ngettsf
 amily@bluemarble.net
LAST-MODIFIED:20230110T182606Z
LOCATION:Parking\, Woodlawn Shelter\, Bryan Park @ 39.155693\, -86.522416
