CREATED:20220901T172010Z
DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><p>Shorter ride this week for those who want to burn
  off some Turkey.&nbsp\; We will start/finish at Yellowwood Dam and head ou
 t Green Valley and Oak Grove.&nbsp\; There's a couple of punchy climbs as w
 e make it Almost to Helmsburg before heading back down through Yellowwood t
 o the dam.</p><p>Hopefully this is the last busy hunting weekend.</p><p><a 
 href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/41503561" id="ow896" __is_owner="true"
 >Almost to Helmsburg</a><br></p><p>These rides feature gravel roads\, singl
 e and double track trails\,&nbsp\; and just enough pavement to string the a
 forementioned together into fun\, woodsy adventure loops.&nbsp\; Rides begi
 n at 10am through the Fall and Winter months as weather allows and typicall
 y last about three to four hours.</p><p>Routes are suitable for mountain bi
 ke or gravel bike\, with some more turned to one or the other.&nbsp\; Rides
  begin at different locations\, primarily associated with Yellowwood State 
 Forest\, Brown County State Park\, and the Hoosier National Forest in Monro
 e\, Lawrence\, and Brown Counties. &nbsp\;Specific routes may be dictated b
 y weather conditions\, but starting locations\, route maps\, and gps file l
 inks will be posted here in advance.</p><p>Expect a lot of trees and few ca
 rs.</p></html-blob>
LAST-MODIFIED:20221125T163205Z
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Almost to Helmsburg - Off Road Adventure
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
