DESCRIPTION:Saturday's Ride is the Home on the Range Ride-- so called becau
 se we might catch a glimpse of buffalo roaming. I am told the skies will no
 t be cloudy all day. Please note\, no discouraging words will be tolerated.
 <br><br>The ride is also known as EllStiGoSpeWhi because the route takes us
  through those communities: Ellettsville\, Stinesville\, Gosport\, Spencer 
 and Whitehall. Major climbs include TX Ridge\, Freeman out of Spencer and t
 he Whitehall hill. It also features a lovely stretch on Rocky Hill Road. Th
 e closing of Vernal and Woodyard force us to use an Arlington/46 detour hea
 ding out and a southern detour on Oard/Kirby & That to return to the park.<
 br><br>I will bring paper maps but here's a link to the approximately 63 mi
 le route on Map My Ride:<br><br><a href="http://www.mapmyride.com/ride/unit
 ed-states/in/bloomington/879128097487422909">Home on the Range Ride</a><br>
 <br>See you Saturday at 8:00 a.m. at Bryan Park.<br><br>Jennifer Miers
LAST-MODIFIED:20230110T182046Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot @ 39.15435\,-86.523
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Home on the Rocky Hill Range (Ellstigospewhi)   Leader:Jen Miers
TRANSP:OPAQUE
CATEGORIES:http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#event
END:VEVENT
