DESCRIPTION:<html-blob>Joe's suggestion!</html-blob><br><html-blob><a href=
 "https://ridewithgps.com/routes/40916709" id="ow557" __is_owner="true">Out 
 Rockport Back Ketcham</a> 30 miles with lots of new pavement</html-blob><br
 ><html-blob>A possible short option turns off of Rockport on Victor. Maybe 
 22 miles.</html-blob><br><html-blob>Note: Allan can't be there.<br><u></u><
 br><u></u>Watch the calendar for weather-related updates and for future rid
 es.&nbsp\;<ul><li>Be SAFE. Don't blow through stop signs. Consider bike lig
 hts.<br></li><li>Be COURTEOUS: Single up in traffic<br></li><li>Be PREDICTA
 BLE: Signal your intentions to cars and fellow riders.</li></ul>This branch
  of the OWLS training group also emphasizes somewhat slower\, moderate ride
 s\, and a route planned in advance that is posted on the ride calendar. Thi
 s is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride. Expect an overall average 
 moving speed 11 - 15 mph including hills. Distances vary from 20 to 30 mile
 s. Early season rides will be somewhat shorter and slower.During cold weath
 er the ride departs at 1:30pm.<br><br>Non-members should sign up for a&nbsp
 \;<a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=
 136627">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which 
 includes electronically signing a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to partici
 pation.<br><br>Questions? Contact&nbsp\;<a href="mailto:allan.edmonds@gmail
 .com">Allan Edmonds</a><u></u><u></u><u></u></html-blob>
LAST-MODIFIED:20221006T224643Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Parking Lot\, S Woodlawn Ave\, Bloomington\, IN 47401\,
  USA
SEQUENCE:3
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Early Birds - Rockport-Ketcham
TRANSP:OPAQUE
