DESCRIPTION:The Bloomington Bicycle Club and Bloomington Parks & Rec invite
  everyone out for a special Nice n Easy ride to celebrate Bikes Week.\n\nNi
 ce N Easy rides cater to those who want to take it easy and to beginning ri
 ders. These Sunday rides feature lower mileage (19-25 miles) and slower pac
 es. They use Bloomington area low traffic roads.\n\n<a href="http://www.blo
 omingtonbicycleclub.org/niceneasy/?5">West Side Map</a>.
