DESCRIPTION:Route: <a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/45863240" target
 ="_blank">East Side</a> 21 miles<br>Host: Chris Hahn<br><br>Meet at the spr
 ay pad area at Switchyard Park for a 1:00pm departure.<br><br>Nice 'n' Easy
  rides cater to those who want to take it easy and to less experienced ride
 rs.  These Sunday rides feature lower mileage (19-24 miles) and slower pace
 s than Saturday touring rides.  They use Bloomington area low traffic roads
 .<br><br>Non-members should\, prior to participation\, sign up for a <a hre
 f="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=137889" 
 target="_blank">free trial membership</a>\, which includes electronically s
 igning a liability waiver.
