BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20230523T174500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20230523T204500
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:1v04bd50vmk9nh42ouber307fk@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20230523T174500
CREATED:20230518T113658Z
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/39128503">26 - Reverse 
 Harmony Bridge (up Victor)</a><br><br>Please observe social distancing norm
 s as we gather and ride. <ul><li>Be SAFE. Don't blow through stop signs. Co
 nsider bike lights.<br></li><li>Be COURTEOUS: Single up in traffic<br></li>
 <li>Be PREDICTABLE: Signal your intentions to cars and fellow riders.</li><
 /ul>The "Older\, Wiser\, and a Little Slower" training group emphasizes mod
 erate rides\, and a route planned in advance that is posted on the ride cal
 endar. This is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride.The OWLS group we
 lcomes a wide range of intermediate riders\, and typically breaks off into 
 a faster and slower group with the former averaging an overall moving speed
  of 16-18 mph\, and the slower group averaging 13-15 mph (including hills).
  Distances vary from 20 to 30 miles\, depending partly on available light. 
 Early season rides will be somewhat shorter and slower. Rides depart prompt
 ly at 5:45.<br><br>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure
 .getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=136627"><u>free trial mem
