 ewithgps.com/routes/49970437" target="_blank">32 Baldy + Berry Ridge</a><br
 ></p><p>These rides feature gravel roads\, single and double track trails\,
   and just enough pavement to string the aforementioned together into fun\,
  woodsy adventure loops.  Rides begin at 10am through the Fall and Winter m
 onths as weather allows and typically last about four hours. </p><p>Routes 
 are suitable for mountain bike or gravel bike\, with some more turned to on
 e or the other.  Rides begin at different locations\, primarily associated 
 with Yellowwood State Forest\, Brown County State Park\, and the Hoosier Na
 tional Forest in Monroe\, Lawrence\, and Brown Counties. Specific routes ma
 y be dictated by weather conditions\, but starting locations\, route maps\,
  and gps file links will be posted here in advance.</p><p>Expect a lot of t
 rees and few cars</p><p>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://s
 ecure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=136627" target="_bla
 nk">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which incl
 udes electronically signing a liability waiver\, prior to participation.</p
 >
