BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART:20220528T140000Z
DTEND:20220528T190000Z
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:1v7eanvdo6g9dtjn9ueom35v96@google.com
CREATED:20230217T204246Z
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=http://bloomingtonbicycle
 club.org/maps/John_Bassett_Maps/Best_Ride_in_Indiana_Story_Option_61.pdf&am
 p\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw3wyl34KLrH7Vj8WC455V
 c3" target="_blank">Best Ride in Indiana Story Option 61</a><a></a><br><br>
 <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://ridewithgps.com/routes/237544
 2&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw1vR2bC0VUZxVmIbS
 BTBTas" target="_blank">GPS Files</a><br><br>This 61 mile route in Eastern 
 Brown and Western Bartholomew Counties was listed as the “Best Ride in Indi
 ana” in the September 2012 issue of Bicycling Magazine.<br><br>“You can rid
 e 50 miles and see 10 cars total\, and you can start and finish at Dag’s\, 
 a great ice-cream shop with unique flavors. Try persimmon\, heavenly hash\,
  or a concoction called coffee and brownies.”<br><br>You be the judge on th
 e ride and the ice cream !<br><br>The ice cream place is now closed\, but t
 his is still a fun adventure. The route is a figure-of-eight crossing at Pi
 ke’s Peak in eastern Brown County.  It is revised from the original route d
 ue to the closing of Crouch&#39\;s Market in Pike&#39\;s Peak.   Instead\, 
 we will loop westward to Story for a rest stop at Story Inn.  Alternatively
 \, you can delete the south part of the figure-of-eight which gives a nice 
 short option of about 38 miles.<br><br>This is a drive and ride. Ride will 
 depart at 10:00 from the Jay C on the west side of Columbus.<br><br>Non-mem
 bers should sign up for a <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://sec
 ure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id%3D133776&amp\;sa=D&amp
 \;source=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw3GbYvb23GQBjLpGGmQG_fq" target=
 "_blank">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which
  includes electronically signing a liability waiver\, prior to participatio
 n.  
LAST-MODIFIED:20230217T204246Z
LOCATION:Jay C Parking Lot\, Columbus\, IN @ 39.200238\, -85.9722
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Best Ride in Indiana: Leader: Jeremy Schott
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
