DESCRIPTION:<p><a href="https://www.strava.com/routes/2912194098535143654">
 <u>31 Robinson\, Tunnel\, Shuffle\, Brummett</u></a><br></p><p>Ready for a 
 high spirited ride? BV Ride is an intermediate/ advanced ride and moderate 
 distance that may or may not include regrouping points.  Pace is anticipate
 d to be 17+ mph. Expect occasional sprint or Strava segments\, pace line ri
 ding at high speed\, intervals\, and fewer regrouping stops.</p><p>The BV R
 ide will start at the Parking lot across from the Bryan Park Pool on Woodla
 wn at 5:45. Mileages will increase as the season progresses. If you keep co
 ming we will make you faster!</p><p>Riders are expected to look out for eac
 h other during the rides.  Ride maps and GPS links will be posted here in a
 dvance. Riders unfamiliar with the route should bring along a copy of the m
 ap.</p>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregist
 ered.com/get_information.php?event_id=133776">free trial membership</a>\, g
 ood for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing a lia
 bility waiver\, prior to participation.
LAST-MODIFIED:20230123T003301Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool\, 1020 S Woodlawn Ave\, Bloomington\, IN 47401\, U
 SA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:  BV ride 31 Robinson\, Tunnel\, Shuffle\, Brummett
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
