CREATED:20231017T184315Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>Hello Everyone.</p><p>I modified one of Indiana Jim's routes
  to take in Cataract Falls and we can also checkout the Covered Bridge ther
 e too.</p><p>The ride will start at Owen Putnam State Forest office on Fish
  Creek Road.  The route is about 50/50 pavement/gravel so ride what you've 
 got.  It will be really hard to drive past Civilian Brewing co on the way b
 ack so expect a detour for some food &amp\; refreshments.</p><p><a href="ht
 tps://ridewithgps.com/routes/41874879"><u>Owen Putnam Cataract Falls</u></a
 ></p><p>Jim Powers will be leading this ride - Thanks Jim!!</p><p>These rid
 es feature gravel roads\, single and double track trails\,  and just enough
  pavement to string the aforementioned together into fun\, woodsy adventure
  loops.  Rides begin at 10am through the Fall and Winter months as weather 
 allows and typically last about three to four hours.</p><p>Routes are suita
 ble for mountain bike or gravel bike\, with some more turned to one or the 
 other.  Rides begin at different locations\, primarily associated with Yell
 owwood State Forest\, Brown County State Park\, and the Hoosier National Fo
 rest in Monroe\, Lawrence\, and Brown Counties.  Specific routes may be dic
 tated by weather conditions\, but starting locations\, route maps\, and gps
  file links will be posted here in advance.</p><p>Expect a lot of trees and
  few cars</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20231113T110908Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Owen Putnam Cataract Falls - Off Road Adventure Ride
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
