  back to the hunters checkin.</p><p>Ride is Gravel\, Pavement and easy goin
 g double track so ride what you've got.</p><p><a href="https://ridewithgps.
 com/routes/41804872">Jackass Out Sewel Back</a><br></p><p>These rides featu
 re gravel roads\, single and double track trails\,  and just enough pavemen
 t to string the aforementioned together into fun\, woodsy adventure loops. 
  Rides begin at 6PM through the Fall and Winter months as weather allows an
 d typically last about two hours.  Lights are mandatory as we enter the Fal
 l and Winter seasons.</p><p>Routes are suitable for mountain bike or gravel
  bike\, with some more turned to one or the other.  Rides begin at differen
 t locations\, primarily associated with Yellowwood State Forest\, Brown Cou
 nty State Park\, and the Hoosier National Forest in Monroe\, Lawrence\, and
  Brown Counties.  Specific routes may be dictated by weather conditions\, b
 ut starting locations\, route maps\, and gps file links will be posted here
  in advance.</p><p>Expect a lot of trees and few cars.  </p><u></u>
