DESCRIPTION:Training Ride-Route to be determined by assembled riders before
  setting out-this is not a no-drop ride\, though we will stop @ several pre
 determined points to allow everyone to gather. Many rides will feature bris
 k\, pace-line riding. Average speeds will vary from around 16mph up to the 
 high 19mph range depending on how we feel and where we go. Distances range 
 from the high 20mi to mid 40mi range depending on the season. Get on your b
 ikes and ride!!
