DESCRIPTION:<u></u><u></u><p><a href="https://www.strava.com/routes/3134178
 540357395648">32 Fairfax Strain Ridge Popcorn Rockport Victor</a><br></p><p
 ><br></p><p>Ready for a high spirited ride? BV Ride is an intermediate/ adv
 anced ride and moderate distance that may or may not include regrouping poi
 nts.  Pace is anticipated to be 17+ mph. Expect occasional sprint or Strava
  segments\, pace line riding at high speed\, intervals\, and fewer regroupi
 ng stops.</p><p>The BV Ride will start at the Parking lot across from the B
 ryan Park Pool on Woodlawn at 5:45. Mileages will increase as the season pr
 ogresses. If you keep coming we will make you faster!</p><p>Riders are expe
 cted to look out for each other during the rides.  Ride maps and GPS links 
 will be posted here in advance. Riders unfamiliar with the route should bri
 ng along a copy of the map.</p>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="ht
 tps://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=133776">free 
 trial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes elec
 tronically signing a liability waiver\, prior to participation.<u></u><u></
 u>
LAST-MODIFIED:20230905T162945Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool\, 1020 S Woodlawn Ave\, Bloomington\, IN 47401\, U
 SA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:BV ride - 32 Fairfax Strain Ridge Popcorn Rockport Victor
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
