DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/47229482">27 - OWLS Two
  Creeks\,  without the Lake</a><br><br><b>I ride extension</b>:  32 - Two C
 reeks and Shilo<br><br><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/47267558">ht
 tps://ridewithgps.com/routes/47267558</a><br><br><br>Non-members should sig
 n up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?
 event_id=136627" target="_blank"><u><u>free trial membership</u></u></a>\, 
 good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing a li
 ability waiver\, prior to participation.<ul><li>Be SAFE. Don't blow through
  stop signs. Consider bike lights.<br></li><li>Be COURTEOUS: Single up in t
 raffic<br></li><li>Be PREDICTABLE: Signal your intentions to cars and fello
 w riders.</li></ul>The "Older\, Wiser\, and a Little Slower" training group
  emphasizes moderate rides\, and a route planned in advance that is posted 
 on the ride calendar. This is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride.Th
 e OWLS group welcomes a wide range of intermediate riders\, and typically b
 reaks off into a faster and slower group with the former averaging an overa
 ll moving speed of 16-18 mph\, and the slower group averaging 13-15 mph (in
 cluding hills). Distances vary from 20 to 30 miles\, depending partly on av
 ailable light. Early season rides will be somewhat shorter and slower. Ride
 s depart promptly at 5:45.<br><br>Questions? Contact <a href="mailto:gail.m
 orell@gmail.com" target="_blank"><u>Gail Morell</u></a>.
LAST-MODIFIED:20250220T145623Z
LOCATION:Sherwood Oaks Christian Church\, 2700 E Rogers Rd\, Bloomington\, 
 IN 47401\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:OWLS Ride - 27 OWLS Two Creeks\, without the Lake 
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
