DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/John
 _Bassett_Maps/Best_Ride_in_Indiana_Story_Option_61.pdf">Best Ride in Indian
 a Story Option 61</a><a></a><br><br><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes
 /2375442">GPS Files</a><br><br>This 61 mile route in Eastern Brown and&nbsp
 \;Western Bartholomew Counties was&nbsp\;listed as the “Best Ride in Indian
 a” in the&nbsp\;September 2012 issue of Bicycling&nbsp\;Magazine.<br><br>“Y
 ou can ride 50 miles and see 10 cars&nbsp\;total\, and you can start and fi
 nish at Dag’s\,&nbsp\;a great ice-cream shop with unique flavors.&nbsp\;Try
  persimmon\, heavenly hash\, or a&nbsp\;concoction called coffee and browni
 es.”<br><br>You be the judge on the ride and the&nbsp\;ice cream !<br><br>T
 he ice cream place is now closed\, but this is still a fun adventure.&nbsp\
 ;The route is a figure-of-eight crossing at&nbsp\;Pike’s Peak in eastern Br
 own County.&nbsp\; It is&nbsp\;revised from the original route due to the c
 losing&nbsp\;of Crouch's Market in Pike's Peak.&nbsp\; &nbsp\;Instead\, we 
 will&nbsp\;loop westward to Story for a rest stop at Story Inn.&nbsp\; Alte
 rnatively\, you can delete the south part of the figure-of-eight which give
 s a nice short option of about 38&nbsp\;miles.<br><br>This is a drive and r
 ide. Ride will depart at&nbsp\;10:00 from the Jay C on the west side of&nbs
 p\;Columbus.<br><br>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secur
 e.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=136627" id="ow1871" __is
 _owner="true">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and 
 which includes electronically signing a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to p
 articipation.&nbsp\;&nbsp\;</html-blob>
LAST-MODIFIED:20230217T203909Z
LOCATION:Jay C Parking Lot\, Columbus\, IN @ 39.200238\, -85.9722
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Best Ride in Indiana- Leader: TBD
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
