CREATED:20230814T185924Z
DESCRIPTION:This ride starts at Crooked Creek Boat Ramp.<br><br><a href="ht
 tps://ridewithgps.com/routes/10773471">Blue Creek Elkinsville Loop 17 - A b
 ike ride in Brown County\, IN (ridewithgps.com)</a><span><br></span><br>Sui
 table for Gravel or MTB but if you have MTB bring it.<br><br>Bring Lights B
 ring Lights Bring Lights!<br><span><br></span><br><span>These rides feature
  gravel roads\, single and double track trails\,  and just enough pavement 
 to string the aforementioned together into fun\, woodsy adventure loops.  R
 ides begin at 6PM through the Fall and Winter months as weather allows and 
 typically last about two hours.  Lights are mandatory as we enter the Fall 
 and Winter seasons.</span><p>Routes are suitable for mountain bike or grave
 l bike\, with some more turned to one or the other.  Rides begin at differe
 nt locations\, primarily associated with Yellowwood State Forest\, Brown Co
 unty State Park\, and the Hoosier National Forest in Monroe\, Lawrence\, an
 d Brown Counties.  Specific routes may be dictated by weather conditions\, 
 but starting locations\, route maps\, and gps file links will be posted her
 e in advance.</p><p>Expect a lot of trees and few cars</p>
