DESCRIPTION:<p>Shorter ride this week\, I need time to do my hair before th
 e banquet :-)  and it's going to be cold</p><p>Ride starts at the Hunters C
 heckin on East Kent</p><p><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/34871982"
 >Up Sewell and Beyond</a><br></p><p>These rides feature gravel roads\, sing
 le and double track trails\,  and just enough pavement to string the aforem
 entioned together into fun\, woodsy adventure loops.  Rides begin at 10am t
 hrough the Fall and Winter months as weather allows and typically last abou
 t three to four hours.</p><p>Routes are suitable for mountain bike or grave
 l bike\, with some more turned to one or the other.  Rides begin at differe
 nt locations\, primarily associated with Yellowwood State Forest\, Brown Co
 unty State Park\, and the Hoosier National Forest in Monroe\, Lawrence\, an
 d Brown Counties.  Specific routes may be dictated by weather conditions\, 
 but starting locations\, route maps\, and gps file links will be posted her
 e in advance.</p><p>Expect a lot of trees and few cars</p>
