DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/45609200" target="_blan
 k">96 Drive &amp\; Ride Spring Mill to Leavenworth</a><br><u><br></u><br><u
 >Notes onSpring Mill</u><br><p><b>If you haveone\, bring your Indiana State
  Parks pass to get into Spring Mill StatePark.  </b>The Spring Mill Inn is 
 <b>currently closed</b> forrenovations\, and the road to the parking garage
  at the Inn is gated.  Alternative parking is available near the entrancega
 te at the Grissom Memorial\, across from the camp store\, and at the park s
 wimmingpool.  These alternative parking areasare noted on the RWGPS map lin
 ked here.  So we do not impact other park visitors\, Isuggest some of us pa
 rk across from the camp store or in the swimming poollot.  Regardless of wh
 ere you park\, meetat the Grissom parking lot near the park entrance at 9:0
 0AM for the start ofthe ride.</p><p><u>RouteOptions</u></p><p>The full rout
 eis 95 miles from Spring Mill State Park to Leavenworth on the Ohio River a
 ndback to Spring Mill.  Very viable shortoptions are a 64-mile loop down to
  Marengo and back\, or turning west at theShoe Tree over to Pilot Knob for 
 an 81 mile loop.  We checked out both of these short versionslast weekend a
 nd they are both good to go. I have done both\, and will likely do one or t
 he other this year.</p><p>Both shortversions follow the first and last part
 s of the 96-mile route.  The Marengo option misses a lot of hilly ridgecoun
 ty to the south.  Shoe Tree cutoffmisses some big hills on SR 62 up to Leav
 enworth\, but adds a couple getting outof the Blue River Valley up to SR 66
  at Pilot Knob.</p><p>All options getMahan Hill - after your legs are gone 
 - as the last obstacle back to theflat(er) sinkhole plain county.</p><p>Goo
 d refuelstops include:</p><p>·       The Marathon convenience store inHardi
 nsburg at Mile 24.</p><p>·       Maxine’s store in Milltown at Mile37 (96-m
 ile route).  There are publicrest rooms down the hill at the park by the Bl
 ue River canoe rental.</p><p>·       The Marathon or Circle A conveniencest
 ores in Marengo (Mile 34 if you turn back north at Marengo\, or Mile 65 if 
 youdo the whole 96-mile loop to the Ohio River).</p><p>·       The Pilot Su
 bway at I 64 in Carefree(Mile 55 of the 96 mile route)</p>\n\nJoin with Goo
 gle Meet: https://meet.google.com/nak-padf-yci\n\nLearn more about Meet at:
  https://support.google.com/a/users/answer/9282720
LAST-MODIFIED:20240907T120029Z
LOCATION:Spring Mill State Park\, 3333 IN-60 E\, Mitchell\, IN 47446\, USA
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:D&R Spring Mill to Leavenworth - hosted by John Bassett
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
