CREATED:20240228T171318Z
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/39128503" target="_blan
 k">26 - OWLS Reverse Harmony Bridge (up Victor)</a><br><br><b>I Ride Extens
 ion</b>:   33 Up Victor and around Breeden<br><br><a href="https://ridewith
 gps.com/routes/46965487">https://ridewithgps.com/routes/46965487</a><br><br
 >Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.c
 om/get_information.php?event_id=136627" target="_blank"><u><u>free trial me
 mbership</u></u></a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes elec
 tronically signing a liability waiver\, prior to participation.<ul><li>Be S
 AFE. Don't blow through stop signs. Consider bike lights.<br></li><li>Be CO
 URTEOUS: Single up in traffic<br></li><li>Be PREDICTABLE: Signal your inten
 tions to cars and fellow riders.</li></ul>The "Older\, Wiser\, and a Little
  Slower" training group emphasizes moderate rides\, and a route planned in 
 advance that is posted on the ride calendar. This is a no drop ride\, but n
 ot a beginner's ride.The OWLS group welcomes a wide range of intermediate r
 iders\, and typically breaks off into a faster and slower group with the fo
 rmer averaging an overall moving speed of 16-18 mph\, and the slower group 
 averaging 13-15 mph (including hills). Distances vary from 20 to 30 miles\,
  depending partly on available light. Early season rides will be somewhat s
 horter and slower. Rides depart promptly at 5:45.<br><br>Questions? Contact
  <a href="mailto:gail.morell@gmail.com" target="_blank"><u>Gail Morell</u><
 /a>.
LAST-MODIFIED:20250220T145623Z
LOCATION:Sherwood Oaks Christian Church\, 2700 E Rogers Rd\, Bloomington\, 
 IN 47401\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:OWLS Ride - 26  Reverse Harmony Bridge (up Victor)
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
