 g Away Tour 15 miles</a><br>Host: Jim Schroeder<br><br>It's Little 500 week
 end in Bloomington.  Sadly\, there's no showing of Breaking Away at the BCT
  this year\, but you can relive it by joining Jim Schroeder for a bicycle t
 our of selected locations from throughout the film.<br><br>Watch the video 
 the night before - Jim will host it if anyone's interested.<br><br>Meet at 
 the spray pad area at Switchyard Park for a 1:00pm departure.<br><br>Nice '
 n' Easy rides cater to those who want to take it easy and to less experienc
 ed riders.  These Sunday rides feature lower mileage (19-24 miles) and slow
 er paces than Saturday touring rides.  They use Bloomington area low traffi
 c roads.<br><br>Non-members should\, prior to participation\, sign up for a
  <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=1
 37889" target="_blank">free trial membership</a>\, which includes electroni
 cally signing a liability waiver.
