 Slower" training group emphasizes moderate rides\, and a route planned in a
 dvance that is posted on the ride calendar. This is a no drop ride\, but no
 t a beginner's ride.The OWLS group welcomes a wide range of intermediate ri
 ders\, and typically breaks off into a faster and slower group with the for
 mer averaging an overall moving speed of 16-18 mph\, and the slower group a
 veraging 13-15 mph (including hills). Distances vary from 20 to 30 miles\, 
 depending partly on available light. Early season rides will be somewhat sh
 orter and slower. Rides depart promptly at 5:45.<br><br>Questions? Contact 
 <a href="mailto:gail.morell@gmail.com" target="_blank"><u>Gail Morell</u></
 a>.
