DESCRIPTION:<p><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/45610737">Up Sewell 
 and Beyond (copy) · Ride with GPS</a></p><p><br></p><p>These rides feature 
 gravel roads\, single and double track trails\,  and just enough pavement t
 o string the aforementioned together into fun\, woodsy adventure loops.  Ri
 des begin at 10am through the Fall and Winter months as weather allows and 
 typically last about four hours. </p><p>Routes are suitable for mountain bi
 ke or gravel bike\, with some more turned to one or the other.  Rides begin
  at different locations\, primarily associated with Yellowwood State Forest
 \, Brown County State Park\, and the Hoosier National Forest in Monroe\, La
 wrence\, and Brown Counties. Specific routes may be dictated by weather con
 ditions\, but starting locations\, route maps\, and gps file links will be 
 posted here in advance.</p><p>Expect a lot of trees and few cars</p><p>Non-
 members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/ge
 t_information.php?event_id=136627" target="_blank">free trial membership</a
 >\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing 
 a liability waiver\, prior to participation.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20250325T180159Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Up Sewel and Beyond - Growlers Off Road Adventure Ride
TRANSP:OPAQUE
