DESCRIPTION:<u></u><a href="http://www.bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/BBCM
 aps/map_pack_1/nashville_old_hilly.pdf">Hilly Route to Nashville</a><br><br
 ><a href="http://ridewithgps.com/routes/1102778">GPS</a><br><br><a href="ht
 tps://ridewithgps.com/routes/43302756">GPS (2023 edition)</a><br><br>The ri
 de name says it all.  Join this little tour on the back roads over to Nashv
 ille.  The 55 mile option features a white knuckle descent down Lanam Ridge
  Hill and two good climbs up Helmsburg Hill and Bear Wallow Hill.  The 2023
  edition takes advantage of the new surface on Kerr Creek Rd. and reduces t
 he number of miles on 45.  It also goes down Owl Creek instead of Lanam Rid
 ge Hill. The 33 mile short option cuts off all this good stuff.<br><br>Non-
 members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/ge
 t_information.php?event_id=136627">free trial membership</a>\, good for up 
 to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing a liability waiv
 er\, prior to participation.<u></u>
