UID:5633dt5l8ncil6rvsjd3g8bhen@google.com
CREATED:20250408T234819Z
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/49226216" target="_blan
 k">Going Dutch Ridge 20 · Ride with GPS</a><br><br><p>These rides feature g
 ravel roads\, single and double track trails\,  and just enough pavement to
  string the aforementioned together into fun\, woodsy adventure loops.  Rid
 es begin at 6PM through the Fall and Winter months as weather allows and ty
 pically last about two hours. Lights are mandatory as we enter the Fall and
  Winter seasons.</p><p>Routes are suitable for mountain bike or gravel bike
 \, with some more turned to one or the other.  Rides begin at different loc
 ations\, primarily associated with Yellowwood State Forest\, Brown County S
 tate Park\, and the Hoosier National Forest in Monroe\, Lawrence\, and Brow
 n Counties. Specific routes may be dictated by weather conditions\, but sta
 rting locations\, route maps\, and gps file links will be posted here in ad
 vance.</p><p>Expect a lot of trees and few cars</p><p>Non-members should si
 gn up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php
 ?event_id=136627" target="_blank"><u><u>free trial membership</u></u></a>\,
  good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing a l
 iability waiver\, prior to participation.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20250408T234934Z
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Popup Gravel Ride - Going Dutch
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
