DESCRIPTION:If you just can't get enough of The Little 500 (held this year 
 April 20-21)\, then you should come ride the BBC Breaking Away Ride on Sund
 ay\, April 15. It's a nostalgic ride that visits many of the scenes in the 
 classic 1979 movie Breaking Away. Ride by the Dave Stohler house and shout 
 "Refund! Refund!" Many more landmarks will be called out by ride leader Jim
  Schroeder who has seen the movie well over 100 times. The ride is only 31 
 miles and includes one rest stop. See the movie before you go\, then ride t
 he movie rich in local history. See you Sunday at Bryan Park Pool parking l
 ot for a 1:30 p.m. departure. Ciao!\n\n<a href="http://www.bloomingtonbicyc
 leclub.org/maps/Jim%20Schroeder/Breaking_Away.pdf">Breaking Away Ride Map</
 a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20230110T183004Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot @ 39.15435\,-86.523
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Breaking Away Ride
TRANSP:OPAQUE
CATEGORIES:http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#event
END:VEVENT
