 7+ mph. Expect occasional sprint or Strava segments\, pace line riding at h
 igh speed\, intervals\, and fewer regrouping stops.</p><p>The BV Ride will 
 start at the Parking lot across from the Bryan Park Pool on Woodlawn at 5:4
 5. Mileages will increase as the season progresses. If you keep coming we w
 ill make you faster!</p><p>Riders are expected to look out for each other d
 uring the rides.  Ride maps and GPS links will be posted here in advance. R
 iders unfamiliar with the route should bring along a copy of the map.</p>No
 n-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/
 get_information.php?event_id=133776">free trial membership</a>\, good for u
 p to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing a liability wa
 iver\, prior to participation.
