CREATED:20230329T153928Z
DESCRIPTION:<p><br></p><p><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://rid
 ewithgps.com/routes/42354339&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\
 ;usg=AOvVaw2CDFHe--USLOgtJCfQNj7A" target="_blank">Blackwell Loop Up 19 for
  a Change</a><br></p><p>These rides feature gravel roads\, single and doubl
 e track trails\,  and just enough pavement to string the aforementioned tog
 ether into fun\, woodsy adventure loops.  Rides begin at 6PM through the Fa
 ll and Winter months as weather allows and typically last about two hours. 
  Lights are mandatory as we enter the Fall and Winter seasons.</p><p>Routes
  are suitable for mountain bike or gravel bike\, with some more turned to o
 ne or the other.  Rides begin at different locations\, primarily associated
  with Yellowwood State Forest\, Brown County State Park\, and the Hoosier N
 ational Forest in Monroe\, Lawrence\, and Brown Counties.  Specific routes 
 may be dictated by weather conditions\, but starting locations\, route maps
 \, and gps file links will be posted here in advance.</p><p>Expect a lot of
  trees and few cars.  </p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20230329T153928Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Blackwell Loop - Up 19 for a Change - Off Road Adventure Ride
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
