DESCRIPTION:<br><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/42602670">Harmony B
 ridge 2023</a><br><br>Re-mapped due to Rhorer Rd closure<br><br>Please obse
 rve social distancing norms as we gather and ride. <ul><li>Be SAFE. Don't b
 low through stop signs. Consider bike lights.<br></li><li>Be COURTEOUS: Sin
 gle up in traffic<br></li><li>Be PREDICTABLE: Signal your intentions to car
 s and fellow riders.</li></ul>The "Older\, Wiser\, and a Little Slower" tra
 ining group emphasizes moderate rides\, and a route planned in advance that
  is posted on the ride calendar. This is a no drop ride\, but not a beginne
 r's ride.The OWLS group welcomes a wide range of intermediate riders\, and 
 typically breaks off into a faster and slower group with the former averagi
 ng an overall moving speed of 16-18 mph\, and the slower group averaging 13
 -15 mph (including hills). Distances vary from 20 to 30 miles\, depending p
 artly on available light. Early season rides will be somewhat shorter and s
 lower. Rides depart promptly at 5:45.<br><br>Non-members should sign up for
  a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id
 =136627"><u>free trial membership</u></a>\, good for up to three rides\, an
 d which includes electronically signing a liability waiver\, prior to parti
 cipation.<br><br>Questions? Contact <a href="mailto:gail.morell@gmail.com">
 <u>Gail Morell</u></a>.
