 venture loops.  Rides begin at 10am through the Fall and Winter months as w
 eather allows and typically last about four hours. </p><p>Routes are suitab
 le for mountain bike or gravel bike\, with some more turned to one or the o
 ther.  Rides begin at different locations\, primarily associated with Yello
 wwood State Forest\, Brown County State Park\, and the Hoosier National For
 est in Monroe\, Lawrence\, and Brown Counties. Specific routes may be dicta
 ted by weather conditions\, but starting locations\, route maps\, and gps f
 ile links will be posted here in advance.</p><p>Expect a lot of trees and f
 ew cars</p><p>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getm
 eregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=136627" target="_blank">free t
 rial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes elect
 ronically signing a liability waiver\, prior to participation.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20250325T180159Z
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Dubois Scarce-o-Fat 20 -Growlers Off Road Adventure Ride
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
