DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/37555701">22 Victor\, R
 ockport\, Tramway</a><br><br>Please observe social distancing norms as we g
 ather and ride. <ul><li>Be SAFE. Don't blow through stop signs. Consider bi
 ke lights.<br></li><li>Be COURTEOUS: Single up in traffic<br></li><li>Be PR
 EDICTABLE: Signal your intentions to cars and fellow riders.</li></ul>The "
 Older\, Wiser\, and a Little Slower" training group emphasizes moderate rid
 es\, and a route planned in advance that is posted on the ride calendar. Th
 is is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride.The OWLS group welcomes a 
 wide range of intermediate riders\, and typically breaks off into a faster 
 and slower group with the former averaging an overall moving speed of 16-18
  mph\, and the slower group averaging 13-15 mph (including hills). Distance
 s vary from 20 to 30 miles\, depending partly on available light. Early sea
 son rides will be somewhat shorter and slower. Rides depart promptly at 5:4
 5.<br><br>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmereg
 istered.com/get_information.php?event_id=136627"><u>free trial membership</
 u></a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically sig
 ning a liability waiver\, prior to participation.<br><br>Questions? Contact
  <a href="mailto:gail.morell@gmail.com"><u>Gail Morell</u></a>.
LAST-MODIFIED:20230828T162654Z
LOCATION:Sherwood Oaks Christian Church\, 2700 E Rogers Rd\, Bloomington\, 
 IN 47401\, USA
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:OWLS Ride - 22 Victor\, Rockport\, Tramway
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
