 "_blank">Muscatatuck Route Map</a></u></u><br>24 miles Alternate route out 
 of town Rogers to 14th to Woodburn<br><br>Our most challenging NnE ride\, w
 ith a good climb in Cascade Park as we leave town and a good climb on Botto
 m Road up to Kinser Pike on the return. Of course in the the other directio
 n we get to sail down hilsl.<br><br>Host: Keith Bobay<br><br>Meet at the Sp
 lashed area at Switchyard Park for a 1:30 pm departure.<br><br>Nice N Easy 
 rides cater to those who want to take it easy and to beginning riders. Thes
 e Sunday rides feature lower mileage (19-26 miles) and slower paces. They u
 se Bloomington area low traffic roads.<br><br>Non-members should\, prior to
  participation\, sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/
 get_information.php?event_id=137889" target="_blank">free trial membership<
 /a>\, which includes electronically signing a liability waiver.
