BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20231230T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20231230T143000
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:5mu5cn4ulv9saduakntkumeqne@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20231230T100000
CREATED:20231017T184315Z
DESCRIPTION:<p><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/45200020">GRR / MTB 
 Tour to Elkinsville 25</a><br></p><p>We haven't done all of Nebo in a long 
 time</p><p>Nadolig Llawen a Blwyddyn Newydd Dda i Chi! (Merry Christmas and
  Happy New Year to you)</p><p>These rides feature gravel roads\, single and
  double track trails\,  and just enough pavement to string the aforemention
 ed together into fun\, woodsy adventure loops.  Rides begin at 10am through
  the Fall and Winter months as weather allows and typically last about thre
 e to four hours.</p><p>Routes are suitable for mountain bike or gravel bike
 \, with some more turned to one or the other.  Rides begin at different loc
 ations\, primarily associated with Yellowwood State Forest\, Brown County S
 tate Park\, and the Hoosier National Forest in Monroe\, Lawrence\, and Brow
 n Counties.  Specific routes may be dictated by weather conditions\, but st
 arting locations\, route maps\, and gps file links will be posted here in a
 dvance.</p><p>Expect a lot of trees and few cars</p>
