DESCRIPTION:<p><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/48904135">Blue Creek
  Berry Ridge Nebo · Ride with GPS</a></p><p>Suitable for Gravel Bike or Mou
 ntain Bike but it you have a Mountain Bike bring it!</p><p>These rides feat
 ure gravel roads\, single and double track trails\,  and just enough paveme
 nt to string the aforementioned together into fun\, woodsy adventure loops.
   Rides begin at 10am through the Fall and Winter months as weather allows 
 and typically last about four hours. </p><p>Routes are suitable for mountai
 n bike or gravel bike\, with some more turned to one or the other.  Rides b
 egin at different locations\, primarily associated with Yellowwood State Fo
 rest\, Brown County State Park\, and the Hoosier National Forest in Monroe\
 , Lawrence\, and Brown Counties. Specific routes may be dictated by weather
  conditions\, but starting locations\, route maps\, and gps file links will
  be posted here in advance.</p><p>Expect a lot of trees and few cars</p><p>
 Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.co
 m/get_information.php?event_id=136627" target="_blank">free trial membershi
 p</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically sign
 ing a liability waiver\, prior to participation.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20250325T180159Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Blue Creek Berry Ridge Nebo - Growlers Off Road Adventure Ride
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
