DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/36673202">27 Harmony HI
 lls</a><br><br>Please observe social distancing norms as we gather and ride
 . <ul><li>Be SAFE. Don't blow through stop signs. Consider bike lights.<br>
 </li><li>Be COURTEOUS: Single up in traffic<br></li><li>Be PREDICTABLE: Sig
 nal your intentions to cars and fellow riders.</li></ul>The "Older\, Wiser\
 , and a Little Slower" training group emphasizes moderate rides\, and a rou
 te planned in advance that is posted on the ride calendar. This is a no dro
 p ride\, but not a beginner's ride.The OWLS group welcomes a wide range of 
 intermediate riders\, and typically breaks off into a faster and slower gro
 up with the former averaging an overall moving speed of 16-18 mph\, and the
  slower group averaging 13-15 mph (including hills). Distances vary from 20
  to 30 miles\, depending partly on available light. Early season rides will
  be somewhat shorter and slower. Rides depart promptly at 5:45.<br><br>Non-
 members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/ge
 t_information.php?event_id=136627"><u>free trial membership</u></a>\, good 
 for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing a liabili
 ty waiver\, prior to participation.<br><br>Questions? Contact <a href="mail
 to:gail.morell@gmail.com"><u>Gail Morell</u></a>.
