DESCRIPTION:<p><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/48940129">Morgan Mon
 roe State Forest 27 · Ride with GPS</a></p><p>These rides feature gravel ro
 ads\, single and double track trails\,  and just enough pavement to string 
 the aforementioned together into fun\, woodsy adventure loops.  Rides begin
  at 10am through the Fall and Winter months as weather allows and typically
  last about four hours. </p><p>Routes are suitable for mountain bike or gra
 vel bike\, with some more turned to one or the other.  Rides begin at diffe
 rent locations\, primarily associated with Yellowwood State Forest\, Brown 
 County State Park\, and the Hoosier National Forest in Monroe\, Lawrence\, 
 and Brown Counties. Specific routes may be dictated by weather conditions\,
  but starting locations\, route maps\, and gps file links will be posted he
 re in advance.</p><p>Expect a lot of trees and few cars</p><p>Non-members s
 hould sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_informa
 tion.php?event_id=136627" target="_blank">free trial membership</a>\, good 
 for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing a liabili
 ty waiver\, prior to participation.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20250325T180159Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Morgan Monroe Forest 27 - Growlers Off Road Adventure Ride
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
