 s the sun at the Henderson Parking Garage.\n\nModerate training rides\, lea
 ve promptly\, average 13-14 mph\, 20-30 miles (shorter in the early season)
 \, with frequent regrouping. See <a href="http://bloomingtonbicycleclub.org
 /monthly_rides.php">bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/monthly_rides.php</a> for mo
 re information about the OWLS.\n\nStarting June 2012 we will be meeting at 
 Bryan Park on Woodlawn\, leaving promptly at 6pm.
