 35 SR 45\, Tunnel\, Shilo\, Bean Blossom\, Old 37</a><br></p><p>Ready for a
  high spirited ride? BV Ride is an intermediate/ advanced ride and moderate
  distance that may or may not include regrouping points.  Pace is anticipat
 ed to be 17+ mph. Expect occasional sprint or Strava segments\, pace line r
 iding at high speed\, intervals\, and fewer regrouping stops.</p><p>The BV 
 Ride will start at the Parking lot across from the Bryan Park Pool on Woodl
 awn at 5:45. Mileages will increase as the season progresses. If you keep c
 oming we will make you faster!</p><p>Riders are expected to look out for ea
 ch other during the rides.  Ride maps and GPS links will be posted here in 
 advance. Riders unfamiliar with the route should bring along a copy of the 
 map.</p>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregis
 tered.com/get_information.php?event_id=133776">free trial membership</a>\, 
 good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing a li
 ability waiver\, prior to participation.
