DESCRIPTION:<u></u><u></u><u></u><br><b><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/ro
 utes/38885110">Way Around Boltinghouse 3</a>7<a><br><br></a></b><br>This ri
 de is a take off on the old Around Boltinghouse Cruise\, a short (22 mile) 
 early season route around the legendary hill on Boltinghouse Road.  We have
  offered this longer version the last few years with the original ride as a
  shorter version\, and the longer version has  become the most popular vers
 ion of the ride.<br> <br>You can always shortcut on Anderson Road for a nic
 e\, shorter  28 mile loop. There are usually a few intrepid soles who turn 
 left at Dolan and ride up the big hill just for grins!<br><br>Non-members s
 hould sign up for a free trial membership good for up to three rides\, and 
 which includes electronically signing a liability waiver\, prior to partici
 pation.  <u></u><u></u><u></u><u></u><u></u><u></u>
