DESCRIPTION:<p><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/41846997" target="_b
 lank">All the H's - Hickory Horsecamp Henderson Hunter</a><br></p><p>These 
 rides feature gravel roads\, single and double track trails\,  and just eno
 ugh pavement to string the aforementioned together into fun\, woodsy advent
 ure loops.  Rides begin at 6PM through the Fall and Winter months as weathe
 r allows and typically last about two hours. Lights are mandatory as we ent
 er the Fall and Winter seasons.</p><p>Routes are suitable for mountain bike
  or gravel bike\, with some more turned to one or the other.  Rides begin a
 t different locations\, primarily associated with Yellowwood State Forest\,
  Brown County State Park\, and the Hoosier National Forest in Monroe\, Lawr
 ence\, and Brown Counties. Specific routes may be dictated by weather condi
 tions\, but starting locations\, route maps\, and gps file links will be po
 sted here in advance.</p><p>Expect a lot of trees and few cars</p><p>Non-me
 mbers should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_
 information.php?event_id=136627" target="_blank"><u>free trial membership</
 u></a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically sig
 ning a liability waiver\, prior to participation.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20250225T143747Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:All the H's - Hickory Horsecamp Henderson Hunter - Growlers Off Roa
 d Adventure Ride
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
