BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250104T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20250104T143000
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:37s3cnotqccjh1ls9qofspa90h@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20250104T100000
CREATED:20240813T191734Z
DESCRIPTION:<p><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/49383039">Story\, Lu
 tes\, Story 23 · Ride with GPS</a></p><p>It's going to be cold on Saturday 
 so a little shorter than usual.  Lets finish somewhere we can warm up like 
 The Story Inn.  We haven't been out this way for a couple of years.  Come a
 nd join us!</p><p>These rides feature gravel roads\, single and double trac
 k trails\,  and just enough pavement to string the aforementioned together 
 into fun\, woodsy adventure loops.  Rides begin at 10am through the Fall an
 d Winter months as weather allows and typically last about four hours. </p>
 <p>Routes are suitable for mountain bike or gravel bike\, with some more tu
 rned to one or the other.  Rides begin at different locations\, primarily a
 ssociated with Yellowwood State Forest\, Brown County State Park\, and the 
 Hoosier National Forest in Monroe\, Lawrence\, and Brown Counties. Specific
  routes may be dictated by weather conditions\, but starting locations\, ro
 ute maps\, and gps file links will be posted here in advance.</p><p>Expect 
