 ervals\, and fewer regrouping stops.</p><p>The BV Ride will start at the Pa
 rking lot across from the Bryan Park Pool on Woodlawn at 5:45. Mileages wil
 l increase as the season progresses. If you keep coming we will make you fa
 ster!</p><p>Riders are expected to look out for each other during the rides
 .  Ride maps and GPS links will be posted here in advance. Riders unfamilia
 r with the route should bring along a copy of the map.</p>Non-members shoul
