DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/29496732">18 - Ramp Cre
 ek and Scott Rd</a><br><br>Please observe social distancing norms as we gat
 her and ride. <ul><li>Be SAFE. Don't blow through stop signs. Consider bike
  lights.<br></li><li>Be COURTEOUS: Single up in traffic<br></li><li>Be PRED
 ICTABLE: Signal your intentions to cars and fellow riders.</li></ul>The "Ol
 der\, Wiser\, and a Little Slower" training group emphasizes moderate rides
 \, and a route planned in advance that is posted on the ride calendar. This
  is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride.The OWLS group welcomes a wi
 de range of intermediate riders\, and typically breaks off into a faster an
 d slower group with the former averaging an overall moving speed of 16-18 m
 ph\, and the slower group averaging 13-15 mph (including hills). Distances 
 vary from 20 to 30 miles\, depending partly on available light. Early seaso
 n rides will be somewhat shorter and slower. Rides depart promptly at 5:45.
 <br><br>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregis
 tered.com/get_information.php?event_id=136627"><u>free trial membership</u>
 </a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signi
 ng a liability waiver\, prior to participation.<br><br>Questions? Contact <
 a href="mailto:gail.morell@gmail.com"><u>Gail Morell</u></a>.
