DESCRIPTION:<u></u><u></u><u></u><u></u><u></u><a href="http://bloomingtonb
 icycleclub.org/maps/John_Bassett_Maps/M_-_M_-Martinsville-Mahalasville-_via
 _South_Shore_60.pdf">M&amp\;M Ride (Martinsville-Mahalasville) via South Sh
 ore</a><br><br><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/39450137">Revised GP
 S Files</a><br><br>The route has been revised for 2022 due to the closure o
 f Burton Ln in Martinsville as part of the I-69 completion.  From Burton Ln
   the new route turns right and follows Southview Dr. along the south side 
 of I-69 to Mahalasville Rd.  Since the Marathon gas station on Burton Ln is
  no longer accessable\, turn left on Mahalasville and go under I-69 to the 
 Kroger gas station for drinks and snacks. After the rest stop\, the route c
 ontinues south on Mahalasville as before.   <br><br>This is a fun\, moderat
 e 60 mile ride that incorporates some fast flats and just a few healthy cli
 mbs.  We do a couple of modifications to the traditional route to accommoda
 te the new traffic patterns resultant from I-69 and bypass some climbs on b
 usy SR 45 on the return route.<br><br>Non-members should sign up for a free
  trial membership\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electro
 nically signing a liability waiver\, prior to participation.  <u></u><u></u
 ><u></u><u></u><u></u><u></u>
LAST-MODIFIED:20230217T203540Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool Parking Lot @ 39.15435\,-86.523
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:M&M Ride (Martinsville-Mahalasville) - Leader: TBD
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
