DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/39702037">34 - OWLS Sou
 thshore Drive</a><br><br>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://
 secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=136627" target="_bl
 ank"><u><u>free trial membership</u></u></a>\, good for up to three rides\,
  and which includes electronically signing a liability waiver\, prior to pa
 rticipation.<ul><li>Be SAFE. Don't blow through stop signs. Consider bike l
 ights.<br></li><li>Be COURTEOUS: Single up in traffic<br></li><li>Be PREDIC
 TABLE: Signal your intentions to cars and fellow riders.</li></ul>The "Olde
 r\, Wiser\, and a Little Slower" training group emphasizes moderate rides\,
  and a route planned in advance that is posted on the ride calendar. This i
 s a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride.The OWLS group welcomes a wide
  range of intermediate riders\, and typically breaks off into a faster and 
 slower group with the former averaging an overall moving speed of 16-18 mph
 \, and the slower group averaging 13-15 mph (including hills). Distances va
 ry from 20 to 30 miles\, depending partly on available light. Early season 
 rides will be somewhat shorter and slower. Rides depart promptly at 5:45.<b
 r><br>Questions? Contact <a href="mailto:gail.morell@gmail.com" target="_bl
 ank"><u>Gail Morell</u></a>.
LAST-MODIFIED:20250220T145623Z
LOCATION:Sherwood Oaks Christian Church\, 2700 E Rogers Rd\, Bloomington\, 
 IN 47401\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:OWLS Ride - 34 Southshore Drive
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
