 Koontz and Harmony Bridge</a></u> 25 miles</p><span>This group emphasizes e
 arlier\, moderate-paced rides with routes planned in advance and posted on 
 the ride calendar. This is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride.  Exp
 ect an overall average moving speed of 12 - 15 mph.  Distances vary from 20
