 ore turned to one or the other.  Rides begin at different locations\, prima
 rily associated with Yellowwood State Forest\, Brown County State Park\, an
 d the Hoosier National Forest in Monroe\, Lawrence\, and Brown Counties.  S
 pecific routes may be dictated by weather conditions\, but starting locatio
 ns\, route maps\, and gps file links will be posted here in advance.</p><p>
 Expect a lot of trees and few cars</p>
