 egin at different locations\, primarily associated with Yellowwood State Fo
 rest\, Brown County State Park\, and the Hoosier National Forest in Monroe\
 , Lawrence\, and Brown Counties. Specific routes may be dictated by weather
  conditions\, but starting locations\, route maps\, and gps file links will
  be posted here in advance.</p><p>Expect a lot of trees and few cars</p><p>
 Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.co
 m/get_information.php?event_id=136627" target="_blank">free trial membershi
 p</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically sign
 ing a liability waiver\, prior to participation.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20250325T180159Z
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Growlers Off Road Adventure Ride - Down Polk Patch
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
