 d fewer regrouping stops.</p><p>The BV Ride will start at the Parking lot a
 cross from the Bryan Park Pool on Woodlawn at 5:45. Mileages will increase 
 as the season progresses. If you keep coming we will make you faster!</p><p
 >Riders are expected to look out for each other during the rides.  Ride map
 s and GPS links will be posted here in advance. Riders unfamiliar with the 
 route should bring along a copy of the map.</p>Non-members should sign up f
