CREATED:20230814T185924Z
DESCRIPTION:<span>This ride will start at the Hunters Checkin on East Kent 
 Road and is suitable for Gravel or MTB bikes.  </span><br><span><br></span>
 <br><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/44228953">All Around TC Steele<
 /a><span><br></span><br><br>Bring Lights!!!<br><br><span>These rides featur
 e gravel roads\, single and double track trails\,  and just enough pavement
  to string the aforementioned together into fun\, woodsy adventure loops.  
 Rides begin at 6PM through the Fall and Winter months as weather allows and
  typically last about two hours.  Lights are mandatory as we enter the Fall
  and Winter seasons.</span><p>Routes are suitable for mountain bike or grav
 el bike\, with some more turned to one or the other.  Rides begin at differ
 ent locations\, primarily associated with Yellowwood State Forest\, Brown C
 ounty State Park\, and the Hoosier National Forest in Monroe\, Lawrence\, a
 nd Brown Counties.  Specific routes may be dictated by weather conditions\,
  but starting locations\, route maps\, and gps file links will be posted he
 re in advance.</p><p>Expect a lot of trees and few cars</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20231113T114319Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:All Around TC Steele - Off Road Adventure Ride
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
