CREATED:20240813T174643Z
DESCRIPTION:<p><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/48139051">All Around
  Yellowwood</a></p><p>These rides feature gravel roads\, single and double 
 tracktrails\,  and just enough pavement to string the aforementioned togeth
 erinto fun\, woodsy adventure loops.  Rides begin at 6PM through the Fall a
 ndWinter months as weather allows and typically last about two hours. Light
 s are mandatory as we enter the Fall and Winter seasons.</p><p>Routes are s
 uitable for mountain bike or gravel bike\, withsome more turned to one or t
 he other.  Rides begin at different locations\,primarily associated with Ye
 llowwood State Forest\, Brown County State Park\, andthe Hoosier National F
 orest in Monroe\, Lawrence\, and Brown Counties. Specific routes may be dic
 tated by weather conditions\, but startinglocations\, route maps\, and gps 
 file links will be posted here in advance.</p><p>Expect a lot of trees and 
 few cars</p><p>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.get
 meregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=136627" target="_blank">free 
 trial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, andwhich includes elect
 ronically signing a liability waiver\, prior toparticipation.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20241119T004411Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:All Around Yellowwood - Growlers Off Road Adventure Rides
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
