DESCRIPTION:<u></u><u></u><p><a href="https://www.strava.com/routes/2912132
 644450418836">36 Take the lake</a><br></p><p>Ready for a high spirited ride
 ? BV Ride is an intermediate/ advanced ride and moderate distance that may 
 or may not include regrouping points.  Pace is anticipated to be 17+ mph. E
 xpect occasional sprint or Strava segments\, pace line riding at high speed
 \, intervals\, and fewer regrouping stops.</p><p>The BV Ride will start at 
 the Parking lot across from the Bryan Park Pool on Woodlawn at 5:45. Mileag
 es will increase as the season progresses. If you keep coming we will make 
 you faster!</p><p>Riders are expected to look out for each other during the
  rides.  Ride maps and GPS links will be posted here in advance. Riders unf
 amiliar with the route should bring along a copy of the map.</p>Non-members
  should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_infor
 mation.php?event_id=133776">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to thre
 e rides\, and which includes electronically signing a liability waiver\, pr
 ior to participation.<u></u><u></u>
