 ace line riding at high speed\, intervals\, and fewer regrouping stops.</p>
 <p>The BV Ride will start at the Parking lot across from the Bryan Park Poo
 l on Woodlawn at 5:45. Mileages will increase as the season progresses. If 
 you keep coming we will make you faster!</p><p>Riders are expected to look 
 out for each other during the rides.  Ride maps and GPS links will be poste
 d here in advance. Riders unfamiliar with the route should bring along a co
 py of the map.</p>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.
 getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=133776">free trial members
 hip</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically si
 gning a liability waiver\, prior to participation.<u></u><u></u>
