BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20230817T174500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20230817T204500
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:1v04bd50vmk9nh42ouber307fk@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20230817T174500
CREATED:20230518T113658Z
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/37327540">Dam Overlook<
 /a><br>Please observe social distancing norms as we gather and ride. <ul><l
 i>Be SAFE. Don't blow through stop signs. Consider bike lights.<br></li><li
 >Be COURTEOUS: Single up in traffic<br></li><li>Be PREDICTABLE: Signal your
  intentions to cars and fellow riders.</li></ul>The "Older\, Wiser\, and a 
 Little Slower" training group emphasizes moderate rides\, and a route plann
 ed in advance that is posted on the ride calendar. This is a no drop ride\,
  but not a beginner's ride.The OWLS group welcomes a wide range of intermed
 iate riders\, and typically breaks off into a faster and slower group with 
 the former averaging an overall moving speed of 16-18 mph\, and the slower 
 group averaging 13-15 mph (including hills). Distances vary from 20 to 30 m
 iles\, depending partly on available light. Early season rides will be some
 what shorter and slower. Rides depart promptly at 5:45.<br><br>Non-members 
 should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_inform
 ation.php?event_id=136627"><u>free trial membership</u></a>\, good for up t
 o three rides\, and which includes electronically signing a liability waive
 r\, prior to participation.<br><br>Questions? Contact <a href="mailto:gail.
 morell@gmail.com"><u>Gail Morell</u></a>.
LAST-MODIFIED:20230725T160639Z
LOCATION:Sherwood Oaks Christian Church\, 2700 E Rogers Rd\, Bloomington\, 
 IN 47401\, USA
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:OWLS Ride - 26 - Dam Overlook
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
