 e West</a></u><br></p><p>Ready for a high spirited NO DROP ride? BV Ride is
  an intermediate/ advanced ride and moderate distance that may or may not i
 nclude regrouping points.  Pace is anticipated to be 17+ mph. Expect occasi
 onal sprint or Strava segments\, pace line riding at high speed\, intervals
 \, and fewer regrouping stops.</p><p>The BV Ride will start at the Parking 
 lot across from the Bryan Park Pool on Woodlawn at 5:45. Mileages will incr
 ease as the season progresses. If you keep coming we will make you faster!<
