X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20231206T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20231206T203000
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:3h1ht7sn6m0fusnrfvjqc9342k@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20231206T180000
CREATED:20230814T185924Z
DESCRIPTION:<span><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/41846997">All the
  H's - Hickory Horsecamp Henderson Hunter</a><br></span><br><span>These rid
 es feature gravel roads\, single and double track trails\,  and just enough
  pavement to string the aforementioned together into fun\, woodsy adventure
  loops.  Rides begin at 6PM through the Fall and Winter months as weather a
 llows and typically last about two hours.  Lights are mandatory as we enter
  the Fall and Winter seasons.</span><p>Routes are suitable for mountain bik
 e or gravel bike\, with some more turned to one or the other.  Rides begin 
 at different locations\, primarily associated with Yellowwood State Forest\
 , Brown County State Park\, and the Hoosier National Forest in Monroe\, Law
 rence\, and Brown Counties.  Specific routes may be dictated by weather con
 ditions\, but starting locations\, route maps\, and gps file links will be 
 posted here in advance.</p><p>Expect a lot of trees and few cars</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20231205T132527Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:All the H's - Off Road Adventure Ride
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
