DESCRIPTION:<p><a href="https://www.strava.com/routes/2912151498153098388" 
 target="_blank">30 Old 37 S\, Popcorn\, Rockport\, Victor Pike</a></p><p>Re
 ady for a high spirited ride? BV Ride is an intermediate/ advanced ride and
  moderate distance that may or may not include regrouping points.  Pace is 
 anticipated to be 17+ mph. Expect occasional sprint or Strava segments\, pa
 ce line riding at high speed\, intervals\, and fewer regrouping stops.</p><
 p>The BV Ride will start at the Parking lot across from the Bryan Park Pool
  on Woodlawn at 5:45. Mileages will increase as the season progresses. If y
 ou keep coming we will make you faster!</p><p>Riders are expected to look o
 ut for each other during the rides.  Ride maps and GPS links will be posted
  here in advance. Riders unfamiliar with the route should bring along a cop
 y of the map.</p>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.g
