 89ZBIW" target="_blank">GPS Files</a><br><br>The BBC&#39\;s historic Parago
 n Ride is one of those that was highly impacted by I-69 construction.  So\,
  a couple of years ago Joe Anderson suggested this new\, modified route whi
 ch adds a little bit of distance and some new roads. It was a big hit\, so 
 we do it again.  The route goes first to Paragon\, then north a little befo
 re returning south through Gosport.  Joe will personally lead this one\, an
 d we are pretty excited about that.<br><br>Non-members should sign up for a
  <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://secure.getmeregistered.com/g
 et_information.php?event_id%3D136627&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;us
