DESCRIPTION:<u></u><p>Hello All\,</p><p>This 21 mile ride will start at the
  Hickory Ridge Firetower and hit All the H's in HNF starting down Hickory R
 idge to Hickory Grove\, past the Horsecamps\, down Henderson Creek and then
  back up Hunter Creek to the firetower</p><p>Keep an eye on the calendar th
 is week as there is a storm coming through Tuesday / Wednesday</p><p><a hre
 f="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/41846997">All the H's - Hickory\, Horseca
 mps\, Henderson\, Hunter</a><br></p><p>These rides feature gravel roads\, s
 ingle and double track trails\,  and just enough pavement to string the afo
 rementioned together into fun\, woodsy adventure loops.  Rides begin at 6PM
  through the Fall and Winter months as weather allows and typically last ab
 out two hours.  Lights are mandatory as we enter the Fall and Winter season
 s.</p><p>Routes are suitable for mountain bike or gravel bike\, with some m
 ore turned to one or the other.  Rides begin at different locations\, prima
 rily associated with Yellowwood State Forest\, Brown County State Park\, an
 d the Hoosier National Forest in Monroe\, Lawrence\, and Brown Counties.  S
 pecific routes may be dictated by weather conditions\, but starting locatio
 ns\, route maps\, and gps file links will be posted here in advance.</p><p>
 Expect a lot of trees and few cars.  </p><u></u>
