DESCRIPTION:<u></u><u></u><p><u><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https
 ://www.strava.com/routes/2912138405322619244&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar
 &amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw0evYARYo6M_956y7ZZdL5j" target="_blank">29 Verna
 l\, 43\, Gardner\, Eller</a></u><br></p><p>Ready for a high spirited NO DRO
 P ride? BV Ride is an intermediate/ advanced ride and moderate distance tha
 t may or may not include regrouping points.  Pace is anticipated to be 17+ 
 mph. Expect occasional sprint or Strava segments\, pace line riding at high
  speed\, intervals\, and fewer regrouping stops.</p><p>The BV Ride will sta
 rt at the Parking lot across from the Bryan Park Pool on Woodlawn at 5:45. 
 Mileages will increase as the season progresses. If you keep coming we will
  make you faster!</p><p>Riders are expected to look out for each other duri
 ng the rides.  Ride maps and GPS links will be posted here in advance. Ride
 rs unfamiliar with the route should bring along a copy of the map.</p>Non-m
 embers should sign up for a <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://s
 ecure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id%3D133776&amp\;sa=D&a
 mp\;source=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw2j50-2uvBSoK9EgtVBL-h8" targe
 t="_blank">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and whi
 ch includes electronically signing a liability waiver\, prior to participat
 ion.<u></u><u></u>
