CREATED:20241119T011347Z
DESCRIPTION:<p><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/44228953">All Around
  TC Steele</a></p><p>These rides feature gravel roads\, single and double t
 rack trails\,  and just enough pavement to string the aforementioned togeth
 er into fun\, woodsy adventure loops.  Rides begin at 6PM through the Fall 
 and Winter months as weather allows and typically last about two hours. Lig
 hts are mandatory as we enter the Fall and Winter seasons.</p><p>Routes are
  suitable for mountain bike or gravel bike\, with some more turned to one o
 r the other.  Rides begin at different locations\, primarily associated wit
 h Yellowwood State Forest\, Brown County State Park\, and the Hoosier Natio
 nal Forest in Monroe\, Lawrence\, and Brown Counties. Specific routes may b
 e dictated by weather conditions\, but starting locations\, route maps\, an
 d gps file links will be posted here in advance.</p><p>Expect a lot of tree
 s and few cars</p><p>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secu
 re.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=136627" target="_blank"
 ><u>free trial membership</u></a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which 
 includes electronically signing a liability waiver\, prior to participation
 .</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20241119T012236Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:All Around TC Steele - Growlers Off Road Adventure Ride
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
