 s/34368287" id="ow390" __is_owner="true">ChambersCrossing</a><br><u></u><br
 ><u></u>Watch the calendar for weather-related updates and for future rides
 .&nbsp\;<ul><li>Be SAFE. Don't blow through stop signs. Consider bike light
 s.<br></li><li>Be COURTEOUS: Single up in traffic<br></li><li>Be PREDICTABL
 E: Signal your intentions to cars and fellow riders.</li></ul>This branch o
 f the OWLS training group also emphasizes somewhat slower\, moderate rides\
 , and a route planned in advance that is posted on the ride calendar. This 
 is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride. Expect an overall average mo
 ving speed 11 - 15 mph including hills. Distances vary from 20 to 30 miles.
  Early season rides will be somewhat shorter and slower.During cold weather
  the ride departs at 1:30pm.<br><br>Non-members should sign up for a&nbsp\;
 <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=13
 6627">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which in
 cludes electronically signing a liability waiver\,&nbsp\;prior to participa
 tion.<br><br>Questions? Contact&nbsp\;<a href="mailto:allan.edmonds@gmail.c
 om">Allan Edmonds</a><u></u><u></u><u></u></html-blob>
