RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20250322T100000
CREATED:20240813T191734Z
DESCRIPTION:<p><b>RIDE RESCHEDULED FROM LAST SUNDAY.  NOTE 10AM START TIME 
 FROM THE HICKORY RIDGE FIRE TOWER</b></p><p><a href="https://ridewithgps.co
 m/routes/49970437">32 Baldy + Berry Ridge</a><br></p><p>These rides feature
  gravel roads\, single and double track trails\,  and just enough pavement 
 to string the aforementioned together into fun\, woodsy adventure loops.  R
 ides begin at 10am through the Fall and Winter months as weather allows and
  typically last about four hours. </p><p>Routes are suitable for mountain b
 ike or gravel bike\, with some more turned to one or the other.  Rides begi
 n at different locations\, primarily associated with Yellowwood State Fores
 t\, Brown County State Park\, and the Hoosier National Forest in Monroe\, L
 awrence\, and Brown Counties. Specific routes may be dictated by weather co
 nditions\, but starting locations\, route maps\, and gps file links will be
  posted here in advance.</p><p>Expect a lot of trees and few cars</p><p>Non
 -members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/g
 et_information.php?event_id=136627" target="_blank">free trial membership</
 a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing
  a liability waiver\, prior to participation.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20250325T180159Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:32 Baldy + Berry Ridge - Growlers Off Road Adventure Ride
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART:20230722T120000Z
DTEND:20230722T200000Z
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:40oifptsthm0thf1m88cac1q48@google.com
CREATED:20230531T123706Z
DESCRIPTION:<u></u><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=http://bloomington
 bicycleclub.org/maps/John_Bassett_Maps/Spring%2520Mill%2520Leavenworth%2520
 96%2520revised.pdf&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVa
 w0cfba6CdFjECmenvSyXLxF" target="_blank">Spring Mill to Leavenworth</a><br>
 <br><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=http://ridewithgps.com/routes/297
 0469&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw1ZceLzOhayasH
 IOI3vhMVI" target="_blank">GPS Links</a><br><br>This is a drive and ride ha
 s been very well attended the last several years\, and is back by by popula
 r demand. The entire route is 96 miles and begins and ends at Spring Mill S
 tate Park.  Start there because a century ride will get you to the Ohio Riv
 er and back.  Shorter options include turning back north at Marengo for a 6
 3 mile loop\, or turning right at the famous Crawford County Shoe Tree for 
 about 82 miles.  Tour some of the best southern Indiana has to offer\, and 
 enjoy the spectacular view of the Ohio River at the Leavenworth Overlook\, 
 the point where we turn back north.<br><br>The first part of the ride is re
 latively flat with several miles of new pavement on SR 337\; the middle par
 t is hilly\, and the last part is flat again on a lot of newish  pavement n
 orth of US 150.  See Lost River\, Marengo\, the Blue River at Milltown\, th
 e world famous Shoe Tree\, Wyandotte Cave\, the Leavenworth Overlook\, idyl
 lic Amish countryside in Orange County\, and the &quot\;Knob&quot\; you hav
 e to go right over the top of.  <br><br>Meet at Spring Mill State Park Inn 
 (upper level of the parking garage) at 8:00.  Bring your park pass. This is
  a good one.<br><br>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://www.g
 oogle.com/url?q=https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?even
 t_id%3D136627&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw0_5c
 Jvz8z3KUY7Yt6t47kW" target="_blank">free trial membership</a>\, good for up
  to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing a liability wai
 ver\, prior to participation.<u></u>
LAST-MODIFIED:20230531T123706Z
LOCATION:Spring Mill Inn Parking Garage @38.734283\, -86.414433
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Spring Mill to Leavenworth 96 - Leader:  TBD
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
