UID:1v04bd50vmk9nh42ouber307fk@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20230801T174500
CREATED:20230518T113658Z
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/37000594">26 Down Gore 
 and up the Dam Hill</a><br><br>Please observe social distancing norms as we
  gather and ride. <ul><li>Be SAFE. Don't blow through stop signs. Consider 
 bike lights.<br></li><li>Be COURTEOUS: Single up in traffic<br></li><li>Be 
 PREDICTABLE: Signal your intentions to cars and fellow riders.</li></ul>The
  "Older\, Wiser\, and a Little Slower" training group emphasizes moderate r
 ides\, and a route planned in advance that is posted on the ride calendar. 
 This is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride.The OWLS group welcomes 
 a wide range of intermediate riders\, and typically breaks off into a faste
 r and slower group with the former averaging an overall moving speed of 16-
 18 mph\, and the slower group averaging 13-15 mph (including hills). Distan
 ces vary from 20 to 30 miles\, depending partly on available light. Early s
 eason rides will be somewhat shorter and slower. Rides depart promptly at 5
 :45.<br><br>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmer
 egistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=136627"><u>free trial membership
 </u></a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically s
 igning a liability waiver\, prior to participation.<br><br>Questions? Conta
 ct <a href="mailto:gail.morell@gmail.com"><u>Gail Morell</u></a>.
LAST-MODIFIED:20230725T154749Z
LOCATION:Sherwood Oaks Christian Church\, 2700 E Rogers Rd\, Bloomington\, 
 IN 47401\, USA
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:OWLS Ride - 26 Down Gore and up Dam Rd Hill
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
