 . Starts8am. I've done this ride two years\, and will likely do it again th
 is year. It's a good\, challenging ride with lots of hills. Showers\, ice c
 ream sundaes and massages at the end. Instead of another t-shirt\, you will
  get a pair of socks\, free\, at the end of the day!
