 up welcomes a wide range of intermediate riders\, and typically breaks off 
 into a faster and slower group with the former averaging an overall moving 
 speed of 16-18 mph\, and the slower group averaging 13-15 mph (including hi
 lls). Distances vary from 20 to 30 miles\, depending partly on available li
 ght. Early season rides will be somewhat shorter and slower. Rides depart p
 romptly at 5:45.<br><br>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://s
 ecure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=136627"><u>free tria
 l membership</u></a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes elec
 tronically signing a liability waiver\, prior to participation.<br><br>Ques
 tions? Contact <a href="mailto:gail.morell@gmail.com"><u>Gail Morell</u></a
 >.
