DESCRIPTION:<u></u><u></u><p><a href="https://www.strava.com/routes/3134176
 227060182592">35 Kerr Gilead 45 Southshore Tunnel</a><br></p><p><br></p><p>
 Ready for a high spirited ride? BV Ride is an intermediate/ advanced ride a
 nd moderate distance that may or may not include regrouping points.  Pace i
 s anticipated to be 17+ mph. Expect occasional sprint or Strava segments\, 
 pace line riding at high speed\, intervals\, and fewer regrouping stops.</p
 ><p>The BV Ride will start at the Parking lot across from the Bryan Park Po
 ol on Woodlawn at 5:45. Mileages will increase as the season progresses. If
  you keep coming we will make you faster!</p><p>Riders are expected to look
  out for each other during the rides.  Ride maps and GPS links will be post
 ed here in advance. Riders unfamiliar with the route should bring along a c
 opy of the map.</p>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure
 .getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=133776">free trial member
 ship</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically s
 igning a liability waiver\, prior to participation.<u></u><u></u>
