DESCRIPTION:<u></u><u></u><p><u><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https
 ://www.strava.com/routes/3052404663737302150&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar
 &amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw0jxQSoSUASQ0xlRW01nihk" target="_blank">25 Short
  loop around Brummett&#39\;s Creek</a></u><br></p><p>Ready for a high spiri
 ted NO DROP ride? BV Ride is an intermediate/ advanced ride and moderate di
 stance that may or may not include regrouping points.  Pace is anticipated 
 to be 17+ mph. Expect occasional sprint or Strava segments\, pace line ridi
 ng at high speed\, intervals\, and fewer regrouping stops.</p><p>The BV Rid
 e will start at the Parking lot across from the Bryan Park Pool on Woodlawn
  at 5:45. Mileages will increase as the season progresses. If you keep comi
 ng we will make you faster!</p><p>Riders are expected to look out for each 
 other during the rides.  Ride maps and GPS links will be posted here in adv
 ance. Riders unfamiliar with the route should bring along a copy of the map
 .</p>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q
 =https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id%3D133776&a
 mp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw2j50-2uvBSoK9EgtVBL
 -h8" target="_blank">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides
 \, and which includes electronically signing a liability waiver\, prior to 
 participation.<u></u><u></u>
