DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/42446177">26 - Mt. Gile
 ad\, Robinson\, and Old Myers</a><br><br>Please observe social distancing n
 orms as we gather and ride. <ul><li>Be SAFE. Don't blow through stop signs.
  Consider bike lights.<br></li><li>Be COURTEOUS: Single up in traffic<br></
 li><li>Be PREDICTABLE: Signal your intentions to cars and fellow riders.</l
 i></ul>The "Older\, Wiser\, and a Little Slower" training group emphasizes 
 moderate rides\, and a route planned in advance that is posted on the ride 
 calendar. This is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride.The OWLS group
  welcomes a wide range of intermediate riders\, and typically breaks off in
 to a faster and slower group with the former averaging an overall moving sp
 eed of 16-18 mph\, and the slower group averaging 13-15 mph (including hill
 s). Distances vary from 20 to 30 miles\, depending partly on available ligh
 t. Early season rides will be somewhat shorter and slower. Rides depart pro
 mptly at 5:45.<br><br>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://sec
 ure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=136627"><u>free trial 
 membership</u></a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electr
 onically signing a liability waiver\, prior to participation.<br><br>Questi
 ons? Contact <a href="mailto:gail.morell@gmail.com"><u>Gail Morell</u></a>.
LAST-MODIFIED:20230517T230408Z
LOCATION:Sherwood Oaks Christian Church\, 2700 E Rogers Rd\, Bloomington\, 
 IN 47401\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:OWLS Ride - 26 - Mt. Gilead\, Robinson\, and Old Myers
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
