CREATED:20100510T001139Z
DESCRIPTION:This limited-entry week long tour will take you to some of the 
 most beautiful places in Indiana\, and riders should expect to average 62 m
 iles a day (on ride days). This event is limited to 250 participants\, so b
 e sure to register early. Ride and registrations details can be found at <a
  href="http://triri.org/se.html">http://triri.org/se.html</a>
