CREATED:20230711T175855Z
DESCRIPTION:<u></u><u></u><p dir="ltr"><a href="https://www.strava.com/rout
 es/2956284510874593442"><u>39 Woodyard\, Reeves\, Hardscrabble\, SR43\, Gar
 dner</u></a></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><span>Ready for a high spirited ri
 de? BV Ride is an intermediate/ advanced ride and moderate distance that ma
 y or may not include regrouping points.  Pace is anticipated to be 17+ mph.
  Expect occasional sprint or Strava segments\, pace line riding at high spe
 ed\, intervals\, and fewer regrouping stops.</span><br></p><p>The BV Ride w
 ill start at the Parking lot across from the Bryan Park Pool on Woodlawn at
  5:45. Mileages will increase as the season progresses. If you keep coming 
 we will make you faster!</p><p>Riders are expected to look out for each oth
 er during the rides.  Ride maps and GPS links will be posted here in advanc
 e. Riders unfamiliar with the route should bring along a copy of the map.</
 p>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.
 com/get_information.php?event_id=133776">free trial membership</a>\, good f
 or up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing a liabilit
 y waiver\, prior to participation.<u></u><u></u>
LAST-MODIFIED:20230711T175855Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool\, 1020 S Woodlawn Ave\, Bloomington\, IN 47401\, U
 SA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:BV ride -36 Take the lake
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
