DESCRIPTION:<span>Camping opportunity at Yellowwood - stayed tuned - I'll k
 eep an eye on weather</span><br><br>Bring Lights!!!<br><br><a href="https:/
 /ridewithgps.com/routes/44441983">Almost Helmsburg from Yellowwood Campsite
 </a><span><br></span><br><span>A couple of club members are planning on cam
 ping at Yellowwood.  Weather permitting w</span><span>e'll have a fire goin
 g\, a big pot of vegetarian chilli.  </span><br><span><br></span><br><span>
 Come and hang out\, we had a great time when we did this last year.</span><
 br><span><br></span><br><span>These rides feature gravel roads\, single and
  double track trails\,  and just enough pavement to string the aforemention
 ed together into fun\, woodsy adventure loops.  Rides begin at 6PM through 
 the Fall and Winter months as weather allows and typically last about two h
 ours.  Lights are mandatory as we enter the Fall and Winter seasons.</span>
 <p>Routes are suitable for mountain bike or gravel bike\, with some more tu
 rned to one or the other.  Rides begin at different locations\, primarily a
 ssociated with Yellowwood State Forest\, Brown County State Park\, and the 
 Hoosier National Forest in Monroe\, Lawrence\, and Brown Counties.  Specifi
 c routes may be dictated by weather conditions\, but starting locations\, r
 oute maps\, and gps file links will be posted here in advance.</p><p>Expect
  a lot of trees and few cars</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20230914T171644Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Yellowwood Camping - Almost Helmsburg - Off Road Adventure Ride
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
