DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/31103689">Fluck Mill 20
 19 (clockwise)</a><br><br>Please observe social distancing norms as we gath
 er and ride. <ul><li>Be SAFE. Don't blow through stop signs. Consider bike 
 lights.<br></li><li>Be COURTEOUS: Single up in traffic<br></li><li>Be PREDI
 CTABLE: Signal your intentions to cars and fellow riders.</li></ul>The "Old
 er\, Wiser\, and a Little Slower" training group emphasizes moderate rides\
 , and a route planned in advance that is posted on the ride calendar. This 
 is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride.The OWLS group welcomes a wid
 e range of intermediate riders\, and typically breaks off into a faster and
  slower group with the former averaging an overall moving speed of 16-18 mp
 h\, and the slower group averaging 13-15 mph (including hills). Distances v
 ary from 20 to 30 miles\, depending partly on available light. Early season
  rides will be somewhat shorter and slower. Rides depart promptly at 5:45.<
 br><br>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregist
 ered.com/get_information.php?event_id=136627"><u>free trial membership</u><
 /a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signin
 g a liability waiver\, prior to participation.<br><br>Questions? Contact <a
  href="mailto:gail.morell@gmail.com"><u>Gail Morell</u></a>.
LAST-MODIFIED:20230517T230408Z
LOCATION:Sherwood Oaks Christian Church\, 2700 E Rogers Rd\, Bloomington\, 
 IN 47401\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:OWLS Ride - 20 Fluck Mill 
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
