 p>Ready for a high spirited ride? BV Ride is an intermediate/ advanced ride
  and moderate distance that may or may not include regrouping points.  Pace
  is anticipated to be 17+ mph. Expect occasional sprint or Strava segments\
 , pace line riding at high speed\, intervals\, and fewer regrouping stops.<
 /p><p>The BV Ride will start at the Parking lot across from the Bryan Park 
 Pool on Woodlawn at 5:45. Mileages will increase as the season progresses. 
 If you keep coming we will make you faster!</p><p>Riders are expected to lo
 ok out for each other during the rides.  Ride maps and GPS links will be po
 sted here in advance. Riders unfamiliar with the route should bring along a
  copy of the map.</p>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secu
 re.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=133776">free trial memb
 ership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically
  signing a liability waiver\, prior to participation.<u></u><u></u>
