 xpect an overall average moving speed 11 - 15 mph. Distances vary from 20 t
 o 30 miles. Early season rides will be somewhat shorter and slower. During 
 colder weather the ride departs at 1:30pm.<br><br>Non-members should sign u
 p for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?eve
 nt_id=136627">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and 
