CREATED:20230518T113658Z
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/40752654">22 Long Russe
 ll</a><br><br>Please observe social distancing norms as we gather and ride.
  <ul><li>Be SAFE. Don't blow through stop signs. Consider bike lights.<br><
 /li><li>Be COURTEOUS: Single up in traffic<br></li><li>Be PREDICTABLE: Sign
 al your intentions to cars and fellow riders.</li></ul>The "Older\, Wiser\,
  and a Little Slower" training group emphasizes moderate rides\, and a rout
 e planned in advance that is posted on the ride calendar. This is a no drop
  ride\, but not a beginner's ride.The OWLS group welcomes a wide range of i
 ntermediate riders\, and typically breaks off into a faster and slower grou
 p with the former averaging an overall moving speed of 16-18 mph\, and the 
 slower group averaging 13-15 mph (including hills). Distances vary from 20 
 to 30 miles\, depending partly on available light. Early season rides will 
 be somewhat shorter and slower. Rides depart promptly at 5:45.<br><br>Non-m
 embers should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get
 _information.php?event_id=136627"><u>free trial membership</u></a>\, good f
 or up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing a liabilit
 y waiver\, prior to participation.<br><br>Questions? Contact <a href="mailt
 o:gail.morell@gmail.com"><u>Gail Morell</u></a>.
LAST-MODIFIED:20230831T155834Z
LOCATION:Sherwood Oaks Christian Church\, 2700 E Rogers Rd\, Bloomington\, 
 IN 47401\, USA
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:OWLS Ride - 22 Long Russell
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
