CREATED:20220901T172010Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>Hello Everyone.</p><p>I modified one of Indiana Jim's routes
  to take in Cataract Falls and we can also checkout the Covered Bridge ther
 e too.</p><p>The ride will start at Owen Putnam State Forest office on Fish
  Creek Road.  The route is about 50/50 pavement/gravel so ride what you've 
 got.  It will be really hard to drive past Civilian Brewing co on the way b
 ack so expect a detour for some food &amp\; refreshments.</p><p><a href="ht
 tps://ridewithgps.com/routes/41874879">Owen Putnam Cataract Falls</a><br></
 p><p>These rides feature gravel roads\, single and double track trails\,  a
 nd just enough pavement to string the aforementioned together into fun\, wo
 odsy adventure loops.  Rides begin at 10am through the Fall and Winter mont
 hs as weather allows and typically last about three to four hours.</p><p>Ro
 utes are suitable for mountain bike or gravel bike\, with some more turned 
 to one or the other.  Rides begin at different locations\, primarily associ
 ated with Yellowwood State Forest\, Brown County State Park\, and the Hoosi
 er National Forest in Monroe\, Lawrence\, and Brown Counties.  Specific rou
 tes may be dictated by weather conditions\, but starting locations\, route 
 maps\, and gps file links will be posted here in advance.</p><p>Expect a lo
 t of trees and few cars.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20230127T151314Z
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Owen Putnam Cataract Falls - Off Road Adventure
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
