DESCRIPTION:<u></u><u></u><p><u><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https
 ://www.strava.com/routes/2912126872135523692&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar
 &amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw3VnTI_-5ExvDbpMB2wkf_o" target="_blank">26 Kerr\
 , Getty\, Robinson\, Firehouse</a></u><br></p><p>Ready for a high spirited 
 NO DROP ride? BV Ride is an intermediate/ advanced ride and moderate distan
 ce that may or may not include regrouping points.  Pace is anticipated to b
 e 17+ mph. Expect occasional sprint or Strava segments\, pace line riding a
 t high speed\, intervals\, and fewer regrouping stops.</p><p>The BV Ride wi
 ll start at the Parking lot across from the Bryan Park Pool on Woodlawn at 
 5:45. Mileages will increase as the season progresses. If you keep coming w
 e will make you faster!</p><p>Riders are expected to look out for each othe
 r during the rides.  Ride maps and GPS links will be posted here in advance
 . Riders unfamiliar with the route should bring along a copy of the map.</p
 >Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=htt
 ps://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id%3D133776&amp\;
 sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw2j50-2uvBSoK9EgtVBL-h8"
  target="_blank">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, a
 nd which includes electronically signing a liability waiver\, prior to part
 icipation.<u></u><u></u>
