CREATED:20240813T191734Z
DESCRIPTION:<p><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/49162769">Freedom 30
  · Ride with GPS</a></p><p>Hard to miss the opportunity to call in Civilian
  Brewery on the way back</p><p>These rides feature gravel roads\, single an
 d double track trails\,  and just enough pavement to string the aforementio
 ned together into fun\, woodsy adventure loops.  Rides begin at 10am throug
 h the Fall and Winter months as weather allows and typically last about fou
 r hours. </p><p>Routes are suitable for mountain bike or gravel bike\, with
  some more turned to one or the other.  Rides begin at different locations\
 , primarily associated with Yellowwood State Forest\, Brown County State Pa
 rk\, and the Hoosier National Forest in Monroe\, Lawrence\, and Brown Count
 ies. Specific routes may be dictated by weather conditions\, but starting l
 ocations\, route maps\, and gps file links will be posted here in advance.<
 /p><p>Expect a lot of trees and few cars</p><p>Non-members should sign up f
 or a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_
 id=136627" target="_blank">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to three
  rides\, and which includes electronically signing a liability waiver\, pri
 or to participation.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20250325T180159Z
