DESCRIPTION:<u></u><u></u><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=http://www.
 bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/BBCMaps/map_pack_1/nashville_90.pdf&amp\;sa
 =D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw0MH37GAdXOjOjeWz4NnVnK" t
 arget="_blank">Nashville 90</a><br><br><a href="https://www.google.com/url?
 q=https://ridewithgps.com/routes/4608332&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp
 \;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw24ENLtmBAfgVFfI96_drfu" target="_blank">GPS Files</a
 ><br><br>This one has become the iconic club ride.  At 90 miles\, and rated
  difficult\, this &quot\;almost&quot\; century incorporates the best of wha
 t this area has to offer cyclists - big climbs\, rolling hills\, curves\, f
 lats\, buccolic views\, bizarre town names (Zelma) and sites (the Stonehead
 ). Ride this once and you&#39\;ll ride it again!<br><br>Non-members should 
 sign up for a <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://secure.getmereg
 istered.com/get_information.php?event_id%3D136627&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=cal
 endar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw0_5cJvz8z3KUY7Yt6t47kW" target="_blank">fre
 e trial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes el
 ectronically signing a liability waiver\, prior to participation.  <u></u><
 u></u>
