BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20230330T174500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20230330T204500
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:6kl5mk4r9f6d86qsniau9f6lhd@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20230330T174500
CREATED:20230211T193802Z
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/19778195">Short Russell
 </a><br><br>Please observe social distancing norms as we gather and ride. <
 ul><li>Be SAFE. Don't blow through stop signs. Consider bike lights.<br></l
 i><li>Be COURTEOUS: Single up in traffic<br></li><li>Be PREDICTABLE: Signal
  your intentions to cars and fellow riders.</li></ul>The "Older\, Wiser\, a
 nd a Little Slower" training group emphasizes moderate rides\, and a route 
 planned in advance that is posted on the ride calendar. This is a no drop r
 ide\, but not a beginner's ride.The OWLS group welcomes a wide range of int
 ermediate riders\, and typically breaks off into a faster and slower group 
 with the former averaging an overall moving speed of 16-18 mph\, and the sl
 ower group averaging 13-15 mph (including hills). Distances vary from 20 to
  30 miles\, depending partly on available light. Early season rides will be
  somewhat shorter and slower. Rides depart promptly at 5:45.<br><br>Non-mem
 bers should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_i
 nformation.php?event_id=136627"><u>free trial membership</u></a>\, good for
  up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing a liability 
 waiver\, prior to participation.<br><br>Questions? Contact <a href="mailto:
 gail.morell@gmail.com"><u>Gail Morell</u></a>.
LAST-MODIFIED:20230517T230408Z
LOCATION:Sherwood Oaks Christian Church\, 2700 E Rogers Rd\, Bloomington\, 
 IN 47401\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:OWLS Ride - 19 Short Russell
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
