DESCRIPTION:<u></u><p>Route is all pavement / gravel with a couple of nice 
 gravel climbs</p><p><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/41950222">Yello
 wwood 18</a><br></p><p>Keep an eye on the calendar this week\, might change
  to Thursday depending on weather.</p><p>These rides feature gravel roads\,
  single and double track trails\,  and just enough pavement to string the a
 forementioned together into fun\, woodsy adventure loops.  Rides begin at 6
 PM through the Fall and Winter months as weather allows and typically last 
 about two hours.  Lights are mandatory as we enter the Fall and Winter seas
 ons.</p><p>Routes are suitable for mountain bike or gravel bike\, with some
  more turned to one or the other.  Rides begin at different locations\, pri
 marily associated with Yellowwood State Forest\, Brown County State Park\, 
 and the Hoosier National Forest in Monroe\, Lawrence\, and Brown Counties. 
  Specific routes may be dictated by weather conditions\, but starting locat
 ions\, route maps\, and gps file links will be posted here in advance.</p><
 p>Expect a lot of trees and few cars.  </p><u></u>
