 com/routes/42023353">Muscatatuck Wildlife Refuge 24 mile GPS File</a><br><b
 r><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/26907106">Muscatatuck Wildlife Re
 fuge extended 32 mile GPS File</a><br><br>This is our usual fist ride of th
 e season out to the Muscatatuck National Wildlife Refuge on Bottom Road.  T
 he basic route is a pretty level 24 mile out &amp\; back designed to be an 
 easy ride to shake off the winter cobwebs.  The route is easily extended to
  32 miles with a loop to the north or can be extended east across I-69 via 
 the Sample Road overpass for those who want some additional miles.  You cou
 ld even ride a little gravel over to the new covered bridge on Maple Grove 
 Road and return to Bottom Road and Bloomington via Maple Grove (North-South
 ) and Maple Grove (East-West).<br><br>Non-members should sign up for a <a h
 ref="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=136627
 ">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includ
 es electronically signing a liability waiver\, prior to participation.  <br
 ><br><a></a>
