DESCRIPTION:<p>This 35 mile ride will start at Unionville Elementary School
 .</p><p>Suitable for Cross / Gravel / MTB</p><p><a href="https://ridewithgp
 s.com/routes/42001189"><u>Almost Mahalsville</u></a></p><p><br></p><p>These
  rides feature gravel roads\, single and double track trails\,  and just en
 ough pavement to string the aforementioned together into fun\, woodsy adven
 ture loops.  Rides begin at 10am through the Fall and Winter months as weat
 her allows and typically last about three to four hours.</p><p>Routes are s
 uitable for mountain bike or gravel bike\, with some more turned to one or 
