DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20230523T174500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20230523T204500
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;WKST=SU;UNTIL=20231101T035959Z;BYDAY=TU,TH
EXDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20230704T174500
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:1v04bd50vmk9nh42ouber307fk@google.com
CREATED:20230518T113658Z
DESCRIPTION:<br>Please observe social distancing norms as we gather and rid
 e. <ul><li>Be SAFE. Don't blow through stop signs. Consider bike lights.<br
 ></li><li>Be COURTEOUS: Single up in traffic<br></li><li>Be PREDICTABLE: Si
 gnal your intentions to cars and fellow riders.</li></ul>The "Older\, Wiser
 \, and a Little Slower" training group emphasizes moderate rides\, and a ro
 ute planned in advance that is posted on the ride calendar. This is a no dr
 op ride\, but not a beginner's ride.The OWLS group welcomes a wide range of
  intermediate riders\, and typically breaks off into a faster and slower gr
 oup with the former averaging an overall moving speed of 16-18 mph\, and th
 e slower group averaging 13-15 mph (including hills). Distances vary from 2
 0 to 30 miles\, depending partly on available light. Early season rides wil
 l be somewhat shorter and slower. Rides depart promptly at 5:45.<br><br>Non
 -members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/g
 et_information.php?event_id=136627"><u>free trial membership</u></a>\, good
  for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing a liabil
 ity waiver\, prior to participation.<br><br>Questions? Contact <a href="mai
 lto:gail.morell@gmail.com"><u>Gail Morell</u></a>.
LAST-MODIFIED:20230518T161029Z
LOCATION:Sherwood Oaks Christian Church\, 2700 E Rogers Rd\, Bloomington\, 
 IN 47401\, USA
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:OWLS Ride -
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
