DESCRIPTION:<u></u><u></u><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=http://bloo
 mingtonbicycleclub.org/maps/John_Bassett_Maps/Paragon_Ride_2018_Version_47.
 pdf&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw0DPegW5ytzUn_f
 _Ktm50P_" target="_blank">Paragon Ride 2018 Version 47</a><br><br><a href="
 https://www.google.com/url?q=https://ridewithgps.com/routes/28782934&amp\;s
 a=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw3JxOS9MkUrj8yxS1sXGKlI" 
 target="_blank">GPS Files</a><br><br>Historically\, the Paragon Ride crosse
 d SR 37 at Turkey Track Road / Pine Road.  With the advent of I-69 that cro
 ssing no longer exists\, so we will add a mile or two and use Godsey Road e
 ast of Paragon to cross I-69 at the Liberty Church Road exit.  From there w
 e’ll take a new access road and old SR 37 straight back to Bloomington for 
 a total of about 47 miles.<br><br> Non-members should sign up for a <a href
 ="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_infor
 mation.php?event_id%3D136627&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\
 ;usg=AOvVaw0_5cJvz8z3KUY7Yt6t47kW" target="_blank">free trial membership</a
 >\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing 
 a liability waiver\, prior to participation.  <u></u><u></u>
