  Creek</a> 27 miles<br><br><span>This group emphasizes earlier\, moderate-p
 aced rides with routes planned in advance and posted on the ride calendar. 
 This is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride.  Expect an overall aver
 age moving speed of 12 - 15 mph.  Distances vary from 20 to a little over 3
 0 miles.  Early season rides will be at the lower end of the distance scale
 .  During colder weather the ride departs at 1:00pm.  </span><br><br>Non-me
 mbers should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_
 information.php?event_id=136627" target="_blank">free trial membership</a>\
 , good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing a 
 liability waiver\, prior to participation.<br><br><br><u></u>
