BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240730T174500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20240730T204500
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:0kvq7ji7pl1i3r10shdasl3q7j_R20240402T214500@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20240730T174500
CREATED:20240228T171318Z
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/16026010">26 OWLS Shuff
 le Creek</a><br><i>For a slightly shorter route option (22 miles)\, turn le
 ft on S.R. 45 from Mt. Gilead\, and continue on to Smith Rd. following the 
 regular route back to the start.</i><br><br>Non-members should sign up for 
 a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=
 136627" target="_blank"><u><u>free trial membership</u></u></a>\, good for 
 up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing a liability w
 aiver\, prior to participation.<ul><li>Be SAFE. Don't blow through stop sig
 ns. Consider bike lights.<br></li><li>Be COURTEOUS: Single up in traffic<br
 ></li><li>Be PREDICTABLE: Signal your intentions to cars and fellow riders.
 </li></ul>The "Older\, Wiser\, and a Little Slower" training group emphasiz
 es moderate rides\, and a route planned in advance that is posted on the ri
 de calendar. This is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride.The OWLS gr
 oup welcomes a wide range of intermediate riders\, and typically breaks off
  into a faster and slower group with the former averaging an overall moving
  speed of 16-18 mph\, and the slower group averaging 13-15 mph (including h
 ills). Distances vary from 20 to 30 miles\, depending partly on available l
 ight. Early season rides will be somewhat shorter and slower. Rides depart 
 promptly at 5:45.<br><br>Questions? Contact <a href="mailto:gail.morell@gma
 il.com" target="_blank"><u>Gail Morell</u></a>.
LAST-MODIFIED:20250220T145623Z
LOCATION:Sherwood Oaks Christian Church\, 2700 E Rogers Rd\, Bloomington\, 
 IN 47401\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:OWLS Ride - 26 Shuffle Creek
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
