X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20231209T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20231209T143000
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:5mu5cn4ulv9saduakntkumeqne@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20231209T100000
CREATED:20231017T184315Z
DESCRIPTION:<p><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/41388150">Hickory Gr
 ove Church Berry Ridge Both Baldy's</a><br></p><p><br></p><p>These rides fe
 ature gravel roads\, single and double track trails\,  and just enough pave
 ment to string the aforementioned together into fun\, woodsy adventure loop
 s.  Rides begin at 10am through the Fall and Winter months as weather allow
 s and typically last about three to four hours.</p><p>Routes are suitable f
 or mountain bike or gravel bike\, with some more turned to one or the other
 .  Rides begin at different locations\, primarily associated with Yellowwoo
 d State Forest\, Brown County State Park\, and the Hoosier National Forest 
 in Monroe\, Lawrence\, and Brown Counties.  Specific routes may be dictated
  by weather conditions\, but starting locations\, route maps\, and gps file
  links will be posted here in advance.</p><p>Expect a lot of trees and few 
 cars</p>
