DESCRIPTION:<br><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/45932287">19.5 - Fl
 uckmill Counter Clockwise</a><br><br>Non-members should sign up for a <a hr
 ef="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=136627"
 ><u><u>free trial membership</u></u></a>\, good for up to three rides\, and
  which includes electronically signing a liability waiver\, prior to partic
 ipation.<ul><li>Be SAFE. Don't blow through stop signs. Consider bike light
 s.<br></li><li>Be COURTEOUS: Single up in traffic<br></li><li>Be PREDICTABL
 E: Signal your intentions to cars and fellow riders.</li></ul>The "Older\, 
 Wiser\, and a Little Slower" training group emphasizes moderate rides\, and
  a route planned in advance that is posted on the ride calendar. This is a 
 no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride.The OWLS group welcomes a wide ran
 ge of intermediate riders\, and typically breaks off into a faster and slow
 er group with the former averaging an overall moving speed of 16-18 mph\, a
 nd the slower group averaging 13-15 mph (including hills). Distances vary f
 rom 20 to 30 miles\, depending partly on available light. Early season ride
 s will be somewhat shorter and slower. Rides depart promptly at 5:45.<br><b
 r><br>Questions? Contact <a href="mailto:gail.morell@gmail.com"><u>Gail Mor
 ell</u></a>.
LAST-MODIFIED:20250220T145623Z
LOCATION:Sherwood Oaks Christian Church\, 2700 E Rogers Rd\, Bloomington\, 
 IN 47401\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:OWLS Ride - 20 Fluck Mill
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
