BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250129T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20250129T203000
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:5e9ae8o56eiq751fl2jhr4orco_R20241204T230000@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20250129T180000
CREATED:20241119T005440Z
DESCRIPTION:<p><b>Thanks to some fine scouting Wednesday morning by Jim Pow
 ers\, we are going to try a evening ride today.  Jim reports most all of th
 e ice is gone on Green Valley and Dubois Ridge.  Ride leaves at 6PM from th
 e old Little Nashville parking lot on SR 46 just west of Nashville.  Bring 
 Lights!  This is a good one we have not done in a while.</b></p><p><a href=
 "https://ridewithgps.com/routes/16544605" target="_blank">Yellowwood Dubois
  Loop 21</a><br></p><p>These rides feature gravel roads\, single and double
  track trails\,  and just enough pavement to string the aforementioned toge
 ther into fun\, woodsy adventure loops.  Rides begin at 6PM through the Fal
 l and Winter months as weather allows and typically last about two hours. L
 ights are mandatory as we enter the Fall and Winter seasons.</p><p>Routes a
 re suitable for mountain bike or gravel bike\, with some more turned to one
  or the other.  Rides begin at different locations\, primarily associated w
 ith Yellowwood State Forest\, Brown County State Park\, and the Hoosier Nat
 ional Forest in Monroe\, Lawrence\, and Brown Counties. Specific routes may
  be dictated by weather conditions\, but starting locations\, route maps\, 
 and gps file links will be posted here in advance.</p><p>Expect a lot of tr
 ees and few cars</p><p>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://se
 cure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=136627" target="_blan
 k"><u>free trial membership</u></a>\, good for up to three rides\, and whic
 h includes electronically signing a liability waiver\, prior to participati
 on.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20250225T143747Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Yellowwood Dubois Loop 21 - Growlers Off Road Adventure Ride
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
