 thgps.com/routes/38774666">GPS Links</a><br><br>This popular route was name
 d after the little diner in Hendricksville and provides a great tour of the
  hills in western Monroe County.  We will leave town via Vernal Pike and re
 turn via Rockport Road and That Road.  In between are some beautiful wester
 n Monroe and eastern Greene County roadways.<br><br>Non-members should sign
  up for a free trial membership\, good for up to three rides\, and which in
 cludes electronically signing a liability waiver\, prior to participation. 
