 es/2912154859389059302"><u>36 Bottom\, Burma\, Frontage\, Sample\, Old 37</
 u></a></p><p><br></p><p>Ready for a high spirited ride? BV Ride is an inter
 mediate/ advanced ride and moderate distance that may or may not include re
 grouping points.  Pace is anticipated to be 17+ mph. Expect occasional spri
 nt or Strava segments\, pace line riding at high speed\, intervals\, and fe
 wer regrouping stops.</p><p>The BV Ride will start at the Parking lot acros
 s from the Bryan Park Pool on Woodlawn at 5:45. Mileages will increase as t
 he season progresses. If you keep coming we will make you faster!</p><p>Rid
 ers are expected to look out for each other during the rides.  Ride maps an
 d GPS links will be posted here in advance. Riders unfamiliar with the rout
 e should bring along a copy of the map.</p>Non-members should sign up for a
  <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=1
 33776">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which i
 ncludes electronically signing a liability waiver\, prior to participation.
 <u></u><u></u>
