DESCRIPTION:<b>We have not been out to Hendricksville for a while because o
 f the SR43 bridge deck replacement.  But\, we can do it this way and enjoy 
 a nice southwest tailwind on the way home.</b><br><br><a href="https://ride
 withgps.com/routes/44088366">Karst Trail Hendricksville Elwren EB 32</a><br
 ><u></u><br><u></u>Watch the calendar for weather-related updates and for f
 uture rides.<br><br>This group emphasizes earlier\, moderate-paced rides wi
 th routes planned in advance and posted on the ride calendar. This is a no 
 drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride. Expect an overall average moving spe
 ed 11 - 15 mph. Distances vary from 20 to 30 miles. Early season rides will
  be somewhat shorter and slower. During colder weather the ride departs at 
 1:30pm.<br><br>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.get
 meregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=136627">free trial membership
 </a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signi
 ng a liability waiver\, prior to participation.<br><br><br><u></u>
LAST-MODIFIED:20230816T215109Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Parking Lot\, S Woodlawn Ave\, Bloomington\, IN 47401\,
  USA
