X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20231125T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20231125T143000
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:5mu5cn4ulv9saduakntkumeqne@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20231125T100000
CREATED:20231017T184315Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>This 32 mile ride will start at the Hickory Ridge Fire Tower
 \, and visit the old Combs 'Road' - we've not been up there for a couple of
  years\, let's go check it out.</p><p>Most suited to MTB but gravel / cross
  bike will work too.</p><p><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/42031988
 "><u>Up Combs to Story</u></a></p><p>These rides feature gravel roads\, sin
 gle and double track trails\,  and just enough pavement to string the afore
 mentioned together into fun\, woodsy adventure loops.  Rides begin at 10am 
 through the Fall and Winter months as weather allows and typically last abo
 ut three to four hours.</p><p>Routes are suitable for mountain bike or grav
 el bike\, with some more turned to one or the other.  Rides begin at differ
 ent locations\, primarily associated with Yellowwood State Forest\, Brown C
 ounty State Park\, and the Hoosier National Forest in Monroe\, Lawrence\, a
 nd Brown Counties.  Specific routes may be dictated by weather conditions\,
  but starting locations\, route maps\, and gps file links will be posted he
 re in advance.</p><p>Expect a lot of trees and few cars</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20231113T111339Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Up Combs to Story - Off Road Adventure Ride
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
