DESCRIPTION:<u></u><u></u><p><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://
 www.strava.com/routes/3134178540357395648&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&am
 p\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw3wmBtz4132Hjaf6JKDjy1c" target="_blank">32 Fairfax 
 Strain Ridge Popcorn Rockport Victor</a><br></p><p><br></p><p>Ready for a h
 igh spirited ride? BV Ride is an intermediate/ advanced ride and moderate d
 istance that may or may not include regrouping points.  Pace is anticipated
  to be 17+ mph. Expect occasional sprint or Strava segments\, pace line rid
 ing at high speed\, intervals\, and fewer regrouping stops.</p><p>The BV Ri
 de will start at the Parking lot across from the Bryan Park Pool on Woodlaw
 n at 5:45. Mileages will increase as the season progresses. If you keep com
 ing we will make you faster!</p><p>Riders are expected to look out for each
  other during the rides.  Ride maps and GPS links will be posted here in ad
 vance. Riders unfamiliar with the route should bring along a copy of the ma
 p.</p>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://www.google.com/url?
 q=https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id%3D133776&
 amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw33UtoPdTHekOxdiXo2
 LWCR" target="_blank">free trial membership</a>\, good for up to three ride
 s\, and which includes electronically signing a liability waiver\, prior to
  participation.<u></u><u></u>
LAST-MODIFIED:20230919T155252Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool\, 1020 S Woodlawn Ave\, Bloomington\, IN 47401\, U
 SA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:BV ride - 32 Fairfax Strain Ridge Popcorn Rockport Victor
TRANSP:OPAQUE
