CREATED:20240813T191734Z
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/49262931">Jeff's Salmer
 on / Wallow Hollow Loop from Hard Truth 29 · Ride with GPS</a><br><p>These 
 rides feature gravel roads\, single and double track trails\,  and just eno
 ugh pavement to string the aforementioned together into fun\, woodsy advent
 ure loops.  Rides begin at 10am through the Fall and Winter months as weath
 er allows and typically last about four hours. </p><p>Routes are suitable f
 or mountain bike or gravel bike\, with some more turned to one or the other
 .  Rides begin at different locations\, primarily associated with Yellowwoo
 d State Forest\, Brown County State Park\, and the Hoosier National Forest 
 in Monroe\, Lawrence\, and Brown Counties. Specific routes may be dictated 
 by weather conditions\, but starting locations\, route maps\, and gps file 
 links will be posted here in advance.</p><p>Expect a lot of trees and few c
 ars</p><p>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmereg
 istered.com/get_information.php?event_id=136627" target="_blank">free trial
  membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electroni
 cally signing a liability waiver\, prior to participation.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20250325T180159Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Jeff's Salmeron / Wallow Hollow from Hard Truth 29 - Growlers Off R
 oad Adventure Ride
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
