DESCRIPTION:<p><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/48903940" target="_b
 lank">All Around TC Steele · Ride with GPS</a></p><p>Doing a test with Emai
 l notification on this one...</p><p><b>Bring Lights! Bring Lights! Bring Li
 ghts!</b></p><p>These rides feature gravel roads\, single and double track 
 trails\, and just enough pavement to string the aforementioned together int
 o fun\, woodsy adventure loops.  Rides begin at 6PM through the Fall and Wi
 nter months as weather allows and typically last about two hours. Lights ar
 e mandatory as we enter the Fall and Winter seasons.</p><p>Routes are suita
 ble for mountain bike or gravel bike\, with some more turned to one or the 
 other.  Rides begin at different locations\, primarily associated with Yell
 owwood State Forest\, Brown County State Park\, and the Hoosier National Fo
 rest in Monroe\, Lawrence\, and Brown Counties. Specific routes may be dict
 ated by weather conditions\, but starting locations\, route maps\, and gps 
 file links will be posted here in advance.</p><p>Expect a lot of trees and 
 few cars</p><p>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.get
 meregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=136627" target="_blank"><u><u
 ><u><u><u><u><u><u>free trial membership</u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></a
 >\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing 
 a liability waiver\, prior to participation.</p>\n\nJoin with Google Meet: 
 https://meet.google.com/prx-vhwm-zzk\n\nLearn more about Meet at: https://s
 upport.google.com/a/users/answer/9282720
LAST-MODIFIED:20260406T132618Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Growlers - All Around TC Steele - Off Road Adventure Ride
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
