DESCRIPTION:<p>Trades District Plaza\, 380 W. 10th street.</p><p>notes</p><
 p>Route: Another Beer Ride 12.5 miles <a href="https://ridewithgps.com/rout
 es/52500842"><u>beginner West Side Neighborhoods · Ride with GPS</u></a></p
 ><p>Host: Jim Powers</p><p>These rides use area bike paths and quiet neighb
 orhood roads and avoid the big hills. These rides are perfect for beginners
 \, families\, or those ready to get back into cycling. Each ride will featu
 re a stop for refreshment and social time. Give this a try!</p><p>Non-membe
 rs should\, prior to participation\, sign up for a <a href="https://secure.
 getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=136627" target="_blank"><u
 ><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u>free trial membership</u></u></u></u></u></u></u><
 /u></u></a>\, good for up to three rides\, includes electronically signing 
 a liability waiver.</p><p><br></p>
