DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/37745723">16.5 -  OWLS 
 Bolin and Rockport</a><br><br>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="htt
 ps://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=136627" target
 ="_blank"><u><u>free trial membership</u></u></a>\, good for up to three ri
 des\, and which includes electronically signing a liability waiver\, prior 
 to participation.<ul><li>Be SAFE. Don't blow through stop signs. Consider b
 ike lights.<br></li><li>Be COURTEOUS: Single up in traffic<br></li><li>Be P
 REDICTABLE: Signal your intentions to cars and fellow riders.</li></ul>The 
 "Older\, Wiser\, and a Little Slower" training group emphasizes moderate ri
 des\, and a route planned in advance that is posted on the ride calendar. T
 his is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride.The OWLS group welcomes a
  wide range of intermediate riders\, and typically breaks off into a faster
  and slower group with the former averaging an overall moving speed of 16-1
 8 mph\, and the slower group averaging 13-15 mph (including hills). Distanc
 es vary from 20 to 30 miles\, depending partly on available light. Early se
 ason rides will be somewhat shorter and slower. Rides depart promptly at 5:
 45.<br><br>Questions? Contact <a href="mailto:gail.morell@gmail.com" target
 ="_blank"><u>Gail Morell</u></a>.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260302T160740Z
LOCATION:Sherwood Oaks Christian Church\, 2700 E Rogers Rd\, Bloomington\, 
 IN 47401\, USA
