DESCRIPTION:Route: East Side 20 miles<br>Host: Allan Edmonds<br><br>This is
  the flattest of our NnE routes. This version of the East Side NnE route go
 es out to the end of Old Knight Ridge\, near Pine Grove\, before turning ba
 ck toward town.<br><br>Meet at the spray pad area at Switchyard Park for a 
 1:00pm departure.<br><br>Nice 'n' Easy rides cater to those who want to tak
 e it easy and to less experienced riders.  These Sunday rides feature lower
  mileage (19-24 miles) and slower paces than Saturday touring rides.  They 
 use Bloomington area low traffic roads.<br><br>Non-members should\, prior t
 o participation\, sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com
 /get_information.php?event_id=137889" target="_blank">free trial membership
 </a>\, which includes electronically signing a liability waiver.
LAST-MODIFIED:20250822T140134Z
LOCATION:Switchyard Park\, 1601 S Rogers St\, Bloomington\, IN 47403\, USA
