DESCRIPTION:<p>Trying something a little different this week.  Please take 
 a look at the Ride With GPS event below.</p><p>Sign up to join the ride if 
 you're interested!!  </p><p>As part of the Website revamp we are looking at
  ways to improve communication.  Using the Event feature will help us know 
 who's going to show up for a ride for example.</p><p>Help us test this capa
 bility!  </p><p><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/events/463697-growlers-off
 -road-adventure-blackwell-to?privacy_code=VQT6YqDXqctBGNmHpay1tB754r0OEDhA"
 >https://ridewithgps.com/events/463697-growlers-off-road-adventure-blackwel
 l-to?privacy_code=VQT6YqDXqctBGNmHpay1tB754r0OEDhA</a></p><p>These rides fe
 ature gravel roads\, single and double track trails\, and just enough pavem
 ent to string the aforementioned together into fun\, woodsy adventure loops
 .  Rides begin at 6PM through the Fall and Winter months as weather allows 
 and typically last about two hours. Lights are mandatory as we enter the Fa
 ll and Winter seasons.</p><p>Routes are suitable for mountain bike or grave
 l bike\, with some more turned to one or the other.  Rides begin at differe
 nt locations\, primarily associated with Yellowwood State Forest\, Brown Co
 unty State Park\, and the Hoosier National Forest in Monroe\, Lawrence\, an
 d Brown Counties. Specific routes may be dictated by weather conditions\, b
 ut starting locations\, route maps\, and gps file links will be posted here
  in advance.</p><p>Expect a lot of trees and few cars</p><p>Non-members sho
 uld sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_informati
 on.php?event_id=136627" target="_blank"><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u>free trial 
 membership</u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></a>\, good for up to three rides
 \, and which includes electronically signing a liability waiver\, prior to 
 participation.</p>
