 lank"><u><u><u>free trial membership</u></u></u></a>\, good for up to one m
 onth\, and which includes electronically signing a liability waiver\, prior
  to participation.<br><br>The “Older\, Wiser\, and a Little Slower” group e
 mphasizes moderate rides and a route planned in advance that is posted on t
 he ride calendar. This is a no drop ride for a range of intermediate riders
