DESCRIPTION:<p><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/53085644" target="_b
 lank">20 - Norman</a><br></p><p><b>Meet at Hickory Ridge Fire Tower.  Route
  is a lot of gravel\, and no trail.</b></p><p><b>Bring Lights! Bring Lights
 ! Bring Lights!</b></p><p>These rides feature gravel roads\, single and dou
 ble track trails\, and just enough pavement to string the aforementioned to
 gether into fun\, woodsy adventure loops.  Rides begin at 6PM through the F
 all and Winter months as weather allows and typically last about two hours.
  Lights are mandatory as we enter the Fall and Winter seasons.</p><p>Routes
  are suitable for mountain bike or gravel bike\, with some more turned to o
 ne or the other.  Rides begin at different locations\, primarily associated
  with Yellowwood State Forest\, Brown County State Park\, and the Hoosier N
 ational Forest in Monroe\, Lawrence\, and Brown Counties. Specific routes m
 ay be dictated by weather conditions\, but starting locations\, route maps\
 , and gps file links will be posted here in advance.</p><p>Expect a lot of 
 trees and few cars</p><p>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://
 secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=136627" target="_bl
 ank"><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u>free trial membership</u></u></u></u></u></u><
 /u></u></a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronicall
 y signing a liability waiver\, prior to participation.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260406T132618Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:20 - Norman - Growlers Off Road Adventure Ride
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
