 <u><u>free trial membership</u></u></a>\, good for up to three rides\, and 
 which includes electronically signing a liability waiver\, prior to partici
 pation.<ul><li>Be SAFE. Don't blow through stop signs. Consider bike lights
 .<br></li><li>Be COURTEOUS: Single up in traffic<br></li><li>Be PREDICTABLE
 : Signal your intentions to cars and fellow riders.</li></ul>The "Older\, W
 iser\, and a Little Slower" training group emphasizes moderate rides\, and 
