DESCRIPTION:Route/Event Link:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/events/491019
 -karst-farm-greenway-beginner-social-ride" target="_blank">https://ridewith
 gps.com/events/491019-karst-farm-greenway-beginner-social-ride</a><br><br>T
 his will be a 15 mile ride\, 99% on the bike path. We will start and end at
  The Sip pub (kids OK with parents). We will rideUP the Karst Farm Greenway
  bike path to Karst Farm Park\, take a break\, and then ride back down to T
 he Sip for social time. <strong>Park at Bender Lumber next door to The Sip.
 </strong><br><p>These rides use area bike paths and quiet neighborhood road
 s and avoid the big hills. They are perfect for beginners\, families\, or t
 hose ready to get back into cycling. Each ride will feature <b>a stop for r
 efreshment and social time.</b>  Give this a try!</p><p>This is a <b>no-dro
 p ride—we will stay with you</b>. Ride with others—it's safer and more fun!
  Learn and explore beginner-friendly cycling routes around Bloomington.</p>
 <p>Non-members should\, prior to participation\, sign up for a <a href="htt
 ps://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSc6QkEJx4zO-lff9XtyQhWIebF1fHQDCIr7cI
 DNMmL5fr7NvA/viewform" target="_blank"><u>free trial membership</u></a>\, w
 hich includes electronically signing a liability waiver.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260713T131822Z
LOCATION:The Sip Craft Beer Pub\, 5920 W State Rd 46\, Bloomington\, IN 474
 04\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Beginner/Social Ride\, Karst Farm Greenway from The Sip.
