CREATED:20250922T201508Z
DESCRIPTION:<p><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/48310421">Blackwell 
 Loop to HNF Trail 19 · Ride with GPS</a></p><p><b>Bring Lights! Bring Light
 s! Bring Lights!</b></p><p>These rides feature gravel roads\, single and do
 uble track trails\, and just enough pavement to string the aforementioned t
 ogether into fun\, woodsy adventure loops.  Rides begin at 6PM through the 
 Fall and Winter months as weather allows and typically last about two hours
 . Lights are mandatory as we enter the Fall and Winter seasons.</p><p>Route
 s are suitable for mountain bike or gravel bike\, with some more turned to 
 one or the other.  Rides begin at different locations\, primarily associate
 d with Yellowwood State Forest\, Brown County State Park\, and the Hoosier 
 National Forest in Monroe\, Lawrence\, and Brown Counties. Specific routes 
 may be dictated by weather conditions\, but starting locations\, route maps
 \, and gps file links will be posted here in advance.</p><p>Expect a lot of
  trees and few cars</p><p>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https:/
 /secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=136627" target="_b
 lank"><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u>free trial membership</u></u></u></u></u></u>
 </u></u></a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronical
 ly signing a liability waiver\, prior to participation.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260406T132618Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Blackwell Loop to Trail HNF 19 - Growlers Off Road Adventure Ride
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
