DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/52390312" target="_blan
 k">Tulip Tree Trek 20 · Ride with GPS</a><br><br>Suitable for MTB\, Gravel\
 , Cross Bikes<br><p>These rides feature gravel roads\, single and double tr
 ack trails\, and just enough pavement to string the aforementioned together
  into fun\, woodsy adventure loops.  Rides begin at 6PM through the Fall an
 d Winter months as weather allows and typically last about two hours. Light
 s are mandatory as we enter the Fall and Winter seasons.</p><p>Routes are s
 uitable for mountain bike or gravel bike\, with some more turned to one or 
 the other.  Rides begin at different locations\, primarily associated with 
 Yellowwood State Forest\, Brown County State Park\, and the Hoosier Nationa
 l Forest in Monroe\, Lawrence\, and Brown Counties. Specific routes may be 
 dictated by weather conditions\, but starting locations\, route maps\, and 
 gps file links will be posted here in advance.</p><p>Expect a lot of trees 
 and few cars</p><p>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure
 .getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=136627" target="_blank"><
 u><u><u><u><u><u>free trial membership</u></u></u></u></u></u></a>\, good f
 or up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing a liabilit
 y waiver\, prior to participation.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20250826T143528Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Growlers Off Road Adventure - Tulip Tree Trek 20
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
