 table for mountain bike or gravel bike\, with some more turned to one or th
 e other.  Rides begin at different locations\, primarily associated with Ye
 llowwood State Forest\, Brown County State Park\, and the Hoosier National 
 Forest in Monroe\, Lawrence\, and Brown Counties. Specific routes may be di
 ctated by weather conditions\, but starting locations\, route maps\, and gp
 s file links will be posted here in advance.</p><p>Expect a lot of trees an
 d few cars</p><p>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.g
 etmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=136627" target="_blank"><u>
 <u><u><u><u><u><u><u>free trial membership</u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u><
 /a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signin
 g a liability waiver\, prior to participation</p>
