UID:3npj7dbbme1mm2hlbr9dtlc83c@google.com
CREATED:20250217T015207Z
DESCRIPTION:<p><b>Note:  Map revisions have been made based on a field insp
 ection of the entire route on September 17.  Unfortunately\, Wyandotte Road
  at the I-64 overpass is closed due to construction of a complete replaceme
 nt bridge over the interstate.  The only viable way to Leavenworth is a rig
 ht turn at the Shoe Tree onto Knight Road and a left turn onto SR66 for an 
 out and back to the Leavenworth Overlook.  </b></p><p><b>Updated (September
  18) routes are here:</b></p><p><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/527
 10604" target="_blank">Spring Mill to Leavenworth 2025</a></p><p><a href="h
 ttps://ridewithgps.com/routes/52710742" target="_blank">Spring Mill to Leav
 enworth 2025 Shoe Tree Cutoff 81</a></p><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/ro
 utes/52710834" target="_blank">Spring Mill to Leavenworth 2025 Marengo Cuto
 ff 64</a><br><br>Some BBCers will be camping at Spring Mill on Friday and S
 aturday nights (before and after the ride). Four camp sites are reserved (N
 os. 34\, 35\, 38\, and 39)\, so if you are interested in camping with this 
 group try to get a site in this general area.   Also\, the recently renovat
 ed Spring Mill Inn is now open and accommodations may be available there.
LAST-MODIFIED:20250918T232511Z
LOCATION:Spring Mill State Park\, 3333 IN-60 E\, Mitchell\, IN 47446\, USA
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Spring Mill - Leavenworth hosted by John Bassett
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
