DTEND:20260503T200000Z
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:4a45jc2odd3inlo8i15gscr5di@google.com
CREATED:20260428T193912Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>Route/Event Link:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/events/479
 100-hoosier-alley-beginner-ride">https://ridewithgps.com/events/479100-hoos
 ier-alley-beginner-ride</a></p><p>These rides use area bike paths and quiet
  neighborhood roads and avoid the big hills. They are perfect for beginners
 \, families\, or those ready to get back into cycling. Each ride will featu
 re <b>a stop for refreshment and social time.</b> Give this a try!</p><p>Th
 is is a <b>no-drop ride—we will stay with you</b>. Ride with others—it's sa
 fer and more fun! Learn and explore beginner-friendly cycling routes around
  Bloomington.</p><p>Non-members should\, prior to participation\, sign up f
 or a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_
 id=137889" target="_blank"><u><u>free trial membership</u></u></a>\, which 
 includes electronically signing a liability waiver.</p>
