DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/37745723">16 -  OWLS Bo
 lin and Rockport 2024</a><br><br>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="
 https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=136627" tar
 get="_blank"><u><u>free trial membership</u></u></a>\, good for up to three
  rides\, and which includes electronically signing a liability waiver\, pri
 or to participation.<ul><li>Be SAFE. Don't blow through stop signs. Conside
 r bike lights.<br></li><li>Be COURTEOUS: Single up in traffic<br></li><li>B
 e PREDICTABLE: Signal your intentions to cars and fellow riders.</li></ul>T
 he "Older\, Wiser\, and a Little Slower" training group emphasizes moderate
  rides\, and a route planned in advance that is posted on the ride calendar
 . This is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride.The OWLS group welcome
 s a wide range of intermediate riders\, and typically breaks off into a fas
 ter and slower group with the former averaging an overall moving speed of 1
 6-18 mph\, and the slower group averaging 13-15 mph (including hills). Dist
 ances vary from 20 to 30 miles\, depending partly on available light. Early
  season rides will be somewhat shorter and slower. Rides depart promptly at
  5:45.<br><br>Questions? Contact <a href="mailto:gail.morell@gmail.com" tar
 get="_blank"><u>Gail Morell</u></a>.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260302T160740Z
LOCATION:Sherwood Oaks Christian Church\, 2700 E Rogers Rd\, Bloomington\, 
 IN 47401\, USA
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:OWLS Ride - 16 Bolin\, Stansifer\, Rockport
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
