DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/51237469" target="_blan
 k"><u>Up Up and aWaycross from Yellowwood Lake · Ride with GPS</u></a><br><
 br>Suitable for Cross\, MTB or Gravel Bikes<p>These rides feature gravel ro
 ads\, single and double track trails\,  and just enough pavement to string 
 the aforementioned together into fun\, woodsy adventure loops.  Rides begin
  at 6PM through the Fall and Winter months as weather allows and typically 
 last about two hours. Lights are mandatory as we enter the Fall and Winter 
 seasons.</p><p>Routes are suitable for mountain bike or gravel bike\, with 
 some more turned to one or the other.  Rides begin at different locations\,
  primarily associated with Yellowwood State Forest\, Brown County State Par
 k\, and the Hoosier National Forest in Monroe\, Lawrence\, and Brown Counti
 es. Specific routes may be dictated by weather conditions\, but starting lo
 cations\, route maps\, and gps file links will be posted here in advance.</
 p><p>Expect a lot of trees and few cars</p><p>Non-members should sign up fo
 r a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_i
 d=136627" target="_blank"><u><u><u><u><u><u><u>free trial membership</u></u
 ></u></u></u></u></u></a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes
  electronically signing a liability waiver\, prior to participation</p>
