 e route to Highway 48 for 20 miles. Or turn off at the Karst Trail\, head t
 o Karst Park and then home.</p><br><span>This group emphasizes earlier\, mo
 derate-paced rides with routes planned in advance and posted on the ride ca
 lendar. This is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride.  Expect an over
 all average moving speed of 12 - 15 mph.  Distances vary from 20 to a littl
 e over 30 miles.  Early season rides will be at the lower end of the distan
 ce scale.  During colder weather the ride departs at 1:00pm.  </span><br><b
 r>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.
 com/get_information.php?event_id=136627" target="_blank">free trial members
 hip</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically si
 gning a liability waiver\, prior to participation.<br><br><br><u></u>
