 ycleclub.org/monthly_rides.php</a> for more information about the OWLS.\n\n
 <a href="http://ridewithgps.com/routes/2833824">Kerr Creek - Robinson - Bet
 hel</a>\, about 30 miles. Out Kerr Creek\, Getty's Creek\, Mount Gilead to 
 Tunnel. Then Robinson to Old 37 to Bethel Lane\, and back home on 45. Short
  option skips Robinson - Old 37 - Bethel and returns directly on 45 from Tu
 nnel Road.
