 nville%2FNeedmore%2FTunnel&sampleGraph=true" style="width: 1px\; min-width:
  100%\; height: 700px\; border: none\;" scrolling="no"></iframe>\n\nThe iRi
 de is a no drop ride with regroup points geared toward the rider wanting to
  push the pace a bit without being race oriented. 16-18mph avg on most ride
 s. We typically follow the OWLS group route and add some extra miles/climbs
  in the second half of the route allowing folks to start out with us and if
  we are too fast they can drop back to the OWLS group. All interested in a 
 brisker pace are welcome!\n\nNon-members should sign up for a free trial me
 mbership of up to one month and sign a liability waiver before participatin
 g in a club ride. https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?ev
 ent_id=141883
