CREATED:20250901T132843Z
DESCRIPTION:<p><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/45610656">Up Combs t
 o Story 32</a><br></p><p><b>Meet at Hickory Grove Fire Tower</b></p><p>Suit
 able for Cross\, MTB or Gravel Bikes</p><p>These rides feature gravel roads
 \, single and double track trails\,  and just enough pavement to string the
  aforementioned together into fun\, woodsy adventure loops.  Rides begin at
  6PM through the Fall and Winter months as weather allows and typically las
 t about two hours. Lights are mandatory as we enter the Fall and Winter sea
 sons.</p><p>Routes are suitable for mountain bike or gravel bike\, with som
 e more turned to one or the other.  Rides begin at different locations\, pr
 imarily associated with Yellowwood State Forest\, Brown County State Park\,
  and the Hoosier National Forest in Monroe\, Lawrence\, and Brown Counties.
  Specific routes may be dictated by weather conditions\, but starting locat
 ions\, route maps\, and gps file links will be posted here in advance.</p><
 p>Expect a lot of trees and few cars</p><p>Non-members should sign up for a
  <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=1
 36627" target="_blank"><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u>free trial membership</u></u
 ></u></u></u></u></u></u></a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which incl
 udes electronically signing a liability waiver\, prior to participation</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20251123T150213Z
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Up Combs to Story 32 - Growlers Off Road Adventure Ride
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
