 ops.  Rides begin at 6PM through the Fall and Winter months as weather allo
 ws and typically last about two hours. Lights are mandatory as we enter the
  Fall and Winter seasons.</p><p>Routes are suitable for mountain bike or gr
 avel bike\, with some more turned to one or the other.  Rides begin at diff
 erent locations\, primarily associated with Yellowwood State Forest\, Brown
  County State Park\, and the Hoosier National Forest in Monroe\, Lawrence\,
  and Brown Counties. Specific routes may be dictated by weather conditions\
 , but starting locations\, route maps\, and gps file links will be posted h
 ere in advance.</p><p>Expect a lot of trees and few cars</p><p>Non-members 
