DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:2gsfpmrodvna19i0e30g9nn9mg@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20250424T174500
CREATED:20240228T171318Z
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/39702246">25 -  OWLS Tw
 o Creeks and a Lake</a><br><br>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="ht
 tps://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=136627" targe
 t="_blank"><u><u>free trial membership</u></u></a>\, good for up to three r
 ides\, and which includes electronically signing a liability waiver\, prior
  to participation.<ul><li>Be SAFE. Don't blow through stop signs. Consider 
 bike lights.<br></li><li>Be COURTEOUS: Single up in traffic<br></li><li>Be 
 PREDICTABLE: Signal your intentions to cars and fellow riders.</li></ul>The
  "Older\, Wiser\, and a Little Slower" training group emphasizes moderate r
 ides\, and a route planned in advance that is posted on the ride calendar. 
 This is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride.The OWLS group welcomes 
 a wide range of intermediate riders\, and typically breaks off into a faste
 r and slower group with the former averaging an overall moving speed of 16-
 18 mph\, and the slower group averaging 13-15 mph (including hills). Distan
 ces vary from 20 to 30 miles\, depending partly on available light. Early s
 eason rides will be somewhat shorter and slower. Rides depart promptly at 5
 :45.<br><br>Questions? Contact <a href="mailto:gail.morell@gmail.com" targe
 t="_blank"><u>Gail Morell</u></a>.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260302T160740Z
LOCATION:Sherwood Oaks Christian Church\, 2700 E Rogers Rd\, Bloomington\, 
 IN 47401\, USA
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:OWLS Ride - 25 Two Creeks and a Lake
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
