BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART:20260419T140000Z
DTEND:20260419T183000Z
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:3f46u16oc4nhdrodnnhvfpll2t@google.com
CREATED:20260412T160822Z
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/events/473319-growlers-29-jeff
 -s-salmeron-wallow-hollo?privacy_code=2O5uhNg7e5qel3H9PKPPWsWotoxjhdvt">htt
 ps://ridewithgps.com/events/473319-growlers-29-jeff-s-salmeron-wallow-hollo
 ?privacy_code=2O5uhNg7e5qel3H9PKPPWsWotoxjhdvt</a><br><br>Join in for a fun
  Brown County gravel ride starting and ending at Hard Truth in Nashville.  
 This is a loop ride borrowed from Jeff Fetterer and has its fair share of u
 ps and downs.  With the exception of Covered Bridge Road the clockwise loop
  generally goes down the steep grades and up the gentler grades.  Get to ne
 ar the top of Bear Wallow Hill without ever being on Bear Wallow Hill Road.
  And\, finish up with a great gravel decent on Wallow Hollow.<br><br>Route 
 is entirely gravel and pavement - no trail.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260416T185656Z
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Growlers - Jeff's Salmeron Wallow Hollow from Hard Truth
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
