 k">25 - OWLS Leonard Springs and Smithville</a><br><br><b>Due to Rogers roa
 d closure we will head out South on Sare Rd. and connect to the Jackson Cre
 ek trail at Rhorer. </b><br><br>Non-members should sign up for a free trial
