UID:04bnsgpu80248accn6js5sltta@google.com
CREATED:20260512T203135Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>Route/Event Link:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/events/481
 613-the-ice-cream-beginner-social-ride-12-mi">https://ridewithgps.com/event
 s/481613-the-ice-cream-beginner-social-ride-12-mi</a></p><p>These rides use
  area bike paths and quiet neighborhood roads and avoid the big hills. They
  are perfect for beginners\, families\, or those ready to get back into cyc
 ling. Each ride will feature <b>a stop for refreshment and social time.</b>
  This time we will stop at Bruster's\, 7 miles into our ride.  <u>Bring cas
 h or CC to buy ice cream! </u> Give this a try!</p><p>This is a <b>no-drop 
 ride—we will stay with you</b>. Ride with others—it's safer and more fun! L
 earn and explore beginner-friendly cycling routes around Bloomington.</p><p
 >Non-members should\, prior to participation\, sign up for a <a href="https
 ://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=137889" target="
 _blank"><u><u><u>free trial membership</u></u></u></a>\, which includes ele
 ctronically signing a liability waiver.</p>
