CREATED:20250901T132843Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>Laura\, Jenny and Mykal have kindly invited us to their plac
 e at Somerset Lake to christen their new deck afterwards!  Bring a snack to
  share and of course your favorite beverage(s)!</p><p><a href="https://ride
 withgps.com/routes/51237469" target="_blank"><u><u>Up Up and aWaycross from
  Yellowwood Lake · Ride with GPS</u></u></a><br><br>Suitable for Cross\, MT
 B or Gravel Bikes</p><p>These rides feature gravel roads\, single and doubl
 e track trails\,  and just enough pavement to string the aforementioned tog
 ether into fun\, woodsy adventure loops.  Rides begin at 6PM through the Fa
 ll and Winter months as weather allows and typically last about two hours. 
 Lights are mandatory as we enter the Fall and Winter seasons.</p><p>Routes 
 are suitable for mountain bike or gravel bike\, with some more turned to on
 e or the other.  Rides begin at different locations\, primarily associated 
 with Yellowwood State Forest\, Brown County State Park\, and the Hoosier Na
 tional Forest in Monroe\, Lawrence\, and Brown Counties. Specific routes ma
 y be dictated by weather conditions\, but starting locations\, route maps\,
  and gps file links will be posted here in advance.</p><p>Expect a lot of t
 rees and few cars</p><p>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://s
 ecure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=136627" target="_bla
 nk"><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u>free trial membership</u></u></u></u></u></u></
 u></u></a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically
  signing a liability waiver\, prior to participation</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20251123T150521Z
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Growlers Off Road Adventure Ride - Up Up and aWaycross & Deck Party
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
