 ly follow the OWLS group route and add some extra miles/climbs in the secon
 d half of the route allowing folks to start out with us and if we are too f
 ast they can drop back to the OWLS group. All interested in a brisker pace 
 are welcome!\n\nNon-members should sign up for a free trial membership of u
 p to one month and sign a liability waiver before participating in a club r
 ide. https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=141883
