DESCRIPTION:<b>ROUTE WILL BE POSTED HERE</b><br><br><a href="https://ridewi
 thgps.com/events/500205-growlers-season-opener" target="_blank">Growlers - 
 Season Opener · Ride with GPS</a><br><br>Come and join us!<br><br>Suitable 
 for Cross\, MTB or Gravel Bikes.<br><br>These rides feature gravel roads\, 
 single and double track trails\,  and just enough pavement to string the af
 orementioned together into fun\, woodsy adventure loops.  Rides begin at 6P
 M through the Fall and Winter months as weather allows and typically last a
 bout two hours. Lights are mandatory as we enter the Fall and Winter season
 s.<br>Routes are suitable for mountain bike or gravel bike\, with some more
  turned to one or the other.  Rides begin at different locations\, primaril
 y associated with Yellowwood State Forest\, Brown County State Park\, and t
 he Hoosier National Forest in Monroe\, Lawrence\, and Brown Counties. Speci
 fic routes may be dictated by weather conditions\, but starting locations\,
  route maps\, and gps file links will be posted here in advance.<br>Expect 
 a lot of trees and few cars<br>Non-members should sign up for a free trial 
 membership\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically
  signing a liability waiver\, prior to participating.
