 r the other.  Rides begin at different locations\, primarily associated wit
 h Yellowwood State Forest\, Brown County State Park\, and the Hoosier Natio
 nal Forest in Monroe\, Lawrence\, and Brown Counties. Specific routes may b
 e dictated by weather conditions\, but starting locations\, route maps\, an
 d gps file links will be posted here in advance.</p><p>Expect a lot of tree
