DESCRIPTION:<p><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/53008514" target="_b
 lank">Yellowwood Dubois Loop 21</a></p><p><b>Meet in the parking lot of the
  old Little Nashville Parking Lot\, as shown on the RWGPS Map.  Bring Light
 s! Bring Lights! Bring Lights!</b></p><p>These rides feature gravel roads\,
  single and double track trails\, and just enough pavement to string the af
 orementioned together into fun\, woodsy adventure loops.  Rides begin at 6P
 M through the Fall and Winter months as weather allows and typically last a
 bout two hours. Lights are mandatory as we enter the Fall and Winter season
 s.</p><p>Routes are suitable for mountain bike or gravel bike\, with some m
 ore turned to one or the other.  Rides begin at different locations\, prima
 rily associated with Yellowwood State Forest\, Brown County State Park\, an
 d the Hoosier National Forest in Monroe\, Lawrence\, and Brown Counties. Sp
 ecific routes may be dictated by weather conditions\, but starting location
 s\, route maps\, and gps file links will be posted here in advance.</p><p>E
 xpect a lot of trees and few cars</p><p>Non-members should sign up for a <a
  href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=1366
 27" target="_blank"><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u>free trial membership</u></u></
 u></u></u></u></u></u></a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which include
 s electronically signing a liability waiver\, prior to participation.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260406T132618Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Yellowwood Dubois Loop 21 - Growlers Off Road Adventure Ride
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
