 eginner-ride?privacy_code=6DeOPEZ8UObSjfLkktIhwELs26VQNvK9</a> </p><p>These
  rides use area bike paths and quiet neighborhood roads and avoid the big h
 ills. They are perfect for beginners\, families\, or those ready to get bac
 k into cycling. Each ride will feature <b>a stop for refreshment and social
  time.</b> Give this a try!</p><p>This is a <b>no-drop ride—we will stay wi
 th you</b>. Ride with others—it's safer and more fun! Learn and explore beg
 inner-friendly cycling routes around Bloomington.</p><p>Non-members should\
