 rop ride with regroup points geared toward the rider wanting to push the pa
 ce a bit without being race oriented. 16-18mph avg on most rides. We typica
 lly follow the OWLS group route and add some extra miles/climbs in the seco
 nd half of the route allowing folks to start out with us and if we are too 
 fast they can drop back to the OWLS group. All interested in a brisker pace
  are welcome!\n\nNon-members should sign up for a free trial membership of 
 up to one month and sign a liability waiver before participating in a club 
 ride. https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=14188
 3
