DESCRIPTION:<br><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/51718438" target="_
 blank">Axsom Branch Out n Back · Ride with GPS</a><br><br>Suitable for Grav
 el\, Cross or Mountain Bike<br><p>These rides feature gravel roads\, single
  and double track trails\,  and just enough pavement to string the aforemen
 tioned together into fun\, woodsy adventure loops.  Rides begin at 6PM thro
 ugh the Fall and Winter months as weather allows and typically last about t
 wo hours. Lights are mandatory as we enter the Fall and Winter seasons.</p>
 <p>Routes are suitable for mountain bike or gravel bike\, with some more tu
 rned to one or the other.  Rides begin at different locations\, primarily a
 ssociated with Yellowwood State Forest\, Brown County State Park\, and the 
 Hoosier National Forest in Monroe\, Lawrence\, and Brown Counties. Specific
  routes may be dictated by weather conditions\, but starting locations\, ro
 ute maps\, and gps file links will be posted here in advance.</p><p>Expect 
 a lot of trees and few cars</p><p>Non-members should sign up for a <a href=
 "https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=136627" ta
 rget="_blank"><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u>free trial membership</u></u></u><
 /u></u></u></u></u></u></a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includ
 es electronically signing a liability waiver\, prior to participation.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20250715T020902Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Growlers Off Road Adventure Ride - Axsom Branch
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
