  fast they can drop back to the OWLS group. All interested in a brisker pac
 e are welcome!\n\nNon-members should sign up for a free trial membership of
  up to one month and sign a liability waiver before participating in a club
  ride. https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=1418
 83
