DESCRIPTION:<b>UPDATE:  Wednesday 1:00 PM.  Green Valley is reported to be 
 underwater at places downstream of Oak Grove.  I suggest we do this route f
 rom the Yellowwood parking lot\, as originally posted\, but turn right on L
 anam Ridge off of Plum Creek\, then turn left on Dubois Ridge and follow th
 at all the way down to Green Valley.  This route keeps us on the ridge and 
 out of the floodwaters.</b><br><br><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/events/
 480484-growlers-gnawbone-lefty-off-road-adventu" target="_blank">https://ri
 dewithgps.com/events/480484-growlers-gnawbone-lefty-off-road-adventu</a>
