DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20251108T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20251108T143000
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:2mnb4tgamjrcrgr0tgkhnnj61b_R20250920T140000@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20251108T100000
CREATED:20250901T132843Z
DESCRIPTION:<br><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/52425571" target="_
 blank"><u>Yellowwood Beanblossom Bond Bartley Ridge · Ride with GPS</u></a>
 <br><br><br>Suitable for MTB\, Gravel\, Cross Bikes<br><p>These rides featu
 re gravel roads\, single and double track trails\, and just enough pavement
  to string the aforementioned together into fun\, woodsy adventure loops.  
 Rides begin at 6PM through the Fall and Winter months as weather allows and
  typically last about two hours. Lights are mandatory as we enter the Fall 
 and Winter seasons.</p><p>Routes are suitable for mountain bike or gravel b
 ike\, with some more turned to one or the other.  Rides begin at different 
 locations\, primarily associated with Yellowwood State Forest\, Brown Count
 y State Park\, and the Hoosier National Forest in Monroe\, Lawrence\, and B
 rown Counties. Specific routes may be dictated by weather conditions\, but 
 starting locations\, route maps\, and gps file links will be posted here in
  advance.</p><p>Expect a lot of trees and few cars</p><p>Non-members should
  sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.
 php?event_id=136627" target="_blank"><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u>free trial mem
 bership</u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></a>\, good for up to three rides\, 
 and which includes electronically signing a liability waiver\, prior to par
 ticipation.</p>
