UID:0k6gr5v8886kponnatra877vp3@google.com
CREATED:20250905T153436Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>Make it a TdR weekend!</p><p>We are offering free rides on S
 unday morning.  There are two options.  Both start at 10am.</p><p>A <b>Brea
 king Away</b> (the movie) bike tour of Bloomington. A ~ 15 mile tour of the
  iconic sites from the movie Breaking Away with our own expert guide - you 
 know you want to! To make this even more fun - re-watch the movie before yo
 u come.</p><p></p><p>A <b>Gravel ride </b>in the Hoosier National Forest. T
 his will be a 24 mile\, mostly gravel route  (with a short cut option to ma
 ke a 20 mile ride). The ride is no drop.  We regroup at any significant tur
 n to make sure we all stay pretty close together.  We will stick around for
  a cold beverage after the ride -  in keeping with gravel ride tradition</p
 ><br><br><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/52483754">TdR Gravel 24 · 
 Ride with GPS</a><br><br><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/52483909">
 TdR Gravel 20 · Ride with GPS</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20250905T155557Z
SEQUENCE:3
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:TDR Gravel Ride 20 or 24 Miles - You Decide
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
