BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART:20250712T140000Z
DTEND:20250712T183000Z
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:6lemg142u3mhca42qrcaha6524@google.com
CREATED:20250711T200046Z
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/45610635">Jeff's Salmer
 on / Wallow Hollow Loop from Hard Truth 29 (copy) · Ride with GPS</a><br><b
 r><br><br>Join in for a fun Brown County gravel ride starting and more impo
 rtantly ending at Hard Truth in Nashville.  This is a loop ride borrowed fr
 om Jeff Fetterer and has its fair share of ups and downs.  With the excepti
 on of Covered Bridge Road the clockwise loop generally goes down the steep 
 grades and up the gentler grades.  Get to near the top of Bear Wallow Hill 
 without ever being on Bear Wallow Hill Road. And\, finish up with a great g
 ravel decent on Wallow Hollow.<br><br>Route is entirely gravel and pavement
  - no trail. <br><br>Shorter options are possible <br><p>These rides featur
 e gravel roads\, single and double track trails\,  and just enough pavement
  to string the aforementioned together into fun\, woodsy adventure loops.  
 Rides begin at 10am through the Fall and Winter months as weather allows an
 d typically last about three to four hours.</p><p>Routes are suitable for m
 ountain bike or gravel bike\, with some more turned to one or the other.  R
 ides begin at different locations\, primarily associated with Yellowwood St
 ate Forest\, Brown County State Park\, and the Hoosier National Forest in M
 onroe\, Lawrence\, and Brown Counties.  Specific routes may be dictated by 
 weather conditions\, but starting locations\, route maps\, and gps file lin
 ks will be posted here in advance.</p><p>Expect a lot of trees and few cars
 </p><p>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregist
 ered.com/get_information.php?event_id=136627" target="_blank"><u>free trial
  membership</u></a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes elect
 ronically signing a liability waiver\, prior to participation.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20250711T200541Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Growlers Off Road Adventure Ride - Jeff's Salmeron / Wallow Hollow 
 Loop from Hard Truth
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
