 ch includes electronically signing a liability waiver\, prior to participat
 ion.<br><br>The “Older\, Wiser\, and a Little Slower” group emphasizes mode
 rate rides and a route planned in advance that is posted on the ride calend
 ar. This is a no drop ride for a range of intermediate riders—it is not a b
