 433-north-campus-tour-beginner-social-ride</a><br><br>This will be a 14 mil
 e ride through campus\, past the stadium\, golf course and hospital. We wil
 l start and end at the Switchyard Park Splash Pad.  After the ride we will 
 enjoy social time at Hopscotch Coffee (also beer and soft drinks).<br><p>Th
 ese rides use area bike paths and quiet neighborhood roads and avoid the bi
 g hills. They are perfect for beginners\, families\, or those ready to get 
 back into cycling. Each ride will feature <b>a stop for refreshment and soc
 ial time.</b>  Give this a try!</p><p>This is a <b>no-drop ride—we will sta
 y with you</b>. Ride with others—it's safer and more fun! Learn and explore
  beginner-friendly cycling routes around Bloomington.</p><p>Non-members sho
 uld\, prior to participation\, sign up for a <a href="https://docs.google.c
 om/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSc6QkEJx4zO-lff9XtyQhWIebF1fHQDCIr7cIDNMmL5fr7NvA/viewf
 orm" target="_blank"><u><u>free trial membership</u></u></a>\, which includ
 es electronically signing a liability waiver.</p>
