 he pace a bit without being race oriented. 16-18mph avg on most rides. We t
 ypically follow the OWLS group route and add some extra miles/climbs in the
  second half of the route allowing folks to start out with us and if we are
  too fast they can drop back to the OWLS group. All interested in a brisker
  pace are welcome!<br><br>Non-members should sign up for a free trial membe
 rship of up to one month and sign a liability waiver before participating i
 n a club ride. <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.
