DESCRIPTION:<p><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/48903940">All Around
  TC Steele · Ride with GPS</a></p><p><b>Bring Lights! Bring Lights! Bring L
 ights!</b></p><p>These rides feature gravel roads\, single and double track
  trails\, and just enough pavement to string the aforementioned together in
 to fun\, woodsy adventure loops.  Rides begin at 6PM through the Fall and W
 inter months as weather allows and typically last about two hours. Lights a
 re mandatory as we enter the Fall and Winter seasons.</p><p>Routes are suit
 able for mountain bike or gravel bike\, with some more turned to one or the
  other.  Rides begin at different locations\, primarily associated with Yel
 lowwood State Forest\, Brown County State Park\, and the Hoosier National F
 orest in Monroe\, Lawrence\, and Brown Counties. Specific routes may be dic
 tated by weather conditions\, but starting locations\, route maps\, and gps
  file links will be posted here in advance.</p><p>Expect a lot of trees and
  few cars</p><p>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.ge
 tmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=136627" target="_blank"><u><
 u><u><u><u><u><u><u>free trial membership</u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></
 a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing
  a liability waiver\, prior to participation.</p>
