BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
DTSTART:20260906T170000Z
DTEND:20260906T200000Z
DTSTAMP:20260905T041501Z
UID:4amcnli8crlsmk59ptbja3mlsc@google.com
CREATED:20260902T010748Z
DESCRIPTION:Route/Event link: <a href="https://ridewithgps.com/events/50045
 1-beginner-social-ride-west-side-neighborh" target="_blank">https://ridewit
 hgps.com/events/500451-beginner-social-ride-west-side-neighborh</a><br><br>
 <p>These rides use area bike paths and quiet neighborhood roads and avoid t
 he big hills. They are perfect for beginners\, families\, or those ready to
  get back into cycling. Each ride will feature <b>a stop for refreshment an
 d social time.</b>  Give this a try!</p><p>This ride uses bike paths and mo
 stly quiet neighborhood roads (there are two short stretches of rural two l
 ane roads (less than a mile in total)\, with as gentle hills as possible in
  Bloomington. Ride starts and ends at the Trades District Plaza. Parking on
  street and in garage are free on Sunday. Trades District Plaza is across t
 he street from Upland Brew Pub (open to all ages) where we will enjoy some 
 post ride social time.</p><p>This is a <b>no-drop ride—we will stay with yo
 u</b>. Ride with others—it's safer and more fun! Learn and explore beginner
 -friendly cycling routes around Bloomington.</p><p>Non-members should\, pri
 or to participation\, sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered
 .com/get_information.php?event_id=137889" target="_blank"><u><u><u><u><u>fr
 ee trial membership</u></u></u></u></u></a>\, which includes electronically
  signing a liability waiver.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260902T011256Z
LOCATION:Trades District Plaza\, 380 W. 10th street.
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Beginner/Social Ride - West Side Neighborhood tour
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
