DESCRIPTION:Route/Event Link:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/events/495256
 -beginner-social-ride-milwaukee-trail-fli" target="_blank">https://ridewith
 gps.com/events/495256-beginner-social-ride-milwaukee-trail-fli</a><br><br>T
 his will be a 15 - 22 mile ride on the Milwaukee Trail in Bedford. The trai
 l is packed crushed gravel\, ridable on any bike - but wider tires are bett
 er.  This is a 22 mile out and back ride that can be shortened by turning b
 ack when you are 1/2 tired... After the ride we will enjoy social time at t
 he Wings and Rings restaurant.<br><p>These rides use area bike paths and qu
 iet neighborhood roads and avoid the big hills. They are perfect for beginn
 ers\, families\, or those ready to get back into cycling. Each ride will fe
 ature <b>a stop for refreshment and social time.</b>  Give this a try!</p><
 p>This is a <b>no-drop ride—we will stay with you</b>. Ride with others—it'
 s safer and more fun! Learn and explore beginner-friendly cycling routes ar
 ound Bloomington.</p><p>Non-members should\, prior to participation\, sign 
 up for a <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSc6QkEJx4zO-lff9
 XtyQhWIebF1fHQDCIr7cIDNMmL5fr7NvA/viewform" target="_blank"><u><u><u><u>fre
 e trial membership</u></u></u></u></a>\, which includes electronically sign
 ing a liability waiver.</p>
