 registered.com/get_information.php?event_id=136627" target="_blank"><u><u>f
 ree trial membership</u></u></a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which i
 ncludes electronically signing a liability waiver\, prior to participation.
 <ul><li>Be SAFE. Don't blow through stop signs. Consider bike lights.<br></
 li><li>Be COURTEOUS: Single up in traffic<br></li><li>Be PREDICTABLE: Signa
 l your intentions to cars and fellow riders.</li></ul>The "Older\, Wiser\, 
