 e a bit without being race oriented. 16-18mph avg on most rides. We typical
 ly follow the OWLS group route (but won’t tonight so download the route if 
 you are not planning to keep the posted average pace) and add some extra mi
 les/climbs in the second half of the route allowing folks to start out with
  us and if we are too fast they can drop back to the OWLS group. All intere
 sted in a brisker pace are welcome!\n\nNon-members should sign up for a fre
 e trial membership of up to one month and sign a liability waiver before pa
 rticipating in a club ride. https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_informat
 ion.php?event_id=141883
