DESCRIPTION:Route: <a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/48213000" target
 ="_blank">Muscatatuck</a> 24 miles<br>Host: Chris Hahn<br><br>Meet at the s
 pray pad area at Switchyard Park for a 1:00pm departure.<br><br>Nice 'n' Ea
 sy rides cater to those who want to take it easy and to less experienced ri
 ders.  These Sunday rides feature lower mileage (19-24 miles) and slower pa
 ces than Saturday touring rides.  They use Bloomington area low traffic roa
 ds.<br><br>Non-members should\, prior to participation\, sign up for a <a h
